// Generated by scripts/build-pokedex.py; PokeAPI e5b79b2e15d7c50735a945936afd4cd1cfd94eae. See docs/POKEDEX.md.
export const DEX_TEXTS={"yellow":[null,{"en":"It can go for days without eating a single morsel. In the bulb on its back, it stores energy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The bulb on its back grows by drawing energy. It gives off an aroma when it is ready to bloom.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The flower on its back catches the sun's rays. The sunlight is then absorbed and used for energy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The flame at the tip of its tail makes a sound as it burns. You can only hear it in quiet places.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Tough fights could excite this POKéMON. When excited, it may blow out bluish-white flames.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When expelling a blast of super hot fire, the red flame at the tip of its tail burns more intensely.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Shoots water at prey while in the water. Withdraws into its shell when in danger.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When tapped, this POKéMON will pull in its head, but its tail will still stick out a little bit.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its enemy, it blasts out water with even more force than a fire hose.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Hardens its shell to protect itself. However, a large impact may cause it to pop out of its shell.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its wings, covered with poisonous powders, repel water. This allows it to fly in the rain.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Beware of the sharp stinger on its head. It hides in grass and bushes where it eats leaves.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Able to move only slightly. When endangered, it may stick out its stinger and poison its enemy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has 3 poisonous stingers on its forelegs and its tail. They are used to jab its enemy repeatedly.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Very docile. If attacked, it will often kick up sand to protect itself rather than fight back.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON is full of vitality. It constantly flies around its large territory in search of prey.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON flies at Mach 2 speed, seeking prey. Its large talons are feared as wicked weapons.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Will chew on anything with its fangs. If you see one, it is certain that 40 more live in the area.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its hind feet are webbed. They act as flippers, so it can swim in rivers and hunt for prey.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Inept at flying high. However, it can fly around very fast to protect its territory.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON that dates back many years. If it senses danger, it flies high and away, instantly.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The older it gets, the longer it grows. At night, it wraps its long body around tree branches to rest.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The frightening patterns on its belly have been studied. Six variations have been confirmed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It keeps its tail raised to monitor its surroundings. If you yank its tail, it will try to bite you.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When electricity builds up inside its body, it becomes feisty. It also glows in the dark.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body is dry. When it gets cold at night, its hide is said to become coated with a fine dew.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is skilled at slashing enemies with its claws. If broken, they start to grow back in a day.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A mild-mannered POKéMON that does not like to fight. Beware, its small horns secrete venom.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When resting deep in its burrow, its thorns always retract. This is proof that it is relaxed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Tough scales cover the sturdy body of this POKéMON. It appears that the scales grow in cycles.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its large ears are always kept upright. If it senses danger, it will attack with a poisonous sting.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its horns contain venom. If they are stabbed into an enemy, the impact makes the poison leak out.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Adored for their cute looks and playfulness. They are thought to be rare, as they do not appear often.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"They appear to be very protective of their own world. It is a kind of fairy, rarely seen by people.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Both its fur and its tails are beautiful. As it grows, the tails split and form more tails.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"According to an enduring legend, 9 noble saints were united and reincarnated as this POKéMON.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Uses its alluring eyes to enrapture its foe. It then sings a pleasing melody that lulls the foe to sleep.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body is full of elasticity. By inhaling deeply, it can continue to inflate itself without limit.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Emits ultrasonic cries while it flies. They act as a sonar used to check for objects in its way.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It attacks in a stealthy manner, without warning. Its sharp fangs are used to bite and suck blood.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It may be mistaken for a clump of weeds. If you try to yank it out of the ground, it shrieks horribly.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Smells incredibly foul! However, around 1 out of 1,000 people enjoy sniffing its nose-bending stink.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Flaps its broad flower petals to scatter its poisonous pollen. The flapping sound is very loud.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Burrows under the ground to gnaw on tree roots. The mushrooms on its back absorb most of the nutrition.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The bug host is drained of energy by the mushrooms on its back. They appear to do all the thinking.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its large eyes act as radars. In a bright place, you can see that they are clusters of many tiny eyes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The powdery scales on its wings are hard to remove. They also contain poison that leaks out on contact.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It prefers dark places. It spends most of its time underground, though it may pop up in caves.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A team of triplets that can burrow over 60 MPH. Due to this, some people think it's an earthquake.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Appears to be more active at night. It loves round and shiny things. It can't stop from picking them up.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Always tormented by headaches. It uses psychic powers, but it is not known if it intends to do so.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its slim and long limbs end in broad flippers. They are used for swimming gracefully in lakes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"An agile POKéMON that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It stops being angry only when nobody else is around. To view this moment is very difficult.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON with a friendly nature. However, it will bark fiercely at anything invading its territory.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A legendary POKéMON in China. Many people are charmed by its grace and beauty while running.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The direction of the spiral on the belly differs by area. It is more adept at swimming than walking.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Under attack, it uses its belly spiral to put the foe to sleep. It then makes its escape.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Swims powerfully using all the muscles in its body. It can even overtake champion swimmers.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Sleeps 18 hours a day. If it senses danger, it will teleport itself to safety even as it sleeps.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Many odd things happen if this POKéMON is close by. For example, it makes clocks run backwards.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON that can memorize anything. It never forgets what it learns-- that's why this POKéMON is smart.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Very powerful in spite of its small size. Its mastery of many types of martial arts makes it very tough.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The belt around its waist holds back its energy. Without it, this POKéMON would be unstoppable.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One arm alone can move mountains. Using all four arms, this POKéMON fires off awesome punches.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Prefers hot and humid places. It ensnares tiny insects with its vines and devours them.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When hungry, it swallows anything that moves. Its hapless prey is melted inside by strong acids.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Lures prey with the sweet aroma of honey. Swallowed whole, the prey is melted in a day, bones and all.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It can sometimes be found all dry and shriveled up on a beach. Toss it back into the sea to revive it.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its 80 tentacles can stretch and contract freely. They wrap around prey and weaken it with poison.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Commonly found near mountain trails, etc. If you step on one by accident, it gets angry.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Often seen rolling down mountain trails. Obstacles are just things to roll straight over, not avoid.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Once it sheds its skin, its body turns tender and whitish. Its hide hardens when it's exposed to air.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Capable of jumping incredibly high. Its hooves and sturdy legs absorb the impact of a hard landing.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Just loves to run. If it sees something faster than itself, it will give chase at top speed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Incredibly slow and sluggish. It is quite content to loll about without worrying about the time.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Lives lazily by the sea. If the SHELLDER on its tail comes off, it becomes a SLOWPOKE again.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is born with the ability to defy gravity. It floats in air on powerful electromagnetic waves.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Generates strange radio signals. It raises the temperature by 3.6F degrees within 3,300 feet.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Lives where reedy plants grow. They are rarely seen, so it's thought their numbers are decreasing.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its short wings make flying difficult. Instead, this POKéMON runs at high speed on developed legs.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One of DODUO's 2 heads splits to form a unique species. It runs close to 40 MPH in prairies.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Loves freezing cold conditions. Relishes swimming in a frigid climate of around 14F degrees.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its entire body is a snowy-white. Unharmed by even intense cold, it swims powerfully in icy waters.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Made of hardened sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won't grow in its path.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Smells so awful, it can cause fainting. Through degeneration, it lost its sense of smell.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The shell can withstand any attack. However, when it is open, the tender body is exposed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"For protection, it uses its harder-than-diamonds shell. It also shoots spikes from the shell.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape as it appears to be made of a gas.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"By licking, it saps the victim's life. It causes shaking that won't stop until the victim's demise.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A GENGAR is close by if you feel a sudden chill. It may be trying to lay a curse on you.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Burrows at high speed in search of food. The tunnels it leaves are used as homes by DIGLETTs.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If you sleep by it all the time, it will sometimes show you dreams it has eaten in the past.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Avoid eye contact if you come across one. It will try to put you to sleep by using its pendulum.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its pincers are superb weapons. They sometimes break off during battle, but they grow back fast.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One claw grew massively and as hard as steel. It has 10,000-HP strength. However, it is too heavy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is said to camouflage itself as a POKé BALL. It will self-destruct with very little stimulus.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Stores electrical energy inside its body. Even the slightest shock could trigger a huge explosion.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The heads attract each other and spin around. There must be 6 heads for it to maintain balance.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its cries are very noisy. This is because each of the 3 heads thinks about whatever it likes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Wears the skull of its deceased mother. Its cries echo inside the skull and come out as a sad melody.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Small and weak, this POKéMON is adept with its bone club. It has grown more vicious over the ages.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When kicking, the sole of its foot turns as hard as a diamond on impact and destroys its enemy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall in the same way as a drill.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its tongue spans almost 7 feet and moves more freely than its forelegs. Its licks can cause paralysis.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"In hot places, its internal gases could expand and explode without any warning. Be very careful!","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It lives and grows by absorbing dust, germs and poison gases that are contained in toxic waste and garbage.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON with a one-track mind. Once it charges, it won't stop running until it falls asleep.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Walks on its hind legs. Shows signs of intelligence. Its armor-like hide even repels molten lava.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A gentle and kindhearted POKéMON that shares its nutritious eggs if it sees an injured POKéMON.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its identity is obscured by masses of thick, blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Raises its young in its belly pouch. Won't run from any fight to keep its young protected.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If it senses any danger, it will vigorously spray water or a special type of ink from its mouth.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Touching the back fin causes numbness. It hooks its tail to coral to stay in place while sleeping.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When it is time for them to lay eggs, they can be seen swimming up rivers and falls in large groups.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is the male's job to make a nest by carving out boulders in a stream using the horn on its head.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"As long as the center section is unharmed, it can grow back fully even if it is chopped to bits.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The center section is named the core. People think it is communicating when it glows in 7 colors.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Always practices its pantomime act. It makes enemies believe something exists that really doesn't.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Leaps out of tall grass and slices prey with its scythes. The movement looks like that of a ninja.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Appears to move to a rhythm of its own, as if it were dancing. It wiggles its hips as it walks.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If a major power outage occurs, it is certain that this POKéMON has eaten electricity at a power plant.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Born in an active volcano. Its body is always cloaked in flames, so it looks like a big ball of fire.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Grips its prey in its pincers and squeezes hard! It can't move if it's cold, so it lives in warm places.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A rowdy POKéMON with a lot of stamina. Once running, it won't stop until it hits something.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Famous for being very unreliable. It can be found swimming in seas, lakes, rivers and shallow puddles.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Brutally vicious and enormously destructive. Known for totally destroying cities in ancient times.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A gentle soul that can read the minds of people. It can ferry people across the sea on its back.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When it spots an enemy, its body transfigures into an almost perfect copy of its opponent.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its genetic code is unstable, so it could evolve in a variety of ways. There are only a few alive.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its cell structure is similar to water molecules. It will melt away and become invisible in water.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A sensitive POKéMON that easily becomes sad or angry. Every time its mood changes, it charges power.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has a flame chamber inside its body. It inhales, then blows out fire that is over 3,000F degrees.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The only POKéMON people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"An ancient POKéMON that was recovered from a fossil. It swims by cleverly twisting its 10 tentacles about.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Sharp beaks ring its mouth. Its shell was too big for it to move freely, so it became extinct.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was recovered from a fossil. It uses the eyes on its back while hiding on the sea floor.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A slim and fast swimmer. It slices its prey with its sharp sickles and drinks the body fluids.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A savage POKéMON that died out in ancient times. It was resurrected using DNA taken from amber.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Will eat anything, even if the food happens to be a little moldy. It never gets an upset stomach.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A legendary bird POKéMON. It freezes water that is contained in winter air and makes it snow.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This legendary bird POKéMON is said to appear when the sky turns dark and lightning showers down.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A legendary bird POKéMON. As it flaps its flaming wings, even the night sky will turn red.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The existence of this mythical POKéMON was only recently confirmed by a fisherman who caught one.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"According to a witness, its body was surrounded by a strange aura that gave it a mystical look.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is said that this POKéMON lives somewhere in the sea and that it flies. However, it is only a rumor.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its DNA is almost the same as MEW's. However, its size and disposition are vastly different.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When viewed through a microscope, this POKéMON's short, fine, delicate hair can be seen.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"}],"crystal":[null,{"en":"While it is young, it uses the nutrients that are stored in the seeds on its back in order to grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The bulb on its back grows as it absorbs nutrients. The bulb gives off a pleasant aroma when it blooms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it warms itself and absorbs the sunlight, its flower petals release a pleasant fragrance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it's healthy, the flame on the tip of its tail will burn vigorously, even if it gets a bit wet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it becomes agitated during battle, it spouts intense flames, incinerating its surroundings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its wings to fly high. The temperature of its fire increases as it gains experience in battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it feels threatened, it draws its legs inside its shell and sprays water from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its long, furry tail is a symbol of longevity, making it quite popular among older people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It firmly plants its feet on the ground before shooting water from the jets on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crawls into foliage where it camouflages itself among leaves that are the same color as its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This is its pre-evolved form. At this stage, it can only harden, so it remains motionless to avoid attack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flits from flower to flower, collecting honey. It can even identify distant flowers in bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The barb on top of its head secretes a strong poison. It uses this toxic barb to protect itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Nearly incapable of movement, it leans against stout trees while waiting for its evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses sharp, poisonous stings to defeat prey, then takes the victim back to its nest for food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rapidly flaps its wings in the grass, stirring up a dust cloud that drives insect prey out into the open.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It slowly flies in a circular pattern, all the while keeping a sharp lookout for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its outstanding vision allows it to spot splashing MAGIKARP, even while flying at 3300 feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This POKéMON's impressive vitality allows it to live anywhere. It also multiplies very quickly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The webs on its hind legs enable it to cross rivers. It searches wide areas for food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect its territory, it flies around ceaselessly, making high-pitched cries.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its long beak to attack. It has a surprisingly long reach, so it must be treated with caution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters the tip of its tongue to seek out the scent of prey, then swallows the prey whole.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To intimidate foes, it spreads its chest wide and makes eerie sounds by expelling air from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is angered, it immediately discharges the energy stored in the pouches in its cheeks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its electric pouches run empty, it raises its tail to gather electricity from the atmosphere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers dry, sandy places because it uses the sand to protect itself when threatened.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Adept at climbing trees, it rolls into a spiny ball, then attacks its enemies from above.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small and very docile, it protects itself with its small, poisonous horn when attacked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a docile nature. If it is threatened with attack, it raises the barbs that are all over its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The hard scales that cover its strong body serve as excellent protection from any attack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It constantly moves its large ears in many directions in order to detect danger right away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is easily agitated and uses its horn for offense as soon as it notices an attacker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its thick arms, legs and tail to attack forcefully. Melee combat is its specialty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though rarely seen, it becomes easier to spot, for some reason, on the night of a full moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to live in quiet, remote mountains, this type of fairy has a strong aversion to being seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As its body grows larger, its six warm tails become more beautiful, with a more luxurious coat of fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to live a thousand years, and each of its tails is loaded with supernatural powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls its cute eyes as it sings a soothing lullaby. Its gentle song puts anyone who hears it to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The rich, fluffy fur that covers its body feels so good that anyone who feels it can't stop touching it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During the day, it gathers with others and hangs from the ceilings of old buildings and caves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it plunges its fangs into its prey, it instantly draws and gulps down more than ten ounces of blood.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bathing in moonlight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The smell from its drool-like syrup and the pollen on its petals is so bad, it may make opponents faint.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By shaking its big petals, it scatters toxic pollen into the air, turning the air yellow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tochukaso growing on this POKéMON's back orders it to extract juice from tree trunks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When nothing's left to extract from the bug, the mushrooms on its back leave spores on the bug's egg.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The small bugs it eats appear only at night, so it sleeps in a hole in a tree until night falls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The scales it scatters will paralyze anyone who touches them, making that person unable to stand.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It digs underground and chews on tree roots, sticking its head out only when the sun isn't bright.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These DIGLETT triplets dig over 60 miles below sea level. No one knows what it's like underground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves things that sparkle. When it sees a shiny object, the gold coin on its head shines too.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Behind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The only time it can use its psychic power is when its sleeping brain cells happen to wake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims gracefully along on the quiet, slow-moving rivers and lakes of which it is so fond.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It will beat up anyone who makes it mad, even if it has to chase them until the end of the world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls a big territory. If it detects an unknown smell, it roars loudly to force out the intruder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An ancient picture scroll shows that people were attracted to its movement as it ran through prairies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The swirl on its belly is its insides showing through the skin. It looks clearer after it eats.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though it is skilled at walking, it prefers to live underwater where there is less danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can use its well-developed arms and legs to run on the surface of the water for a split second.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hypnotizes itself so that it can teleport away when it senses danger, even if it is asleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it closes its eyes, twice as many alpha particles come out of the surface of its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an IQ of 5000. It calculates many things in order to gain the edge in every battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It trains by lifting rocks in the mountains. It can even pick up a GRAVELER with ease.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This tough POKéMON always stays in the zone. Its muscles become thicker after every battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With four arms that react more quickly than it can think, it can execute many punches at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it notices anything that moves, it immediately flings its vine at the object.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it's hungry, it swings its razor-sharp leaves, slicing up any unlucky object nearby for food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once ingested into this POKéMON's body, even the hardest object will melt into nothing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it floats along on the waves, it uses its toxic feelers to stab anything it touches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its 80 feelers absorb water, it stretches to become like a net to entangle its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Proud of their sturdy bodies, they bash against each other in a contest to prove whose is harder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It travels by rolling on mountain paths. If it gains too much speed, it stops by running into huge rocks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its rock-like body is so durable, even high-powered dynamite blasts fail to scratch its rugged hide.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Training by jumping over grass that grows longer every day has made it a world-class jumper.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It just loves to gallop. The faster it goes, the longer the swaying flames of its mane will become.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is always so absent-minded that it won't react, even if its flavorful tail is bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An attached SHELLDER won't let go because of the tasty flavor that oozes out of its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electricity emitted by the units on each side of its body cause it to become a strong magnet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When many MAGNETON gather together, the resulting magnetic storm disrupts radio waves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In order to prevent their extinction, more people have made an effort to breed these POKéMON.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives on a grassy plain where it can see a long way. If it sees an enemy, it runs away at 60 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An enemy that takes its eyes off any of the three heads--even for a second--will get pecked severely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The light blue fur that covers it keeps it protected against the cold. It loves iceberg-filled oceans.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps under shallow ocean waters during the day, then looks for food at night when it's cold.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When two of these POKéMON's bodies are combined together, new poisons are created.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it moves, a very strong poison leaks from it, making the ground there barren for three years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Clamping on to an opponent reveals its vulnerable parts, so it uses this move only as a last resort.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even a missile can't break the spikes it uses to stab opponents. They're even harder than its shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps its opponent in its gas-like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in the dark, planning to take the life of the next living thing that wanders close by.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Hiding in people's shadows at night, it absorbs their heat. The chill it causes makes the victims shake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it digs through the ground, it absorbs many hard objects. This is what makes its body so solid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it twitches its nose, it can tell where someone is sleeping and what that person is dreaming about.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The longer it swings its pendulum, the longer the effects of its hypnosis last.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it is unable to find food, it will absorb nutrients by swallowing a mouthful of sand.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its oversized claw is very powerful, but when it's not in battle, the claw just gets in the way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During the study of this POKéMON, it was discovered that its components are not found in nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The more energy it charges up, the faster it gets. But this also makes it more likely to explode.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If even one is separated from the group, the energy bond between the six will make them rejoin instantly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Living in a good environment makes it grow lots of heads. A head that drops off becomes an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lost its mother after its birth. It wears its mother's skull, never revealing its true face.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Somewhere in the world is a cemetery just for MAROWAK. It gets its bones from those graves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is also called the Kick Master. It uses its elastic legs to execute every known kick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To increase the strength of all its punch moves, it spins its arms just before making contact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a tongue that is over 6’6’’ long. It uses this long tongue to lick its body clean.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one gets close enough to it when it expels poisonous gas, the gas swirling inside it can be seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it inhales poisonous gases from garbage, its body expands, and its insides smell much worse.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can remember only one thing at a time. Once it starts rushing, it forgets why it started.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By lightly spinning its drill-like horn, it can easily shatter even a diamond in the rough.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"People try to catch it for its extremely nutritious eggs, but it rarely can be found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During battle, it constantly moves the vines that cover its body in order to annoy its opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To avoid crushing the baby it carries in its pouch, it always sleeps standing up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they're in a safe location, they can be seen playfully tangling their tails together.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The male raises the young. If it is approached, it uses its toxic spikes to fend off the intruder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During spawning season, they swim gracefully in the water, searching for their perfect mate.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When autumn comes, the males patrol the area around their nests in order to protect their offspring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the stars twinkle at night, it floats up from the sea floor, and its body's center core flickers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that it uses the seven-colored core of its body to send electric waves into outer space.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the mysterious power it has in its fingers to solidify air into an invisible wall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It's very proud of its speed. It moves so fast that its opponent does not even know what knocked it down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has several different cry patterns, each of which seems to have its own meaning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When two ELECTABUZZ touch, they control the electric currents to communicate their feelings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves more frequently in hot areas. It can heal itself by dipping its wound into lava.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the temperature drops at night, it sleeps on treetops or among roots where it is well hidden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These violent POKéMON fight with other members of their herd in order to prove their strength.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This weak and pathetic POKéMON gets easily pushed along rivers when there are strong currents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears whenever there is world conflict, burning down any place it travels through.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This gentle POKéMON loves to give people rides and provides a very comfortable way to get around.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it encounters another DITTO, it will move faster than normal to duplicate that opponent exactly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its ability to evolve into many forms allows it to adapt smoothly and perfectly to any environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it uses the fins on the tip of its tail to swim, it blends with the water perfectly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The negatively charged ions generated in its fur create a constant sparking noise.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it has stored up enough heat, this POKéMON's body temperature can reach up to 1700 degrees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An artificial POKéMON created due to extensive research, it can perform only what is in its program.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In prehistoric times, it swam on the sea floor, eating plankton. Its fossils are sometimes found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heavy shell allowed it to reach only nearby food. This could be the reason it is extinct.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Three hundred million years ago, it hid on the sea floor. It also has eyes on its back that glow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was able to swim quickly through the water by compactly folding up its razor-sharp sickles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In prehistoric times, this POKéMON flew freely and fearlessly through the skies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This POKéMON's stomach is so strong, even eating moldy or rotten food will not affect it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legendary bird POKéMON. As it flies through the sky, it cools the air, causing snow to fall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legendary bird POKéMON. They say lightning caused by the flapping of its wings causes summer storms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legendary bird POKéMON. It is said to migrate from the south along with the spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sheds many layers of skin as it grows larger. During this process, it is protected by a rapid waterfall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called the divine POKéMON. When its entire body brightens slightly, the weather changes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that somewhere in the ocean lies an island where these gather. Only they live there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to rest quietly in an undiscovered cave, this POKéMON was created solely for battling.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can learn any move, some people began research to see if it is the ancestor of all POKéMON.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to bask in the sunlight. It uses the leaf on its head to seek out warm places.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The scent that wafts from the leaves on its neck causes anyone who smells it to become energetic.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Anyone who stands beside it becomes refreshed, just as if they were relaxing in a sunny forest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fire that spouts from its back burns hottest when it is angry. The flaring flames intimidate foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Before battle, it turns its back on its opponent to demonstrate how ferociously its fire blazes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When heat from its body causes the air around it to shimmer, this is a sign that it is ready to battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This rough critter chomps at any moving object it sees. Turning your back on it is not recommended.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tips of its fangs are slanted backward. Once those fangs clamp down, the prey has no hope of escape.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it has a massive body, its powerful hind legs enable it to move quickly, even on the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When acting as a lookout, it warns others of danger by screeching and hitting the ground with its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in narrow burrows that fit its slim body. The deeper the nests go, the more mazelike they become.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It begins to hoot at the same time every day. Some trainers use them in place of clocks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its extremely soft feathers make no sound in flight. It silently sneaks up on prey without being detected.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid and clusters together with others. The fluid secreted by its feet indicates its location.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the daytime when it gets warm, it curls up inside a big leaf and drifts off into a deep slumber.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If prey becomes ensnared in its nest of spun string, it waits motionlessly until it becomes dark.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rather than making a nest in one specific spot, it wanders in search of food after darkness falls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of its pursuit of faster, yet more silent flight, a new set of wings grew on its hind legs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its antennae, which evolved from a fin, have both positive and negative charges flowing through them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This POKéMON uses the bright part of its body, which changed from a dorsal fin, to lure prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is unskilled at storing electric power. Any kind of shock causes it to discharge energy spontaneously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If the impact site of a meteorite is found, this POKéMON is certain to be within the immediate area.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Instead of walking with its short legs, it moves around by bouncing on its soft, tender body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is considered to be a symbol of good luck. Its shell is said to be filled with happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it does not flap its wings very much, it can stay up in the air as it tags along after its trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is extremely good at climbing tree trunks and likes to eat the new sprouts on the trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it begins to meditate at sunrise, the entire day will pass before it will move again.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores lots of air in its soft fur, allowing it to stay cool in summer and warm in winter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because of its rubbery, electricity-resistant skin, it can store lots of electricity in its fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it gets dark, the light from its bright, shiny tail can be seen from far away on the ocean's surface.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When these dance together, their petals rub against each other, making pretty, relaxing sounds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fur on its body naturally repels water. It can stay dry, even when it plays in the water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The bubble-like pattern on its stomach helps it camouflage itself when it's in the water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If a tree branch shakes when there is no wind, it's a SUDOWOODO, not a tree. It hides from the rain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it expands its throat to croak out a tune, nearby POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL gather immediately.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can be carried away on even the gentlest breeze. It may even float all the way to the next town.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As soon as it rains, it closes its flower and hides in the shade of a tree to avoid getting wet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even in the fiercest wind, it can control its fluff to make its way to any place in the world it wants.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its tail to hang on to tree branches. It uses its momentum to swing from one branch to another.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very weak. Its only means of defense is to shake its leaves desperately at its attacker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As the hot season approaches, the petals on this POKéMON's face become more vivid and lively.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can see in all directions without moving its big eyes, helping it spot attackers and food right away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mucous membrane covers its body. Touching it barehanded will cause a shooting pain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is always slimy. It often bangs its head on the river bottom as it swims but seems not to care.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its forked tail quivers when it is predicting its opponent's next move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On the night of a full moon, or when it gets excited, the ring patterns on its body glow yellow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides any shiny object it finds in a secret location. MURKROW and MEOWTH loot one another's stashes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Every time it yawns, SHELLDER injects more poison into it. The poison makes it more intelligent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to watch people it's scared. It frightens them by screaming loudly or appearing suddenly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because different types of UNOWN exist, it is said that they must have a variety of abilities.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In order to conceal its black tail, it lives in a dark cave and only moves about at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is in danger, its tail uses some sort of mysterious powers to drive away the enemy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spits out a fluid that it uses to glue tree bark to its body. The fluid hardens when it touches air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Usually found hanging on to a fat tree trunk. It shoots out bits of its shell when it sees action.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides deep inside caves where no light ever reaches it and remains virtually motionless there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It builds its nest on a steep cliff. When it is done gliding, it hops along the ground back to its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The many small metal particles that cover this POKéMON's body reflect bright light well.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In truth, it is a cowardly POKéMON. It growls eagerly in order to hide its fear from its opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can make most any POKéMON run away simply by opening its mouth wide to reveal its big fangs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When faced with a larger opponent, it swallows as much water as it can to match the opponent's size.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This POKéMON's pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets a hold of into bits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fluid secreted by its toes carves holes in rocks for nesting and can be mixed with BERRIES to make a drink.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its Herculean powers, it can easily throw around an object that is 100 times its own weight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This cunning POKéMON hides under the cover of darkness, waiting to attack its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always licks honey. Its palm tastes sweet because of all the honey it has absorbed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it has a large body, it is quite skilled at climbing trees. It eats and sleeps in the treetops.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These group together in areas that are hotter than normal. If it cools off, its skin hardens.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is as hot as lava and is always billowing. Flames will occasionally burst from its shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the tip of its nose to dig for food. Its nose is so tough that even frozen ground poses no problem.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although its legs are short, its rugged hooves prevent it from slipping, even on icy ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The points on its head absorb nutrients from clean water. They cannot survive in polluted water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To escape from an attacker, it may shoot water out of its mouth, then use that force to swim backward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its instinct is to bury itself in holes. It often steals the nesting holes of others to sleep in them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always carries its food with it, wherever it goes. If attacked, it throws its food at the opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims along freely, eating things that swim into its mouth. Its whole body is very coarse.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The feathers that it sheds are very sharp. It is said that people once used the feathers as swords.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Around dawn, its ominous howl echoes through the area to announce that this is its territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pungent-smelling flame that shoots from its mouth results from toxins burning in its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores energy by sleeping at underwater depths at which no other life forms can survive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During the deserted morning hours, it comes ashore where it deftly uses its trunk to take a shower.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because this POKéMON's skin is so tough, a normal attack won't even leave a scratch on it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This manmade POKéMON evolved from the latest technology. It may have unprogrammed reactions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The round balls found on the fallen antlers can be ground into a powder that aids in sleeping.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The color of the mysterious fluid secreted from its tail is predetermined for each SMEARGLE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To brush up on its fighting skills, it will challenge anyone. It has a very strong competitive spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After doing a handstand to throw off the opponent's timing, it presents its fancy kick moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sensitivity of its lips develops most quickly. It uses them to try to identify unknown objects.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves violent thunder. The space between its horns flickers bluish-white when it is charging energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It naturally spits an 1100-degree flame. It is said when many appear, it heralds a volcanic eruption.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In order to milk a MILTANK, one must have a knack for rhythmically pulling up and down on its udders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Biting into one of the delicious eggs that BLISSEY provides will make everyone around smile with joy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This rough POKéMON stores energy inside its body, then sweeps across the land, shooting off electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This brawny POKéMON courses around the earth, spouting flames hotter than a volcano's magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This divine POKéMON blows around the world, always in search of a pure reservoir.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born deep underground, this POKéMON becomes a pupa after eating enough dirt to make a mountain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It will not stay still, even while it's a pupa. It already has arms and legs under its solid shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In just one of its mighty hands, it has the power to make the ground shake and mountains crumble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an incredible ability to calm raging storms. It is said that LUGIA appears when storms start.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It will reveal itself before a pure-hearted trainer by shining its bright rainbow-colored wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Revered as a guardian of the forest, CELEBI appears wherever beautiful forests exist.","esFrom":"x"}],"ruby":[null,{"en":"BULBASAUR can be seen napping in bright sunlight. There is a seed on its back. By soaking up the sun’s rays, the seed grows progressively larger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"There is a bud on this POKéMON’s back. To support its weight, IVYSAUR’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"There is a large flower on VENUSAUR’s back. The flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The flame that burns at the tip of its tail is an indication of its emotions. The flame wavers when CHARMANDER is enjoying itself. If the POKéMON becomes enraged, the flame burns fiercely.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHARMELEON mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHARIZARD flies around the sky in search of powerful opponents. It breathes fire of such great heat that it melts anything. However, it never turns its fiery breath on any opponent weaker than itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SQUIRTLE’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this POKéMON to swim at high speeds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as WARTORTLE ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness as a battler.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BLASTOISE has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The shell covering this POKéMON’s body is as hard as an iron slab. METAPOD does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BUTTERFREE has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WEEDLE has an extremely acute sense of smell. It is capable of distinguishing its favorite kinds of leaves from those it dislikes just by sniffing with its big red proboscis (nose).","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KAKUNA remains virtually immobile as it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it is extremely busy as it prepares for its coming evolution. This is evident from how hot the shell becomes to the touch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest - this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PIDGEY has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It is capable of unerringly returning home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PIDGEOTTO claims a large area as its own territory. This POKéMON flies around, patrolling its living space. If its territory is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON has a dazzling plumage of beautifully glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are captivated by the striking beauty of the feathers on its head, compelling them to choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RATTATA is cautious in the extreme. Even while it is asleep, it constantly listens by moving its ears around. It is not picky about where it lives - it will make its nest anywhere.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RATICATE’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SPEAROW has a very loud cry that can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FEAROW is recognized by its long neck and elongated beak. They are conveniently shaped for catching prey in soil or water. It deftly moves its long and skinny beak to pluck prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once ARBOK wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Whenever PIKACHU comes across something new, it blasts it with a jolt of electricity. If you come across a blackened berry, it’s evidence that this POKéMON mistook the intensity of its charge.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If the electrical sacks become excessively charged, RAICHU plants its tail in the ground and discharges. Scorched patches of ground will be found near this POKéMON’s nest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SANDSHREW’s body is configured to absorb water without waste, enabling it to survive in an arid desert. This POKéMON curls up to protect itself from its enemies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SANDSLASH’s body is covered by tough spikes, which are hardened sections of its hide. Once a year, the old spikes fall out, to be replaced with new spikes that grow out from beneath the old ones.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NIDORAN has barbs that secrete a powerful poison. They are thought to have developed as protection for this small-bodied POKéMON. When enraged, it releases a horrible toxin from its horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When NIDORINA are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This POKéMON appears to become nervous if separated from the others.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NIDOQUEEN’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The male NIDORAN has developed muscles for moving its ears. Thanks to them, the ears can be freely moved in any direction. Even the slightest sound does not escape this POKéMON’s notice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NIDORINO has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this POKéMON goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On every night of a full moon, groups of this POKéMON come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CLEFABLE moves by skipping lightly as if it were flying using its wings. Its bouncy step lets it even walk on water. It is known to take strolls on lakes on quiet, moonlit nights.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At the time of its birth, VULPIX has one white tail. The tail separates into six if this POKéMON receives plenty of love from its TRAINER. The six tails become magnificently curled.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NINETALES casts a sinister light from its bright red eyes to gain total control over its foe’s mind. This POKéMON is said to live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JIGGLYPUFF’s vocal chords can freely adjust the wavelength of its voice. This POKéMON uses this ability to sing at precisely the right wavelength to make its foes most drowsy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WIGGLYTUFF has large, saucerlike eyes. The surfaces of its eyes are always covered with a thin layer of tears. If any dust gets in this POKéMON’s eyes, it is quickly washed away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ZUBAT remains quietly unmoving in a dark spot during the bright daylight hours. It does so because prolonged exposure to the sun causes its body to become slightly burned.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GOLBAT loves to drink the blood of living things. It is particularly active in the pitch black of night. This POKéMON flits around in the night skies, seeking fresh blood.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"During the daytime, ODDISH buries itself in soil to absorb nutrients from the ground using its entire body. The more fertile the soil, the glossier its leaves become.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GLOOM releases a foul fragrance from the pistil of its flower. When faced with danger, the stench worsens. If this POKéMON is feeling calm and secure, it does not release its usual stinky aroma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VILEPLUME’s toxic pollen triggers atrocious allergy attacks. That’s why it is advisable never to approach any attractive flowers in a jungle, however pretty they may be.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PARAS has parasitic mushrooms growing on its back called tochukaso. They grow large by drawing nutrients from the BUG POKéMON host. They are highly valued as a medicine for extending life.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PARASECT is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VENONAT is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even miniscule prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VENOMOTH is nocturnal - it is a POKéMON that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DIGLETT are raised in most farms. The reason is simple - wherever this POKéMON burrows, the soil is left perfectly tilled for planting crops. This soil is made ideal for growing delicious vegetables.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DUGTRIO are actually triplets that emerged from one body. As a result, each triplet thinks exactly like the other two triplets. They work cooperatively to burrow endlessly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PSYDUCK uses a mysterious power. When it does so, this POKéMON generates brain waves that are supposedly only seen in sleepers. This discovery spurred controversy among scholars.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The webbed flippers on its forelegs and hind legs and the streamlined body of GOLDUCK give it frightening speed. This POKéMON is definitely much faster than even the most athletic swimmer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GROWLITHE has a superb sense of smell. Once it smells anything, this POKéMON won’t forget the scent, no matter what. It uses its advanced olfactory sense to determine the emotions of other living things.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARCANINE is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this POKéMON’s body is its source of power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"POLIWAG has a very thin skin. It is possible to see the POKéMON’s spiral innards right through the skin. Despite its thinness, however, the skin is also very flexible. Even sharp fangs bounce right off it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The surface of POLIWHIRL’s body is always wet and slick with an oily fluid. Because of this greasy covering, it can easily slip and slide out of the clutches of any enemy in battle.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ABRA sleeps for eighteen hours a day. However, it can sense the presence of foes even while it is sleeping. In such a situation, this POKéMON immediately teleports to safety.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KADABRA emits a peculiar alpha wave if it develops a headache. Only those people with a particularly strong psyche can hope to become a TRAINER of this POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ALAKAZAM’s brain continually grows, making its head far too heavy to support with its neck. This POKéMON holds its head up using its psychokinetic power instead.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MACHOP’s muscles are special - they never get sore no matter how much they are used in exercise. This POKéMON has sufficient power to hurl a hundred adult humans.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MACHOKE’s thoroughly toned muscles possess the hardness of steel. This POKéMON has so much strength, it can easily hold aloft a sumo wrestler on just one finger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MACHAMP has the power to hurl anything aside. However, trying to do any work requiring care and dexterity causes its arms to get tangled. This POKéMON tends to leap into action before it thinks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, this POKéMON spits a corrosive fluid that melts even iron.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WEEPINBELL has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the POKéMON hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VICTREEBEL has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this POKéMON swallows it whole.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TENTACOOL’s body is largely composed of water. If it is removed from the sea, it dries up like parchment. If this POKéMON happens to become dehydrated, put it back into the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TENTACRUEL has large red orbs on its head. The orbs glow before lashing the vicinity with a harsh ultrasonic blast. This POKéMON’s outburst creates rough waves around it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The longer a GEODUDE lives, the more its edges are chipped and worn away, making it more rounded in appearance. However, this POKéMON’s heart will remain hard, craggy, and rough always.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GRAVELER grows by feeding on rocks. Apparently, it prefers to eat rocks that are covered in moss. This POKéMON eats its way through a ton of rocks on a daily basis.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GOLEM live up on mountains. If there is a large earthquake, these POKéMON will come rolling down off the mountains en masse to the foothills below.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This POKéMON becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RAPIDASH usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this POKéMON turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SLOWPOKE uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this POKéMON often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SLOWBRO’s tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes SLOWBRO to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAGNEMITE attaches itself to power lines to feed on electricity. If your house has a power outage, check your circuit breakers. You may find a large number of this POKéMON clinging to the breaker box.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAGNETON emits a powerful magnetic force that is fatal to mechanical devices. As a result, large cities sound sirens to warn citizens of large-scale outbreaks of this POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DODUO’s two heads never sleep at the same time. Its two heads take turns sleeping, so one head can always keep watch for enemies while the other one sleeps.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Watch out if DODRIO’s three heads are looking in three separate directions. It’s a sure sign that it is on its guard. Don’t go near this POKéMON if it’s being wary - it may decide to peck you.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEEL hunts for prey in the frigid sea underneath sheets of ice. When it needs to breathe, it punches a hole through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DEWGONG loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GRIMER’s sludgy and rubbery body can be forced through any opening, however small it may be. This POKéMON enters sewer pipes to drink filthy wastewater.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"From MUK’s body seeps a foul fluid that gives off a nose-bendingly horrible stench. Just one drop of this POKéMON’s body fluid can turn a pool stagnant and rancid.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At night, this POKéMON uses its broad tongue to burrow a hole in the seafloor sand and then sleep in it. While it is sleeping, SHELLDER closes its shell, but leaves its tongue hanging out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CLOYSTER is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This POKéMON shoots spikes from its shell using the same system.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GASTLY is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this POKéMON cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HAUNTER is a dangerous POKéMON. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This POKéMON will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ONIX has a magnet in its brain. It acts as a compass so that this POKéMON does not lose direction while it is tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes increasingly rounder and smoother.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KRABBY live on beaches, burrowed inside holes dug into the sand. On sandy beaches with little in the way of food, these POKéMON can be seen squabbling with each other over territory.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KINGLER has an enormous, oversized claw. It waves this huge claw in the air to communicate with others. However, because the claw is so heavy, the POKéMON quickly tires.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VOLTORB was first sighted at a company that manufactures POKé BALLS. The link between that sighting and the fact that this POKéMON looks very similar to a POKé BALL remains a mystery.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ELECTRODE eats electricity in the atmosphere. On days when lightning strikes, you can see this POKéMON exploding all over the place from eating too much electricity.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON consists of six eggs that form a closely knit cluster. The six eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear on the eggs, EXEGGCUTE is close to evolution.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"EXEGGUTOR originally came from the tropics. Its heads steadily grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall off, they group together to form EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CUBONE pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the POKéMON wears are made by the tears it sheds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE that has overcome its sadness at the loss of its mother and grown tough. This POKéMON’s tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HITMONLEE’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Whenever LICKITUNG comes across something new, it will unfailingly give it a lick. It does so because it memorizes things by texture and by taste. It is somewhat put off by sour things.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If KOFFING becomes agitated, it raises the toxicity of its internal gases and jets them out from all over its body. This POKéMON may also overinflate its round body, then explode.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WEEZING loves the gases given off by rotted kitchen garbage. This POKéMON will find a dirty, unkempt house and make it its home. At night, when the people in the house are asleep, it will go through the trash.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RHYHORN runs in a straight line, smashing everything in its path. It is not bothered even if it rushes headlong into a block of steel. This POKéMON may feel some pain from the collision the next day, however.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RHYDON’s horn can crush even uncut diamonds. One sweeping blow of its tail can topple a building. This POKéMON’s hide is extremely tough. Even direct cannon hits don’t leave a scratch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHANSEY lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If you come across a young KANGASKHAN playing by itself, you must never disturb it or attempt to catch it. The baby POKéMON’s parent is sure to be in the area, and it will become violently enraged at you.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HORSEA eats small insects and moss off of rocks. If the ocean current turns fast, this POKéMON anchors itself by wrapping its tail around rocks or coral to prevent being washed away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEADRA sleeps after wriggling itself between the branches of coral. Those trying to harvest coral are occasionally stung by this POKéMON’s poison barbs if they fail to notice it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GOLDEEN is a very beautiful POKéMON with fins that billow elegantly in water. However, don’t let your guard down around this POKéMON - it could ram you powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the autumn, SEAKING males can be seen performing courtship dances in riverbeds to woo females. During this season, this POKéMON’s body coloration is at its most beautiful.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STARYU’s center section has an organ called the core that shines bright red. If you go to a beach toward the end of summer, the glowing cores of these POKéMON look like the stars in the sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STARMIE’s center section - the core - glows brightly in seven colors. Because of its luminous nature, this POKéMON has been given the nickname “the gem of the sea.”","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once it is believed, it will exist as if it were a real thing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SCYTHER is blindingly fast. Its blazing speed enhances the effectiveness of the twin scythes on its forearms. This POKéMON’s scythes are so effective, they can slice through thick logs in one wicked stroke.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JYNX walks rhythmically, swaying and shaking its hips as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without giving any thought to what they are doing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When a storm arrives, gangs of this POKéMON compete with each other to scale heights that are likely to be stricken by lightning bolts. Some towns use ELECTABUZZ in place of lightning rods.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In battle, MAGMAR blows out intensely hot flames from all over its body to intimidate its opponent. This POKéMON’s fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees in its surroundings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PINSIR is astoundingly strong. It can grip a foe weighing twice its weight in its horns and easily lift it. This POKéMON’s movements turn sluggish in cold places.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is not satisfied unless it is rampaging at all times. If there is no opponent for TAUROS to battle, it will charge at thick trees and knock them down to calm itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAGIKARP is a pathetic excuse for a POKéMON that is only capable of flopping and splashing. This behavior prompted scientists to undertake research into it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When MAGIKARP evolves into GYARADOS, its brain cells undergo a structural transformation. It is said that this transformation is to blame for this POKéMON’s wildly violent nature.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"People have driven LAPRAS almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, this POKéMON is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DITTO rearranges its cell structure to transform itself into other shapes. However, if it tries to transform itself into something by relying on its memory, this POKéMON manages to get details wrong.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This POKéMON has the ability to freely control water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the POKéMON to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose - it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This POKéMON’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"OMANYTE is one of the ancient and long-since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KABUTO is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in extremely rare cases, living examples have been discovered. The POKéMON has not changed at all for 300 million years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KABUTOPS swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The POKéMON was apparently evolving from being a water-dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from genetic material extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies in ancient times.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARTICUNO is a legendary bird POKéMON that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this POKéMON flies, snow will fall.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ZAPDOS is a legendary bird POKéMON that has the ability to control electricity. It usually lives in thunderclouds. The POKéMON gains power if it is stricken by lightning bolts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MOLTRES is a legendary bird POKéMON that has the ability to control fire. If this POKéMON is injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DRATINI continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DRAGONITE is capable of circling the globe in just sixteen hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEWTWO is a POKéMON that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans created this POKéMON’s body, they failed to endow MEWTWO with a compassionate heart.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEW is said to possess the genetic composition of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In battle, CHIKORITA waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling POKéMON and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BAYLEEF’s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each tubular leaf is a small shoot of a tree. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The fragrance of MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, this POKéMON gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CYNDAQUIL protects itself by flaring up the flames on its back. The flames are vigorous if the POKéMON is angry. However, if it is tired, the flames splutter fitfully with incomplete combustion.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"QUILAVA keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This POKéMON applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TYPHLOSION obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This POKéMON creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Despite the smallness of its body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While the POKéMON may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Once CROCONAW has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FERALIGATR intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When SENTRET sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this POKéMON becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can slickly squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, this POKéMON is very nimble and fleet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HOOTHOOT has an internal organ that senses and tracks the earth’s rotation. Using this special organ, this POKéMON begins hooting at precisely the same time every day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NOCTOWL never fails at catching prey in darkness. This POKéMON owes its success to its superior vision that allows it to see in minimal light, and to its soft, supple wings that make no sound in flight.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LEDYBA secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This POKéMON conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live LEDIAN in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this - the POKéMON uses the light of the stars as its energy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The web spun by SPINARAK can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this POKéMON can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARIADOS’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This POKéMON constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If this POKéMON is flying by fluttering only a pair of wings on either the forelegs or hind legs, it’s proof that CROBAT has been flying a long distance. It switches the wings it uses if it is tired.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHINCHOU lets loose positive and negative electrical charges from its two antennas to make its prey faint. This POKéMON flashes its electric lights to exchange signals with others.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LANTURN is nicknamed “the deep-sea star” for its illuminated antenna. This POKéMON produces light by causing a chemical reaction between bacteria and its bodily fluids inside the antenna.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PICHU charges itself with electricity more easily on days with thunderclouds or when the air is very dry. You can hear the crackling of static electricity coming off this POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"IGGLYBUFF’s vocal chords are not sufficiently developed. It would hurt its throat if it were to sing too much. This POKéMON gargles with freshwater from a clean stream.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"As its energy, TOGEPI uses the positive emotions of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and POKéMON. This POKéMON stores up feelings of happiness inside its shell, then shares them with others.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TOGETIC is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When the POKéMON spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NATU cannot fly because its wings are not yet fully grown. If your eyes meet with this POKéMON’s eyes, it will stare back intently at you. But if you move even slightly, it will hop away to safety.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"XATU stands rooted and still in one spot all day long. People believe that this POKéMON does so out of fear of the terrible things it has foreseen in the future.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAREEP’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail grows.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FLAAFFY’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AMPHAROS gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used the light of this POKéMON to send signals back and forth with others far away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When BELLOSSOM gets exposed to plenty of sunlight, the leaves ringing its body begin to spin around. This POKéMON’s dancing is renowned in the southern lands.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MARILL’s oil-filled tail acts much like a life preserver. If you see just its tail bobbing on the water’s surface, it’s a sure indication that this POKéMON is diving beneath the water to feed on aquatic plants.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AZUMARILL’s long ears are indispensable sensors. By focusing its hearing, this POKéMON can identify what kinds of prey are around, even in rough and fast-running rivers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The curled hair on POLITOED’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this POKéMON earns from its peers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, HOPPIP links its leaves with other HOPPIP to prepare against being blown away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SKIPLOOM’s flower blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. How much the flower opens depends on the temperature. For that reason, this POKéMON is sometimes used as a thermometer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JUMPLUFF rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The POKéMON descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AIPOM’s tail ends in a hand-like appendage that can be cleverly manipulated. However, because the POKéMON uses its tail so much, its real hands have become rather clumsy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUNKERN tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUNFLORA converts solar energy into nutrition. It moves around actively in the daytime when it is warm. It stops moving as soon as the sun goes down for the night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"YANMA is capable of seeing 360 degrees without having to move its eyes. It is a great flier that is adept at making sudden stops and turning midair. This POKéMON uses its flying ability to quickly chase down targeted prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WOOPER usually lives in water. However, it occasionally comes out onto land in search of food. On land, it coats its body with a gooey, toxic film.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"QUAGSIRE hunts for food by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in unaware. Because the POKéMON does not move, it does not get very hungry.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said that this POKéMON developed its precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"UMBREON evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MURKROW was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This POKéMON shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SLOWKING undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this POKéMON apparently forgets everything it has learned if the SHELLDER on its head comes off.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The POKéMON apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is shaped like ancient writing. It is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN. Research into this topic is ongoing but nothing is known.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If two or more WOBBUFFET meet, they will turn competitive and try to outdo each other’s endurance. However, they may try to see which one can endure the longest without food. TRAINERS need to beware of this habit.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GIRAFARIG’s rear head also has a brain, but it is small. The rear head attacks in response to smells and sounds. Approaching this POKéMON from behind can cause the rear head to suddenly lash out and bite.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PINECO hangs from a tree branch and patiently waits for prey to come along. If the POKéMON is disturbed while eating by someone shaking its tree, it drops down to the ground and explodes with no warning.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FORRETRESS conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the POKéMON is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DUNSPARCE has a drill for its tail. It uses this tail to burrow into the ground backwards. This POKéMON is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GLIGAR glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This POKéMON hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STEELIX lives even further underground than ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig towards the earth’s core. There are records of this POKéMON reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, SNUBBULL sends smaller POKéMON scurrying away in terror. However, this POKéMON seems a little sad at making its foes flee.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GRANBULL has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the POKéMON to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"QWILFISH sucks in water, inflating itself. This POKéMON uses the pressure of the water it swallowed to shoot toxic quills all at once from all over its body. It finds swimming somewhat challenging.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This POKéMON flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SHUCKLE quietly hides itself under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its hard shell while eating berries it has stored away. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HERACROSS charges in a straight line at its foe, slips beneath the foe’s grasp, and then scoops up and hurls the opponent with its mighty horn. This POKéMON even has enough power to topple a massive tree.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SNEASEL scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. This POKéMON seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON likes to lick its palms that are sweetened by being soaked in honey. TEDDIURSA concocts its own honey by blending fruits and pollen collected by BEEDRILL.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the forests inhabited by URSARING, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where they gather food. This POKéMON walks through its forest gathering food every day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Molten magma courses throughout SLUGMA’s circulatory system. If this POKéMON is chilled, the magma cools and hardens. Its body turns brittle and chunks fall off, reducing its size.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAGCARGO’s shell is actually its skin that hardened as a result of cooling. Its shell is very brittle and fragile - just touching it causes it to crumble apart. This POKéMON returns to its original size by dipping itself in magma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SWINUB roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under the cover of dead grass. This POKéMON occasionally roots out hot springs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This POKéMON uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CORSOLA’s branches glitter very beautifully in seven colors when they catch sunlight. If any branch breaks off, this POKéMON grows it back in just one night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"REMORAID sucks in water, then expels it at high velocity using its abdominal muscles to shoot down flying prey. When evolution draws near, this POKéMON travels downstream from rivers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"OCTILLERY grabs onto its foe using its tentacles. This POKéMON tries to immobilize it before delivering the finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be too strong, OCTILLERY spews ink to escape.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DELIBIRD carries its food bundled up in its tail. There once was a famous explorer who managed to reach the peak of Mt. Everest thanks to one of these POKéMON sharing its food.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SKARMORY is entirely encased in hard, protective armor. This POKéMON flies at close to 190 mph. It slashes foes with its wings that possess swordlike cutting edges.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HOUNDOUR hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KINGDRA lives at extreme ocean depths that are otherwise uninhabited. It has long been believed that the yawning of this POKéMON creates spiraling ocean currents.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"For its nest, PHANPY digs a vertical pit in the ground at the edge of a river. It marks the area around its nest with its trunk to let the others know that the area has been claimed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DONPHAN’s favorite attack is curling its body into a ball, then charging at its foe while rolling at high speed. Once it starts rolling, this POKéMON can’t stop very easily.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PORYGON2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made POKéMON has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SMEARGLE marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TYROGUE becomes stressed out if it does not get to train every day. When raising this POKéMON, the TRAINER must establish and uphold various training methods.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HITMONTOP spins on its head at high speed, all the while delivering kicks. This technique is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense at the same time. The POKéMON travels faster spinning than it does walking.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SMOOCHUM actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ELEKID stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this POKéMON begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAGBY’s state of health is determined by observing the fire it breathes. If the POKéMON is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MILTANK gives over five gallons of milk on a daily basis. Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and grown-ups alike. People who can’t drink milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BLISSEY senses sadness with its fluffy coat of fur. If it does so, this POKéMON will rush over to the sad person, however far they may be, to share an egg of happiness that brings a smile to any face.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. The roars of this POKéMON send shock waves shuddering through the air and shake the ground as if lightning bolts had come crashing down.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ENTEI embodies the passion of magma. This POKéMON is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It sends up massive bursts of fire that utterly consume all that they touch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUICUNE embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gracefulness. This POKéMON has the power to purify dirty water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this POKéMON must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, LARVITAR cannot see its parent’s face.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable - it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TYRANITAR is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. This POKéMON wanders about in mountains seeking new opponents to fight.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUGIA’s wings pack devastating power - a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart regular houses. As a result, this POKéMON chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HO-OH’s feathers glow in seven colors depending on the angle at which they are struck by light. These feathers are said to bring happiness to the bearers. This POKéMON is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TREECKO has small hooks on the bottom of its feet that enable it to scale vertical walls. This POKéMON attacks by slamming foes with its thick tail.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The leaves growing out of GROVYLE’s body are convenient for camouflaging it from enemies in the forest. This POKéMON is a master at climbing trees in jungles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The leaves growing on SCEPTILE’s body are very sharp edged. This POKéMON is very agile - it leaps all over the branches of trees and jumps on its foe from above or behind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TORCHIC sticks with its TRAINER, following behind with unsteady steps. This POKéMON breathes fire of over 1,800 degrees F, including fireballs that leave the foe scorched black.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"COMBUSKEN toughens up its legs and thighs by running through fields and mountains. This POKéMON’s legs possess both speed and power, enabling it to dole out ten kicks in one second.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In battle, BLAZIKEN blows out intense flames from its wrists and attacks foes courageously. The stronger the foe, the more intensely this POKéMON’s wrists burn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The fin on MUDKIP’s head acts as highly sensitive radar. Using this fin to sense movements of water and air, this POKéMON can determine what is taking place around it without using its eyes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The surface of MARSHTOMP’s body is enveloped by a thin, sticky film that enables it to live on land. This POKéMON plays in mud on beaches when the ocean tide is low.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SWAMPERT is very strong. It has enough power to easily drag a boulder weighing more than a ton. This POKéMON also has powerful vision that lets it see even in murky water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At first sight, POOCHYENA takes a bite at anything that moves. This POKéMON chases after prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it may turn tail if the prey strikes back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MIGHTYENA gives obvious signals when it is preparing to attack. It starts to growl deeply and then flattens its body. This POKéMON will bite savagely with its sharply pointed fangs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ZIGZAGOON restlessly wanders everywhere at all times. This POKéMON does so because it is very curious. It becomes interested in anything that it happens to see.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LINOONE always runs full speed and only in straight lines. If facing an obstacle, it makes a right-angle turn to evade it. This POKéMON is very challenged by gently curving roads.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Using the spikes on its rear end, WURMPLE peels the bark off trees and feeds on the sap that oozes out. This POKéMON’s feet are tipped with suction pads that allow it to cling to glass without slipping.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SILCOON tethers itself to a tree branch using silk to keep from falling. There, this POKéMON hangs quietly while it awaits evolution. It peers out of the silk cocoon through a small hole.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BEAUTIFLY’s favorite food is the sweet pollen of flowers. If you want to see this POKéMON, just leave a potted flower by an open window. BEAUTIFLY is sure to come looking for pollen.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CASCOON makes its protective cocoon by wrapping its body entirely with a fine silk from its mouth. Once the silk goes around its body, it hardens. This POKéMON prepares for its evolution inside the cocoon.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DUSTOX is instinctively drawn to light. Swarms of this POKéMON are attracted by the bright lights of cities, where they wreak havoc by stripping the leaves off roadside trees for food.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LOTAD live in ponds and lakes, where they float on the surface. It grows weak if its broad leaf dies. On rare occasions, this POKéMON travels on land in search of clean water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LOMBRE is nocturnal - it will get active after dusk. It is also a mischief-maker. When this POKéMON spots anglers, it tugs on their fishing lines from beneath the surface and enjoys their consternation.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUDICOLO begins dancing as soon as it hears cheerful, festive music. This POKéMON is said to appear when it hears the singing of children on hiking outings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEEDOT attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. It sucks moisture from the tree while hanging off the branch. The more water it drinks, the glossier this POKéMON’s body becomes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NUZLEAF live in densely overgrown forests. They occasionally venture out of the forest to startle people. This POKéMON dislikes having its long nose pinched.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SHIFTRY is a mysterious POKéMON that is said to live atop towering trees dating back over a thousand years. It creates terrific windstorms with the fans it holds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TAILLOW courageously stands its ground against foes, however strong they may be. This gutsy POKéMON will remain defiant even after a loss. On the other hand, it cries loudly if it becomes hungry.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SWELLOW flies high above our heads, making graceful arcs in the sky. This POKéMON dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. The hapless prey is tightly grasped by SWELLOW’s clawed feet, preventing escape.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WINGULL has the habit of carrying prey and valuables in its beak and hiding them in all sorts of locations. This POKéMON rides the winds and flies as if it were skating across the sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PELIPPER is a flying transporter that carries small POKéMON and eggs inside its massive bill. This POKéMON builds its nest on steep cliffs facing the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RALTS senses the emotions of people using the horns on its head. This POKéMON rarely appears before people. But when it does, it draws closer if it senses that the person has a positive disposition.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that a KIRLIA that is exposed to the positive emotions of its TRAINER grows beautiful. This POKéMON controls psychokinetic powers with its highly developed brain.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GARDEVOIR has the ability to read the future. If it senses impending danger to its TRAINER, this POKéMON is said to unleash its psychokinetic energy at full power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"From the tips of its feet, SURSKIT secretes an oil that enables it to walk on water as if it were skating. This POKéMON feeds on microscopic organisms in ponds and lakes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MASQUERAIN intimidates enemies with the eyelike patterns on its antennas. This POKéMON flaps its four wings to freely fly in any direction - even sideways and backwards - as if it were a helicopter.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SHROOMISH live in damp soil in the dark depths of forests. They are often found keeping still under fallen leaves. This POKéMON feeds on compost that is made up of fallen, rotted leaves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BRELOOM closes in on its foe with light and sprightly footwork, then throws punches with its stretchy arms. This POKéMON’s fighting technique puts boxers to shame.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SLAKOTH lolls around for over twenty hours every day. Because it moves so little, it does not need much food. This POKéMON’s sole daily meal consists of just three leaves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VIGOROTH is always itching and agitated to go on a wild rampage. It simply can’t tolerate sitting still for even a minute. This POKéMON’s stress level rises if it can’t be moving constantly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SLAKING spends all day lying down and lolling about. It eats grass growing within its reach. If it eats all the grass it can reach, this POKéMON reluctantly moves to another spot.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NINCADA lives underground for many years in complete darkness. This POKéMON absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees. It stays motionless as it waits for evolution.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NINJASK moves around at such a high speed that it cannot be seen, even while its crying can be clearly heard. For that reason, this POKéMON was long believed to be invisible.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SHEDINJA’s hard body doesn’t move - not even a twitch. In fact, its body appears to be merely a hollow shell. It is believed that this POKéMON will steal the spirit of anyone peering into its hollow body from its back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Normally, WHISMUR’s voice is very quiet - it is barely audible even if one is paying close attention. However, if this POKéMON senses danger, it starts crying at an earsplitting volume.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LOUDRED’s bellowing can completely decimate a wood-frame house. It uses its voice to punish its foes. This POKéMON’s round ears serve as loudspeakers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"EXPLOUD triggers earthquakes with the tremors it creates by bellowing. If this POKéMON violently inhales from the ports on its body, it’s a sign that it is preparing to let loose a huge bellow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAKUHITA is tenacious - it will keep getting up and attacking its foe however many times it is knocked down. Every time it gets back up, this POKéMON stores more energy in its body for evolving.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HARIYAMA practices its straight-arm slaps in any number of locations. One hit of this POKéMON’s powerful, openhanded, straight-arm punches could snap a telephone pole in two.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AZURILL spins its tail as if it were a lasso, then hurls it far. The momentum of the throw sends its body flying, too. Using this unique action, one of these POKéMON managed to hurl itself a record 33 feet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NOSEPASS’s magnetic nose is always pointed to the north. If two of these POKéMON meet, they cannot turn their faces to each other when they are close because their magnetic noses repel one another.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SKITTY has the habit of becoming fascinated by moving objects and chasing them around. This POKéMON is known to chase after its own tail and become dizzy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DELCATTY prefers to live an unfettered existence in which it can do as it pleases at its own pace. Because this POKéMON eats and sleeps whenever it decides, its daily routines are completely random.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SABLEYE lead quiet lives deep inside caverns. They are feared, however, because these POKéMON are thought to steal the spirits of people when their eyes burn with a sinister glow in the darkness.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MAWHILE’s huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed. Its docile-looking face serves to lull its foe into letting down its guard. When the foe least expects it, MAWHILE chomps it with its gaping jaws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON has a body of steel. To make its body, ARON feeds on iron ore that it digs from mountains. Occasionally, it causes major trouble by eating bridges and rails.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LAIRON tempers its steel body by drinking highly nutritious mineral springwater until it is bloated. This POKéMON makes its nest close to springs of delicious water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AGGRON claims an entire mountain as its own territory. It mercilessly beats up anything that violates its environment. This POKéMON vigilantly patrols its territory at all times.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEDITITE undertakes rigorous mental training deep in the mountains. However, whenever it meditates, this POKéMON always loses its concentration and focus. As a result, its training never ends.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that through meditation, MEDICHAM heightens energy inside its body and sharpens its sixth sense. This POKéMON hides its presence by merging itself with fields and mountains.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ELECTRIKE stores electricity in its long body hair. This POKéMON stimulates its leg muscles with electric charges. These jolts of power give its legs explosive acceleration performance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MANECTRIC is constantly discharging electricity from its mane. The sparks sometimes ignite forest fires. When it enters a battle, this POKéMON creates thunderclouds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PLUSLE always acts as a cheerleader for its partners. Whenever a teammate puts out a good effort in battle, this POKéMON shorts out its body to create the crackling noises of sparks to show its joy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MINUN is more concerned about cheering on its partners than its own safety. It shorts out the electricity in its body to create brilliant showers of sparks to cheer on its teammates.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"With the arrival of night, VOLBEAT emits light from its tail. It communicates with others by adjusting the intensity and flashing of its light. This POKéMON is attracted by the sweet aroma of ILLUMISE.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ILLUMISE attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT using a sweet fragrance. Once the VOLBEAT have gathered, this POKéMON leads the lit-up swarm in drawing geometric designs on the canvas of the night sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ROSELIA shoots sharp thorns as projectiles at any opponent that tries to steal the flowers on its arms. The aroma of this POKéMON brings serenity to living things.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Virtually all of GULPIN’s body is its stomach. As a result, it can swallow something its own size. This POKéMON’s stomach contains a special fluid that digests anything.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When SWALOT spots prey, it spurts out a hideously toxic fluid from its pores and sprays the target. Once the prey has weakened, this POKéMON gulps it down whole with its cavernous mouth.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CARVANHA’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Nicknamed “the bully of the sea,” SHARPEDO is widely feared. Its cruel fangs grow back immediately if they snap off. Just one of these POKéMON can thoroughly tear apart a supertanker.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WAILMER’s nostrils are located above its eyes. This playful POKéMON loves to startle people by forcefully snorting out seawater it stores inside its body out of its nostrils.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WAILORD is the largest of all identified POKéMON up to now. This giant POKéMON swims languorously in the vast open sea, eating massive amounts of food at once with its enormous mouth.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"NUMEL is extremely dull witted - it doesn’t notice being hit. However, it can’t stand hunger for even a second. This POKéMON’s body is a seething cauldron of boiling magma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CAMERUPT has a volcano inside its body. Magma of 18,000 degrees F courses through its body. Occasionally, the humps on this POKéMON’s back erupt, spewing the superheated magma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TORKOAL digs through mountains in search of coal. If it finds some, it fills hollow spaces on its shell with the coal and burns it. If it is attacked, this POKéMON spouts thick black smoke to beat a retreat.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SPOINK bounces around on its tail. The shock of its bouncing makes its heart pump. As a result, this POKéMON cannot afford to stop bouncing - if it stops, its heart will stop.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GRUMPIG uses the black pearls on its body to amplify its psychic power waves for gaining total control over its foe. When this POKéMON uses its special power, its snorting breath grows labored.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"All the SPINDA that exist in the world are said to have utterly unique spot patterns. The shaky, tottering steps of this POKéMON give it the appearance of dancing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TRAPINCH’s nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit dug in sand. This POKéMON patiently waits for prey to tumble down the pit. Its giant jaws have enough strength to crush even boulders.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To make prey faint, VIBRAVA generates ultrasonic waves by vigorously making its two wings vibrate. This POKéMON’s ultrasonic waves are so powerful, they can bring on headaches in people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FLYGON is nicknamed “the elemental spirit of the desert.” Because its flapping wings whip up a cloud of sand, this POKéMON is always enveloped in a sandstorm while flying.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CACNEA lives in arid locations such as deserts. It releases a strong aroma from its flower to attract prey. When prey comes near, this POKéMON shoots sharp thorns from its body to bring the victim down.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"During the daytime, CACTURNE remains unmoving so that it does not lose any moisture to the harsh desert sun. This POKéMON becomes active at night when the temperature drops.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SWABLU has light and fluffy wings that are like cottony clouds. This POKéMON is not frightened of people. It lands on the heads of people and sits there like a cotton-fluff hat.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ALTARIA dances and wheels through the sky among billowing, cotton-like clouds. By singing melodies in its crystal-clear voice, this POKéMON makes its listeners experience dreamy wonderment.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Memories of battling its arch-rival SEVIPER are etched into every cell of ZANGOOSE’s body. This POKéMON adroitly dodges attacks with incredible agility.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEVIPER shares a generations-long feud with ZANGOOSE. The scars on its body are evidence of vicious battles. This POKéMON attacks using its sword-edged tail.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUNATONE was discovered at a location where a meteorite fell. As a result, some people theorize that this POKéMON came from space. However, no one has been able to prove this theory so far.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SOLROCK is a new species of POKéMON that is said to have fallen from space. It floats in air and moves silently. In battle, this POKéMON releases intensely bright light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BARBOACH’s sensitive whiskers serve as a superb radar system. This POKéMON hides in mud, leaving only its two whiskers exposed while it waits for prey to come along.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WHISCASH is extremely territorial. Just one of these POKéMON will claim a large pond as its exclusive territory. If a foe approaches it, it thrashes about and triggers a massive earthquake.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CORPHISH were originally foreign POKéMON that were imported as pets. They eventually turned up in the wild. This POKéMON is very hardy and has greatly increased its population.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CRAWDAUNT has an extremely violent nature that compels it to challenge other living things to battle. Other life-forms refuse to live in ponds inhabited by this POKéMON, making them desolate places.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BALTOY moves while spinning around on its one foot. Primitive wall paintings depicting this POKéMON living among people were discovered in some ancient ruins.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CLAYDOL are said to be dolls of mud made by primitive humans and brought to life by exposure to a mysterious ray. This POKéMON moves about while levitating.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LILEEP became extinct approximately a hundred million years ago. This ancient POKéMON attaches itself to a rock on the seafloor and catches approaching prey using tentacles shaped like flower petals.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CRADILY roams around the ocean floor in search of food. This POKéMON freely extends its tree trunk-like neck and captures unwary prey using its eight tentacles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ANORITH was regenerated from a prehistoric fossil. This primitive POKéMON once lived in warm seas. It grips its prey firmly between its two large claws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARMALDO’s tough armor makes all attacks bounce off. This POKéMON’s two enormous claws can be freely extended or contracted. They have the power to punch right through a steel slab.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FEEBAS’s fins are ragged and tattered from the start of its life. Because of its shoddy appearance, this POKéMON is largely ignored. It is capable of living in both the sea and in rivers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MILOTIC is said to be the most beautiful of all the POKéMON. It has the power to becalm such emotions as anger and hostility to quell bitter feuding.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CASTFORM’s appearance changes with the weather. This POKéMON gained the ability to use the vast power of nature to protect its tiny body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KECLEON is capable of changing its body colors at will to blend in with its surroundings. There is one exception - this POKéMON can’t change the zigzag pattern on its belly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SHUPPET is attracted by feelings of jealousy and vindictiveness. If someone develops strong feelings of vengeance, this POKéMON will appear in a swarm and line up beneath the eaves of that person’s home.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BANETTE generates energy for laying strong curses by sticking pins into its own body. This POKéMON was originally a pitiful plush doll that was thrown away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DUSKULL can pass through any wall no matter how thick it may be. Once this POKéMON chooses a target, it will doggedly pursue the intended victim until the break of dawn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DUSCLOPS’s body is completely hollow - there is nothing at all inside. It is said that its body is like a black hole. This POKéMON will absorb anything into its body, but nothing will ever come back out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The bunches of fruit around TROPIUS’s neck are very popular with children. This POKéMON loves fruit, and eats it continuously. Apparently, its love for fruit resulted in its own outgrowth of fruit.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHIMECHO makes its cries echo inside its hollow body. When this POKéMON becomes enraged, its cries result in ultrasonic waves that have the power to knock foes flying.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Every time ABSOL appears before people, it is followed by a disaster such as an earthquake or a tidal wave. As a result, it came to be known as the disaster POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WYNAUT can always be seen with a big, happy smile on its face. Look at its tail to determine if it is angry. When angered, this POKéMON will be slapping the ground with its tail.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SNORUNT live in regions with heavy snowfall. In seasons without snow, such as spring and summer, this POKéMON steals away to live quietly among stalactites and stalagmites deep in caverns.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GLALIE has a body made of rock, which it hardens with an armor of ice. This POKéMON has the ability to freeze moisture in the atmosphere into any shape it desires.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SPHEAL is much faster rolling than walking to get around. When groups of this POKéMON eat, they all clap at once to show their pleasure. Because of this, their mealtimes are noisy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEALEO has the habit of always juggling on the tip of its nose anything it sees for the first time. This POKéMON occasionally entertains itself by balancing and rolling a SPHEAL on its nose.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WALREIN’s two massively developed tusks can totally shatter blocks of ice weighing ten tons with one blow. This POKéMON’s thick coat of blubber insulates it from subzero temperatures.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CLAMPERL’s sturdy shell is not only good for protection - it is also used for clamping and catching prey. A fully grown CLAMPERL’s shell will be scored with nicks and scratches all over.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HUNTAIL’s presence went unnoticed by people for a long time because it lives at extreme depths in the sea. This POKéMON’s eyes can see clearly even in the murky dark depths of the ocean.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GOREBYSS lives in the southern seas at extreme depths. Its body is built to withstand the enormous pressure of water at incredible depths. Because of this, this POKéMON’s body is unharmed by ordinary attacks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RELICANTH is a POKéMON species that existed for a hundred million years without ever changing its form. This ancient POKéMON feeds on microscopic organisms with its toothless mouth.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUVDISC live in shallow seas in the tropics. This heart-shaped POKéMON earned its name by swimming after loving couples it spotted in the ocean’s waves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"BAGON has a dream of one day soaring in the sky. In doomed efforts to fly, this POKéMON hurls itself off cliffs. As a result of its dives, its head has grown tough and as hard as tempered steel.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Inside SHELGON’s armor-like shell, cells are in the midst of transformation to create an entirely new body. This POKéMON’s shell is extremely heavy, making its movements sluggish.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SALAMENCE came about as a result of a strong, long-held dream of growing wings. It is said that this powerful desire triggered a sudden mutation in this POKéMON’s cells, causing it to sprout its magnificent wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Instead of blood, a powerful magnetic force courses throughout BELDUM’s body. This POKéMON communicates with others by sending controlled pulses of magnetism.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this POKéMON generates strong psychokinetic power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"METAGROSS has four brains in total. Combined, the four brains can breeze through difficult calculations faster than a supercomputer. This POKéMON can float in the air by tucking in its four legs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"REGIROCK was sealed away by people long ago. If this POKéMON’s body is damaged in battle, it is said to seek out suitable rocks on its own to repair itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"REGICE’s body was made during an ice age. The deep-frozen body can’t be melted, even by fire. This POKéMON controls frigid air of minus 328 degrees F.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"REGISTEEL has a body that is harder than any kind of metal. Its body is apparently hollow. No one has any idea what this POKéMON eats.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LATIAS is highly sensitive to the emotions of people. If it senses any hostility, this POKéMON ruffles the feathers all over its body and cries shrilly to intimidate the foe.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LATIOS has the ability to make its foe see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This POKéMON is intelligent and understands human speech.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KYOGRE has the power to create massive rain clouds that cover the entire sky and bring about torrential downpours. This POKéMON saved people who were suffering from droughts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GROUDON has long been described in mythology as the POKéMON that raised lands and expanded continents. This POKéMON took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with KYOGRE.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RAYQUAZA lived for hundreds of millions of years in the earth’s ozone layer, never descending to the ground. This POKéMON appears to feed on water and particles in the atmosphere.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A legend states that JIRACHI will make true any wish that is written on notes attached to its head when it awakens. If this POKéMON senses danger, it will fight without awakening.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The DNA of a space virus underwent a sudden mutation upon exposure to a laser beam and resulted in DEOXYS. The crystalline organ on this POKéMON’s chest appears to be its brain.","esFrom":"omegaruby"}],"sapphire":[null,{"en":"BULBASAUR can be seen napping in bright sunlight. There is a seed on its back. By soaking up the sun’s rays, the seed grows progressively larger.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"There is a bud on this POKéMON’s back. To support its weight, IVYSAUR’s legs and trunk grow thick and strong. If it starts spending more time lying in the sunlight, it’s a sign that the bud will bloom into a large flower soon.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"There is a large flower on VENUSAUR’s back. The flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The flame that burns at the tip of its tail is an indication of its emotions. The flame wavers when CHARMANDER is enjoying itself. If the POKéMON becomes enraged, the flame burns fiercely.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CHARMELEON mercilessly destroys its foes using its sharp claws. If it encounters a strong foe, it turns aggressive. In this excited state, the flame at the tip of its tail flares with a bluish white color.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CHARIZARD flies around the sky in search of powerful opponents. It breathes fire of such great heat that it melts anything. However, it never turns its fiery breath on any opponent weaker than itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SQUIRTLE’s shell is not merely used for protection. The shell’s rounded shape and the grooves on its surface help minimize resistance in water, enabling this POKéMON to swim at high speeds.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its tail is large and covered with a rich, thick fur. The tail becomes increasingly deeper in color as WARTORTLE ages. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness as a battler.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BLASTOISE has water spouts that protrude from its shell. The water spouts are very accurate. They can shoot bullets of water with enough accuracy to strike empty cans from a distance of over 160 feet.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The shell covering this POKéMON’s body is as hard as an iron slab. METAPOD does not move very much. It stays still because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the hard shell.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BUTTERFREE has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can even search out, extract, and carry honey from flowers that are blooming over six miles from its nest.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WEEDLE has an extremely acute sense of smell. It is capable of distinguishing its favorite kinds of leaves from those it dislikes just by sniffing with its big red proboscis (nose).","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KAKUNA remains virtually immobile as it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it is extremely busy as it prepares for its coming evolution. This is evident from how hot the shell becomes to the touch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. No one should ever approach its nest - this is for their own safety. If angered, they will attack in a furious swarm.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PIDGEY has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It is capable of unerringly returning home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PIDGEOTTO claims a large area as its own territory. This POKéMON flies around, patrolling its living space. If its territory is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON has a dazzling plumage of beautifully glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are captivated by the striking beauty of the feathers on its head, compelling them to choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RATTATA is cautious in the extreme. Even while it is asleep, it constantly listens by moving its ears around. It is not picky about where it lives - it will make its nest anywhere.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RATICATE’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SPEAROW has a very loud cry that can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FEAROW is recognized by its long neck and elongated beak. They are conveniently shaped for catching prey in soil or water. It deftly moves its long and skinny beak to pluck prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. Assuming this position allows it to quickly respond to a threat from any direction with a glare from its upraised head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON is terrifically strong in order to constrict things with its body. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once ARBOK wraps its body around its foe, escaping its crunching embrace is impossible.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON has electricity-storing pouches on its cheeks. These appear to become electrically charged during the night while PIKACHU sleeps. It occasionally discharges electricity when it is dozy after waking up.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON exudes a weak electrical charge from all over its body that makes it take on a slight glow in darkness. RAICHU searches for electricity by planting its tail in the ground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SANDSHREW has a very dry hide that is extremely tough. The POKéMON can roll into a ball that repels any attack. At night, it burrows into the desert sand to sleep.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SANDSLASH can roll up its body as if it were a ball covered with large spikes. In battle, this POKéMON will try to make the foe flinch by jabbing it with its spines. It then leaps at the stunned foe to tear wildly with its sharp claws.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NIDORAN has barbs that secrete a powerful poison. They are thought to have developed as protection for this small-bodied POKéMON. When enraged, it releases a horrible toxin from its horn.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When NIDORINA are with their friends or family, they keep their barbs tucked away to prevent hurting each other. This POKéMON appears to become nervous if separated from the others.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NIDOQUEEN’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The male NIDORAN has developed muscles for moving its ears. Thanks to them, the ears can be freely moved in any direction. Even the slightest sound does not escape this POKéMON’s notice.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NIDORINO has a horn that is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this POKéMON goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"On every night of a full moon, groups of this POKéMON come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY return to their quiet mountain retreats and go to sleep nestled up against each other.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CLEFABLE moves by skipping lightly as if it were flying using its wings. Its bouncy step lets it even walk on water. It is known to take strolls on lakes on quiet, moonlit nights.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Inside VULPIX’s body burns a flame that never goes out. During the daytime, when the temperatures rise, this POKéMON releases flames from its mouth to prevent its body from growing too hot.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Legend has it that NINETALES came into being when nine wizards possessing sacred powers merged into one. This POKéMON is highly intelligent - it can understand human speech.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When this POKéMON sings, it never pauses to breathe. If it is in a battle against an opponent that does not easily fall asleep, JIGGLYPUFF cannot breathe, endangering its life.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WIGGLYTUFF’s body is very flexible. By inhaling deeply, this POKéMON can inflate itself seemingly without end. Once inflated, WIGGLYTUFF bounces along lightly like a balloon.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ZUBAT avoids sunlight because exposure causes it to become unhealthy. During the daytime, it stays in caves or under the eaves of old houses, sleeping while hanging upside down.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GOLBAT bites down on prey with its four fangs and drinks the victim’s blood. It becomes active on inky dark moonless nights, flying around to attack people and POKéMON.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ODDISH searches for fertile, nutrient-rich soil, then plants itself. During the daytime, while it is planted, this POKéMON’s feet are thought to change shape and become similar to the roots of trees.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"From its mouth GLOOM drips honey that smells absolutely horrible. Apparently, it loves the horrid stench. It sniffs the noxious fumes and then drools even more of its honey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VILEPLUME has the world’s largest petals. They are used to attract prey that are then doused with toxic spores. Once the prey are immobilized, this POKéMON catches and devours them.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PARAS has parasitic mushrooms growing on its back called tochukaso. They grow large by drawing nutrients from this BUG POKéMON host. They are highly valued as a medicine for extending life.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PARASECT is known to infest large trees en masse and drain nutrients from the lower trunk and roots. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VENONAT is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even miniscule prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VENOMOTH is nocturnal - it is a POKéMON that only becomes active at night. Its favorite prey are small insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DIGLETT are raised in most farms. The reason is simple - wherever this POKéMON burrows, the soil is left perfectly tilled for planting crops. This soil is made ideal for growing delicious vegetables.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DUGTRIO are actually triplets that emerged from one body. As a result, each triplet thinks exactly like the other two triplets. They work cooperatively to burrow endlessly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MEOWTH withdraws its sharp claws into its paws to slinkily sneak about without making any incriminating footsteps. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PERSIAN has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the POKéMON’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it uses its mysterious power, PSYDUCK can’t remember having done so. It apparently can’t form a memory of such an event because it goes into an altered state that is much like deep sleep.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GOLDUCK is the fastest swimmer among all POKéMON. It swims effortlessly, even in a rough, stormy sea. It sometimes rescues people from wrecked ships floundering in high seas.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When MANKEY starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When PRIMEAPE becomes furious, its blood circulation is boosted. In turn, its muscles are made even stronger. However, it also becomes much less intelligent at the same time.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GROWLITHE has a superb sense of smell. Once it smells anything, this POKéMON won’t forget the scent, no matter what. It uses its advanced olfactory sense to determine the emotions of other living things.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ARCANINE is known for its high speed. It is said to be capable of running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within this POKéMON’s body is its source of power.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"POLIWAG has a very thin skin. It is possible to see the POKéMON’s spiral innards right through the skin. Despite its thinness, however, the skin is also very flexible. Even sharp fangs bounce right off it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The surface of POLIWHIRL’s body is always wet and slick with an oily fluid. Because of this greasy covering, it can easily slip and slide out of the clutches of any enemy in battle.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ABRA needs to sleep for eighteen hours a day. If it doesn’t, this POKéMON loses its ability to use telekinetic powers. If it is attacked, ABRA escapes using TELEPORT while it is still sleeping.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KADABRA holds a silver spoon in its hand. The spoon is used to amplify the alpha waves in its brain. Without the spoon, the POKéMON is said to be limited to half the usual amount of its telekinetic powers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ALAKAZAM’s brain continually grows, infinitely multiplying brain cells. This amazing brain gives this POKéMON an astoundingly high IQ of 5,000. It has a thorough memory of everything that has occurred in the world.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MACHOP exercises by hefting around a GRAVELER as if it were a barbell. There are some MACHOP that travel the world in a quest to master all kinds of martial arts.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MACHOKE undertakes bodybuilding every day even as it helps people with tough, physically demanding labor. On its days off, this POKéMON heads to the fields and mountains to exercise and train.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MACHAMP is known as the POKéMON that has mastered every kind of martial arts. If it grabs hold of the foe with its four arms, the battle is all but over. The hapless foe is thrown far over the horizon.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, this POKéMON spits a corrosive fluid that melts even iron.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WEEPINBELL has a large hook on its rear end. At night, the POKéMON hooks on to a tree branch and goes to sleep. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VICTREEBEL has a long vine that extends from its head. This vine is waved and flicked about as if it were an animal to attract prey. When an unsuspecting prey draws near, this POKéMON swallows it whole.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TENTACOOL absorbs sunlight and refracts it using water inside its body to convert it into beam energy. This POKéMON shoots beams from its crystal-like eyes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TENTACRUEL has tentacles that can be freely elongated and shortened at will. It ensnares prey with its tentacles and weakens the prey by dosing it with a harsh toxin. It can catch up to 80 prey at the same time.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When GEODUDE sleeps deeply, it buries itself halfway into the ground. It will not awaken even if hikers step on it unwittingly. In the morning, this POKéMON rolls downhill in search of food.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Rocks are GRAVELER’s favorite food. This POKéMON will climb a mountain from the base to the summit, crunchingly feasting on rocks all the while. Upon reaching the peak, it rolls back down to the bottom.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GOLEM is known for rolling down from mountains. To prevent them from rolling into the homes of people downhill, grooves have been dug into the sides of mountains to serve as guideways for diverting this POKéMON’s course.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. This POKéMON becomes stronger by stumbling and falling to keep up with its parent.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RAPIDASH usually can be seen casually cantering in the fields and plains. However, when this POKéMON turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SLOWPOKE uses its tail to catch prey by dipping it in water at the side of a river. However, this POKéMON often forgets what it’s doing and often spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SLOWBRO’s tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This causes SLOWBRO to grudgingly swim and catch prey instead.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAGNEMITE floats in the air by emitting electromagnetic waves from the units at its sides. These waves block gravity. This POKéMON becomes incapable of flight if its internal electrical supply is depleted.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAGNETON emits a powerful magnetic force that is fatal to electronics and precision instruments. Because of this, it is said that some towns warn people to keep this POKéMON inside a POKé BALL.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FARFETCH’D is always seen with a stick from a plant of some sort. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON has been known to fight with others over sticks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DODUO’s two heads contain completely identical brains. A scientific study reported that on rare occasions, there will be examples of this POKéMON possessing different sets of brains.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Apparently, the heads aren’t the only parts of the body that DODRIO has three of. It has three sets of hearts and lungs as well, so it is capable of running long distances without rest.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEEL hunts for prey in the frigid sea underneath sheets of ice. When it needs to breathe, it punches a hole through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DEWGONG loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GRIMER emerged from the sludge that settled on a polluted seabed. This POKéMON loves anything filthy. It constantly leaks a horribly germ-infested fluid from all over its body.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON’s favorite food is anything that is repugnantly filthy. In dirty towns where people think nothing of throwing away litter on the streets, MUK are certain to gather.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"At night, this POKéMON uses its broad tongue to burrow a hole in the seafloor sand and then sleep in it. While it is sleeping, SHELLDER closes its shell, but leaves its tongue hanging out.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CLOYSTER is capable of swimming in the sea. It does so by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. This POKéMON shoots spikes from its shell using the same system.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GASTLY is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this POKéMON cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HAUNTER is a dangerous POKéMON. If one beckons you while floating in darkness, you must never approach it. This POKéMON will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Sometimes, on a dark night, your shadow thrown by a streetlight will suddenly and startlingly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ONIX has a magnet in its brain. It acts as a compass so that this POKéMON does not lose direction while it is tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes increasingly rounder and smoother.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that one of these POKéMON is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HYPNO holds a pendulum in its hand. The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum lull the foe into a deep state of hypnosis. While this POKéMON searches for prey, it polishes the pendulum.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KRABBY live on beaches, burrowed inside holes dug into the sand. On sandy beaches with little in the way of food, these POKéMON can be seen squabbling with each other over territory.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KINGLER has an enormous, oversized claw. It waves this huge claw in the air to communicate with others. However, because the claw is so heavy, the POKéMON quickly tires.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VOLTORB is extremely sensitive - it explodes at the slightest of shocks. It is rumored that it was first created when a POKé BALL was exposed to a powerful pulse of energy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"One of ELECTRODE’s characteristics is its attraction to electricity. It is a problematical POKéMON that congregates mostly at electrical power plants to feed on electricity that has just been generated.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON consists of six eggs that form a closely knit cluster. The six eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear on the eggs, EXEGGCUTE is close to evolution.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"EXEGGUTOR originally came from the tropics. Its heads steadily grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall off, they group together to form EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CUBONE pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the POKéMON wears are made by the tears it sheds.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE that has overcome its sadness at the loss of its mother and grown tough. This POKéMON’s tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HITMONLEE’s legs freely contract and stretch. Using these springlike legs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its legs and loosens the muscles to overcome fatigue.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Whenever LICKITUNG comes across something new, it will unfailingly give it a lick. It does so because it memorizes things by texture and by taste. It is somewhat put off by sour things.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KOFFING embodies toxic substances. It mixes the toxins with raw garbage to set off a chemical reaction that results in a terribly powerful poison gas. The higher the temperature, the more gas is concocted by this POKéMON.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WEEZING alternately shrinks and inflates its twin bodies to mix together toxic gases inside. The more the gases are mixed, the more powerful the toxins become. The POKéMON also becomes more putrid.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RHYHORN’s brain is very small. It is so dense, while on a run it forgets why it started running in the first place. It apparently remembers sometimes if it demolishes something.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RHYDON has a horn that serves as a drill. It is used for destroying rocks and boulders. This POKéMON occasionally rams into streams of magma, but the armor-like hide prevents it from feeling the heat.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CHANSEY lays nutritionally excellent eggs on an everyday basis. The eggs are so delicious, they are easily and eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TANGELA’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If you come across a young KANGASKHAN playing by itself, you must never disturb it or attempt to catch it. The baby POKéMON’s parent is sure to be in the area, and it will become violently enraged at you.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If HORSEA senses danger, it will reflexively spray a dense black ink from its mouth and try to escape. This POKéMON swims by cleverly flapping the fins on its back.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEADRA generates whirlpools by spinning its body. The whirlpools are strong enough to swallow even fishing boats. This POKéMON weakens prey with these currents, then swallows it whole.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GOLDEEN loves swimming wild and free in rivers and ponds. If one of these POKéMON is placed in an aquarium, it will shatter even the thickest glass with one ram of its horn and make its escape.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEAKING is very protective of its eggs. The male and female will take turns patrolling around their nest and eggs. The guarding of eggs by these POKéMON goes on for over a month.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"STARYU apparently communicates with the stars in the night sky by flashing the red core at the center of its body. If parts of its body are torn, this POKéMON simply regenerates the missing pieces and limbs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"STARMIE swims through water by spinning its star-shaped body as if it were a propeller on a ship. The core at the center of this POKéMON’s body glows in seven colors.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. Its gestures and motions convince watchers that something unseeable actually exists. Once it is believed, it will exist as if it were a real thing.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SCYTHER is blindingly fast. Its blazing speed enhances the effectiveness of the twin scythes on its forearms. This POKéMON’s scythes are so effective, they can slice through thick logs in one wicked stroke.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"JYNX walks rhythmically, swaying and shaking its hips as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without giving any thought to what they are doing.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When a storm arrives, gangs of this POKéMON compete with each other to scale heights that are likely to be stricken by lightning bolts. Some towns use ELECTABUZZ in place of lightning rods.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In battle, MAGMAR blows out intensely hot flames from all over its body to intimidate its opponent. This POKéMON’s fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees in its surroundings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PINSIR has a pair of massive horns Protruding from the surface of these horns are thorns. These thorns are driven deeply into the foe’s body when the pincer closes, making it tough for the foe to escape.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON is not satisfied unless it is rampaging at all times. If there is no opponent for TAUROS to battle, it will charge at thick trees and knock them down to calm itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAGIKARP is virtually useless in battle as it can only splash around. As a result, it is considered to be weak. However, it is actually a very hardy POKéMON that can survive in any body of water no matter how polluted it is.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Once GYARADOS goes on a rampage, its ferociously violent blood doesn’t calm until it has burned everything down. There are records of this POKéMON’s rampages lasting a whole month.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"People have driven LAPRAS almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, this POKéMON is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DITTO rearranges its cell structure to transform itself into other shapes. However, if it tries to transform itself into something by relying on its memory, this POKéMON manages to get details wrong.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to the environment in which it lives. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow it to live underwater. This POKéMON has the ability to freely control water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"JOLTEON’s cells generate a low level of electricity. This power is amplified by the static electricity of its fur, enabling the POKéMON to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur has a functional purpose - it releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. This POKéMON’s body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"OMANYTE is one of the ancient and long-since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by people. If attacked by an enemy, it withdraws itself inside its hard shell.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large and heavy, causing its movements to become too slow and ponderous.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KABUTO is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in extremely rare cases, living examples have been discovered. The POKéMON has not changed at all for 300 million years.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KABUTOPS swam underwater to hunt for its prey in ancient times. The POKéMON was apparently evolving from being a water-dweller to living on land as evident from the beginnings of change in its gills and legs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from genetic material extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies in ancient times.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its expansive belly as a place to play.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ARTICUNO is a legendary bird POKéMON that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this POKéMON flies, snow will fall.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ZAPDOS is a legendary bird POKéMON that has the ability to control electricity. It usually lives in thunderclouds. The POKéMON gains power if it is stricken by lightning bolts.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MOLTRES is a legendary bird POKéMON that has the ability to control fire. If this POKéMON is injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DRATINI continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter weather conditions in its vicinity by discharging energy from the crystals on its neck and tail.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DRAGONITE is capable of circling the globe in just sixteen hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MEWTWO is a POKéMON that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans created this POKéMON’s body, they failed to endow MEWTWO with a compassionate heart.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MEW is said to possess the genetic composition of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In battle, CHIKORITA waves its leaf around to keep the foe at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, becalming the battling POKéMON and creating a cozy, friendly atmosphere all around.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BAYLEEF’s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each tubular leaf is a small shoot of a tree. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The fragrance of MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, this POKéMON gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CYNDAQUIL protects itself by flaring up the flames on its back. The flames are vigorous if the POKéMON is angry. However, if it is tired, the flames splutter fitfully with incomplete combustion.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"QUILAVA keeps its foes at bay with the intensity of its flames and gusts of superheated air. This POKéMON applies its outstanding nimbleness to dodge attacks even while scorching the foe with flames.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TYPHLOSION obscures itself behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intensely hot flames. This POKéMON creates blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Despite the smallness of its body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While the POKéMON may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Once CROCONAW has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FERALIGATR intimidates its foes by opening its huge mouth. In battle, it will kick the ground hard with its thick and powerful hind legs to charge at the foe at an incredible speed.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When SENTRET sleeps, it does so while another stands guard. The sentry wakes the others at the first sign of danger. When this POKéMON becomes separated from its pack, it becomes incapable of sleep due to fear.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can slickly squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, this POKéMON is very nimble and fleet.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HOOTHOOT has an internal organ that senses and tracks the earth’s rotation. Using this special organ, this POKéMON begins hooting at precisely the same time every day.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NOCTOWL never fails at catching prey in darkness. This POKéMON owes its success to its superior vision that allows it to see in minimal light, and to its soft, supple wings that make no sound in flight.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LEDYBA secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This POKéMON conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live LEDIAN in countless numbers. There is a good reason for this - the POKéMON uses the light of the stars as its energy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The web spun by SPINARAK can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that this POKéMON can determine what kind of prey is touching its web just by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web’s strands.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ARIADOS’s feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. This POKéMON constricts the foe with thin and strong silk webbing.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CROBAT sneaks up on its intended prey using wings that barely make a sound. This POKéMON rests by hanging on a tree branch with its rear legs that serve as wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CHINCHOU’s two antennas are filled with cells that generate strong electricity. This POKéMON’s cells create so much electrical power, it even makes itself tingle slightly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LANTURN is known to emit light. If you peer down into the dark sea from a ship at night, you can sometimes see this POKéMON’s light rising from the depths where it swims. It gives the sea an appearance of a starlit night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When PICHU plays with others, it may short out electricity with another PICHU, creating a shower of sparks. In that event, this POKéMON will begin crying, startled by the flash of sparks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance through the night and stop only at the break of day, when these POKéMON quench their thirst with the morning dew.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"IGGLYBUFF has a soft and plushy body that feels very much like a marshmallow. From this body wafts a gently sweet fragrance that soothes and calms the emotions of its foes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"As its energy, TOGEPI uses the positive emotions of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and POKéMON. This POKéMON stores up feelings of happiness inside its shell, then shares them with others.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TOGETIC is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When the POKéMON spots someone who is pure of heart, it is said to appear and share its happiness with that person.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NATU has a highly developed jumping ability. The POKéMON flaps and leaps onto tree branches that are taller than grown-up people to pick at the tree’s new shoots.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"XATU is known to stand motionless while staring at the sun all day long. Some people revere it as a mystical POKéMON out of their belief that XATU is in possession of the power to see into the future.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAREEP’s fluffy coat of wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more static electricity is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail grows.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FLAAFFY’s wool quality changes so that it can generate a high amount of static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare and slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AMPHAROS gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used the light of this POKéMON to send signals back and forth with others far away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A BELLOSSOM grows flowers more beautifully if it has evolved from a smelly GLOOM - the stinkier the better. At night, this POKéMON closes its petals and goes to sleep.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When fishing for food at the edge of a fast-running stream, MARILL wraps its tail around the trunk of a tree. This POKéMON’s tail is flexible and configured to stretch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AZUMARILL can make balloons out of air. It makes these air balloons if it spots a drowning POKéMON. The air balloons enable the POKéMON in trouble to breathe.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SUDOWOODO camouflages itself as a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. However, because the forelegs remain green throughout the year, the POKéMON is easily identified as a fake during the winter.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The curled hair on POLITOED’s head is proof of its status as a king. It is said that the longer and more curled the hair, the more respect this POKéMON earns from its peers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, HOPPIP links its leaves with other HOPPIP to prepare against being blown away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SKIPLOOM’s flower blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. How much the flower opens depends on the temperature. For that reason, this POKéMON is sometimes used as a thermometer.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"JUMPLUFF rides warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. The POKéMON descends to the ground when it encounters cold air while it is floating.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AIPOM’s tail ends in a hand-like appendage that can be cleverly manipulated. However, because the POKéMON uses its tail so much, its real hands have become rather clumsy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SUNKERN tries to move as little as it possibly can. It does so because it tries to conserve all the nutrients it has stored in its body for its evolution. It will not eat a thing, subsisting only on morning dew.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SUNFLORA converts solar energy into nutrition. It moves around actively in the daytime when it is warm. It stops moving as soon as the sun goes down for the night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"YANMA is capable of seeing 360 degrees without having to move its eyes. It is a great flier that is adept at making sudden stops and turning midair. This POKéMON uses its flying ability to quickly chase down targeted prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WOOPER usually lives in water. However, it occasionally comes out onto land in search of food. On land, it coats its body with a gooey, toxic film.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"QUAGSIRE hunts for food by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in unaware. Because the POKéMON does not move, it does not get very hungry.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said that this POKéMON developed its precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"UMBREON evolved as a result of exposure to the moon’s waves. It hides silently in darkness and waits for its foes to make a move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MURKROW was feared and loathed as the alleged bearer of ill fortune. This POKéMON shows strong interest in anything that sparkles or glitters. It will even try to steal rings from women.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SLOWKING undertakes research every day in an effort to solve the mysteries of the world. However, this POKéMON apparently forgets everything it has learned if the SHELLDER on its head comes off.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. The POKéMON apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fearful feelings of foes and turn them into nutrition.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON is shaped like ancient writing. It is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN. Research into this topic is ongoing but nothing is known.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WOBBUFFET does nothing but endure attacks - it won’t attack on its own. However, it won’t endure an attack on its tail. When that happens, the POKéMON will try to take the foe with it using DESTINY BOND.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GIRAFARIG’s rear head contains a tiny brain that is too small for thinking. However, the rear head doesn’t need to sleep, so it can keep watch over its surroundings 24 hours a day.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PINECO hangs from a tree branch and patiently waits for prey to come along. If the POKéMON is disturbed while eating by someone shaking its tree, it drops down to the ground and explodes with no warning.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FORRETRESS conceals itself inside its hardened steel shell. The shell is opened when the POKéMON is catching prey, but it does so at such a quick pace that the shell’s inside cannot be seen.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DUNSPARCE has a drill for its tail. It uses this tail to burrow into the ground backwards. This POKéMON is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GLIGAR glides through the air without a sound as if it were sliding. This POKéMON hangs on to the face of its foe using its clawed hind legs and the large pincers on its forelegs, then injects the prey with its poison barb.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"STEELIX lives even further underground than ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig towards the earth’s core. There are records of this POKéMON reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, SNUBBULL sends smaller POKéMON scurrying away in terror. However, this POKéMON seems a little sad at making its foes flee.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GRANBULL has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The enormous fangs are heavy, causing the POKéMON to tip its head back for balance. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite indiscriminately.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"QWILFISH sucks in water, inflating itself. This POKéMON uses the pressure of the water it swallowed to shoot toxic quills all at once from all over its body. It finds swimming somewhat challenging.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This POKéMON flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SHUCKLE quietly hides itself under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its hard shell while eating berries it has stored away. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HERACROSS has sharp claws on its feet. These are planted firmly into the ground or the bark of a tree, giving the POKéMON a secure and solid footing to forcefully fling away foes with its proud horn.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SNEASEL scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. This POKéMON seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON likes to lick its palms that are sweetened by being soaked in honey. TEDDIURSA concocts its own honey by blending fruits and pollen collected by BEEDRILL.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In the forests inhabited by URSARING, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where they gather food. This POKéMON walks through its forest gathering food every day.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SLUGMA does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this POKéMON’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAGCARGO’s body temperature is approximately 18,000 degrees F. Water is vaporized on contact. If this POKéMON is caught in the rain, the raindrops instantly turn into steam, cloaking the area in a thick fog.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SWINUB roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under the cover of dead grass. This POKéMON occasionally roots out hot springs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair that enables it to endure the freezing cold. This POKéMON uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Clusters of CORSOLA congregate in warm seas where they serve as ideal hiding places for smaller POKéMON. When the water temperature falls, this POKéMON migrates to the southern seas.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"REMORAID sucks in water, then expels it at high velocity using its abdominal muscles to shoot down flying prey. When evolution draws near, this POKéMON travels downstream from rivers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"OCTILLERY grabs onto its foe using its tentacles. This POKéMON tries to immobilize it before delivering the finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be too strong, OCTILLERY spews ink to escape.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DELIBIRD carries its food bundled up in its tail. There once was a famous explorer who managed to reach the peak of Mt. Everest thanks to one of these POKéMON sharing its food.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the sea’s waves. This POKéMON is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SKARMORY’s steel wings become tattered and bashed in from repeated battles. Once a year, the battered wings grow back completely, restoring the cutting edges to their pristine state.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HOUNDOUR hunt as a coordinated pack. They communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is unparalleled.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply towards the back serves a leadership role. These POKéMON choose their leader by fighting amongst themselves.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KINGDRA sleeps on the seafloor where it is otherwise devoid of life. When a storm arrives, the POKéMON is said to awaken and wander about in search of prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PHANPY uses its long nose to shower itself. When others gather around, they thoroughly douse each other with water. These POKéMON can be seen drying their soaking-wet bodies at the edge of water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If DONPHAN were to tackle with its hard body, even a house could be destroyed. Using its massive strength, the POKéMON helps clear rock and mud slides that block mountain trails.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PORYGON2 was created by humans using the power of science. The man-made POKéMON has been endowed with artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SMEARGLE marks the boundaries of its territory using a body fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. Over 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TYROGUE becomes stressed out if it does not get to train every day. When raising this POKéMON, the TRAINER must establish and uphold various training methods.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HITMONTOP spins on its head at high speed, all the while delivering kicks. This technique is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense at the same time. The POKéMON travels faster spinning than it does walking.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SMOOCHUM actively runs about, but also falls quite often. Whenever the chance arrives, it will look for its reflection to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ELEKID stores electricity in its body. If it touches metal and accidentally discharges all its built-up electricity, this POKéMON begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAGBY’s state of health is determined by observing the fire it breathes. If the POKéMON is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MILTANK gives over five gallons of milk on a daily basis. Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and grown-ups alike. People who can’t drink milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BLISSEY senses sadness with its fluffy coat of fur. If it does so, this POKéMON will rush over to the sad person, however far they may be, to share an egg of happiness that brings a smile to any face.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. The roars of this POKéMON send shock waves shuddering through the air and shake the ground as if lightning bolts had come crashing down.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ENTEI embodies the passion of magma. This POKéMON is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It sends up massive bursts of fire that utterly consume all that they touch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SUICUNE embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gracefulness. This POKéMON has the power to purify dirty water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. To come up to the surface, this POKéMON must eat its way through the soil above. Until it does so, LARVITAR cannot see its parent’s face.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it compresses and forcefully ejects to propel itself like a jet. The body is very durable - it avoids damage even if it hits solid steel.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TYRANITAR is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. This POKéMON wanders about in mountains seeking new opponents to fight.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LUGIA’s wings pack devastating power - a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart regular houses. As a result, this POKéMON chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HO-OH’s feathers glow in seven colors depending on the angle at which they are struck by light. These feathers are said to bring happiness to the bearers. This POKéMON is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TREECKO is cool, calm, and collected - it never panics under any situation. If a bigger foe were to glare at this POKéMON, it would glare right back without conceding an inch of ground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON adeptly flies from branch to branch in trees. In a forest, no POKéMON can ever hope to catch a fleeing GROVYLE however fast they may be.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SCEPTILE has seeds growing on its back. They are said to be bursting with nutrients that revitalize trees. This POKéMON raises the trees in a forest with loving care.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TORCHIC has a place inside its body where it keeps its flame. Give it a hug - it will be glowing with warmth. This POKéMON is covered all over by a fluffy coat of down.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"COMBUSKEN battles with the intensely hot flames it spews from its beak and with outstandingly destructive kicks. This POKéMON’s cry is very loud and distracting.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BLAZIKEN has incredibly strong legs - it can easily clear a 30-story building in one leap. This POKéMON’s blazing punches leave its foes scorched and blackened.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In water, MUDKIP breathes using the gills on its cheeks. If it is faced with a tight situation in battle, this POKéMON will unleash its amazing power - it can crush rocks bigger than itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MARSHTOMP is much faster at traveling through mud than it is at swimming. This POKéMON’s hindquarters exhibit obvious development, giving it the ability to walk on just its hind legs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SWAMPERT predicts storms by sensing subtle differences in the sounds of waves and tidal winds with its fins. If a storm is approaching, it piles up boulders to protect itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"POOCHYENA is an omnivore - it will eat anything. A distinguishing feature is how large its fangs are compared to its body. This POKéMON tries to intimidate its foes by making the hair on its tail bristle out.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MIGHTYENA travel and act as a pack in the wild. The memory of its life in the wild compels the POKéMON to obey only those TRAINERS that it recognizes to possess superior skill.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The hair on ZIGZAGOON’s back is bristly. It rubs the hard back hair against trees to leave its territorial markings. This POKéMON may play dead to fool foes in battle.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When hunting, LINOONE will make a beeline straight for the prey at a full run. While this POKéMON is capable of topping 60 mph, it has to come to a screeching halt before it can turn.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WURMPLE is targeted by SWELLOW as prey. This POKéMON will try to resist by pointing the spikes on its rear at the attacking predator. It will weaken the foe by leaking poison from the spikes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SILCOON was thought to endure hunger and not consume anything before its evolution. However, it is now thought that this POKéMON slakes its thirst by drinking rainwater that collects on its silk.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BEAUTIFLY has a long mouth like a coiled needle, which is very convenient for collecting pollen from flowers. This POKéMON rides the spring winds as it flits around gathering pollen.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it is attacked, CASCOON remains motionless however badly it may be hurt. It does so because if it were to move, its body would be weak upon evolution. This POKéMON will also not forget the pain it endured.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When DUSTOX flaps its wings, a fine dust is scattered all over. This dust is actually a powerful poison that will even make a pro wrestler sick. This POKéMON searches for food using its antennae like radar.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LOTAD is said to have dwelled on land before. However, this POKéMON is thought to have returned to water because the leaf on its head grew large and heavy. It now lives by floating atop the water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LOMBRE’s entire body is covered by a slippery, slimy film. It feels horribly unpleasant to be touched by this POKéMON’s hands. LOMBRE is often mistaken for a human child.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Upon hearing an upbeat and cheerful rhythm, the cells in LUDICOLO’s body become very energetic and active. Even in battle, this POKéMON will exhibit an amazing amount of power.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEEDOT looks exactly like an acorn when it is dangling from a tree branch. It startles other POKéMON by suddenly moving. This POKéMON polishes its body once a day using leaves.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON pulls out the leaf on its head and makes a flute with it. The sound of NUZLEAF’s flute strikes fear and uncertainty in the hearts of people lost in a forest.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SHIFTRY’s large fans generate awesome gusts of wind at a speed close to 100 feet per second. The whipped-up wind blows anything away. This POKéMON chooses to live quietly deep in forests.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TAILLOW is young - it has only just left its nest. As a result, it sometimes becomes lonesome and cries at night. This POKéMON feeds on WURMPLE that live in forests.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SWELLOW is very conscientious about the upkeep of its glossy wings. Once two SWELLOW are gathered, they diligently take care of cleaning each other’s wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WINGULL rides updrafts rising from the sea by extending its long and narrow wings to glide. This POKéMON’s long beak is useful for catching prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"PELIPPER searches for food while in flight by skimming the wave tops. This POKéMON dips its large bill in the sea to scoop up food, then swallows everything in one big gulp.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RALTS has the ability to sense the emotions of people. If its TRAINER is in a cheerful mood, this POKéMON grows cheerful and joyous in the same way.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KIRLIA uses the horns on its head to amplify its psychokinetic power. When the POKéMON uses its power, the air around it becomes distorted, creating mirages of nonexistent scenery.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GARDEVOIR has the psychokinetic power to distort the dimensions and create a small black hole. This POKéMON will try to protect its TRAINER even at the risk of its own life.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If SURSKIT senses danger, it secretes a thick, sugary syrup from the tip of its head. There are some POKéMON that love eating this syrup.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MASQUERAIN’s antennas have eyelike patterns that usually give it an angry look. If the “eyes” are droopy and appear sad, it is said to be a sign that a heavy rainfall is on its way.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If SHROOMISH senses danger, it shakes its body and scatters spores from the top of its head. This POKéMON’s spores are so toxic, they make trees and weeds wilt.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The seeds ringing BRELOOM’s tail are made of hardened toxic spores. It is horrible to eat the seeds. Just taking a bite of this POKéMON’s seed will cause your stomach to rumble.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SLAKOTH’s heart beats just once a minute. Whatever happens, it is content to loaf around motionless. It is rare to see this POKéMON in motion.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VIGOROTH is simply incapable of remaining still. Even when it tries to sleep, the blood in its veins grows agitated, compelling this POKéMON to run wild throughout the jungle before it can settle down.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Wherever SLAKING live, rings of over a yard in diameter appear in grassy fields. They are made by the POKéMON as it eats all the grass within reach while lying prone on the ground.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NINCADA lives underground. It uses its sharp claws to carve the roots of trees and absorb moisture and nutrients. This POKéMON can’t withstand bright sunlight so avoids it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If NINJASK is not trained properly, it will refuse to obey the TRAINER and cry loudly continuously. Because of this quality, this POKéMON is said to be one that puts the TRAINER’s abilities to the test.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SHEDINJA is a peculiar POKéMON. It seems to appear unsought in a POKé BALL after a NINCADA evolves. This bizarre POKéMON is entirely immobile - it doesn’t even breathe.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WHISMUR is very timid. If it starts to cry loudly, it becomes startled by its own crying and cries even harder. When it finally stops crying, the POKéMON goes to sleep, all tired out.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LOUDRED shouts while stamping its feet. After it finishes shouting, this POKéMON becomes incapable of hearing anything for a while. This is considered to be a weak point.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"EXPLOUD communicates its feelings to the others by emitting whistle-like sounds from the tubes on its body. This POKéMON only raises its voice when it is in battle.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MAKUHITA has a tireless spirit - it will never give up hope. It eats a lot of food, gets plenty of sleep, and it trains very rigorously. By living that way, this POKéMON packs its body with energy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HARIYAMA’s thick body may appear fat, but it is actually a hunk of solid muscle. If this POKéMON bears down and tightens all its muscles, its body becomes as hard as a rock.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AZURILL’s tail is large and bouncy. It is packed full of the nutrients this POKéMON needs to grow. AZURILL can be seen bouncing and playing on its big, rubbery tail.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NOSEPASS had been said to be completely unmoving, with its magnetic nose pointed due north. However, close observation has revealed that the POKéMON actually moves by a little over 3/8 of an inch every year.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SKITTY is known to chase around playfully after its own tail. In the wild, this POKéMON lives in holes in the trees of forests. It is very popular as a pet because of its adorable looks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DELCATTY sleeps anywhere it wants without keeping a permanent nest. If other POKéMON approach it as it sleeps, this POKéMON will never fight - it will just move away somewhere else.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SABLEYE digs the ground with sharpened claws to find rocks that it eats. Substances in the eaten rocks crystallize and rise up to the POKéMON’s body surface.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Don’t be taken in by this POKéMON’s cute face - it’s very dangerous. MAWILE fools the foe into letting down its guard, then chomps down with its massive jaws. The steel jaws are really horns that have been transformed.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ARON has a body of steel. With one all-out charge, this POKéMON can demolish even a heavy dump truck. The destroyed dump truck then becomes a handy meal for the POKéMON.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LAIRON feeds on iron contained in rocks and water. It makes its nest on mountains where iron ore is buried. As a result, the POKéMON often clashes with humans mining the iron ore.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"AGGRON is surprisingly protective of its environment. If its mountain is ravaged by a landslide or a fire, this POKéMON will haul topsoil to the area, plant trees, and beautifully restore its own territory.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MEDITITE heightens its inner energy through meditation. It survives on just one berry a day. Minimal eating is another aspect of this POKéMON’s training.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Through the power of meditation, MEDICHAM developed its sixth sense. It gained the ability to use psychokinetic powers. This POKéMON is known to meditate for a whole month without eating.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ELECTRIKE runs faster than the human eye can follow. The friction from running is converted into electricity, which is then stored in this POKéMON’s fur.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MANECTRIC discharges strong electricity from its mane. The mane is used for collecting electricity in the atmosphere. This POKéMON creates thunderclouds above its head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When PLUSLE is cheering on its partner, it flashes with electric sparks from all over its body. If its partner loses, this POKéMON cries loudly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MINUN loves to cheer on its partner in battle. It gives off sparks from its body while it is doing so. If its partner is in trouble, this POKéMON gives off increasing amounts of sparks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VOLBEAT’s tail glows like a lightbulb. With other VOLBEAT, it uses its tail to draw geometric shapes in the night sky. This POKéMON loves the sweet aroma given off by ILLUMISE.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ILLUMISE leads a flight of illuminated VOLBEAT to draw signs in the night sky. This POKéMON is said to earn greater respect from its peers by composing more complex designs in the sky.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"On extremely rare occasions, a ROSELIA is said to appear with its flowers in unusual colors. The thorns on this POKéMON’s head contain a vicious poison.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Most of GULPIN’s body is made up of its stomach - its heart and brain are very small in comparison. This POKéMON’s stomach contains special enzymes that dissolve anything.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SWALOT has no teeth, so what it eats, it swallows whole, no matter what. Its cavernous mouth yawns widely. An automobile tire could easily fit inside this POKéMON’s mouth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If anything invades CARVANHA’s territory, it will swarm and tear at the intruder with its pointed fangs. On its own, however, this POKéMON turns suddenly timid.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SHARPEDO can swim at speeds of up to 75 mph by jetting seawater out of its backside. This POKéMON’s drawback is its inability to swim long distances.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WAILMER can store water inside its body to transform itself into a ball for bouncing around on the ground. By filling itself up with more water, this POKéMON can elevate the height of its bounces.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When chasing prey, WAILORD herds them by leaping out of the water and making a humongous splash. It is breathtaking to see this POKéMON leaping out of the sea with others in its pod.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"NUMEL stores magma of almost 2,200 degrees F within its body. If it gets wet, the magma cools and hardens. In that event, the POKéMON’s body grows heavy and its movements become sluggish.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The humps on CAMERUPT’s back are formed by a transformation of its bones. They sometimes blast out molten magma. This POKéMON apparently erupts often when it is enraged.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TORKOAL generates energy by burning coal. It grows weaker as the fire dies down. When it is preparing for battle, this POKéMON burns more coal.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SPOINK keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this POKéMON’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GRUMPIG uses the black pearls on its body to wield its fantastic powers. When it is doing so, it dances bizarrely. This POKéMON’s black pearls are valuable as works of art.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical spot patterns on their hides. This POKéMON moves in a curious manner as if it is stumbling in dizziness. Its lurching movements can cause the opponent to become confused.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"TRAPINCH is a patient hunter. It digs an inescapable pit in a desert and waits for its prey to come tumbling down. This POKéMON can go a whole week without access to any water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"VIBRAVA’s wings have not yet completed the process of growing. Rather than flying long distances, they are more useful for generating ultrasonic waves by vibrating.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"FLYGON whips up a sandstorm by flapping its wings. The wings create a series of notes that sound like singing. Because the “singing” is the only thing that can be heard in a sandstorm, this POKéMON is said to be the desert spirit.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The more arid and harsh the environment, the more pretty and fragrant a flower CACNEA grows. This POKéMON battles by wildly swinging its thorny arms.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If a traveler is going through a desert in the thick of night, CACTURNE will follow in a ragtag group. The POKéMON are biding their time, waiting for the traveler to tire and become incapable of moving.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SWABLU loves to make things clean. If it spots something dirty, it will wipe and polish it with its cottony wings. If its wings become dirty, this POKéMON finds a stream and showers itself.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ALTARIA sings in a gorgeous soprano. Its wings are like cotton clouds. This POKéMON catches updrafts with its buoyant wings and soars way up into the wild blue yonder.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ZANGOOSE usually stays on all fours, but when angered, it gets up on its hind legs and extends its claws. This POKéMON shares a bitter rivalry with SEVIPER that dates back over generations.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEVIPER’s swordlike tail serves two purposes - it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This POKéMON will not give up its long-running blood feud with ZANGOOSE.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LUNATONE becomes active around the time of the full moon. Instead of walking, it moves by floating in midair. The POKéMON’s intimidating red eyes cause all those who see it to become transfixed with fear.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Sunlight is the source of SOLROCK’s power. It is said to possess the ability to read the emotions of others. This POKéMON gives off intense heat while rotating its body.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BARBOACH’s body is covered with a slimy film. If a foe grabs it, this POKéMON just slips out of the enemy’s grip. This POKéMON grows weak if the slimy coating dries up.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If WHISCASH goes on a wild rampage, it sets off a quake-like tremor with a radius of over three miles. This POKéMON has the ability to predict real earthquakes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CORPHISH catches prey with its sharp claws. It has no likes or dislikes when it comes to food - it will eat anything. This POKéMON has no trouble living in filthy water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CRAWDAUNT molts (sheds) its shell regularly. Immediately after molting, its shell is soft and tender. Until the shell hardens, this POKéMON hides in its streambed burrow to avoid attack from its foes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"As soon as it spots others of its kind, BALTOY congregates with them and then begins crying noisily in unison. This POKéMON sleeps while cleverly balancing itself on its one foot.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CLAYDOL is an enigma that appeared from a clay statue made by an ancient civilization dating back 20,000 years. This POKéMON shoots beams from both its hands.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LILEEP is an ancient POKéMON that was regenerated from a fossil. It remains permanently anchored to a rock. From its immobile perch, this POKéMON intently scans for prey with its two eyes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CRADILY’s body serves as an anchor, preventing it from being washed away in rough seas. This POKéMON secretes a strong digestive fluid from its tentacles.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ANORITH is said to be a type of POKéMON predecessor, with eight wings at the sides of its body. This POKéMON swam in the primordial sea by undulating these eight wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ARMALDO is a POKéMON species that became extinct in prehistoric times. This POKéMON is said to have walked on its hind legs, which would have been more convenient for life on land.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"While FEEBAS’s body is in tatters, it has a hardy and tenacious life force that enables it to live anywhere. However, this POKéMON is also slow and dimwitted, making it an easy catch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MILOTIC live at the bottom of large lakes. When this POKéMON’s body glows a vivid pink, it releases a pulsing wave of energy that brings soothing calm to restless spirits.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CASTFORM borrows the power of nature to transform itself into the guises of the sun, rain clouds, and snow clouds. This POKéMON’s feelings change with the weather.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KECLEON alters its body coloration to blend in with its surroundings, allowing it to sneak up on its prey unnoticed. Then it lashes out with its long, stretchy tongue to instantly ensnare the unsuspecting target.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SHUPPET grows by feeding on dark emotions, such as vengefulness and envy, in the hearts of people. It roams through cities in search of grudges that taint people.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A cursed energy permeated the stuffing of a discarded and forgotten plush doll, giving it new life as BANETTE. The POKéMON’s energy would escape if it were to ever open its mouth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DUSKULL wanders lost among the deep darkness of midnight. There is an oft-told admonishment given to misbehaving children that this POKéMON will spirit away bad children who earn scoldings from their mothers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DUSCLOPS absorbs anything, however large the object may be. This POKéMON hypnotizes its foe by waving its hands in a macabre manner and by bringing its single eye to bear. The hypnotized foe is made to do DUSCLOPS’s bidding.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Children of the southern tropics eat as snacks the fruit that grows in bunches around the neck of TROPIUS. This POKéMON flies by flapping the leaves on its back as if they were wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"In high winds, CHIMECHO cries as it hangs from a tree branch or the eaves of a building using a suction cup on its head. This POKéMON plucks berries with its long tail and eats them.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"ABSOL has the ability to foretell the coming of natural disasters. It lives in a harsh, rugged mountain environment. This POKéMON very rarely ventures down from the mountains.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WYNAUT gather on moonlit nights to play by squeezing up against each other. By being squeezed, this POKéMON gains endurance and is trained to dole out powerful counterattacks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SNORUNT survives by eating only snow and ice. Old folklore claims that a house visited by this POKéMON is sure to prosper for many generations to come.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GLALIE has the ability to freely control ice. For example, it can instantly freeze its foe solid. After immobilizing its foe in ice, this POKéMON enjoys eating it in leisurely fashion.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SPHEAL always travels by rolling around on its ball-like body. When the season for ice floes arrives, this POKéMON can be seen rolling about on ice and crossing the sea.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"SEALEO often balances and rolls things on the tip of its nose. While the POKéMON is rolling something, it checks the object’s aroma and texture to determine whether it likes the object or not.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"WALREIN swims all over in frigid seawater while crushing icebergs with its grand, imposing tusks. Its thick layer of blubber makes enemy attacks bounce off harmlessly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"CLAMPERL grows while being protected by its rock-hard shell. When its body becomes too large to fit inside the shell, it is sure evidence that this POKéMON is getting close to evolution.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"HUNTAIL’s tail is shaped like a fish. It uses the tail to attract prey, then swallows the prey whole with its large, gaping mouth. This POKéMON swims by wiggling its slender body like a snake.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Although GOREBYSS is the very picture of elegance and beauty while swimming, it is also cruel. When it spots prey, this POKéMON inserts its thin mouth into the prey’s body and drains the prey of its body fluids.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RELICANTH is a rare species that was discovered in deep-sea explorations. This POKéMON’s body withstands the enormous water pressure of the ocean depths. Its body is covered in tough scales that are like craggy rocks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LUVDISC’s heart-shaped body is a symbol of love and romance. It is said that any couple meeting this POKéMON is promised a loving relationship that never ends.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BAGON harbors a never-ending dream of one day soaring high among the clouds. As if trying to dispel its frustration over its inability to fly, this POKéMON slams its hard head against huge rocks and shatters them into pebbles.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Covering SHELGON’s body are outgrowths much like bones. The shell is very hard and bounces off enemy attacks. When awaiting evolution, this POKéMON hides away in a cavern.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"By evolving into SALAMENCE, this POKéMON finally realizes its long-held dream of growing wings. To express its joy, it flies and wheels all over the sky while spouting flames from its mouth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BELDUM keeps itself floating by generating a magnetic force that repels earth’s natural magnetism. When it sleeps, this POKéMON anchors itself to a cliff using the hooks on its rear.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. This POKéMON turns its arms to the rear for traveling at high speed.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"METAGROSS is the result of two METANG achieving fusion. When hunting, this POKéMON pins the prey to the ground under its massive body. It then eats the helpless victim using the large mouth on its stomach.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"REGIROCK’s body is composed entirely of rocks. Recently, a study made the startling discovery that the rocks were all unearthed from different locations.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"REGICE cloaks itself with frigid air of negative 328 degrees F. Things will freeze solid just by going near this POKéMON. Its icy body is so cold, it will not melt even if it is immersed in magma.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"REGISTEEL was imprisoned by people in ancient times. The metal composing its body is thought to be a curious substance that is not of this earth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LATIAS is highly intelligent and capable of understanding human speech. It is covered with a glass-like down. The POKéMON enfolds its body with its down and refracts light to alter its appearance.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"LATIOS will only open its heart to a TRAINER with a compassionate spirit. This POKéMON can fly faster than a jet plane by folding its forelegs to minimize air resistance.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"KYOGRE is named in mythology as the POKéMON that expanded the sea by covering the land with torrential rains and towering tidal waves. It took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with GROUDON.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"GROUDON has the power to scatter rain clouds and make water evaporate with light and heat. It came as a savior to people who had been suffering from terrible floods.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"RAYQUAZA is said to have lived for hundreds of millions of years in the earth’s ozone layer, above the clouds. Its existence had been completely unknown because it lived so high in the sky.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"JIRACHI will awaken from its sleep of a thousand years if you sing to it in a voice of purity. It is said to make true any wish that people desire.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"DEOXYS emerged from a virus that came from space. It is highly intelligent and wields psychokinetic powers. This POKéMON shoots lasers from the crystalline organ on its chest.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"}],"emerald":[null,{"en":"BULBASAUR can be seen napping in bright sunlight. There is a seed on its back. By soaking up the sun’s rays, the seed grows progressively larger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To support its bulb, IVYSAUR’s legs grow sturdy. If it spends more time lying in the sunlight, the bud will soon bloom into a large flower.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VENUSAUR’s flower is said to take on vivid colors if it gets plenty of nutrition and sunlight. The flower’s aroma soothes the emotions of people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The flame that burns at the tip of its tail is an indication of its emotions. The flame wavers when CHARMANDER is happy, and blazes when it is enraged.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Without pity, its sharp claws destroy foes. If it encounters a strong enemy, it becomes agitated, and the flame on its tail flares with a bluish white color.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A CHARIZARD flies about in search of strong opponents. It breathes intense flames that can melt any material. However, it will never torch a weaker foe.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its shell is not just for protection. Its rounded shape and the grooves on its surface minimize resistance in water, enabling SQUIRTLE to swim at high speeds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its large tail is covered with rich, thick fur that deepens in color with age. The scratches on its shell are evidence of this POKéMON’s toughness in battle.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The waterspouts that protrude from its shell are highly accurate. Their bullets of water can precisely nail tin cans from a distance of over 160 feet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its shell is as hard as an iron slab. A METAPOD does not move very much because it is preparing its soft innards for evolution inside the shell.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a superior ability to search for delicious honey from flowers. It can seek, extract, and carry honey from flowers blooming over six miles away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A WEEDLE has an extremely acute sense of smell. It distinguishes its favorite kinds of leaves from those it dislikes by sniffing with its big red proboscis (nose).","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It remains virtually immobile while it clings to a tree. However, on the inside, it busily prepares for evolution. This is evident from how hot its shell becomes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A BEEDRILL is extremely territorial. For safety reasons, no one should ever approach its nest. If angered, they will attack in a swarm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has an extremely sharp sense of direction. It can unerringly return home to its nest, however far it may be removed from its familiar surroundings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON flies around, patrolling its large territory. If its living space is violated, it shows no mercy in thoroughly punishing the foe with its sharp claws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON has gorgeous, glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are so captivated by the beautiful feathers on its head that they choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A RATTATA is cautious in the extreme. Even while it is asleep, it constantly moves its ears and listens for danger. It will make its nest anywhere.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A RATICATE’s sturdy fangs grow steadily. To keep them ground down, it gnaws on rocks and logs. It may even chew on the walls of houses.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its long neck and elongated beak are ideal for catching prey in soil or water. It deftly moves this extended and skinny beak to pluck prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"An EKANS curls itself up in a spiral while it rests. This position allows it to quickly respond to an enemy from any direction with a threat from its upraised head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON has a terrifically strong constricting power. It can even flatten steel oil drums. Once it wraps its body around its foe, escaping is impossible.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stores electricity in the electric sacs on its cheeks. When it releases pent-up energy in a burst, the electric power is equal to a lightning bolt.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it stores too much electricity, its behavior turns aggressive. To avoid this, it occasionally discharges excess energy and calms itself down.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it curls up in a ball, it can make any attack bounce off harmlessly. Its hide has turned tough and solid as a result of living in the desert.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It curls up in a ball to protect itself from enemy attacks. It also curls up to prevent heatstroke during the daytime when temperatures rise sharply.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its highly toxic barbs are thought to have developed as protection for this small-bodied POKéMON. When enraged, it releases a horrible toxin from its horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it is with its friends or family, its barbs are tucked away to prevent injury. It appears to become nervous if separated from the others.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles using its tough, scaly body. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The male NIDORAN has developed muscles that freely move its ears in any direction. Even the slightest sound does not escape this POKéMON’s notice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its horn is harder than a diamond. If it senses a hostile presence, all the barbs on its back bristle up at once, and it challenges the foe with all its might.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power capable of toppling a metal transmission tower. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On every night of a full moon, they come out to play. When dawn arrives, the tired CLEFAIRY go to sleep nestled up against each other in deep and quiet mountains.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A CLEFABLE uses its wings to skip lightly as if it were flying. Its bouncy step lets it even walk on water. On quiet, moonlit nights, it strolls on lakes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can freely control fire, making fiery orbs fly like will-o’-the-wisps. Just before evolution, its six tails grow hot as if on fire.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has long been said that each of the nine tails embody an enchanted power. A long-lived NINETALES will have fur that shines like gold.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Nothing can avoid falling asleep hearing a JIGGLYPUFF’s song. The sound waves of its singing voice match the brain waves of someone in a deep sleep.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fur is the ultimate in luxuriousness. Sleeping alongside a WIGGLYTUFF is simply divine. Its body expands seemingly without end when it inhales.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"While living in pitch-black caverns, their eyes gradually grew shut and deprived them of vision. They use ultrasonic waves to detect obstacles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fangs easily puncture even thick animal hide. It loves to feast on the blood of people and POKéMON. It flits about in darkness and strikes from behind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON grows by absorbing moonlight. During the daytime, it buries itself in the ground, leaving only its leaves exposed to avoid detection by its enemies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A horribly noxious honey drools from its mouth. One whiff of the honey can result in memory loss. Some fans are said to enjoy this overwhelming stink, however.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In seasons when it produces more pollen, the air around a VILEPLUME turns yellow with the powder as it walks. The pollen is highly toxic and causes paralysis.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PARAS has parasitic tochukaso mushrooms growing on its back. They grow by drawing nutrients from the host. They are valued as a medicine for long life.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PARASECT are known to infest the roots of large trees en masse and drain nutrients. When an infested tree dies, they move onto another tree all at once.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body is said to have evolved for protection. Its large eyes never fail to spot even miniscule prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VENOMOTH are nocturnal--they only are active at night. Their favorite prey are insects that gather around streetlights, attracted by the light in the darkness.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"DIGLETT are raised in most farms. The reason is simple--wherever they burrow, the soil is left perfectly tilled for growing delicious crops.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Because the triplets originally split from one body, they think exactly alike. They work cooperatively to burrow endlessly through the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEOWTH withdraw their sharp claws into their paws to silently sneak about. For some reason, this POKéMON loves shiny coins that glitter with light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PERSIAN’s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When its headache intensifies, it starts using strange powers. However, it has no recollection of its powers, so it always looks befuddled and bewildered.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A GOLDUCK is an adept swimmer. It sometimes joins competitive swimmers in training. It uses psychic powers when its forehead shimmers with light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it becomes furious, its blood circulation becomes more robust, and its muscles are made stronger. But it also becomes much less intelligent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its superb sense of smell ensures that this POKéMON won’t forget any scent, no matter what. It uses its sense of smell to detect the emotions of others.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This fleet-footed POKéMON is said to run over 6,200 miles in a single day and night. The fire that blazes wildly within its body is its source of power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is possible to see this POKéMON’s spiral innards right through its thin skin. However, the skin is also very flexible. Even sharp fangs bounce right off it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body surface is always wet and slick with an oily fluid. Because of this greasy covering, it can easily slip and slide out of the clutches of any enemy in battle.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its highly developed muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. This POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that sleeps 18 hours a day. Observation revealed that it uses TELEPORT to change its location once every hour.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is rumored that a boy with psychic abilities suddenly transformed into KADABRA while he was assisting research into extrasensory powers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"While it has strong psychic abilities and high intelligence, an ALAKAZAM’s muscles are very weak. It uses psychic power to move its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It continually undertakes strenuous training to master all forms of martial arts. Its strength lets it easily hoist a sumo wrestler onto its shoulders.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A belt is worn by a MACHOKE to keep its overwhelming power under control. Because it is so dangerous, no one has ever removed the belt.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is impossible to defend against punches and chops doled out by its four arms. Its fighting spirit flares up when it faces a tough opponent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A BELLSPROUT’s thin and flexible body lets it bend and sway to avoid any attack, however strong it may be. From its mouth, it leaks a fluid that melts even iron.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At night, a WEEPINBELL hangs on to a tree branch with its hooked rear and sleeps. If it moves around in its sleep, it may wake up to find itself on the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The long vine extending from its head is waved about as if it were a living thing to attract prey. When an unsuspecting victim approaches, it is swallowed whole.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is almost entirely composed of water. It ensnares its foe with its two long tentacles, then stabs with the poison stingers at their tips.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in complex rock formations on the ocean floor and traps prey using its 80 tentacles. Its red orbs glow when it grows excited or agitated.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It climbs mountain paths using only the power of its arms. Because they look just like boulders lining paths, hikers may step on them without noticing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They descend from mountains by tumbling down steep slopes. They are so brutal, they smash aside obstructing trees and massive boulders with thunderous tackles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to live in volcanic craters on mountain peaks. Once a year, it sheds its hide and grows larger. The shed hide crumbles and returns to the soil.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PONYTA is very weak at birth. It can barely stand up. Its legs become stronger as it stumbles and falls while trying to keep up with its parent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It usually canters casually in the fields and plains. But once a RAPIDASH turns serious, its fiery manes flare and blaze as it gallops its way up to 150 mph.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It catches prey by dipping its tail in water at the side of a river. But it often forgets what it is doing and spends entire days just loafing at water’s edge.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its tail has a SHELLDER firmly attached with a bite. As a result, the tail can’t be used for fishing anymore. This forces it to reluctantly swim and catch prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The units at its sides are extremely powerful magnets. They generate enough magnetism to draw in iron objects from over 300 feet away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is actually three MAGNEMITE linked by magnetism. It generates powerful radio waves that raise temperatures by 3.6 degrees F within a 3,300-foot radius.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is always seen with a stick from a plant. Apparently, there are good sticks and bad sticks. This POKéMON occasionally fights with others over choice sticks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads remains always vigilant for any sign of danger. When threatened, it flees at over 60 miles per hour.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A peculiar POKéMON species with three heads. It vigorously races across grassy plains even in arid seasons with little rainfall.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEEL hunt for prey in frigid, ice-covered seas. When it needs to breathe, it punches a hole through the ice with the sharply protruding section of its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It loves to snooze on bitterly cold ice. The sight of this POKéMON sleeping on a glacier was mistakenly thought to be a mermaid by a mariner long ago.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Born from polluted sludge in the sea, GRIMER’s favorite food is anything filthy. They feed on wastewater pumped out from factories.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It prefers warm and humid habitats. In the summertime, the toxic substances in its body intensify, making MUK reek like putrid kitchen garbage.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At night, it burrows a hole in the seafloor with its broad tongue to make a place to sleep. While asleep, it closes its shell, but leaves its tongue hanging out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It swims in the sea by swallowing water, then jetting it out toward the rear. The CLOYSTER shoots spikes from its shell using the same system.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When exposed to a strong wind, a GASTLY’s gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If a HAUNTER beckons you while it is floating in darkness, don’t approach it. This POKéMON will try to lick you with its tongue and steal your life away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Deep in the night, your shadow cast by a streetlight may suddenly overtake you. It is actually a GENGAR running past you, pretending to be your shadow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"There is a magnet in its brain that prevents an ONIX from losing direction while tunneling. As it grows older, its body becomes steadily rounder and smoother.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If your nose becomes itchy while you are sleeping, it’s a sure sign that a DROWZEE is standing above your pillow and trying to eat your dream through your nostrils.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The arcing movement and glitter of the pendulum in a HYPNO’s hand lull the foe into deep hypnosis. While searching for prey, it polishes the pendulum.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KRABBY live in holes dug into beaches. On sandy shores with little in the way of food, they can be seen squabbling with each other over territory.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It waves its huge, oversized claw in the air to communicate with others. But since the claw is so heavy, this POKéMON quickly tires.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It bears an uncanny and unexplained resemblance to a POKé BALL. Because it explodes at the slightest shock, even veteran TRAINERS treat it with caution.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They appear in great numbers at electric power plants. Because they feed on electricity, they cause massive and chaotic blackouts in nearby cities.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It consists of six eggs that care for each other. The eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear, it is close to evolution.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Originally from the tropics, EXEGGUTOR’s heads grow larger from exposure to strong sunlight. It is said that when the heads fall, they group to form an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull it wears are from its tears.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A MAROWAK is the evolved form of a CUBONE that has grown tough by overcoming the grief of losing its mother. Its tempered and hardened spirit is not easily broken.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its legs freely stretch and contract. Using these springlike limbs, it bowls over foes with devastating kicks. After battle, it rubs down its tired legs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who aimed to become the world champion. Having an indomitable spirit means that it will never give up.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Whenever it sees something unfamiliar, it always licks the object because it memorizes things by texture and taste. It is somewhat put off by sour things.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Getting up close to a KOFFING will give you a chance to observe, through its thin skin, the toxic gases swirling inside. It blows up at the slightest stimulation.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"By diluting its toxic gases with a special process, the highest grade of perfume can be extracted. To WEEZING, gases emanating from garbage are the ultimate feast.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Once it starts running, it doesn’t stop. Its tiny brain makes it so stupid that it can’t remember why it started running in the first place.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its horn, which rotates like a drill, destroys tall buildings with one strike. It stands on its hind legs, and its brain is well developed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CHANSEY lay nutritionally excellent eggs every day. The eggs are so delicious, they are eagerly devoured by even those people who have lost their appetite.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If you come across a young KANGASKHAN playing by itself, never try to catch it. The baby’s parent is sure to be in the area, and it will become violently enraged.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"By cleverly flicking the fins on its back side to side, it moves in any direction while facing forward. It spits ink to escape if it senses danger.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The poisonous barbs all over its body are highly valued as ingredients for making traditional herbal medicine. It shows no mercy to anything approaching its nest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the springtime, schools of GOLDEEN can be seen swimming up falls and rivers. It metes out staggering damage with its single horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It punches holes in boulders on streambeds. This is a clever innovation that prevents its eggs from being attacked or washed away by the current.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It gathers with others in the night and makes its red core glow on and off with the twinkling stars. It can regenerate limbs if they are severed from its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"People in ancient times imagined that STARMIE were transformed from the reflections of stars that twinkled on gentle waves at night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A MR. MIME is a master of pantomime. It can convince others that something unseeable actually exists. Once believed, the imaginary object does become real.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its blindingly fast speed adds to the sharpness of its twin forearm scythes. The scythes can slice through thick logs in one wicked stroke.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A JYNX sashays rhythmically as if it were dancing. Its motions are so bouncingly alluring, people seeing it are compelled to shake their hips without noticing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When a storm approaches, it competes with others to scale heights that are likely to be stricken by lightning. Some towns use ELECTABUZZ in place of lightning rods.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In battle, it blows out intense flames from all over its body to intimidate its foe. These fiery bursts create heat waves that ignite grass and trees in the area.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Their pincers are strong enough to shatter thick logs. Because they dislike cold, PINSIR burrow and sleep under the ground on chilly nights.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is not satisfied unless it is rampaging at all times. If there is no opponent for TAUROS to battle, it will charge at thick trees and knock them down to calm itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its swimming muscles are weak, so it is easily washed away by currents. In places where water pools, you can see many MAGIKARP deposited there by the flow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is an extremely vicious and violent POKéMON. When humans begin to fight, it will appear and burn everything to the ground with intensely hot flames.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"People have driven LAPRAS almost to the point of extinction. In the evenings, it is said to sing plaintively as it seeks what few others of its kind still remain.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A DITTO rearranges its cell structure to transform itself. However, if it tries to change based on its memory, it will get details wrong.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"An EEVEE has an unstable genetic makeup that suddenly mutates due to its environment. Radiation from various STONES causes this POKéMON to evolve.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"VAPOREON underwent a spontaneous mutation and grew fins and gills that allow them to live underwater. They have the ability to freely control water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its cells generate weak power that is amplified by its fur’s static electricity to drop thunderbolts. The bristling fur is made of electrically charged needles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FLAREON’s fluffy fur releases heat into the air so that its body does not get excessively hot. Its body temperature can rise to a maximum of 1,650 degrees F.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A PORYGON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"One of the ancient and long-since-extinct POKéMON that have been regenerated from fossils by humans. If attacked, it withdraws into its hard shell.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"An OMASTAR uses its tentacles to capture its prey. It is believed to have become extinct because its shell grew too large, making its movements slow and ponderous.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is a POKéMON that has been regenerated from a fossil. However, in rare cases, living examples have been discovered. KABUTO have not changed for 300 million years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KABUTOPS once swam underwater to hunt for prey. It was apparently evolving from being a water dweller to living on land as evident from changes in its gills and legs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"AERODACTYL is a POKéMON from the age of dinosaurs. It was regenerated from DNA extracted from amber. It is imagined to have been the king of the skies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SNORLAX’s typical day consists of nothing more than eating and sleeping. It is such a docile POKéMON that there are children who use its big belly as a place to play.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARTICUNO is a legendary bird POKéMON that can control ice. The flapping of its wings chills the air. As a result, it is said that when this POKéMON flies, snow will fall.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ZAPDOS is a legendary bird POKéMON that has the ability to control electricity. It usually lives in thunderclouds. It gains power if it is stricken by lightning bolts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MOLTRES is a legendary bird POKéMON that can control fire. If injured, it is said to dip its body in the molten magma of a volcano to burn and heal itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A DRATINI continually molts and sloughs off its old skin. It does so because the life energy within its body steadily builds to reach uncontrollable levels.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A DRAGONAIR stores an enormous amount of energy inside its body. It is said to alter the weather around it by loosing energy from the crystals on its neck and tail.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can circle the globe in just 16 hours. It is a kindhearted POKéMON that leads lost and foundering ships in a storm to the safety of land.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was created by genetic manipulation. However, even though the scientific power of humans made its body, they failed to give it a warm heart.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A MEW is said to possess the genes of all POKéMON. It is capable of making itself invisible at will, so it entirely avoids notice even if it approaches people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It waves its leaf around to keep foes at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly atmosphere that becalms the battlers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A BAYLEEF’s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree shoot. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The fragrance of a MEGANIUM’s flower soothes and calms emotions. In battle, it gives off more of its becalming scent to blunt the foe’s fighting spirit.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It flares flames from its back to protect itself. The fire burns vigorously if the POKéMON is angry. When it is tired, it sputters with incomplete combustion.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with intense gusts of flames and superheated air. Its quick nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even while scorching an enemy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze that it creates using its intense flames. TYPHLOSION create blazing explosive blasts that burn everything to cinders.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Despite its small body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While it may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough strength to cause serious injury.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like fishhooks, they become irremovably embedded.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It opens its huge mouth to intimidate enemies. In battle, it runs using its thick and powerful hind legs to charge the foe with incredible speed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They take turns standing guard when it is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the others if it senses danger. If one becomes separated, it turns sleepless with fear.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A FURRET has a very slim build. When under attack, it can squirm through narrow spaces and get away. In spite of its short limbs, it is very nimble and fleet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has an internal organ that senses the earth’s rotation. Using this special organ, a HOOTHOOT begins hooting at precisely the same time every day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It unfailingly catches prey in darkness. NOCTOWL owe their success to superior vision that allows them to see in minimal light, and to their supple and silent wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LEDYBA communicate using a fluid that they secrete from where the legs join the body. They are said to convey feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that in lands with clean air, where the stars fill the sky, there live many LEDIAN. For good reason, they use the light of the stars as energy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The web it spins can be considered its second nervous system. It is said that a SPINARAK determines its prey by the tiny vibrations it feels through the web.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and vertical walls. It constricts its foe with thin and strong silk webbing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Over the course of evolution, its hind legs turned into wings. By alternately resting its front and rear wings, it can fly all day without having to stop.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it discharges positive and negative electricity from its two antennae. It lives in depths beyond sunlight’s reach.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The light-emitting orbs on its back are very bright. They are formed from a part of its dorsal fin. This POKéMON illuminates the inky darkness of deep seas.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is still inept at retaining electricity. When it is startled, it discharges power accidentally. It gets better at holding power as it grows older.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On nights with many shooting stars, CLEFFA can be seen dancing in a ring. They dance until daybreak, when they quench their thirst with the morning dew.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its soft and pliable body is very bouncy. When it sings continuously with all its might, its body steadily turns a deepening pink color.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"As its energy, it uses the feelings of compassion and pleasure exuded by people and POKéMON. It stores up happy feelings in its shell, then shares them out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to be a POKéMON that brings good fortune. When it spots someone who is pure of heart, a TOGETIC appears and shares its happiness with that person.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It runs up short trees that grow on the savanna to peck at new shoots. A NATU’s eyes look as if they are always observing something.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing the future. Some people in different lands have long believed that XATU are emissaries from another world.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds a static charge. The more energy is charged, the more brightly the lightbulb at the tip of its tail glows.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fleece quality changes to generate strong static electricity with a small amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its hide are shielded against electricity.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used its light to send signals back and forth with others far away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its flower petals deepen in color through exposure to sunlight. When cloudy weather persists, it does a dance that is thought to be a ritual for summoning the sun.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is covered with water-repellent fur. Because of the fur, it can swim through water at high speed without being slowed by the water’s resistance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in water virtually all day long. Its body color and pattern act as camouflage that makes it tough for enemies to spot in water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked by enemies. But since its forelegs remain green throughout the year, it is easily identified as a fake in the winter.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The curled hair on its head proves its status as a king. It is said that the longer and curlier the hair, the more respect it earns from its peers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, a HOPPIP links leaves with others to prepare against being blown away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It blossoms when the temperature rises above 64 degrees F. Because its flower’s blooming changes with the temperature, it is sometimes used as a thermometer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JUMPLUFF ride warm southern winds to cross the sea and fly to foreign lands. This POKéMON lands when it encounters cold air while it is floating.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike appendage. However, because it uses the tail so much, AIPOM’s real hands have become rather clumsy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUNKERN try to minimize movement to conserve the nutrients they have stored in their bodies for evolution. They will not eat, subsisting only on morning dew.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUNFLORA convert solar energy into nutrition. They are highly active in the warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as soon as the sun sets.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can see 360 degrees without moving its eyes. It is a great flier capable of making sudden stops and turning midair to quickly chase down targeted prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"WOOPER usually live in water but come out onto land seeking food occasionally. On land, they coat their bodies with a gooey, toxic film.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A QUAGSIRE hunts by leaving its mouth wide open in water and waiting for its prey to blunder in. Because it doesn’t move, it does not get very hungry.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"An ESPEON is extremely loyal to any TRAINER it considers to be worthy. It is said to have developed precognitive powers to protect its TRAINER from harm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"UMBREON evolved from exposure to the moon’s energy pulses. It lurks in darkness and waits for its foes to move. The rings on its body glow when it leaps to attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MURKROW were feared as the alleged bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong interest in anything that sparkles. It will even try to steal rings from women.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It undertakes research every day to solve the mysteries of the world. However, it apparently forgets everything if the SHELLDER on its head comes off.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A MISDREAVUS frightens people with a creepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses its red spheres to absorb the fear of foes as its nutrition.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is shaped like ancient text characters. Although research is ongoing, it is a mystery as to which came first, the ancient writings or the various UNOWN.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Usually docile, a WOBBUFFET strikes back ferociously if its black tail is attacked. It makes its lair in caves where it waits for nightfall.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A GIRAFARIG is an herbivore--it eats grass and tree shoots. While it is eating, its tail makes chewing and swallowing motions as if it were also eating.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PINECO hangs from a tree branch and waits for prey. While eating, if it is disturbed by someone shaking its tree, it falls on the ground and suddenly explodes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It keeps itself inside its steel shell. The shell is opened when it is catching prey, but it is so quick that the shell’s inside cannot be seen.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into the ground backwards. This POKéMON is known to make its nest in complex shapes deep under the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It glides without making a single sound. It grasps the face of its foe using its hind and large front claws, then stabs with its poison barb.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STEELIX live even further underground than ONIX. This POKéMON is known to dig toward the earth’s core, reaching a depth of over six-tenths of a mile underground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"By baring its fangs and making a scary face, it sends smaller POKéMON scurrying in terror. The SNUBBULL does seem a little sad at making its foes flee.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a particularly well-developed lower jaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing it to tilt its head. Unless it is startled, it will not try to bite.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A QWILFISH uses the pressure of water it swallows to shoot toxic quills all at once from all over its body. It finds swimming to be somewhat challenging.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SHUCKLE hides under rocks, keeping its body concealed inside its shell while eating stored berries. The berries mix with its body fluids to become a juice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They gather in forests seeking the sweet sap of trees. It is completely clad in a steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn, which it uses to fling foes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SNEASEL scales trees by punching its hooked claws into the bark. It seeks out unguarded nests and steals eggs for food while the parents are away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It licks its palms that are sweetened by being soaked in honey. A TEDDIURSA makes its own honey by blending fruits and pollen collected by BEEDRILL.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In forests, it is said that there are many streams and towering trees where an URSARING gathers food. It walks through its forest collecting food every day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is a species of POKéMON that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of hardened magma. Tens of thousands of years spent living in volcanic craters have turned MAGCARGO’s bodies into magma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It roots for food by rubbing its snout against the ground. Its favorite food is a mushroom that grows under dried grass. It occasionally roots out hot springs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PILOSWINE is covered by a thick coat of long hair for enduring freezing cold. It uses its tusks to dig up food that has been buried under ice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CORSOLA live in warm southern seas. If the sea becomes polluted, the beautiful coral stalks become discolored and crumble away in tatters.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A REMORAID uses its abdominal muscles to forcefully expel swallowed water, then shoot down flying prey. When evolution approaches, it travels down rivers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It ensnares its foe with its suction-cupped tentacles before delivering the finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be too strong, it spews ink to escape.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It carries food bundled up in its tail. There was a famous explorer who managed to scale Mt. Everest thanks to a DELIBIRD sharing its food.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On sunny days, schools of MANTINE can be seen elegantly leaping over the waves. It is not bothered by the REMORAID that hitches rides.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that has a body and wings of steel. People in the past used feathers fallen from SKARMORY to make swords and knives.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"HOUNDOUR communicate with each other using a variety of cries to corner their prey. This POKéMON’s remarkable teamwork is simply unparalleled.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In a HOUNDOOM pack, the one with its horns raked sharply back serves a leadership role. They choose their leader by fighting among themselves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sleeps quietly, deep on the seafloor. When it comes up to the surface, it creates a huge whirlpool that can swallow even ships.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"PHANPY’s big ears serve as broad fans. When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears busily to cool down. Even the young are very strong.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A DONPHAN is so strong it can easily haul a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of attack won’t even leave a scratch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It was created by humans using the power of science. It has been given artificial intelligence that enables it to learn new gestures and emotions on its own.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were once traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SMEARGLE marks its territory using a fluid that leaks out from the tip of its tail. About 5,000 different marks left by this POKéMON have been found.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"TYROGUE become stressed out if they do not get to train every day. When raising this POKéMON, the TRAINER must establish a regular training schedule.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its technique of kicking while spinning is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense. HITMONTOP travel faster spinning than they do walking.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It actively runs about, but also falls often. Whenever it falls, it will check its reflection on a lake’s surface to make sure its face hasn’t become dirty.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it touches metal and discharges the electricity it has stored in its body, an ELEKID begins swinging its arms in circles to recharge itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If a MAGBY is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It gives over five gallons of milk daily. Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and grown-ups alike. People who can’t drink milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it senses sadness with its fluffy fur, a BLISSEY will rush over to the sad person, however far away, to share an egg of happiness that brings a smile to any face.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"RAIKOU embodies the speed of lightning. Its roars send shock waves shuddering through the air and ground as if lightning bolts were crashing down.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ENTEI embodies the passion of magma. It is thought to have been born in the eruption of a volcano. It blasts fire that consumes all that it touches.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SUICUNE embodies the compassion of a pure spring of water. It runs across the land with gliding elegance. It has the power to purify dirty water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A LARVITAR is born deep under the ground. It must eat its way through the soil above and reach the surface for it to see its parents’ faces.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A PUPITAR creates a gas inside its body that it ejects under compression to propel itself like a jet. Its body can withstand a collision with solid steel.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A TYRANITAR is so overwhelmingly powerful, it can bring down a whole mountain to make its nest. It roams in mountains seeking new opponents to fight.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUGIA is so powerful even a light fluttering of its wings can blow apart houses. As a result, it chooses to live out of sight deep under the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its feathers--which glow in seven colors depending on the angle at which they are struck by light--are thought to bring joy. It is said to live at the foot of a rainbow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON came from the future by crossing over time. It is thought that so long as CELEBI appears, a bright and shining future awaits us.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It makes its nest in a giant tree in the forest. It ferociously guards against anything nearing its territory. It is said to be the protector of the forest’s trees.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Leaves grow out of this POKéMON’s body. They help obscure a GROVYLE from the eyes of its enemies while it is in a thickly overgrown forest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the jungle, its power is without equal. This POKéMON carefully grows trees and plants. It regulates its body temperature by basking in sunlight.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If attacked, it strikes back by spitting balls of fire it forms in its stomach. A TORCHIC dislikes darkness because it can’t see its surroundings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lashes out with 10 kicks per second. Its strong fighting instinct compels it to keep up its offensive until the opponent gives up.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It learns martial arts that use punches and kicks. Every several years, its old feathers burn off, and new, supple feathers grow back in their place.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On land, it can powerfully lift large boulders by planting its four feet and heaving. It sleeps by burying itself in soil at the water’s edge.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its toughened hind legs enable it to stand upright. Because it weakens if its skin dries out, it replenishes fluids by playing in mud.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it senses the approach of a storm and a tidal wave, it protects its seaside nest by piling up boulders. It swims as fast as a jet ski.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It savagely threatens foes with bared fangs. It chases after fleeing targets tenaciously. It turns tail and runs, however, if the foe strikes back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the wild, MIGHTYENA live in a pack. They never defy their leader’s orders. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Rubbing its nose against the ground, it always wanders about back and forth in search of something. It is distinguished by the zigzag footprints it leaves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is exceedingly fast if it only has to run in a straight line. When it spots pond-dwelling prey underwater, it quickly leaps in and catches it with its sharp claws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sticks to tree branches and eats leaves. The thread it spits from its mouth, which becomes gooey when it touches air, slows the movement of its foes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It prepares for evolution using the energy it stored while it was a WURMPLE. It keeps watch over the surroundings with its two eyes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its colorfully patterned wings are its most prominent feature. It flies through flower-covered fields collecting pollen. It attacks ferociously when angered.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To avoid detection by its enemies, it hides motionlessly beneath large leaves and in the gaps of branches. It also attaches dead leaves to its body for camouflage.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is a nocturnal POKéMON that flies from fields and mountains to the attraction of streetlights at night. It looses highly toxic powder from its wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON lives in ponds with clean water. It is known to ferry small POKéMON across ponds by carrying them on the broad leaf on its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it hears festive music, all the cells in its body become stimulated, and it begins moving in rhythm. It does not quail even when it faces a tough opponent.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It hangs off branches and absorbs nutrients. When it finishes eating, its body becomes so heavy that it drops to the ground with a thump.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A forest-dwelling POKéMON that is skilled at climbing trees. Its long and pointed nose is its weak point. It loses power if the nose is gripped.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds. Feared from long ago as the guardian of forests, this POKéMON lives in a deep forest where people do not venture.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Although it is small, it is very courageous. It will take on a larger SKARMORY on an equal footing. However, its will weakens if it becomes hungry.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SWELLOW dives upon prey from far above. It never misses its targets. It takes to the skies in search of lands with a warm climate.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It makes its nest on a sheer cliff at the edge of the sea. It has trouble keeping its wings flapping in flight. Instead, it soars on updrafts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It skims the tops of waves as it flies. When it spots prey, it uses its large beak to scoop up the victim with water. It protects its eggs in its beak.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A RALTS has the power to sense the emotions of people and POKéMON with the horns on its head. It takes cover if it senses any hostility.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A KIRLIA has the psychic power to create a rip in the dimensions and see into the future. It is said to dance with pleasure on sunny mornings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It apparently does not feel the pull of gravity because it supports itself with psychic power. It will give its life to protect its TRAINER.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They gather on puddles after evening downpours, gliding across the surface of water as if sliding. It secretes honey with a sweet aroma from its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the large eyelike patterns on its antennae. Because it can’t fly if its wings get wet, it shelters itself from rain under large trees and eaves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It loves to eat damp, composted soil in forests. If you enter a forest after a long rain, you can see many SHROOMISH feasting on composted soil.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It scatters spores from holes in the cap on its head. It loves warm and humid climates. It feeds on trees and plants in fields and forests.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sleeps virtually all day and night long. It doesn’t change its nest its entire life, but it sometimes travels great distances by swimming in rivers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can’t keep still because its blood boils with energy. It runs through the fields and mountains all day to calm itself. If it doesn’t, it can’t sleep at night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Hordes of SLAKING gather around trees when fruits come into season. They wait around patiently for ripened fruits to fall out of the trees.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It makes its nest at the roots of a mighty tree. Using its whiskerlike antennae, it probes its surroundings in the pitch-black darkness of soil.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Because it darts about vigorously at high speed, it is very difficult to see. Hearing its distinctive cries for too long induces a headache.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A peculiar POKéMON that floats in air even though its wings remain completely still. The inside of its body is hollow and utterly dark.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its cries equal a jet plane in volume. It inhales through its ear canals. Because of this system, it can cry continually without having to catch its breath.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It positions the round speakers on its head to assail foes with ultrasonic waves at massive volume. It builds power by stomping the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has sound-generating organs all over its body. It communicates with others by adjusting the tone and volume of the cries it emits.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It loves to toughen up its body above all else. If you hear quaking rumbles in a cave, it is the sound of MAKUHITA undertaking strenuous training.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has the habit of challenging others without hesitation to tests of strength. It’s been known to stand on train tracks and stop trains using forearm thrusts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its tail, which is packed with nutrition, is very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny days they gather at the edge of water and splash about for fun.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body emits a powerful magnetism. It feeds on prey that is pulled in by the force. Its magnetism is stronger in cold seasons.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A SKITTY’s adorably cute behavior makes it highly popular. In battle, it makes its tail puff out. It threatens foes with a sharp growl.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Rather than keeping a permanent lair, it habitually seeks comfortable spots and sleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes active at dusk.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A SABLEYE lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its giant jaws are actually steel horns that transformed. It fools foes into complacency with its adorable gestures, then chomps them with its huge jaws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that is clad in steel armor. A new suit of armor is made when it evolves. The old, discarded armor is salvaged as metal for making iron products.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When two LAIRON meet in the wild, they fight for territory by bashing into each other with their steel bodies. The sound of their collision carries for miles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its iron horns grow longer a little at a time. They are used to determine the AGGRON’s age. The gouges in its armor are worn with pride as mementos from battles.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It continually meditates for hours every day. As a result of rigorous and dedicated yoga training, it has tempered its spiritual power so much it can fly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Through crushingly harsh yoga training, it gained the power to foretell its foe’s actions. It battles with elegant, dance-like movement.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It generates electricity using friction from the atmosphere. In seasons with especially arid air, its entire body blazes with violent showers of sparks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Because lightning falls in their vicinities, MANECTRIC were thought to have been born from lightning. In battle, they create thunderclouds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has the trait of cheering on its fellow POKéMON. By shorting out the electricity it releases from its paws, it creates pom-poms for cheering.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"At a meeting of POKéMON academics, it was announced that simultaneous exposure to electricity from a PLUSLE and MINUN will promote circulation and boost vitality.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"With their taillights lit, VOLBEAT fly in a swarm, drawing geometric designs in the night sky. They move their nests if their pond water becomes dirty.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A nocturnal POKéMON that becomes active upon nightfall. It leads a VOLBEAT swarm to draw patterns in the night sky. Over 200 different patterns have been confirmed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A ROSELIA that drinks nutritionally rich springwater blooms with lovely flowers. The fragrance of its flowers has the effect of making its foes careless.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON’s stomach fluid can even digest scrap iron. In one gulp, it can swallow something that is as large as itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its powerful stomach acid is capable of digesting almost anything. The one thing in the whole world a SWALOT can’t digest is its own stomach.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CARVANHA attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious POKéMON, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The vicious and sly gangster of the sea. Its skin is specially textured to minimize drag in water. Its speed tops out at over 75 miles per hour.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"While this POKéMON usually lives in the sea, it can survive on land, although not too long. It loses vitality if its body becomes dried out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It breathes through nostrils that it raises above the sea. By inhaling to its maximum capacity, a WAILORD can dive close to 10,000 feet beneath the waves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A NUMEL stores boiling magma in the hump on its back. It is a hardy POKéMON that can transport a 220-pound load. It has served humans at work since long ago.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that lives in the crater of a volcano. Every 10 years, the volcanoes on its back erupt violently. Research is under way on the cause of eruption.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It battles using energy it gets from burning coal. When loosing smoke from its nostrils, it lets off a sound that is similar to a locomotive’s horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn’t stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stores power in the black pearls on its forehead. When it uses psychic power, it performs an odd dance step. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is distinguished by a pattern of spots that is always different. Its unsteady, tottering walk has the effect of fouling its foe’s aim.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its big jaws crunch through boulders. Because its head is so big, it has a hard time getting back upright if it tips over onto its back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It looses ultrasonic waves by rubbing its wings together. Since a VIBRAVA’s wings are still in the process of growing, it can only fly short distances.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"CACNEA live in deserts with virtually no rainfall. It battles by swinging its thick, spiked arms. Once a year, a yellow flower blooms.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"After spending thousands of years in harsh deserts, its blood transformed into the same substances as sand. It is nocturnal, so it hunts at night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that has wings like cottony clouds. After enduring winter, in which little food is available, SWABLU flocks move closer to towns in the spring.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It hums in a beautiful soprano voice. It flies among white clouds in the blue sky. It launches intensely hot fireballs from its mouth.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it battles, it stands on its hind legs and attacks with its sharply clawed forelegs. Its fur bristles if it encounters any SEVIPER.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEVIPER and ZANGOOSE are eternal rivals. It counters a ZANGOOSE’s dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It becomes very active on the night of a full moon. This POKéMON was first discovered 40 years ago at the site of a meteor strike.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Solar energy is the source of this POKéMON’s power. On sunny days, groups of SOLROCK line up facing the sun and absorb its light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a slimy film. The film acts as a barrier to prevent germs in muddy water from entering the BARBOACH’s body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Mysteriously, it can foretell earthquakes. In the daytime, it sleeps in mud at the bottom of a pond. When it awakens, it continually feeds throughout the night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Once it grips prey with its large pincers, it will never let go, no matter what. It is a hardy POKéMON that can thrive in any environment.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A brutish POKéMON that loves to battle. A veteran CRAWDAUNT that has prevailed in hundreds of battles has giant pincers marked with countless scars.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A BALTOY moves by spinning on its single foot. It has been depicted in murals adorning the walls of a once-bustling city in an ancient age.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A CLAYDOL sleeps while hovering in midair. Its arms are separate from its body. They are kept floating by the POKéMON’s manipulation of psychic power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It disguises itself as seaweed by making its tentacles sway. Unsuspecting prey that come too close are swallowed whole. It became extinct 100 million years ago.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It drags its heavy body along the seafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows of warm seas. CRADILY can be seen on beaches when the tide goes out.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It was resurrected from a fossil using the power of science. It swims by undulating the eight wings at its sides. They were feet that adapted to life in the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"ARMALDO usually lives on land. However, when it hunts for prey, it dives beneath the ocean. It swims around using its two large wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"FEEBAS live in ponds that are heavily infested with weeds. Because of its hopelessly shabby appearance, it seems as if few TRAINERS raise it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to live at the bottom of large lakes. Considered to be the most beautiful of all POKéMON, it has been depicted in paintings and statues.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It alters its form depending on the weather. Changes in the climate such as the temperature and humidity appear to affect its cellular structure.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that has the ability to alter its body colors to match its surroundings. A KECLEON reverts to its original colors if it is startled.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON roams about deep in the night seeking such negative emotions as grudges and envy. It retreats to its nest when the sun begins to rise.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"An abandoned plush doll became this POKéMON. They are said to live in garbage dumps and wander about in search of the children that threw them away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A glare from its single scarlet eye makes even burly grown-ups freeze in utter fear. It is a nocturnal POKéMON that roams about under the cloak of darkness.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is thought that its body is hollow with only a spectral ball of fire burning inside. However, no one has been able to confirm this theory as fact.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves. The bunch of fruit that grows around its neck is deliciously sweet. In the spring, it scatters pollen from its neck.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They fly about very actively when the hot season arrives. They communicate among themselves using seven different and distinguishing cries.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sharply senses even subtle changes in the sky and the land to predict natural disasters. It is a long-lived POKéMON that has a life-span of 100 years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A WYNAUT loves to eat sweet fruits. It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn by the fragrance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They tend to move about in groups of around five SNORUNT. In snowy regions, it is said that when they are seen late at night, snowfall will arrive by morning.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A GLALIE has the power to instantaneously freeze moisture in the atmosphere. A dazzling cloud of diamondlike ice crystals forms around its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is completely covered with plushy fur. As a result, it never feels the cold even when it is rolling about on ice floes or diving in the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"SEALEO live in herds on ice floes. Using its powerful flippers, it shatters ice. It dives into the sea to hunt prey five times a day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To protect its herd, the leader battles anything that invades its territory, even at the cost of its life. Its tusks may snap off in battle.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A CLAMPERL slams its shell closed on prey to prevent escape. The pearl it creates upon evolution is said to be infused with a mysterious energy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To withstand the crushing pressure of water deep under the sea, its spine is very thick and sturdy. Its tail, which is shaped like a small fish, has eyes that light up.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A GOREBYSS siphons the body fluids of prey through its thin, tubular mouth. Its light pink body color turns vivid when it finishes feeding.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was once believed to have been extinct. The species has not changed its form for 100 million years. It walks on the seafloor using its pectoral fins.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"LUVDISC make the branches of CORSOLA their nests. There is a custom from long ago of giving a LUVDISC as a gift to express one’s feelings of love.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Although it is small, this POKéMON is very powerful because its body is a bundle of muscles. It launches head-butts with its ironlike skull.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It hardly eats while it awaits evolution. It becomes hardier by enduring hunger. Its shell peels off the instant it begins to evolve.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"After many long years, its cellular structure underwent a sudden mutation to grow wings. When angered, it loses all thought and rampages out of control.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When BELDUM gather in a swarm, they move in perfect unison as if they were but one POKéMON. They communicate with each other using brain waves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The claws tipping its arms pack the destructive power to tear through thick iron sheets as if they were silk. It flies at over 60 miles per hour.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"METAGROSS has four brains that are joined by a complex neural network. As a result of integration, this POKéMON is smarter than a supercomputer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that is made entirely of rocks and boulders. If parts of its body chip off in battle, REGIROCK repairs itself by adding new rocks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of Antarctic ice. After extensive studies, researchers believe the ice was formed during an ice age.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is harder than any other kind of metal. The body metal is composed of a mysterious substance. Not only is it hard, it shrinks and stretches flexibly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They make a small herd of only several members. They rarely make contact with people or other POKéMON. They disappear if they sense enemies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"KYOGRE has appeared in mythology as the creator of the sea. After long years of feuding with GROUDON, it took to sleep at the bottom of the sea.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"GROUDON has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that flies endlessly in the ozone layer. It is said it would descend to the ground if KYOGRE and GROUDON were to fight.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"JIRACHI is said to make wishes come true. While it sleeps, a tough crystalline shell envelops the body to protect it from enemies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that mutated from an extraterrestrial virus exposed to a laser beam. Its body is configured for superior agility and speed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"}],"firered":[null,{"en":"There is a plant seed on its back right from the day this POKéMON is born. The seed slowly grows larger.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"There is a plant bulb on its back. When it absorbs nutrients, the bulb is said to blossom into a large flower.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A bewitching aroma wafts from its flower. The fragrance becalms those engaged in a battle.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"From the time it is born, a flame burns at the tip of its tail. Its life would end if the flame were to go out.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It lashes about with its tail to knock down its foe. It then tears up the fallen opponent with sharp claws.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its wings can carry this POKéMON close to an altitude of 4,600 feet. It blows out fire at very high temperatures.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When it retracts its long neck into its shell, it squirts out water with vigorous force.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON is very popular as a pet. Its fur-covered tail is a symbol of its longevity.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It crushes its foe under its heavy body to cause fainting. In a pinch, it will withdraw inside its shell.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is covered with a green skin. When it grows, it sheds the skin, covers itself with silk, and becomes a cocoon.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Even though it is encased in a sturdy shell, the body inside is tender. It can’t withstand a harsh attack.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The wings are protected by rain-repellent dust. As a result, this POKéMON can fly about even in rain.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Often found in forests and grasslands. It has a sharp, toxic barb of around two inches on top of its head.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON is in a temporary stage while making its body. It is almost completely unable to move on its own.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"May appear in a swarm. Flies at violent speeds, all the while stabbing with the toxic stinger on its rear.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Does not like to fight. It hides in tall grass and so on, foraging for food such as small bugs.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The claws on its feet are well developed. It can carry prey such as an EXEGGCUTE to its nest over 60 miles away.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It spreads its gorgeous wings widely to intimidate enemies. It races through the skies at Mach-2 speed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its fangs are long and very sharp. They grow continuously, so it gnaws on hard things to whittle them down.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its rear feet have three toes each. They are webbed, enabling it to swim across rivers.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It busily flits around here and there. Even if it is frail, it can be a tough foe that uses MIRROR MOVE.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its huge and magnificent wings can keep it aloft in the sky. It can remain flying a whole day without landing.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A very common sight in grassland, etc. It flicks its tongue in and out to sense danger in its surroundings.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly appears to be a frightening face. Weak foes will flee just at the sight of the pattern.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has small electric sacs on both its cheeks. If threatened, it looses electric charges from the sacs.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its electric charges can reach even 100,000 volts. Careless contact can cause even an Indian elephant to faint.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It burrows and lives underground. If threatened, it curls itself up into a ball for protection.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is adept at attacking with the spines on its back and its sharp claws while quickly scurrying about.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Though small, it must be treated with caution because of its powerfully toxic barbs. The female has smaller horns.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The female has a gentle temperament. It emits ultrasonic cries that have the power to befuddle foes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The body is covered by stiff, needle-like scales. If it becomes excited, the needles bristle outwards.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its large ears are flapped like wings when it is listening to distant sounds. It extends toxic barbs when angered.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is easily angered. By swinging its well-developed horn wildly, it can even punch through diamond.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is recognized by its rock-hard hide and its extended horn. Be careful with the horn as it contains venom.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its adorable appearance makes it popular as a pet. However, it is rare and difficult to find.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has an acute sense of hearing. It can easily hear a pin being dropped nearly 1,100 yards away.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"While young, it has six gorgeous tails. When it grows, several new tails are sprouted.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has nine long tails and fur that gleams gold. It is said to live for 1,000 years.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It captivates foes with its huge, round eyes, then lulls them to sleep by singing a soothing melody.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its fur is extremely fine, dense, and supple. The exquisitely pleasant fur conveys an image of luxury.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has no eyes. Instead, it relies on its ultrasonic cries for echo location to flit about in darkness.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It clamps down on its prey with needle-sharp fangs and drains over 10 ounces of blood in one gulp.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its scientific name is “Oddium Wanderus.” At night, it is said to walk nearly 1,000 feet on its two roots.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its pistils exude an incredibly foul odor. The horrid stench can cause fainting at a distance of 1.25 miles.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. It fiendishly scatters allergy-causing pollen from its petals.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Growing out of the bug’s back are mushrooms called tochukaso. The mushrooms grow with the bug host.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It scatters toxic spores from the mushroom cap. In China, the spores are used as herbal medicine.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its eyes act as radar, enabling it to be active in darkness. The eyes can also shoot powerful beams.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The wings are covered with dustlike scales. Every time it flaps its wings, it looses highly toxic dust.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It burrows through the ground at a shallow depth. It leaves raised earth in its wake, making it easy to spot.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"In battle, it digs through the ground and strikes the unsuspecting foe from an unexpected direction.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"All it does is sleep during the daytime. At night, it patrols its territory with its eyes aglow.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. It is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is constantly wracked by a headache. When the headache turns intense, it begins using mysterious powers.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The forelegs are webbed, helping to make it an adept swimmer. It can be seen swimming elegantly in lakes, etc.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is always outrageously furious. If it gives chase, it will tenaciously track the target no matter how far.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Very friendly and faithful to people. It will try to repel enemies by barking and biting.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON that is described in Chinese legends. It is said to race at an unbelievable speed.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its slick black skin is thin and damp. A part of its internal organs can be seen through the skin as a spiral pattern.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its two legs are well developed. Even though it can live on the ground, it prefers living in water.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"An adept swimmer, it knows the front crawl, butterfly, and more. It is faster than the best human swimmers.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It sleeps for 18 hours a day. It uses a variety of extrasensory powers even while asleep.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It happened one morning - a boy with extrasensory powers awoke in bed transformed into KADABRA.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It does not like physical attacks very much. Instead, it freely uses extrasensory powers to defeat foes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its whole body is composed of muscles. Even though it’s the size of a human child, it can hurl 100 grown-ups.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its formidable body never gets tired. It helps people by doing work such as the moving of heavy goods.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its four ruggedly developed arms can launch a flurry of 1,000 punches in just two seconds.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its bud looks like a human face. Because of the bud, it is rumored to be a type of legendary mandrake plant.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The leafy parts act as cutters for slashing foes. It spits a fluid that dissolves everything.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Lures prey into its mouth with a honeylike aroma. The helpless prey is melted with a dissolving fluid.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its eyes are as transparent as crystals. From them, it shoots mysterious beams of light.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has 80 tentacles that move about freely. They can sting, causing poisoning and sharp, stabbing pain.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its round form makes it easy to pick up. Some people have used them to hurl at each other in a snowball fight.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Be careful while hiking on mountain trails. GRAVELER may come rolling down the path without slowing.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is enclosed in a hard shell that is as rugged as slabs of rock. It sheds skin once a year to grow larger.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body is light, and its legs are incredibly powerful. It can clear Ayers Rock in one leap.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It can gallop at a top speed of 150 miles per hour. It can race as fast as a bullet train while ablaze.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is always vacantly lost in thought, but no one knows what it is thinking about. It is good at fishing with its tail.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When a SLOWPOKE went hunting in the sea, its tail was bitten by a SHELLDER. That made it evolve into SLOWBRO.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It moves while constantly hovering. It discharges THUNDER WAVE and so on from the units at its sides.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A linked cluster formed of several MAGNEMITE. It discharges powerful magnetic waves at high voltage.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It always walks about with a plant stalk clamped in its beak. The stalk is used for building its nest.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A two-headed POKéMON that was discovered as a sudden mutation. It runs at a pace of over 60 miles per hour.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"An odd species that is rarely found. The three heads respectively represent joy, sadness, and anger.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Covered with light blue fur, its hide is thick and tough. It is active in bitter cold of minus 40 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a pure white fur. The colder the weather, the more active it becomes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Sludge exposed to X rays from the moon transformed into GRIMER. It loves feeding on filthy things.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is usually undetectable because it blends in with the ground. Touching it can cause terrible poisoning.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is encased in a shell that is harder than diamond. Inside, however, it is surprisingly tender.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its shell is extremely hard. It cannot be shattered, even with a bomb. The shell opens only when it is attacking.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A being that exists as a thin gas. It can topple an Indian elephant by enveloping the prey in two seconds.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If you get the feeling of being watched in darkness when nobody is around, HAUNTER is there.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is said to emerge from darkness to steal the lives of those who become lost in mountains.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It usually lives underground. It searches for food while boring its way through the ground at 50 miles per hour.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A descendent of the legendary animal baku, which is said to eat dreams. It is skilled at hypnotism.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It carries a pendulum-like device. There once was an incident in which it took away a child it hypnotized.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It can be found near the sea. The large pincers grow back if they are torn out of their sockets.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its large and hard pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, being so big, it is unwieldy to move.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A life-form whose identity is unknown. It is said to SCREECH or suddenly SELFDESTRUCT.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It explodes in response to even minor stimuli. It is feared, with the nickname of “The Bomb Ball.”","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Even though it appears to be eggs of some sort, it was discovered to be a life-form more like plant seeds.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Tropical Rainforest.” Each of the nuts has a face and a will of its own.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It wears the skull of its dead mother on its head. When it becomes lonesome, it is said to cry loudly.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is small and was originally very weak. Its temperament turned ferocious when it began using bones.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The legs freely contract and stretch. The stretchy legs allow it to hit a distant foe with a rising kick.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The spirit of a pro boxer has infused this POKéMON. It throws punches that are faster than a bullet train.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its tongue is twice the length of its body. It can be moved like an arm for grabbing food and attacking.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its thin, balloon-like body is inflated by horribly toxic gases. It reeks when it is nearby.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Very rarely, a sudden mutation can result in two small KOFFING twins becoming conjoined as a WEEZING.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Strong, but not too bright, this POKéMON can shatter even a skyscraper with its charging TACKLES.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It begins walking on its hind legs after evolution. It can punch holes through boulders with its horn.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It lays several eggs a day. The eggs are apparently rich in nutrients and extremely delicious.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Blue plant vines cloak the POKéMON’s identity in a tangled mass. It entangles anything that gets close.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The female raises its offspring in a pouch on its belly. It is skilled at attacking using COMET PUNCH.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It maintains balance using its tail, which is wound up like a coil. It may spray ink from its mouth.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body bristles with sharp spikes. Carelessly trying to touch it could cause fainting from the spikes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its dorsal and pectoral fins are strongly developed like muscles. It can swim at a speed of five knots.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"The horn on its head is sharp like a drill. It bores a hole in a boulder to make its nest.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It appears in large numbers by seashores. At night, its central core flashes with a red light.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON has a geometric body. Because of its body, the locals suspect that it is an alien creature.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is adept at conning people. It is said to be able to create walls out of thin air by miming.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It tears and shreds prey with its wickedly sharp scythes. It very rarely spreads its wings to fly.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It speaks using a language that sounds human. Research is under way to determine what is being said.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It loves to feed on strong electricity. It occasionally appears around large power plants and so on.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Found near the mouth of a volcano. This fire-breather’s body temperature is nearly 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its two long pincer horns are powerful. Once they grip an enemy, they won’t release until the foe is torn.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"When it is about to TACKLE, it whips its body repeatedly with its three long tails.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is virtually worthless in terms of both power and speed. It is the most weak and pathetic POKéMON in the world.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has an extremely aggressive nature. The HYPER BEAM it shoots from its mouth totally incinerates all targets.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its high intelligence enables it to understand human speech. It likes to ferry people on its back.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It can freely recombine its own cellular structure to transform into other life-forms.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"An extremely rare POKéMON that may evolve in a number of different ways depending on stimuli.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its body’s cellular structure is similar to the molecular composition of water. It can melt invisibly in water.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"If it is angered or startled, the fur all over its body bristles like sharp needles that pierce foes.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It has a flame bag inside its body. After inhaling deeply, it blows out flames of nearly 3,100 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Using the most advanced technologies, scientists finally succeeded in making the first artificial POKéMON.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A prehistoric POKéMON that lived in the primordial sea, it swims by twisting its 10 tentacles about.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its tentacles are highly developed as if they are hands and feet. As soon as it ensnares prey, it bites.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"This POKéMON was regenerated from the fossil of an ancient creature. It protects itself with a hard shell.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It swims freely through water. It catches prey with its scythe-like arms and drains the victim’s fluids.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It was regenerated from a dinosaur’s genetic matter that was found in amber. It flies with high-pitched cries.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is not satisfied unless it eats over 880 pounds of food every day. When it is done eating, it goes promptly to sleep.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird POKéMON. With its long tail trailing behind, its flying form is magnificent.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird POKéMON. While it is flying, it makes crackling and snapping sounds.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird POKéMON. Those seeing it are overwhelmed by its orange wings that seem to be on fire.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Even the young can exceed 6.5 feet in length. It grows larger by repeatedly shedding skin.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It is said to live in seas and lakes. Even though it has no wings, it has been seen flying occasionally.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"It can fly in spite of its big and bulky physique. It circles the globe in just 16 hours.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON whose genetic code was repeatedly recombined for research. It turned vicious as a result.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"A POKéMON of South America that was thought to have been extinct. It is very intelligent and learns any move.","esFrom":"letsgopikachu"},{"en":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaves have the ability to check the humidity and temperature.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A spicy aroma emanates from around its neck. The aroma acts as a stimulant to restore health.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MEGANIUM’s breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It usually stays hunched over. If it is angry or surprised, it shoots flames out of its back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is hard for it to support its own weight out of water, so it gets down on all fours. But it moves fast.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"There is no telling where its tail begins. Despite its short legs, it is quick at hunting RATTATA.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a perfect sense of time. Whatever happens, it keeps rhythm by precisely tilting its head in time.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When the weather turns cold, numerous LEDYBA gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The star patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It spins a web using fine--but durable-- thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A single strand of a special string is endlessly spun out of its rear. The string leads back to its nest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"On the dark ocean floor, its only means of communication is its constantly flashing lights.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It blinds prey with an intense burst of light, then swallows the immobilized prey in a single gulp.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its extremely flexible and elastic body makes it bounce continuously--anytime, anywhere.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A proverb claims that happiness will come to anyone who can make a sleeping TOGEPI stand up.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It usually forages for food on the ground but may, on rare occasions, hop onto branches to peck at shoots.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In South America, it is said that its right eye sees the future and its left eye views the past.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The bright light on its tail can be seen far away. It has been treasured since ancient times as a beacon.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The end of its tail serves as a buoy that keeps it from drowning, even in a vicious current.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from getting wet.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives atop tall trees. When leaping from branch to branch, it deftly uses its tail for balance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In the daytime, it rushes about in a hectic manner, but it comes to a complete stop when the sun sets.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its large eyes can scan 360 degrees. It looks in all directions to seek out insects as its prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it walks around on the ground, it coats its body with a slimy, poisonous film.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Due to its relaxed and carefree attitude, it often bumps its head on boulders and boat hulls as it swims.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When darkness falls, the rings on its body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered SLOWPOKE’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It loves to bite and yank people’s hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its tail, which also contains a small brain, may bite on its own if it notices an alluring smell.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It hangs and waits for flying-insect prey to come near. It does not move about much on its own.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If spotted, it escapes by burrowing with its tail. It can hover just slightly using its wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that if an ONIX lives for over 100 years, its composition changes to become diamond-like.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Because its fangs are too heavy, it always keeps its head tilted down. However, its BITE is powerful.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stores BERRIES inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Usually docile, but if disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Vicious in nature, it drives PIDGEY from their nests and feasts on the eggs that are left behind.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Before food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"With its ability to distinguish any smell, it unfailingly finds all food buried deep underground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its brittle shell occasionally spouts intense flames that circulate throughout its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it smells something enticing, it dashes off headlong to find the source of the aroma.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensitive to sound.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"In a south sea nation, the people live in communities that are built on groups of these POKéMON.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Using its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a MANTINE’s underside to scavenge for leftovers.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It instinctively sneaks into rocky holes. If it gets sleepy, it steals the nest of a fellow OCTILLERY.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It nests at the edge of sharp cliffs. It spends all day carrying food to its awaiting chicks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"After nesting in bramble bushes, the wings of its chicks grow hard from scratches by thorns.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other POKéMON get the shivers and head straight back to their nests.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take a long time to grow.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Those who stare at its antlers will gradually lose control of their senses and be unable to stand.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Even though it is small, it can’t be ignored because it will slug any handy target without warning.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It always rocks its head slowly backwards and forwards as if it is trying to kiss someone.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Even in the most vicious storm, this POKéMON plays happily if thunder rumbles in the sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is found in volcanic craters. Its body heat exceeds 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit, so don’t underestimate it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it has just had a baby, the milk it produces contains much more nutrition than usual.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a very compassionate nature. If it sees a sick POKéMON, it will nurse the sufferer back to health.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON races across the land while barking a cry that sounds like crashing thunder.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that races across the land. It is said that one is born every time a new volcano appears.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON races across the land. It is said that north winds will somehow blow whenever it appears.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is born deep underground. It can’t emerge until it has entirely consumed the soil around it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body can’t be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A legend says that its body glows in seven colors. A rainbow is said to form behind it when it flies.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When CELEBI disappears deep in a forest, it is said to leave behind an egg it brought from the future.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It quickly scales even vertical walls. It senses humidity with its tail to predict the next day’s weather.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its strongly developed thigh muscles give it astounding agility and jumping performance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The leaves on its forelegs are as sharp as swords. It agilely leaps about the branches of trees to strike.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It boosts its concentration by emitting harsh cries. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its large tail fin propels it through water with powerful acceleration. It is strong in spite of its size.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is at its best when on muddy ground with poor footing. It quickly overwhelms foes struggling in mud.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled TRAINER. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON with abundant curiosity. It shows an interest in everything, so it always zigs and zags.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When running in a straight line, it can top 60 miles per hour. However, it has a tough time with curved roads.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives amidst tall grass and in forests. When attacked, it resists by pointing its venomous spikes at the foe.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It conserves its energy by moving as little as possible. It awaits evolution while drinking only a little rainwater.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Despite its appearance, it has an aggressive nature. It attacks by jabbing with its long, thin mouth.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body, which is made of soft silk, hardens over time. When cracks appear, evolution is near.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It scatters horribly toxic dust when it senses danger. They tend to gather in the glow of streetlamps at night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates LUDICOLO’s cells, making it more powerful.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it remains still, it becomes impossible to distinguish from real nuts. It delights in surprising foraging PIDGEY.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of NUZLEAF’s grass flute fills listeners with dread.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If its two tail feathers are standing at attention, it is proof of good health. It soars elegantly in the sky.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It rides upon ocean winds as if it were a glider. In the winter, it hides food around its nest.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is a flying transporter that carries small POKéMON in its beak. It bobs on the waves to rest its wings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and POKéMON. It hides if it senses hostility.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its TRAINER.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sleeps for 20 hours every day. Making drowsy those that see it is one of its abilities.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is always hungry because it won’t stop rampaging. Even while it is eating, it can’t keep still.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is the world’s most slothful POKéMON. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is so quick, it is said to be able to avoid any attack. It loves to feed on tree sap.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A most peculiar POKéMON that somehow appears in a POKé BALL when a NINCADA evolves.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It usually murmurs, but starts crying loudly if it senses danger. It stops when its ear covers are shut.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It emits a variety of sounds from the holes all over its body. Its loud cries can be heard from over six miles away.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It grows stronger by enduring harsh training. It is a gutsy POKéMON that can withstand any attack.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It battles by flinging around its tail, which is bigger than its body. The tail is a flotation device in water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its magnetic nose consistently faces north. Travelers check NOSEPASS to get their bearings.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to be difficult to earn its trust. However, it is extremely popular for its cute looks and behavior.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The favorite of trend-conscious female TRAINERS, they are used in competition for their style and fur.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It uses its docile-looking face to lull foes into complacency, then bites with its huge, relentless jaws.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It eats iron to build its steel body. It is a pest that descends from mountains to eat bridges and train tracks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It claims a large mountain as its sole territory. It mercilessly thrashes those that violate its space.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It elegantly avoids attacks with dance-like steps, then launches a devastating blow in the same motion.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It cheers on partners while scattering sparks from its body. It climbs telephone poles to absorb electricity.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its dislike of water makes it take shelter under the eaves of houses in rain. It uses pom-poms made of sparks for cheering.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives around clean ponds. At night, its rear lights up. It converses with others by flashing its light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It guides VOLBEAT to draw signs in night skies. There are scientists that study the patterns it creates.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the ROSELIA is.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"There is nothing its stomach can’t digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can swallow a tire whole in one gulp. It secretes a horribly toxic fluid from the pores on its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"The ruffian of the seas, it has fangs that crunch through iron. It swims by jetting water from its rear.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"When it sucks in a large volume of seawater, it becomes like a big, bouncy ball. It eats a ton of food daily.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is among the largest of all POKéMON. It herds prey in a pack then swallows the massed prey in one gulp.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. When it grows cold, the magma hardens and slows it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell. If it is attacked, it belches thick, black smoke and flees.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can gain control over foes by doing odd dance steps. The black pearls on its forehead are precious gems.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical patterns. It confuses foes with its stumbling motions.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in deserts. It becomes active at night when it hunts for prey exhausted from the desert’s heat.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If you hear a beautiful melody trilling deep among mountains far from people, it is ALTARIA’s humming.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its health ebbs and flows with the lunar cycle. It brims with power when exposed to the light of the full moon.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It absorbs solar energy during the day. Always expressionless, it can sense what its foe is thinking.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It makes its nest at the bottom of swamps. It will eat anything - if it is alive, WHISCASH will eat it.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It came from overseas. It is a very hardy creature that will quickly proliferate, even in polluted streams.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"A rough customer that wildly flails its giant claws. It is said to be extremely hard to raise.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It became extinct roughly 100 million years ago. It was regenerated from a fossil using advanced techniques.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is a kind of POKéMON progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Protected by a hard shell, its body is very sturdy. It skewers prey with its claws to feed.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Ridiculed for its shabby appearance, it is ignored by researchers. It lives in ponds choked with weeds.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has the ability to change its form into the sun, the rain, or a snow cloud, depending on the weather.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It changes body color to blend in with its surroundings. It also changes color if it is happy or sad.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a POKéMON. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Making itself invisible, it silently sneaks up to prey. It has the ability to slip through thick walls.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives in tropical jungles. The bunch of fruit around its neck is delicious. The fruit grows twice a year.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said that a home visited by a SNORUNT will prosper. It can withstand cold of minus 150 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a body of ice that won’t melt, even with fire. It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its body is covered in fluffy fur. The fur keeps it from feeling cold while it is rolling on ice.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning SPHEAL on its nose.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea where no light ever filters down. It lights up its small fishlike tail to attract prey.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has remained unchanged for 100 million years. It was discovered during a deep-sea exploration.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its steel-hard head can shatter boulders. It longingly hopes for wings to grow so it can fly.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It uses magnetic waves to converse with its kind. All the cells in its body are magnetic.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is formed by two METANG fusing. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"Research revealed that its body is made of the same kind of ice that is found at the South Pole.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is sturdier than any kind of metal. It hardened due to pressure underground over tens of thousands of years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has a docile temperament and dislikes fighting. Tucking in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This legendary POKéMON is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling KYOGRE.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It has lived for hundreds of millions of years in the ozone layer. Its flying form looks like a meteor.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"It is said to make any wish come true. It is awake for only seven days out of a thousand years.","esFrom":"omegaruby"},{"en":"This DEOXYS has transformed into its aggressive guise. It can fool enemies by altering its appearance.","esFrom":"omegaruby"}],"leafgreen":[null,{"en":"A strange seed was planted on its back at birth. The plant sprouts and grows with this POKéMON.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When the bulb on its back grows large, it appears to lose the ability to stand on its hind legs.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its plant blooms when it is absorbing solar energy. It stays on the move to seek sunlight.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It has a preference for hot things. When it rains, steam is said to spout from the tip of its tail.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When it swings its burning tail, it elevates the air temperature to unbearably high levels.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It spits fire that is hot enough to melt boulders. It may cause forest fires by blowing flames.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"After birth, its back swells and hardens into a shell. It powerfully sprays foam from its mouth.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It often hides in water to stalk unwary prey. For fast swimming, it moves its ears to maintain balance.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The pressurized water jets on this brutal POKéMON’s shell are used for high-speed tackles.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"This POKéMON is vulnerable to attack while its shell is soft, exposing its weak and tender body.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"In battle, it flaps its wings at great speed to release highly toxic dust into the air.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Often found in forests, eating leaves. It has a sharp stinger on its head that injects poison.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Almost incapable of moving, this POKéMON can only harden its shell to protect itself when it is in danger.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It flies at high speed and attacks using the large venomous stingers on its forelegs and tail.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A common sight in forests and woods. It flaps its wings at ground level to kick up blinding sand.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Very protective of its sprawling territorial area, this POKéMON will fiercely peck at any intruder.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When hunting, it skims the surface of water at high speed to pick off unwary prey such as MAGIKARP.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Bites anything when it attacks. Small and very quick, it is a common sight in many places.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It uses its whiskers to maintain its balance. It apparently slows down if they are cut off.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Eats bugs in grassy areas. It has to flap its short wings at high speed to stay airborne.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"With its huge and magnificent wings, it can keep aloft without ever having to land for rest.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Moving silently and stealthily, it eats the eggs of birds, such as PIDGEY and SPEAROW, whole.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is rumored that the ferocious warning markings on its belly differ from area to area.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When several of these POKéMON gather, their electricity can build and cause lightning storms.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its long tail serves as a ground to protect itself from its own high-voltage power.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Burrows deep underground in arid locations far from water. It only emerges to hunt for prey.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Curls up into a spiny ball when threatened. It can roll while curled up to attack or escape.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Although small, its venomous barbs render this POKéMON dangerous. The female has smaller horns.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The female’s horns develop slowly. Prefers physical attacks such as clawing and biting.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its hard scales provide strong protection. It uses its hefty bulk to execute powerful moves.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It stiffens its ears to sense danger. The larger its horns, the more powerful its secreted venom.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"An aggressive POKéMON that is quick to attack. The horn on its head secretes a powerful venom.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey’s bones.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"With its magical and cute appeal, it has many admirers. It is rare and found only in certain areas.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A timid fairy POKéMON that is rarely seen, it will run and hide the moment it senses people.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When it is born, it has just one snow-white tail. The tail splits from its tip as it grows older.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Very smart and very vengeful. Grabbing one of its many tails could result in a 1,000-year curse.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When its huge eyes waver, it sings a mysteriously soothing melody that lulls its enemies to sleep.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The body is soft and rubbery. When angered, it will suck in air and inflate itself to an enormous size.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It forms colonies in perpetually dark places and uses ultrasonic waves to identify and approach targets.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Once it bites, it will not stop draining energy from the victim even if it gets too heavy to fly.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"During the day, it keeps its face buried in the ground. At night, it wanders around sowing its seeds.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The fluid that oozes from its mouth isn’t drool. It is a nectar that is used to attract prey.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The larger its petals, the more toxic pollen it contains. Its big head is heavy and hard to hold up.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Burrows to suck tree roots. The mushrooms on its back grow by drawing nutrients from the bug host.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A host-parasite pair in which the parasite mushroom has taken over the host bug. Prefers damp places.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Lives in the shadows of tall trees where it eats bugs. It is attracted by light at night.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The dustlike scales covering its wings are color-coded to indicate the kinds of poison it has.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Lives about one yard underground where it feeds on plant roots. It sometimes appears aboveground.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A team of DIGLETT triplets. It triggers huge earthquakes by burrowing 60 miles underground.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Adores round objects. It wanders the streets on a nightly basis to look for dropped loose change.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"While lulling its enemies with its vacant look, this wily POKéMON will use psychokinetic powers.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Often seen swimming elegantly by lakeshores. It is often mistaken for the Japanese monster Kappa.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Always furious and tenacious to boot. It will not abandon chasing its quarry until it catches up.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is very protective of its territory. It will bark and bite to repel intruders from its space.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A POKéMON that has long been admired for its beauty. It runs agilely as if on wings.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its newly grown legs prevent it from walking well. It appears to prefer swimming over walking.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It can live in or out of water. When out of water, it constantly sweats to keep its body slimy.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A swimmer adept at both the front crawl and breaststroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Using its ability to read minds, it will sense impending danger and TELEPORT to safety.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It emits special alpha waves from its body that induce headaches just by being close.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its brain can outperform a supercomputer. Its IQ (intelligence quotient) is said to be around 5,000.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Loves to build its muscles. It trains in all styles of martial arts to become even stronger.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its muscular body is so powerful, it must wear a power-save belt to be able to regulate its motions.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its superpowerful punches are said to knock the victim flying clear over the horizon.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A carnivorous POKéMON that traps and eats bugs. It appears to use its root feet to replenish moisture.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It spits out POISONPOWDER to immobilize the enemy and then finishes it with a spray of ACID.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Said to live in huge colonies deep in jungles, although no one has ever returned from there.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Drifts in shallow seas. Anglers who hook them by accident are often punished by their stingers.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The tentacles are normally kept short. On hunts, they are extended to ensnare and immobilize prey.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Found in fields and mountains. Mistaking them for boulders, people often step or trip on them.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Rolls down slopes to move. It rolls over any obstacle without slowing or changing its direction.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its boulder-like body is extremely hard. It can easily withstand dynamite blasts without taking damage.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its hooves are ten times harder than diamond. It can trample anything completely flat in little time.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Very competitive, this POKéMON will chase anything that moves fast in the hopes of racing it.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Incredibly slow and dopey. It takes five seconds for it to feel pain when under attack.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The SHELLDER that latches onto SLOWPOKE’s tail is said to feed on the host’s leftover scraps.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Uses antigravity to stay suspended. Appears without warning and uses THUNDER WAVE and similar moves.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Formed by several MAGNEMITE linked together. They frequently appear when sunspots flare up.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The plant stalk it holds is its weapon. The stalk is used like a sword to cut all sorts of things.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A bird that makes up for its poor flying with its fast foot speed. Leaves giant footprints.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Uses its three brains to execute complex plans. While two heads sleep, one head is said to stay awake.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The protruding horn on its head is very hard. It is used for bashing through thick icebergs.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It stores thermal energy in the body. It swims at a steady eight knots even in intensely cold waters.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Appears in filthy areas. It thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Thickly covered with a filthy, vile sludge. It is so toxic, even its footprints contain poison.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its hard shell repels any kind of attack. It is vulnerable only when its shell is open.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When attacked, it launches its horns in quick volleys. Its innards have never been seen.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Because of its ability to slip through block walls, it is said to be from another dimension.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"On the night of a full moon, if shadows move on their own and laugh, it must be GENGAR’s doing.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"As it grows, the stone portions of its body harden to become similar to black-colored diamonds.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Puts enemies to sleep, then eats their dreams. Occasionally gets sick from eating only bad dreams.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When it locks eyes with an enemy, it will use a mix of PSI moves such as HYPNOSIS and CONFUSION.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its pincers are not only powerful weapons, they are used for balance when walking sideways.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The large pincer has 10,000-horsepower crushing force. However, its huge size makes it unwieldy to use.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Usually found in power plants. Easily mistaken for a POKé BALL, it has zapped many people.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It stores electric energy under very high pressure. It often explodes with little or no provocation.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is often mistaken for eggs. When disturbed, they quickly gather and attack in swarms.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is said that on rare occasions, one of its heads will drop off and continue on as an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this POKéMON’s real face.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The bone it holds is its key weapon. It throws the bone skillfully like a boomerang to KO targets.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When in a hurry, its legs lengthen progressively. It runs smoothly with extra-long, loping strides.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning-fast volleys that are impossible to see.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its tongue can be extended like a chameleon’s. It leaves a tingling sensation when it licks enemies.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Because it stores several kinds of toxic gases in its body, it is prone to exploding without warning.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Where two kinds of poison gases meet, two KOFFING can fuse into a WEEZING over many years.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its massive bones are 1,000 times harder than human bones. Its TACKLE can knock a semitrailer flying.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Protected by an armor-like hide, it is capable of living in molten lava of 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A rare and elusive POKéMON that is said to bring happiness to those who manage to catch one.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. The vines sway as it walks.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"The infant rarely ventures out of its mother’s protective pouch until it is three years old.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Known to shoot down flying bugs with precision blasts of ink from the surface of the water.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is capable of swimming backwards by rapidly flapping its winglike pectoral fins and stout tail.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its tail fin billows like an elegant ballroom dress, giving it the nickname of “The Water Queen.”","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"In the autumn spawning season, they can be seen swimming powerfully up rivers and creeks.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"An enigmatic POKéMON that can effortlessly regenerate any appendage it loses in battle.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its central core glows with the seven colors of the rainbow. Some people value the core as a gem.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"If interrupted while it is miming, it will suddenly DOUBLESLAP the offender with its broad hands.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"With ninja-like agility and speed, it can create the illusion that there is more than one of itself.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It seductively wiggles its hips as it walks. It can cause people to dance in unison with it.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Normally found near power plants, they can wander away and cause major blackouts in cities.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its body always burns with an orange glow that enables it to hide perfectly amidst flames.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"If it fails to crush the foe in its pincers, it will swing around and toss the opponent.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When it targets an enemy, it charges furiously while whipping its body with its long tails.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"In the distant past, it was somewhat stronger than the horribly weak descendants that exist today.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Rarely seen in the wild. Huge and vicious, it is capable of destroying entire cities in a rage.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A POKéMON that has been overhunted almost to extinction. It can ferry people on its back.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Capable of copying an opponent’s genetic code to instantly transform itself into a duplicate of the enemy.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its genetic code is irregular. It may mutate if it is exposed to radiation from element STONES.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Lives close to water. Its long tail is ridged with a fin which is often mistaken for a mermaid’s.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It accumulates negative ions in the atmosphere to blast out 10,000-volt lightning bolts.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"When storing thermal energy in its body, its temperature can soar to over 1,600 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. It is capable of moving freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Although long extinct, in rare cases, it can be genetically regenerated from fossils.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Despite having strong fangs and tentacles, it went extinct when its heavy shell made it unable to catch prey.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was regenerated from a fossil found in what was once the ocean floor long ago.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Its sleek shape is perfect for swimming. It slashes prey with its claws and drains their fluids.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A ferocious, prehistoric POKéMON that goes for the enemy’s throat with its serrated, sawlike fangs.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Very lazy. Just eats and sleeps. As its rotund bulk builds, it becomes steadily more slothful.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A legendary bird POKéMON that is said to appear to doomed people who are lost in icy mountains.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A legendary bird POKéMON that is said to appear from clouds while dropping enormous lightning bolts.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It is said to be the legendary bird POKéMON of fire. Every flap of its wings creates a dazzling flare of flames.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Long considered a mythical POKéMON until recently, when a small colony was found living underwater.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A mystical POKéMON that exudes a gentle aura. It is said to have the ability to change the weather.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"Only a very few people ever see this POKéMON. Its intelligence is said to match that of humans.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"It was created by a scientist after years of horrific gene-splicing and DNA-engineering experiments.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"So rare that it is still said to be a mirage by many experts. Only a few people have seen it worldwide.","esFrom":"letsgoeevee"},{"en":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up the sun’s rays.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The scent of spices comes from around its neck. Somehow, sniffing it makes you want to fight.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The aroma that rises from its petals contains a substance that calms aggressive feelings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is timid and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its well-developed jaws are powerful and capable of crushing anything. Even its TRAINER must be careful.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears up its victim.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A very cautious POKéMON, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other POKéMON to enter.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially adapted. They concentrate even faint light and enable it to see in the dark.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is very timid. It will be afraid to move if it is alone. But it will be active if it is in a group.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It is hard to tell which end is which.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It shoots positive and negative electricity between the tips of its two antennae and zaps its enemies.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The light it emits is so bright that it can illuminate the sea’s surface from a depth of over three miles.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The shell seems to be filled with joy. It is said that it will share good luck when treated kindly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Because its wings aren’t yet fully grown, it has to hop to get around. It is always staring at something.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"They say that it stays still and quiet because it is seeing both the past and future at the same time.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won’t grow.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The tail’s tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"BELLOSSOM gather at times and appear to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The tip of its tail, which contains oil that is lighter than water, lets it swim without drowning.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can even tell what is in wild, fast-moving rivers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears to be closer to a rock than a plant.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. They do enjoy gentle breezes, though.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The bloom on top of its head opens and closes as the temperature fluctuates up and down.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores to float, even around the world.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It may drop out of the sky suddenly. If attacked by a SPEAROW, it will violently shake its leaves.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It converts sunlight into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and becomes still.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON lives in cold water. It will leave the water to search for food when it gets cold outside.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This carefree POKéMON has an easygoing nature. While swimming, it always bumps into boat hulls.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When agitated, this POKéMON protects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It likes playing mischievous tricks such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Their shapes look like hieroglyphs on ancient tablets. It is said that the two are somehow related.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It hates light and shock. If attacked, it inflates its body to pump up its counterstrike.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent and bite.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It likes to make its shell thicker by adding layers of tree bark. The extra weight doesn’t bother it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside the armor is a total mystery.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When spotted, this POKéMON escapes backward by furiously boring into the ground with its tail.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It flies straight at its target’s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its body has been compressed deep under the ground. As a result, it is even harder than diamond.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is actually timid and easily spooked. If attacked, it flails about to fend off its attacker.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"To fire its poison spikes, it must inflate its body by drinking over 2.6 gallons of water all at once.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The BERRIES it stores in its vaselike shell decompose and become a gooey liquid.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This powerful POKéMON thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it suddenly extends the claws and startles its enemy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it finds honey, its crescent mark glows. It always licks its paws because they are soaked with honey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Although it is a good climber, it prefers to snap stout trees with its forelegs and eat fallen BERRIES.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The shell on its back is just skin that has cooled and hardened. It breaks easily with a slight touch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It continuously sheds and grows. The tip of its head is prized as a treasure for its beauty.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has superb accuracy. The water it shoots out can strike even moving prey from more than 100 yards.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It traps enemies with its suction-cupped tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It carries food all day long. There are tales about lost people who were saved by the food it had.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if REMORAID attach to it to scavenge for its leftovers.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its sturdy wings look heavy, but its bones are hollow and light, allowing it to fly freely in the sky.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, this can be dangerous.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its TACKLE is strong enough to knock down a house.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This upgraded version of PORYGON is designed for space exploration. However, it can’t even fly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A special fluid oozes from the tip of its tail. It paints the fluid everywhere to mark its territory.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is always bursting with energy. To make itself stronger, it keeps on fighting even if it loses.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If you become enchanted by its smooth, elegant, dance-like kicks, you may get drilled hard.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its lips are the most sensitive parts on its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It rotates its arms to generate electricity, but it tires easily, so it charges up only a little bit.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Each and every time it inhales and exhales, hot embers dribble out of its mouth and nostrils.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its milk is packed with nutrition, making it the ultimate beverage for the sick or weary.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Anyone who takes even one bite of BLISSEY’s egg becomes unfailingly caring and pleasant to everyone.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Volcanoes erupt when it barks. Unable to restrain its extreme power, it races headlong around the land.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Said to be the reincarnation of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it will fall asleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its THRASHING can topple a mountain.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its body can’t be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the bottom of the sea because its powers are too strong.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Legends claim this POKéMON flies the world’s skies continuously on its magnificent seven-colored wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It quickly scales even vertical walls. It senses humidity with its tail to predict the next day’s weather.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its strongly developed thigh muscles give it astounding agility and jumping performance.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The leaves on its forelegs are as sharp as swords. It agilely leaps about the branches of trees to strike.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has a flame sac inside its belly that perpetually burns. It feels warm if it is hugged.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It boosts its concentration by emitting harsh cries. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When facing a tough foe, it looses flames from its wrists. Its powerful legs let it jump clear over buildings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its large tail fin propels it through water with powerful acceleration. It is strong in spite of its size.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is at its best when on muddy ground with poor footing. It quickly overwhelms foes struggling in mud.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its arms are rock-hard. With one swing, they can batter down its foe. It makes its nest on beautiful beaches.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has a very tenacious nature. Its acute sense of smell lets it chase a chosen prey without ever losing track.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled TRAINER. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A POKéMON with abundant curiosity. It shows an interest in everything, so it always zigs and zags.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When running in a straight line, it can top 60 miles per hour. However, it has a tough time with curved roads.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives amidst tall grass and in forests. When attacked, it resists by pointing its venomous spikes at the foe.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It conserves its energy by moving as little as possible. It awaits evolution while drinking only a little rainwater.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Despite its appearance, it has an aggressive nature. It attacks by jabbing with its long, thin mouth.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its body, which is made of soft silk, hardens over time. When cracks appear, evolution is near.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It scatters horribly toxic dust when it senses danger. They tend to gather in the glow of streetlamps at night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It searches about for clean water. If it does not drink water for too long, the leaf on its head wilts.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The rhythm of bright, festive music activates LUDICOLO’s cells, making it more powerful.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it remains still, it becomes impossible to distinguish from real nuts. It delights in surprising foraging PIDGEY.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"They live in holes bored in large trees. The sound of NUZLEAF’s grass flute fills listeners with dread.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A POKéMON that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It dislikes cold seasons. They migrate to other lands in search of warmth, flying over 180 miles a day.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If its two tail feathers are standing at attention, it is proof of good health. It soars elegantly in the sky.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It rides upon ocean winds as if it were a glider. In the winter, it hides food around its nest.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is a flying transporter that carries small POKéMON in its beak. It bobs on the waves to rest its wings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is highly attuned to the emotions of people and POKéMON. It hides if it senses hostility.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The cheerful spirit of its TRAINER gives it energy for its psychokinetic power. It spins and dances when happy.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has the power to predict the future. Its power peaks when it is protecting its TRAINER.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"They usually live on ponds, but after an evening shower, they may appear on puddles in towns.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The antennae have distinctive patterns that look like eyes. When it rains, they grow heavy, making flight impossible.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It prefers damp places. By day it remains still in the forest shade. It releases toxic powder from its head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The seeds on its tail are made of toxic spores. It knocks out foes with quick, virtually invisible punches.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It sleeps for 20 hours every day. Making drowsy those that see it is one of its abilities.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is always hungry because it won’t stop rampaging. Even while it is eating, it can’t keep still.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is the world’s most slothful POKéMON. However, it can exert horrifying power by releasing pent-up energy all at once.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON is so quick, it is said to be able to avoid any attack. It loves to feed on tree sap.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A most peculiar POKéMON that somehow appears in a POKé BALL when a NINCADA evolves.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It usually murmurs, but starts crying loudly if it senses danger. It stops when its ear covers are shut.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When it stamps its feet and bellows, it generates ultrasonic waves that can blow apart a house.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It emits a variety of sounds from the holes all over its body. Its loud cries can be heard from over six miles away.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It grows stronger by enduring harsh training. It is a gutsy POKéMON that can withstand any attack.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It stomps on the ground to build power. It can send a 10-ton truck flying with a straight-arm punch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It battles by flinging around its tail, which is bigger than its body. The tail is a flotation device in water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its magnetic nose consistently faces north. Travelers check NOSEPASS to get their bearings.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said to be difficult to earn its trust. However, it is extremely popular for its cute looks and behavior.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The favorite of trend-conscious female TRAINERS, they are used in competition for their style and fur.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It uses its docile-looking face to lull foes into complacency, then bites with its huge, relentless jaws.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It eats iron to build its steel body. It is a pest that descends from mountains to eat bridges and train tracks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It habitually shows off its strength with the size of sparks it creates by ramming its steel body into boulders.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It claims a large mountain as its sole territory. It mercilessly thrashes those that violate its space.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It elegantly avoids attacks with dance-like steps, then launches a devastating blow in the same motion.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It stores static electricity in its fur for discharging. It gives off sparks if a storm approaches.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It rarely appears before people. It is said to nest where lightning has fallen.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It cheers on partners while scattering sparks from its body. It climbs telephone poles to absorb electricity.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its dislike of water makes it take shelter under the eaves of houses in rain. It uses pom-poms made of sparks for cheering.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives around clean ponds. At night, its rear lights up. It converses with others by flashing its light.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It guides VOLBEAT to draw signs in night skies. There are scientists that study the patterns it creates.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the ROSELIA is.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"There is nothing its stomach can’t digest. While it is digesting, vile, overpowering gases are expelled.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It can swallow a tire whole in one gulp. It secretes a horribly toxic fluid from the pores on its body.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"The ruffian of the seas, it has fangs that crunch through iron. It swims by jetting water from its rear.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When it sucks in a large volume of seawater, it becomes like a big, bouncy ball. It eats a ton of food daily.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is among the largest of all POKéMON. It herds prey in a pack then swallows the massed prey in one gulp.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Magma of almost 2,200 degrees Fahrenheit courses through its body. When it grows cold, the magma hardens and slows it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If angered, the humps on its back erupt in a shower of molten lava. It lives in the craters of volcanoes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell. If it is attacked, it belches thick, black smoke and flees.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It can gain control over foes by doing odd dance steps. The black pearls on its forehead are precious gems.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"No two SPINDA are said to have identical patterns. It confuses foes with its stumbling motions.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives in arid deserts. It makes a sloping pit trap in sand where it patiently awaits prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It generates ultrasonic waves by violently flapping its wings. After making its prey faint, it melts the prey with acid.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It prefers harsh environments such as deserts. It can survive for 30 days on water stored in its body.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives in deserts. It becomes active at night when it hunts for prey exhausted from the desert’s heat.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It constantly grooms its cotton-like wings. It takes a shower to clean itself if it becomes dirty.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If you hear a beautiful melody trilling deep among mountains far from people, it is ALTARIA’s humming.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"If it comes across a SEVIPER, its fur bristles and it assumes its battle pose. Its sharp claws are its best weapon.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its health ebbs and flows with the lunar cycle. It brims with power when exposed to the light of the full moon.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It absorbs solar energy during the day. Always expressionless, it can sense what its foe is thinking.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It makes its nest at the bottom of swamps. It will eat anything - if it is alive, WHISCASH will eat it.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It came from overseas. It is a very hardy creature that will quickly proliferate, even in polluted streams.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"A rough customer that wildly flails its giant claws. It is said to be extremely hard to raise.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It was discovered in ancient ruins. While moving, it constantly spins. It stands on one foot even when asleep.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It appears to have been born from clay dolls made by ancient people. It uses telekinesis to float and move.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It became extinct roughly 100 million years ago. It was regenerated from a fossil using advanced techniques.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is a kind of POKéMON progenitor. It uses its extending claws to catch prey hiding among rocks on the seafloor.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Protected by a hard shell, its body is very sturdy. It skewers prey with its claws to feed.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Ridiculed for its shabby appearance, it is ignored by researchers. It lives in ponds choked with weeds.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"MILOTIC is breathtakingly beautiful. Those that see it are said to forget their combative spirits.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has the ability to change its form into the sun, the rain, or a snow cloud, depending on the weather.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It changes body color to blend in with its surroundings. It also changes color if it is happy or sad.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It loves to feed on feelings like envy and malice. Its upright horn catches the emotions of people.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a POKéMON. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Making itself invisible, it silently sneaks up to prey. It has the ability to slip through thick walls.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its body is entirely hollow. When it opens its mouth, it sucks everything in as if it were a black hole.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives in tropical jungles. The bunch of fruit around its neck is delicious. The fruit grows twice a year.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It travels by riding on winds. It cleverly uses its long tail to pluck nuts and berries, which it loves to eat.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It appears when it senses an impending natural disaster. As a result, it was mistaken as a doom-bringer.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said that a home visited by a SNORUNT will prosper. It can withstand cold of minus 150 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has a body of ice that won’t melt, even with fire. It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its body is covered in fluffy fur. The fur keeps it from feeling cold while it is rolling on ice.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It touches new things with its nose to test for smell and feel. It plays by spinning SPHEAL on its nose.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It swims through icy seas while shattering ice floes with its large tusks. It is protected by its thick blubber.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is protected by a sturdy shell. Once in a lifetime, it makes a magnificent pearl.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea where no light ever filters down. It lights up its small fishlike tail to attract prey.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its swimming form is exquisitely elegant. With its thin mouth, it feeds on seaweed that grows between rocks.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has remained unchanged for 100 million years. It was discovered during a deep-sea exploration.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"During the spawning season, countless LUVDISC congregate at coral reefs, turning the waters pink.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its steel-hard head can shatter boulders. It longingly hopes for wings to grow so it can fly.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Its armored body makes all attacks bounce off. The armor is too tough, however, making it heavy and somewhat sluggish.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It becomes uncontrollable if it is enraged. It destroys everything with shredding claws and fire.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It uses magnetic waves to converse with its kind. All the cells in its body are magnetic.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It floats midair using magnetism. Its body is so tough, even a crash with a jet plane won’t leave a scratch.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is formed by two METANG fusing. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"Research revealed that its body is made of the same kind of ice that is found at the South Pole.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is sturdier than any kind of metal. It hardened due to pressure underground over tens of thousands of years.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It can telepathically communicate with people. It changes its appearance using its down that refracts light.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has a docile temperament and dislikes fighting. Tucking in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This POKéMON is said to have expanded the sea by bringing heavy rains. It has the power to control water.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"This legendary POKéMON is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling KYOGRE.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It has lived for hundreds of millions of years in the ozone layer. Its flying form looks like a meteor.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"It is said to make any wish come true. It is awake for only seven days out of a thousand years.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"},{"en":"When it changes form, an aurora appears. It absorbs attacks by altering its cellular structure.","esFrom":"alphasapphire"}],"diamond":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that CHARIZARD’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in forests with others. It stores electricity in the pouches on its cheeks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It turns aggressive if it has too much electricity in its body. It discharges power through its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It curls up, then rolls into foes with its back. Its sharp spines inflict severe damage.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Thought to live with others on quiet mountains, it is popular for its adorable nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rarely seen by people, it is said to be drawn by the full moon to play at deserted lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even though it has no eyes, it can sense obstacles using ultrasonic waves it emits from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the blood of humans and Pokémon. It flies around at night in search of neck veins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host PARAS.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls PARASECT. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its usual headache worsens, it starts exhibiting odd powers. It can’t remember doing so, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives in lakes. It swims faster than any human swimming champion.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps for 18 hours a day. Even when awake, it teleports itself while remaining seated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one is nearby, an eerie shadow appears on TV screens. Seeing the shadow is said to bring bad luck.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its superb memory lets it recall everything it has experienced from birth. Its IQ exceeds 5,000.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hefts a GRAVELER repeatedly to strengthen its entire body. It uses every type of martial arts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"MACHOKE’s boundless power is very dangerous, so it wears a belt that suppresses its energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It punches with its four arms at blinding speed. It can launch 1,000 punches in two seconds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is virtually composed of water. It shoots strange beams from its crystal-like eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With 80 tentacles for ensnaring victims, it prevents escape until the prey is weakened by poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many live on mountain trails and remain half buried while keeping an eye on climbers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"GRAVELER make their homes on sheer cliff faces by gouging out numerous horizontal holes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sheds its hide once a year. Its boulderlike body is so tough, even dynamite can’t harm it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"About an hour after birth, its fiery mane and tail grow out, giving it an impressive appearance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gallops at nearly 150 mph. With its mane blazing ferociously, it races as if it were an arrow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The units at its sides generate electromagnetic waves that keep it airborne. It feeds on electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is actually three MAGNEMITE linked by magnetism. A group can set off a magnetic storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives on icebergs. It swims in the sea using the point on its head to break up ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon’s body is 95% made up of gases, which are blown away by strong gusts of wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can slip through any obstacle. It lurks inside walls to keep an eye on its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in shadows. It is said that if GENGAR is hiding, it cools the area by nearly 10 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it travels underground, it causes rumbling and tremors. It can move at 50 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Instead of hands, it uses its tongue, which is twice its height. Its sticky saliva grips anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to deliver happiness. Being compassionate, it shares its eggs with injured people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims elegantly by flittering its tail fin as if it were a dress. It has the look of a queen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest by hollowing out boulders in streams with its horn. It defends its eggs with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a pantomime expert that can create invisible but solid walls using miming gestures.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nearly impossible to parry its attacking scythes. Its movements are like a ninja’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Half of all blackouts occur when this Pokémon appears at power plants and eats electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born in the spout of a volcano, its body is covered by flames that shimmer like the sun.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it can’t tear, it tosses far.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to be the world’s weakest Pokémon. No one knows why it has managed to survive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it appears, its rage never settles until it has razed the fields and mountains around it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to reconstitute its entire cellular structure to transform into whatever it sees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon that adapts to harsh environments by taking on different evolutionary forms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has evolved to be suitable for an aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its stomach can digest any kind of food, even if it happens to be moldy or rotten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining MEW’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe MEW to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always stands on one foot. Even when attacked, it does not brace itself using both feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes are special. They can pick out objects as long as there is the tiniest amount of light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Having four wings enables it to fly faster and more quietly. It turns active when the night comes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"LANTURN’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electric pouches on its cheeks are still small. They cannot store much electricity yet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its silhouette is like a star. It is believed to arrive riding on shooting stars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its shell is said to be stuffed with happiness that it shares with kindhearted people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called “joy dust.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its tail as a float, it dives underwater. It likes eating plants that grow on river bottoms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in rivers and lakes. In water, its coloring and patterns trick the vision of foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite appearing to be a tree, its body is closer to rocks and stones. It is very weak to water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its tail to pluck fruits that are out of reach. Its tail is more adept than its real hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes can see 360 degrees without moving its head. It won’t miss prey--even those behind it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in cold water, half burying itself in mud at the bottom to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a sluggish nature. It lies at the river’s bottom, waiting for prey to stray into its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The light of the moon changed EEVEE’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is believed that seeing this Pokémon at night will bring about ominous occurrences.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to sneak up on people late at night, then startle them with its shrieklike cry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Shaped like ancient writing, it is a huge mystery whether language or UNOWN came first.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail also has a small brain. It bites to repel any foe trying to sneak up on it from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sails on the winds with its limbs extended to strike from the sky. It aims for the prey’s face.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Tempered underground under high pressure and heat, its body is harder than any metal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gathers in forests to search for tree sap, its favorite food. It’s strong enough to hurl foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It feeds on eggs stolen from nests. Its sharply hooked claws rip vulnerable spots on prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves eating mushrooms that grow under dead grass. It also finds hot springs while foraging.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its shaggy coat makes it unable to see. It checks surroundings with its sensitive nose instead.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It squirts water forcefully from its mouth to shoot down flying prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the gaps of boulders and in holes on the seafloor. Its suction cups grip prey tightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the waves are calm, one may encounter a swarm of MANTINE swimming as if they are in flight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It generates electricity by whirling its arms. However, it can’t store the energy it makes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body temperature is around 1,100 degrees F. It is healthy if it is breathing yellow flames.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink MILTANK’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This kindhearted Pokémon nurses sick Pokémon to health. It senses feelings of sadness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to eat leaves. If it is attacked by a STARLY, it will defend itself with its spiked rear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It anchors itself by wrapping twigs with the silk from its body. It motionlessly awaits evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an aggressive nature. It stabs prey with its long, narrow mouth to drain the prey’s fluids.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is hot inside its cocoon. All the cells in its body create the energy for it to evolve.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A nocturnal Pokémon. Drawn by streetlights, they messily eat the leaves of trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest on steep sea cliffs. Riding updrafts, it soars to great heights.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dips its large bill in the sea, then scoops up numerous prey along with water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the horns on its head to sense human emotions. It is said to appear in front of cheerful people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It will try to guard its trusted Trainer with its life. It has the ability to see the future.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heart beats at a tenfold tempo, so it cannot sit still for even a moment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives by water. It moves quickly on land by bouncing on its big tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nose is a magnet. As a result, this Pokémon always keeps its face pointing north.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Through yoga training, it has honed its sixth sense. Its movements are elegant.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves ILLUMISE’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"ROSELIA raised on clean drinking water are known to grow vividly colored flowers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks like a fluffy cloud when it is in flight. It hums with its soprano voice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It coats its entire body with a slimy fluid so it can squirm and slip away if grabbed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very territorial. It repels foes by setting off tremors that extend over a three-mile radius.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is famous for its shabby appearance. While populous, they tend to cluster in set locations.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When people bicker, it is said to arise from the depths of lakes to becalm violent hearts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its appearance changes with the weather. Recently, its molecules were found to be just like water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it continually ate only its favorite fruit, the fruit started growing around its neck.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To knock foes flying, it makes the air shudder with its cries. It converses using seven cries.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the snow country, certain folklore says a house will prosper if a SNORUNT lives there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself, it clads its body in an armor of ice, made by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls across ice floes to reach shore because its body is poorly shaped for swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It converses with others by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Made from soil, the shell on its back hardens when it drinks water. It lives along lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives along water in forests. In the daytime, it leaves the forest to sunbathe its treed shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small Pokémon occasionally gather on its unmoving back to begin building their nests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It agilely scales sheer cliffs to live atop craggy mountains. Its fire is put out when it sleeps.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To intimidate attackers, it stretches the fire on its tail to make itself appear bigger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses a special kind of martial arts involving all its limbs. Its fire never goes out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it is very proud, it hates accepting food from people. Its thick down guards it from cold.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives alone, away from others. Apparently, every one of them believes it is the most important.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The three horns that extend from its beak attest to its power. The leader has the biggest horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They flock in great numbers. Though small, they flap their wings with great power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies around forests and fields in search of bug Pokémon. It stays within a huge flock.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a savage nature. It will courageously challenge foes that are much larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With nerves of steel, nothing can perturb it. It is more agile and active than it appears.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest by damming streams with bark and mud. It is known as an industrious worker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shakes its head back to front, causing its antennae to hit each other and sound like a xylophone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crosses its knifelike arms in front of its chest when it cries. It can compose melodies ad lib.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"All of its fur dazzles if danger is sensed. It flees while the foe is momentarily blinded.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its claws loose electricity with enough amperage to cause fainting. They live in small groups.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has eyes that can see through anything. It spots and captures prey hiding behind objects.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Over the winter, it closes its bud and endures the cold. In spring, the bud opens and releases pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attracts prey with a sweet aroma, then downs it with thorny whips hidden in its arms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its skull is as hard as iron.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its powerful head butt has enough power to shatter even the most durable things upon impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lived in jungles around 100 million years ago. Its facial hide is extremely hard.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Any frontal attack is repulsed. It is a docile Pokémon that feeds on grass and berries.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To shelter itself from cold, wintry winds, it covers itself with a cloak made of twigs and leaves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When BURMY evolved, its cloak became a part of this Pokémon’s body. The cloak is never shed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and steals honey collected by COMBEE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon formed by three others. It busily carries sweet floral honey to VESPIQUEN.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its abdomen is a honeycomb for grubs. It raises its grubs on honey collected by COMBEE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes fur balls that crackle with static electricity. It stores them with berries in tree holes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a flotation sac that is like an inflatable collar. It floats on water with its head out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It floats using its well-developed flotation sac. It assists in the rescues of drowning people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is very sweet and tasty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blooms during times of strong sunlight. It tries to make up for everything it endured as a bud.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its colors and shapes differ from region to region. In the Sinnoh region, two types are confirmed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a pliable body without any bones. If any part of its body is torn off, it grows right back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon formed by the spirits of people and Pokémon. It loves damp, humid seasons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s drowzy in daytime, but flies off in the evening in big groups. No one knows where they go.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It slams foes by sharply uncoiling its rolled ears. It stings enough to make a grown-up cry in pain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An extremely cautious Pokémon. It cloaks its body with its fluffy ear fur when it senses danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like incantations. Those hearing it are tormented by headaches and hallucinations.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous MURKROW in tow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It claws if displeased and purrs when affectionate. Its fickleness is very popular among some.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a brazen brute that barges its way into another Pokémon’s nest and claims it as its own.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It emits cries by agitating an orb at the back of its throat. It moves with flouncing hops.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It protects itself by spraying a noxious fluid from its rear. The stench lingers for 24 hours.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sprays a vile-smelling fluid from the tip of its tail to attack. Its range is over 160 feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Implements shaped like it were discovered in ancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One caused a news sensation when it was dug up at a construction site after a 2,000-year sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks as if it is always crying. It is actually adjusting its body’s fluid levels by eliminating excess.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves round white things. It carries an egg-shaped rock in imitation of CHANSEY.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can learn and speak human words. If they gather, they all learn the same saying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was formed by 108 spirits. It is bound to a fissure in an odd keystone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is a long-held belief that medicine made from its scales will heal even incurable illnesses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it folds up its body and extends its wings, it looks like a jet plane. It flies at sonic speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wolfs down its weight in food once a day, swallowing food whole with almost no chewing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in arid places. Instead of perspiration, it expels grainy sand from its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blasts internally stored sand from ports on its body to create a towering twister for attack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grips prey with its tail claws and injects poison. It tenaciously hangs on until the poison takes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cheeks hold poison sacs. It tries to catch foes off guard to jab them with toxic fingers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling saliva, then chomps down. It takes a whole day to eat prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After long exposure to sunlight, the patterns on its tail fins shine vividly when darkness arrives.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives on the deep-sea floor. It attracts prey by flashing the patterns on its four tail fins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A friendly Pokémon that captures the subtle flows of seawater using its two antennae.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives on snowy mountains. Having had little contact with humans, it is boldly inquisitive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whips up blizzards in mountains that are always buried in snow. It is the abominable snowman.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They live in cold regions, forming groups of four or five that hunt prey with impressive coordination.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. GEODUDE are shot at rare times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It will never appear where there is strife. Its sightings have become rare recently.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By churning its wings, it creates shock waves that inflict critical internal injuries to foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It observes prey while hanging inverted from branches. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Known as “The Being of Knowledge.” It is said that it can wipe out the memory of those who see its eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Known as “The Being of Emotion.” It taught humans the nobility of sorrow, pain, and joy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Known as “The Being of Willpower.” It sleeps at the bottom of a lake to keep the world in balance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power to control time. It appears in Sinnoh-region myths as an ancient deity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to distort space. It is described as a deity in Sinnoh-region mythology.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dwells in volcanic caves. It digs in with its cross-shaped feet to crawl on ceilings and walls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours. It appears in an ancient cemetery.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Shiny particles are released from its wings like a veil. It is said to represent the crescent moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives in warm seas. It inflates the flotation sac on its head to drift and search for food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born on a cold seafloor, it will swim great distances to return to its birthplace.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in flower patches and avoids detection by curling up to look like a flowering plant.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is described in mythology as the Pokémon that shaped the universe with its 1,000 arms.","esFrom":"x"}],"pearl":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that CHARIZARD’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the stamina to keep flying all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it looses crackling power from the electric pouches on its cheeks, it is being wary.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can loose 100,000-volt bursts of electricity, instantly downing foes several times its size.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It curls up, then rolls into foes with its back. Its sharp spines inflict severe damage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies using the wings on its back to collect moonlight. This Pokémon is difficult to find.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its hearing is so acute it can hear a pin drop over half a mile away. It lives on quiet mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Disliking sunlight, it sleeps deep in forests and caves until sundown.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it starts sucking blood, it does not stop until it is full. It flies at night in search of prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host PARAS.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is controlled by a mushroom grown larger than the bug body. It is said to prefer damp places.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never remembers using its odd powers, so it always tilts its head in puzzlement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flippers of its well-developed limbs give it shocking speed. It is the best swimmer among Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even while asleep, it maintains a telepathic radar. It teleports when it is threatened.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it uses its psychic power, it emits strong ha waves that can ruin precision devices.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its highly developed brain is on par with a supercomputer. It can use all forms of psychic abilities.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its muscles never cramp however much it trains. It lives in the mountains away from humans.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can lift a dump truck with one hand. Using that power, it helps people with heavy jobs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can knock a train flying with a punch. However, it is terrible at delicate work using its fingers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts in sea currents. Countless fishermen are hurt by its poison stingers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It alerts others to danger by stridently flashing the red orbs on its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is impossible to distinguish from rocks. It slams against others in contests of hardness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tumbles down slopes, heedless of any body parts chipping off. It eats a ton of rocks daily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tumbles down mountains, leaving grooves from peak to base. Stay clear of these grooves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs grow strong while it chases after its parent. It runs in fields and mountains all day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has astounding acceleration. From a standstill, it can reach top speed within 10 steps.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The units at its sides generate electromagnetic waves that keep it airborne. It feeds on electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is actually three MAGNEMITE linked by magnetism. A group can set off a magnetic storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives on icebergs. It swims in the sea using the point on its head to break up ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon born from poison gases. It defeats even the largest foes by enveloping them in gas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It licks with its gaseous tongue to steal the victim’s life force. It lurks in darkness for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lurking in the shadowy corners of rooms, it awaits chances to steal its prey’s life force.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It squirms through the ground using its long and rugged body. It always eats while burrowing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Instead of hands, it uses its tongue, which is twice its height. Its sticky saliva grips anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is clad in a thick hide, and its tackles topple buildings. Unfortunately, it is not smart.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its brain developed after it stood up on its hind legs. Its drill horn bores tunnels through solid rock.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lays several eggs a day and won’t share them with those who have evil in their hearts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims at a steady 5 knots. If it senses danger, it will strike back with its sharp horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect its family, it will fight with its drill-sharp horn. It lives in hollowed rocks in streams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Emanations from its fingertips solidify the air into invisible walls that repel even harsh attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nearly impossible to parry its attacking scythes. Its movements are like a ninja’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Half of all blackouts occur when this Pokémon appears at power plants and eats electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Born in the spout of a volcano, its body is covered by flames that shimmer like the sun.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it can’t tear, it tosses far.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is unable to swim against even slow-moving currents. It always splashes about for some reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In ancient literature, there is a record of a GYARADOS that razed a village when violence flared.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the ability to reconstitute its entire cellular structure to transform into whatever it sees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon that adapts to harsh environments by taking on different evolutionary forms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has evolved to be suitable for an aquatic life. It can invisibly melt away into water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It controls 10,000-volt power and can raise all the fur on its body as if it were sharp needles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a flame sac in its body. Its body temperature tops 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit before battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The world’s first artificially created Pokémon. It can travel through electronic space.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stops eating only to sleep. It doesn’t feel full unless it eats nearly 900 pounds a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining MEW’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe MEW to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It switches its standing foot so quickly, it can’t be seen. It cries at the same time every day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it flips its head upside down, it’s a sign that it is engaged in very complex thinking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that gained vastly enhanced flying performance by having its legs turn into wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"LANTURN’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It plays with others by touching tails and setting off sparks. This appears to be a test of courage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many appear when the night skies are filled with shooting stars. They disappear with sunrise.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its shell is said to be stuffed with happiness that it shares with kindhearted people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to appear in front of kindly people to scatter a glowing down called “joy dust.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The tip of its tail is filled with oil that is lighter than water, so it acts as a float.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of living things on riverbeds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stands along paths pretending to be a tree. If it starts raining, it seems to disappear.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives atop giant trees. It wraps its tail around a branch so it won’t fall off while asleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its eyes can see 360 degrees without moving its head. It won’t miss prey--even those behind it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the temperature cools in the evening, they emerge from water to seek food along the shore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A dim-witted Pokémon. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head into boats or rocks while swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fur has the look and feel of velvet. The orb on its forehead glows when it uses psycho-power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The light of the moon changed EEVEE’s genetic structure. It lurks in darkness for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears near travelers to lure them into deep forests. It is said to carry misfortune.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gets nourishment from fear that it absorbs into its red orbs. In daytime, it sleeps in darkness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They seem to communicate among each other telepathically. They are always found stuck on walls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it sleeps, the head on its tail keeps watch. The tail doesn’t need to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sails on the winds with its limbs extended to strike from the sky. It aims for the prey’s face.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chews its way through boulders with its sturdy jaws. Its eyes can see in the darkness underground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With powerful legs and claws, it generates enough power to hurl foes over great distances.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is extremely vicious and will not stop attacking until its foe is incapable of moving.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves eating mushrooms that grow under dead grass. It also finds hot springs while foraging.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its shaggy coat makes it unable to see. It checks surroundings with its sensitive nose instead.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It clings to MANTINE to feed on the big Pokémon’s scraps. This is an adaptation to avoid foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It obscures its foe’s vision by spitting a cloud of murky ink. It makes its nest among boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims elegantly, mindless of REMORAID hitching on to its broad fins. It has a docile nature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It conveys its feelings using different cries. It works in a pack to cleverly take down prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Long ago, people imagined its eerie howls to be the call of the grim reaper.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With planetary development software installed, it became capable of working in space.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It generates electricity by whirling its arms. However, it can’t store the energy it makes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body temperature is around 1,100 degrees F. It is healthy if it is breathing yellow flames.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink MILTANK’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a Pokémon that delivers happiness. Eating its egg is said to make one kind to everyone.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spits a white silk that turns sticky when it contacts air. It is used to immobilize foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drinks dew that collects on its silk and waits for evolution. Its hard cocoon repels attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When flower fields bloom, it flits around, collecting pollen. Despite its appearance, it is savage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Encased within its tough cocoon, it endures attacks. It never forgets the appearance of its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It violently flutters its wings to scatter toxic dust when attacked. It becomes active after sunset.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Catching sea winds with its long wings, it soars as if it were a glider. It folds its wings to rest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It acts as a delivery service by carrying small Pokémon in its bill. It bobs on the waves to rest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the horns on its head to sense human emotions. It is said to appear in front of cheerful people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is highly perceptive of its Trainer’s feelings. It dances when it is feeling happy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It will try to guard its trusted Trainer with its life. It has the ability to see the future.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its heart beats at a tenfold tempo, so it cannot sit still for even a moment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail is filled with nutrients necessary for growth. It plays by bouncing on its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nose is a magnet. As a result, this Pokémon always keeps its face pointing north.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never misses its daily yoga workouts, and it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Through daily meditation, it hones its spiritual power. It can sense what others are thinking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves ILLUMISE’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The beautiful flowers on its arms have toxic thorns. Don’t even think about picking those flowers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its wings are like cotton tufts. If it perches on someone’s head, it looks like a cotton hat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks like a fluffy cloud when it is in flight. It hums with its soprano voice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its whiskers make a superb radar. They are used to locate prey, even in the murkiest of water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a result of causing tremors by thrashing about, it developed the ability to foretell real quakes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats anything, so it can even live in polluted streams and lakes. No one pays any attention to it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is the world’s most beautiful Pokémon. There are many works of art featuring MILOTIC.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its appearance changes with the weather. Recently, its molecules were found to be just like water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It doggedly pursues its prey wherever it goes. However, the chase is abandoned at sunrise.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is hollow. It is said that those who look into its body are sucked into the void.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it continually ate only its favorite fruit, the fruit started growing around its neck.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Emitting ultrasonic cries, it floats on winds to travel great distances.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It senses coming disasters and appears before people only to warn them of impending danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the snow country, certain folklore says a house will prosper if a SNORUNT lives there.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect itself, it clads its body in an armor of ice, made by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rolls across ice floes to reach shore because its body is poorly shaped for swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It converses with others by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shell is hardened soil. Some Pokémon come to peck the berries growing on the trees on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Groups of this Pokémon migrating in search of water have been mistaken for “moving forests.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fiery rear end is fueled by gas made in its belly. Even rain can’t extinguish the fire.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses ceilings and walls to launch aerial attacks. Its fiery tail is but one weapon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its crown of fire is indicative of its fiery nature. It is beaten by none in terms of quickness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives along shores in northern countries. A skilled swimmer, it dives for over 10 minutes to hunt.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its wings deliver wicked blows that snap even the thickest of trees. It searches for prey in icy seas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims as fast as a jet boat. The edges of its wings are sharp and can slice apart drifting ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Usually with a large flock, it is barely noticeable when alone. Its cries are very strident.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in forests and fields. Squabbles over territory occur when flocks collide.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The muscles in its wings and legs are strong. It can easily fly while gripping a small Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It constantly gnaws on logs and rocks to whittle down its front teeth. It nests alongside water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While its movements out of water are sluggish, it can swim as fast as any FEEBAS.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chats with others using the sounds of its colliding antennae. These sounds are fall hallmarks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It signals its emotions with its melodies. Scientists are studying these melodic patterns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its forelegs have a muscle-based system of generating electricity. Its body shines if endangered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rests its forelegs on others to communicate with rhythmic electric pulses from its claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its eyes gleam gold, it can spot hiding prey--even those taking shelter behind a wall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives alongside clear ponds. It scatters pollen that induces harsh sneezing and runny noses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With the movements of a dancer, it strikes with whips that are densely lined with poison thorns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was resurrected from an iron ball-like fossil. It downs prey with its head butts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its skull is as hard as iron. It is a brute that tears down jungle trees while catching prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It habitually polishes its face by rubbing it against tree trunks. It is weak to attacks from behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When attacked, they form a wall with their shieldlike faces to protect their young.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its cloak is broken in battle, it quickly remakes the cloak with materials nearby.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its appearance changes depending on where it evolved. The materials on hand become a part of its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It does not keep a nest. It flies over fields and mountains in constant search of floral honey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It collects and delivers honey to its colony. At night, they cluster to form a beehive and sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When endangered, grubs from its six-cell honeycomb strike back. There is only one in a colony.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes electricity with pouches in its cheeks and shoots charges from its tail. It lives atop trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims by rotating its two tails like a screw. When it dives, its flotation sac collapses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its flotation sac developed as a result of pursuing aquatic prey. It can double as a rubber raft.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is docile as a bud, but turns cheerful when it blooms. It folds back into a bud if sunlight wanes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives along bodies of water. Its body shape has changed to suit its habitat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It apparently had a huge shell for protection in ancient times. It lives in shallow tidal pools.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They work in large colonies and make rings by linking their tails, apparently in friendship.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tugs on the hands of children to steal them away. However, it gets pulled around instead.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carries people and Pokémon when it flies. But since it only drifts, it can end up anywhere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it perks up its ears. On cold nights, it sleeps with its head tucked into its fur.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is very conscious of its looks and never fails to groom its ears. It runs with sprightly jumps.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chants incantations. While they usually torment targets, some chants bring happiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its MURKROW cronies bring it food. It idles its time away, grooming itself in its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its sharp glare, it puts foes in a mild hypnotic state. It is a very fickle Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To make itself appear intimidatingly beefy, it tightly cinches its waist with its twin tails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Each time it hops, it makes a ringing sound. It deafens foes by emitting high-frequency cries.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sprays a nose-curling, stinky fluid from its rear to repel attackers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sprays a stinky fluid from its tail. The fluid smells worse the longer it is allowed to fester.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"X-ray photos were taken to check its body structure. Nothing appeared, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can summon rain clouds. People long ago revered it as the bringer of plentiful harvests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers arid environments. It leaks water from its eyes to adjust its body’s fluid levels.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It likes places where people gather. It mimics foes to confuse them, then makes its getaway.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carries a round, egg-shaped rock in its belly pouch and gives the rock to its friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It keeps rhythm by flicking its tail feathers like a metronome. It imitates human speech.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was bound to a fissure in an odd keystone as punishment for misdeeds 500 years ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It once lived in the tropics. To avoid the cold, it lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It habitually digs up and hoards gems in its nest. Its loot is constantly targeted by thieves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies at speeds equal to a jet fighter plane. It never allows its prey to escape.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is lithe yet powerful. It can crest three mountains and cross two canyons in one night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It enshrouds itself with sand to protect itself from germs. It does not enjoy getting wet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its huge mouth is almost seven feet across. It has enough power to completely crush a car.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in arid lands. It buries itself in sand and lies in wait for unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is encased in a sturdy shell. Its head rotates 180 degrees, eliminating blind spots.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inflating its poison sacs, it makes an eerie blubbering sound for intimidation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Hanging from branches using its tentacles, it looks like a plant. It awaits prey, mouth wide open.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The way its two tail fins flutter while it swims has earned it the nickname “BEAUTIFLY of the Sea.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To avoid detection by predators, it crawls along the seafloor using the two fins on its chest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Scientists discovered that the distinctive patterns on its back differ by region.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the spring, it grows berries with the texture of frozen treats around its belly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blankets wide areas in snow by whipping up blizzards. It is also known as “The Ice Monster.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sends signals to others by carving odd patterns in frost-covered trees and ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It evolved from exposure to a special magnetic field. Three units generate magnetism.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It wraps things with its extensible tongue. Getting too close to it will leave you soaked with drool.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It puts rocks in holes in its palms and uses its muscles to shoot them. GEODUDE are shot at rare times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It ensnares prey by extending arms made of vines. Losing arms to predators does not trouble it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It pushes the tips of its two tails against the foe, then lets loose with over 20,000 volts of power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It will never appear where there is strife. Its sightings have become rare recently.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By churning its wings, it creates shock waves that inflict critical internal injuries to foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Just like a plant, it uses photosynthesis. As a result, it is always enveloped in clear air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a protective technique, it can completely freeze its fur to make its hairs stand like needles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It observes prey while hanging inverted from branches. When the chance presents itself, it swoops!","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its impressive tusks are made of ice. The population thinned when it turned warm after the ice age.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A master of courtesy and swordsmanship, it fights using extending swords on its elbows.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It exudes strong magnetism from all over. It controls three small units called Mini-Noses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The antenna on its head captures radio waves from the world of spirits that command it to take people there.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is composed of plasma. It is known to infiltrate electronic devices and wreak havoc.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that its emergence gave humans the intelligence to improve their quality of life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sleeps at the bottom of a lake. Its spirit is said to leave its body to fly on the lake’s surface.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that UXIE, MESPRIT and AZELF all came from the same egg.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon spoken of in legend. It is said that time began moving when DIALGA was born.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to live in a gap in the spatial dimension parallel to ours. It appears in mythology.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It dwells in volcanic caves. It digs in with its cross-shaped feet to crawl on ceilings and walls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is an enduring legend that states this Pokémon towed continents with ropes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours. It appears in an ancient cemetery.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Shiny particles are released from its wings like a veil. It is said to represent the crescent moon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives in warm seas. It inflates the flotation sac on its head to drift and search for food.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Water makes up 80% of its body. This Pokémon is easily affected by its environment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Folklore has it that on moonless nights, this Pokémon will make people see horrific nightmares.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can dissolve toxins in the air to instantly transform ruined land into a lush field of flowers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is told in mythology that this Pokémon was born before the universe even existed.","esFrom":"y"}],"platinum":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where CHARMELEON live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that CHARIZARD’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow PIKACHU that is in a weakened state.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It curls up, then rolls into foes with its back. Its sharp spines inflict severe damage.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of CLEFAIRY dancing under a full moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very wary and rarely shows itself to people. Its ears can hear a pin drop over half a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host PARAS.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls PARASECT. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Overwhelmed by enigmatic abilities, it suffers a constant headache. It sometimes uses mysterious powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is seen swimming dynamically and elegantly using its well-developed limbs and flippers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its psychic power is such a strain on its brain that it needs to sleep for 18 hours a day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of GEODUDE at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It happily carries heavy cargo to toughen up. It willingly does hard work for people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its body is almost entirely composed of water, it shrivels up if it is washed ashore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It extends its 80 tentacles to form an encircling poisonous net that is difficult to escape.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls on mountain paths to move. Once it builds momentum, no Pokémon can stop it without difficulty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the SHELLDER on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The faster the units at its sides rotate, the greater the magnetic force they generate.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many mysteriously appear when more sunspots dot the sun. They stop TV sets from displaying properly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When DODUO evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives on icebergs. It swims in the sea using the point on its head to break up ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a GENGAR delighting in casting curses on people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burrows through the ground at a speed of 50 mph while feeding on large boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it extends its over-six-foot-long tongue, its tail quivers. There is a possibility they are connected.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In autumn, its body becomes more fatty in preparing to propose to a mate. It takes on beautiful colors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It windmills its arms to slightly boost its punches. Foes have been known to escape in the meantime.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it breathes deeply, heat waves form around its body, making it hard to see clearly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it can’t tear, it tosses far.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A MAGIKARP living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it begins to rampage, a GYARADOS will burn everything down, even in a harsh storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to reconstitute its entire cellular structure to transform into whatever it sees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining MEW’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe MEW to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks time precisely. Some countries consider it to be a wise friend, versed in the world’s ways.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"LANTURN’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kindhearted people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The oil-filled end of its tail floats on water. It keeps MARILL from drowning even in a strong current.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make POLIWAG obey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when HOPPIP gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can hover in one spot by flapping its wings at high speed. It flits about to guard its territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When walking on land, it covers its body with a poisonous film that keeps its skin from dehydrating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being bitten by SHELLDER gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A smart and sneaky Pokémon. A pair may work together to steal eggs by having one lure the parents away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very sensitive nose. It can locate mushrooms, berries, and even hot springs buried under ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It forcefully squirts water. The water jet never misses prey even if the REMORAID is deep in the sea.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to lurk inside holes in rocks. It sometimes sprays ink on prey by sticking out only its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores REMORAID that cling to its fins seeking food scraps.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink MILTANK’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It soars high in the sky, riding on updrafts like a glider. It carries food tucked in its bill.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heart beats at a tenfold tempo, so it cannot sit still for even a moment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When endangered, it may protect itself by raising its magnetism and drawing iron objects to its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gains the ability to see the aura of its opponents by honing its mind through starvation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves ILLUMISE’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides VOLBEAT to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The more healthy the ROSELIA, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No two SPINDA have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has feuded with SEVIPER for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its appearance changes with the weather. Recently, its molecules were found to be just like water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that several SNORUNT gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prevents prey from escaping by instantaneously freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls across ice floes to reach shore because its body is poorly shaped for swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It converses with others by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is formed by two BELDUM joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"METANG combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought KYOGRE long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy TURTWIG, the shell should feel moist.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Some Pokémon are born on a TORTERRA’s back and spend their entire life there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses unique fighting moves with fire on its hands and feet. It will take on any opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because every PRINPLUP considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a STARAVIA cries noisily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A comparison revealed that BIDOOF’s front teeth grow at the same rate as RATTATA’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A river dammed by BIBAREL will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it loves floral honey, it won’t gather any itself. Instead, it plots to steal some from COMBEE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The trio is together from birth. It constantly gathers honey from flowers to please VESPIQUEN.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and carry off prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. STARLY try to peck it off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, AMBIPOM rarely uses its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one utters a deep cry, many MURKROW gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It brought rains by opening portals to another world. It was revered as a bringer of plentiful harvests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to carry around a small rock. It may wander around others’ feet and cause them to stumble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As soon as the tail claws close, its needle tips secrete poison. It can survive a year without food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength, taking down foes without using toxins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crawls along the seafloor using its long front fins like legs. It competes for food with LANTURN.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"People organize tours to see this Pokémon frolic and skim the tops of waves with REMORAID.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A group tried to use scientific means to make MAGNEZONE evolve, but their efforts ended in failure.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shares many blessings with people who respect one another’s rights and avoid needless strife.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its electric-like body can enter some kinds of machines and take control in order to make mischief.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When UXIE flew, people gained the ability to solve problems. It was the birth of knowledge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When MESPRIT flew, people learned the joy and sadness of living. It was the birth of emotions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When AZELF flew, people gained the determination to do things. It was the birth of willpower.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that time flows when DIALGA’s heart beats.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that space becomes more stable with PALKIA’s every breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of rugged steel. However, it is partially melted in spots because of its own heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On nights around the quarter moon, the aurora from its tail extends and undulates beautifully.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have emerged from an egg in a place where there was nothing, then shaped the world.","esFrom":"x"}],"heartgold":[null,{"en":"The seed on its back is filled with nutrients. The seed grows steadily larger as its body grows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Exposure to sunlight adds to its strength. Sunlight also makes the bud on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By spreading the broad petals of its flower and catching the sun’s rays, it fills its body with power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flame on its tail shows the strength of its life force. If it is weak, the flame also burns weakly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very hotheaded by nature, so it constantly seeks opponents. It calms down only when it wins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If CHARIZARD becomes furious, the flame at the tip of its tail flares up in a light blue shade.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell is soft when it is born. It soon becomes so resilient, prodding fingers will bounce off it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a well-established symbol of longevity. If its shell has algae on it, that WARTORTLE is very old.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It deliberately makes itself heavy so it can withstand the recoil of the water jets it fires.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antennae on its head to drive away enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inside the shell, it is soft and weak as it prepares to evolve. It stays motionless in the shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It collects honey every day. It rubs honey onto the hairs on its legs to carry it back to its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its poison stinger is very powerful. Its bright-colored body is intended to warn off its enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it is a cocoon, it can move a little. It can extend its poison barb if it is attacked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can take down any opponent with its powerful poison stingers. It sometimes attacks in swarms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually hides in tall grass. Because it dislikes fighting, it protects itself by kicking up sand.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has outstanding vision. However high it flies, it is able to distinguish the movements of its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its well-developed chest muscles make it strong enough to whip up a gusty windstorm with just a few flaps.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats anything. Wherever food is available, it will settle down and produce offspring continuously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Gnaws on anything with its tough fangs. It can even topple concrete buildings by gnawing on them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its short wings to flush out insects from tall grass. It then plucks them with its stubby beak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots itself suddenly high into the sky, then plummets down in one fell swoop to strike its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can freely detach its jaw to swallow large prey whole. It can become too heavy to move, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Transfixing prey with the face-like pattern on its belly, it binds and poisons the frightened victim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This intelligent Pokémon roasts hard berries with electricity to make them tender enough to eat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its electricity builds, its muscles are stimulated, and it becomes more aggressive than usual.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it fell from a great height, this Pokémon could save itself by rolling into a ball and bouncing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In an attempt to hide itself, it will run around at top speed to kick up a blinding dust storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The poison hidden in its small horn is extremely potent. Even a tiny scratch can have fatal results.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When feeding its young, it first chews the food into a paste, then spits it out for the offspring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered with needle-like scales. It never shows signs of shrinking from any attack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is small, but its horn is filled with poison. It charges then stabs with the horn to inject poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. If it senses anything, it attacks immediately.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swings its big tail around during battle. If its foe flinches, it will charge with its sturdy body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The moonlight that it stores in the wings on its back apparently gives it the ability to float in midair.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its acute hearing, it can pick up sounds from far away. It usually hides in quiet places.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it develops, its single white tail gains color and splits into six. It is quite warm and cuddly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Some legends claim that each of its nine tails has its own unique type of special mystical power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it inflates to sing a lullaby, it can perform longer and cause sure drowsiness in its audience.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their fur feels so good that if two of them snuggle together, they won’t want to be separated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While flying, it constantly emits ultrasonic waves from its mouth to check its surroundings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"However hard its victim’s hide may be, it punctures with sharp fangs and gorges itself with blood.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Awakened by moonlight, it roams actively at night. In the day, it stays quietly underground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"What appears to be drool is actually sweet honey. It is very sticky and clings stubbornly if touched.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the world’s largest petals. With every step, the petals shake out heavy clouds of toxic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is doused with mushroom spores when it is born. As its body grows, mushrooms sprout from its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stays mostly in dark, damp places, the preference not of the bug, but of the big mushroom on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes also function as radar units. It catches and eats small bugs that hide in darkness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it attacks, it flaps its large wings violently to scatter its poisonous powder all around.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is very thin. If it is exposed to light, its blood heats up, causing it to grow weak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads bob separately up and down to loosen the soil nearby, making it easier for it to burrow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is fascinated by round objects. It can’t stop playing with them until it tires and falls asleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has mystical powers but doesn’t recall that it has used them. That is why it always looks puzzled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it swims at full speed using its long, webbed limbs, its forehead somehow begins to glow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If approached while asleep, it may awaken and angrily give chase in a groggy state of semi-sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a brave and trustworthy nature. It fearlessly stands up to bigger and stronger foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary Chinese Pokémon is considered magnificent. Many people are enchanted by its grand mane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it is inept at walking on its newly grown legs, it always swims around in water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The swirl on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it may gradually cause drowsiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This strong and skilled swimmer is even capable of crossing the Pacific Ocean just by kicking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It senses impending attacks and teleports away to safety before the actual attacks can strike.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It possesses strong spiritual power. The more danger it faces, the stronger its psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Closing both its eyes heightens all its other senses. This enables it to use its abilities to their extremes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Always brimming with power, it passes time by lifting boulders. Doing so makes it even stronger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always goes at its full power, but this very tough and durable Pokémon never gets tired.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It quickly swings its four arms to rock its opponents with ceaseless punches and chops from all angles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even though its body is extremely skinny, it is blindingly fast when catching its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even though it is filled with acid, it does not melt because it also oozes a protective fluid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Acid that has dissolved many prey becomes sweeter, making it even more effective at attracting prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the tide goes out, dehydrated TENTACOOL remains can be found washed up on the shore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its 80 tentacles absorb water and stretch almost endlessly to constrict its prey and enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Most people may not notice, but a closer look should reveal that there are many GEODUDE around.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With a free and uncaring nature, it doesn’t mind if pieces break off while it rolls down mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sheds its skin once a year. The discarded shell immediately hardens and crumbles away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a weak runner immediately after birth. It gradually becomes faster by chasing after its parents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At full gallop, its four hooves barely touch the ground because it moves so incredibly fast.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lazes vacantly near water. If something bites its tail, it won’t even notice for a whole day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If the tail-biting SHELLDER is thrown off in a harsh battle, it reverts to being an ordinary SLOWPOKE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is attracted by electromagnetic waves. It may approach Trainers if they are using their Pokégear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Three MAGNEMITE are linked by a strong magnetic force. Earaches will occur if you get too close.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If anyone tries to disturb where the essential plant stalks grow, it uses its own stalk to thwart them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By alternately raising and lowering its two heads, it balances itself to be more stable while running.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It collects data and plans three times as wisely, but it may think too much and fall into a state of immobility.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it can’t walk well on land, it is a graceful swimmer. It especially loves being in frigid seas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its streamlined body has little drag in water. The colder the temperature, the friskier it gets.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it moves, it loses bits of its body, from which new GRIMER emerge. This worsens the stench around it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They love to gather in smelly areas where sludge accumulates, making the stench around them worse.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims facing backward by opening and closing its two-piece shell. It is surprisingly fast.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it slams its shell shut, it is impossible to open, even by those with superior strength.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In total darkness, where nothing is visible, HAUNTER lurks, silently stalking its next victim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It steals heat from its surroundings. If you feel a sudden chill, it is certain that a GENGAR appeared.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It twists and squirms through the ground. The thunderous roar of its tunneling echoes a long way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If you think that you had a good dream but you can’t remember it, a DROWZEE has probably eaten it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is very hungry, it puts humans it meets to sleep, then it feasts on their dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses danger approaching, it cloaks itself with bubbles from its mouth so it will look bigger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can hardly lift its massive, overgrown pincer. The pincer’s size makes it difficult to aim properly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls to move. If the ground is uneven, a sudden jolt from hitting a bump can cause it to explode.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is dangerous. If it has too much electricity and has nothing to do, it amuses itself by exploding.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their shells are very durable. Even if they crack, they can survive without spilling their contents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads think independently. However, they are friendly and never appear to squabble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes and emits a plaintive and mournful sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has been seen pounding boulders with the bone it carries in order to tap out messages to others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This amazing Pokémon has an awesome sense of balance. It can kick in succession from any position.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tongue has well-developed nerves that run to the very tip, so it can be deftly manipulated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its thin, filmy body is filled with gases that cause constant sniffles, coughs and teary eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one of the twin KOFFING inflates, the other one deflates. It constantly mixes its poisonous gases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is inept at turning because of its four short legs. It can only charge and run in one direction.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its rugged hide protects it from even the heat of lava. However, the hide also makes it insensitive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks carefully to prevent its egg from breaking. However, it is extremely fast at running away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it is safe, the young gets out of the belly pouch to play. The adult keeps a close eye on the youngster.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If attacked by a larger enemy, it quickly swims to safety by adeptly controlling its well-developed dorsal fin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An examination of its cells revealed the presence of a gene not found in HORSEA. It became a hot topic.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its dorsal, pectoral and tail fins wave elegantly in water. That is why it is known as the water dancer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During spawning season, SEAKING gather from all over, causing rivers to appear a brilliant red.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At night, the middle of its body slowly flickers with the same rhythm as a human heartbeat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The middle section of its body is called the core. It glows in a different color each time it is seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A skilled mime from birth, it gains the ability to create invisible objects as it matures.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It slashes through grass with its sharp scythes, moving too fast for the human eye to track.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rocks its body rhythmically. It appears to alter the rhythm depending on how it is feeling.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Electricity runs across the surface of its body. In darkness, its entire body glows a whitish-blue.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dislikes cold places, so it blows scorching flames to make the environment suitable for itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its pincer horns, it digs burrows to sleep in at night. In the morning, damp soil clings to its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They fight each other by locking horns. The herd’s protector takes pride in its battle-scarred horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An underpowered, pathetic Pokémon. It may jump high on rare occasions, but usually not more than seven feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They say that during past strife, GYARADOS would appear and leave blazing ruins in its wake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They have gentle hearts. Because they rarely fight, many have been caught. Their number has dwindled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can transform into anything. When it sleeps, it changes into a stone to avoid being attacked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to alter the composition of its body to suit its surrounding environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When VAPOREON’s fins begin to vibrate, it is a sign that rain will come within a few hours.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It concentrates the weak electric charges emitted by its cells and launches wicked lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores some of the air it inhales in its internal flame pouch, which heats it to over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a manmade Pokémon. Since it doesn’t breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Revived from an ancient fossil, this Pokémon uses air stored in its shell to sink and rise in water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Apparently, it cracked SHELLDER’s shell with its sharp fangs and sucked out the insides.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On rare occasions, some have been found as fossils which they became while hiding on the ocean floor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the water, it tucks in its limbs to become more compact, then it wiggles its shell to swim fast.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A vicious Pokémon from the distant past, it appears to have flown by spreading its wings and gliding.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"What sounds like its cry may actually be its snores or the rumblings of its hungry belly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The magnificent, seemingly translucent wings of this legendary bird Pokémon are said to be made of ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary bird Pokémon causes savage thunderstorms by flapping its glittering wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon scatters embers with every flap of its wings. It is a thrilling sight to behold.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is born large to start with. It repeatedly sheds its skin as it steadily grows longer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They say that if it emits an aura from its whole body, the weather will begin to change instantly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that this Pokémon constantly flies over the immense seas and rescues drowning people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its battle abilities were raised to the ultimate level, it thinks only of defeating its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Apparently, it appears only to those people who are pure of heart and have a strong desire to see it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A sweet aroma gently wafts from the leaf on its head. It is docile and loves to soak up sunrays.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The scent of spices comes from around its neck. Somehow, sniffing it makes you want to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The aroma that rises from its petals contains a substance that calms aggressive feelings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid, and always curls itself up in a ball. If attacked, it flares up its back for protection.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Be careful if it turns its back during battle. It means that it will attack with the fire on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its rage peaks, it becomes so hot that anything that touches it will instantly go up in flames.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it bites with its massive and powerful jaws, it shakes its head and savagely tears its victim up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A very cautious Pokémon, it raises itself up using its tail to get a better view of its surroundings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a nest to suit its long and skinny body. The nest is impossible for other Pokémon to enter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always stands on one foot. It changes feet so fast, the movement can rarely be seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially adapted. They concentrate even faint light and enable it to see in the dark.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very timid. It will be afraid to move if it is alone. But it will be active if it is in a group.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the stars flicker in the night sky, it flutters about, scattering a glowing powder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lies still in the same pose for days in its web, waiting for its unsuspecting prey to wander close.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spins string not only from its rear but also from its mouth. It’s hard to tell which end is which.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies so silently through the dark on its four wings that it may not be noticed even when nearby.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots positive and negative electricity between the tips of its two antennae and zaps its enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The light it emits is so bright that it can illuminate the sea’s surface from a depth of over three miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is not yet skilled at storing electricity. It may send out a jolt if amused or startled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because of its unusual, starlike silhouette, people believe that it came here on a meteor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very soft body. If it starts to roll, it will bounce all over and be impossible to stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell seems to be filled with joy. It is said that it will share good luck when treated kindly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They say that it will appear before kindhearted, caring people and shower them with happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its wings aren’t yet fully grown, it has to hop to get around. It is always staring at something.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They say that it stays still and quiet because it is seeing both the past and future at the same time.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If static electricity builds in its body, its fleece doubles in volume. Touching it will shock you.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of storing too much electricity, it developed patches where even downy wool won’t grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tail’s tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"BELLOSSOM gather at times and seem to dance. They say that the dance is a ritual to summon the sun.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its tail, which contains oil that is lighter than water, lets it swim without drowning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By keeping still and listening intently, it can tell what is in even wild, fast-moving rivers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it always pretends to be a tree, its composition appears more similar to rock than to vegetation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If POLIWAG and POLIWHIRL hear its echoing cry, they respond by gathering from far and wide.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. But they do enjoy gentle breezes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The bloom on top of its head opens and closes as the temperature fluctuates up and down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it catches the wind, it deftly controls its cotton-puff spores-- it can even float around the world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It may plummet from the sky. If attacked by a SPEAROW, it will violently shake its leaves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It converts sunlight into energy. In the darkness after sunset, it closes its petals and becomes still.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it flaps its wings really fast, it can generate shock waves that will shatter windows in the area.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon lives in cold water. It will leave the water to search for food when it gets cold outside.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This carefree Pokémon has an easy-going nature. While swimming, it always bumps into boat hulls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the fine hair that covers its body to sense air currents and predict its enemy’s actions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When agitated, this Pokémon protects itself by spraying poisonous sweat from its pores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Feared and loathed by many, it is believed to bring misfortune to all those who see it at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has incredible intellect and intuition. Whatever the situation, it remains calm and collected.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes playing mischievous tricks, such as screaming and wailing to startle people at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their shapes look like hieroglyphs on ancient tablets. It is said that the two are somehow related.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hates light and shock. If attacked, it inflates its body to build up its counterstrike.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail has a small brain of its own. Beware! If you get close, it may react to your scent by biting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to make its shell thicker by adding layers of tree bark. The additional weight doesn’t bother it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is shielded by a steel-hard shell. What lurks inside this shell is a total mystery.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When spotted, this Pokémon escapes backward by furiously boring into the ground with its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies straight at its target’s face, then clamps down on the startled victim to inject poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body has been compressed deep under the ground. As a result, it is even harder than a diamond.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it looks frightening, it is actually kind and affectionate. It is very popular among women.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is actually timid and easily spooked. If attacked, it flails about to fend off its attacker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To fire its poison spikes, it must inflate its body by drinking over 2.6 gallons of water all at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The berries it stores in its vase-like shell decompose and become a gooey liquid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its paws conceal sharp claws. If attacked, it suddenly extends the claws and startles its enemy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it finds honey, its crescent mark glows. It always licks its paws because they’re soaked with honey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although it is a good climber, it prefers to snap trees with its forelegs and eat fallen berries.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell on its back is just skin that has cooled and hardened. It breaks easily with a slight touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rubs its snout on the ground to find and dig up food. It sometimes discovers hot springs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because the long hair all over its body obscures its sight, it just keeps charging repeatedly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It continuously sheds and grows. The tip of its head is prized as a treasure because of its beauty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has superb accuracy. The water it shoots out can strike moving prey from more than 300 feet away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It traps foes with the suction cups on its tentacles, then smashes them with its rock-hard head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carries food all day long. There are tales about lost people who were saved by its stored food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it majestically swims, it doesn’t care if REMORAID attach to it for scavenging its leftovers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sturdy wings look heavy, but they are actually hollow and light, allowing it to fly freely in the sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses different kinds of cries for communicating with others of its kind and for pursuing its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If you are burned by the flames it shoots from its mouth, the pain will never go away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that it usually hides in underwater caves. It can create whirlpools by yawning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swings its long snout around playfully, but because it is so strong, that can be dangerous.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has sharp, hard tusks and a rugged hide. Its tackle is strong enough to knock down a house.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This upgraded version of PORYGON is designed for space exploration. It can’t fly, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A special fluid oozes from the tip of its tail. It paints the fluid everywhere to mark its territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is always bursting with energy. To make itself stronger, it keeps on fighting even if it loses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If you are enchanted by its smooth, dance-like kicks, you may get a closer experience with one than you’d like.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its lips are the most sensitive part of its body. It always uses its lips first to examine things.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rotates its arms to generate electricity, but it tires easily, so it only charges up a little bit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each and every time it inhales and exhales, hot embers dribble from its mouth and nostrils.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its milk is packed with nutrition, making it the ultimate beverage for the sick or weary.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Anyone who takes even one taste of BLISSEY’s egg becomes unfailingly caring and pleasant to everyone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The rain clouds it carries let it fire thunderbolts at will. They say that it descended with lightning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Volcanoes erupt when it barks. Unable to contain its sheer power, it races headlong around the land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to be the embodiment of north winds, it can instantly purify filthy, murky water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It feeds on soil. After it has eaten a large mountain, it falls asleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its shell is as hard as sheet rock, and it is also very strong. Its thrashing can topple a mountain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body can’t be harmed by any sort of attack, so it is very eager to make challenges against enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that it quietly spends its time deep at the bottom of the sea because its powers are too strong.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legends claim this Pokémon flies the world’s skies continuously on its magnificent, seven-colored wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon wanders across time. Grass and trees flourish in the forests in which it has appeared.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It leaps from tree branch to tree branch quite swiftly. It shows astounding agility.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inside its body is a place where it keeps a small flame. Hug it! It will be as warm as a hot-water bottle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its power can crush boulders. It rests by covering itself with mud at the bottom of a river.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases its prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it turns tail if the prey strikes back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gets interested in everything, which is why it zigs and zags. It is good at finding items.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When running in a straight line, it can easily top 60 miles an hour. It has a tough time with curved roads.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives among the tall grass and in forests. It repels attacks by raising up the spikes on its rear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Having wrapped silk around the branches of a tree, it quiescently awaits evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Vibrantly patterned wings are its prominent feature. It sucks sweet flower nectar with its long mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It endures attacks with patience, because the more pain before evolution, the sturdier it becomes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scatters its fine dust all over when it is attacked. It is a nocturnal Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it gets cold, they migrate, flying over 180 miles a day. It hunts for tasty prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. It catches its prey with sharp claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It soars on updrafts without flapping its wings. It makes a nest on sheer cliffs at the sea’s edge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It protects its young in its beak. It bobs on waves, resting on them on days when the waters are calm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The horns on its head provide a strong power that enables it to sense people’s emotions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It unleashes psychokinetic energy at full power when protecting a Trainer it has bonded closely with.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction-- to and fro and sideways.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The way SLAKOTH lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its stress level rises if it cannot keep moving constantly. Too much stress makes it feel sick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there’s no food left within its reach.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A strange Pokémon--it flies without moving its wings, has a hollow shell for a body, and does not breathe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shouts loudly by inhaling air, and then uses its well-developed stomach muscles to exhale.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It toughens up by slamming into thick trees over and over. It gains a sturdy body and dauntless spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail is packed full of the nutrients it needs to grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If two of these meet, they cannot get too close because their noses repel each other.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s adorable when it chases its own tail. It’s difficult to earn its trust.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"You can tell its age by the length of its iron horns. It claims an entire mountain as its territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It meditates to heighten its inner energy and to float in the air. It eats one berry a day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe’s next move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores electricity in its fur. It gives off sparks from all over its body in seasons when the air is dry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nest can be found where a thunderbolt hits. It is discharging electricity from its mane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Exposure to electricity from MINUN and PLUSLE promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It emits light from its tail to communicate. It loves the sweet aroma given off by ILLUMISE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fragrance attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"ROSELIA that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a small heart and brain. Its stomach comprises most of its body, with enzymes to dissolve anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It bounces playfully like a ball. The more seawater it swallows, the higher it bounces.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is the largest of all identified Pokémon. They jump as a pack to herd their prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the crater of a volcano. It is well known that the humps on its back erupt every 10 years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"You find abandoned coal mines full of them. They dig tirelessly in search of coal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can perform odd dance steps to influence foes. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The chances of two SPINDA having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It vibrates its wings vigorously, creating ultrasonic waves that cause serious headaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nicknamed “The Desert Spirit” because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies gracefully through the sky. Its melodic humming makes you feel like you’re in a dream.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a SEVIPER nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any ZANGOOSE. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"BARBOACH uses its whiskers to taste things just as a person uses his or her tongue to taste things.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It claims a large swamp to itself. If a foe comes near it, it sets off tremors by thrashing around.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was originally a Pokémon from afar that escaped to the wild. It can adapt to the dirtiest river.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. It will crash itself into any foe that approaches its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves while spinning around on its single foot. Some BALTOY have been seen spinning on their heads.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that it originates from clay dolls made by an ancient civilization.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It disguises its tentacles as flowers to attract and catch prey. It became extinct in ancient times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. Its heavy body weighs it down so it won’t get washed away in rough weather.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An ancestral Pokémon that lived in the ocean. Over time, its eight feet transformed into wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its enormous, retractable claws can cut through most anything. Its entire body is clad in sturdy plates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon can change its cells, taking different forms based on the temperature and humidity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon developed from an abandoned doll that amassed a grudge. It is seen in dark alleys.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it finds bad children who won’t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away--or so it’s said.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It’s a highly favored tropical snack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tends to move in a pack. Individuals squash against one another to toughen their spirits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s said that if they are seen at midnight, they’ll cause heavy snow. They eat snow and ice to survive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere. It uses this power to freeze its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crosses the oceans by rolling itself on drifting ice. Fluffy fur keeps it warm when the temperature is below freezing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in the pitch-dark sea. It attracts prey by moving its tail in mimicry of a small animal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its pink body becomes more vivid with the rise of water temperatures in the springtime.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Discovered by chance during deep-sea explorations, it has not changed since ancient times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its well-developed neck muscles and ironlike head can smash boulders into pieces.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It surrounds its body in an iron-hard shell to accumulate enough power to evolve.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The magnetic force generated by its body repels the ground’s natural magnetism, letting it float.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When two BELDUM fuse together, a magnetic nervous system places their brains in union.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It folds its four legs when flying. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can’t be melted, even by magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with GROUDON.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with KYOGRE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Photosynthesis occurs across its body under the sun. The shell on its back is actually hardened soil.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A GROTLE that lives in the forest is said to have its own secret springwater.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ancient people imagined that beneath the ground, a gigantic TORTERRA dwelled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A bigger fire on its tail and a brighter blue pattern on its face means its rank in its pack is higher.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It doesn’t like to be taken care of. It’s difficult to bond with since it won’t listen to its Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives a solitary life. Its wings deliver wicked blows that can snap even the thickest of trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It avoids unnecessary disputes, but it will decimate anything that threatens its pride.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They maintain huge flocks, although fierce scuffles break out between various flocks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When STARAVIA evolve into STARAPTOR, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in groups by the water. It chews up boulders and trees around its nest with its incisors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It busily makes its nest with stacks of branches and roots it has cut up with its sharp incisors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By allowing its cry to resonate in the hollow of its belly, it produces a captivating sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. Its fur glows when it’s in trouble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"LUXRAY’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it feels the sun’s warm touch, it opens its bud to release pollen. It lives alongside clear pools.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"CRANIDOS toughen up their already rock-hard heads by headbutting one another.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When attacked, they form a wall. Their rock-hard faces serve to protect them from the attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It covers itself with a cloak to shelter from the cold. When it’s hot, its cloak is thinner.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that a WORMADAM that evolves on a cold day will have a thicker cloak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters around at night and steals honey from the COMBEE hive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At night, COMBEE sleep in a group of about a thousand, packed closely together in a lump.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises grubs in the holes in its body. It secretes pheromones to control COMBEE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s one of the kinds of Pokémon with electric cheek pouches. It shoots charges from its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its flotation sac inflated, it can carry people on its back. It deflates the sac before it dives.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They live on large trees. They are said to communicate by connecting their tails to those of others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is whispered that any child who mistakes DRIFLOON for a balloon and holds on to it could wind up missing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"You can tell how it feels by the way it rolls its ears. When it’s scared, both ears are rolled up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sheds its fur twice a year. Its winter fur is soft and fluffy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it’s happy, GLAMEOW demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It would claim another Pokémon’s nest as its own if it finds a nest sufficiently comfortable.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It emits high-frequency cries that people can’t hear. Once it starts, it can cry for an awfully long time.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The foul fluid from its rear is so revolting that it can make people feel queasy up to a mile and a quarter away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a repugnant fluid from its tail, but the stench dulls after a few squirts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ancient people believed that the pattern on BRONZOR’s back contained a mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ancient people believed that petitioning BRONZONG for rain was the way to make crops grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carefully carries a round, white rock that it thinks is an egg. It’s bothered by how curly its hair looks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it’s one of them. This way they won’t attack it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was formed by uniting 108 spirits. It has been bound to the Odd Keystone to keep it from doing any mischief.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shrouds itself in sand to ward off germs. It travels easily through the sands of the desert.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burrows under the sand to lie in wait for prey. Its tail claws can inject its prey with a savage poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks people and Pokémon that cross the desert. This has only furthered its bad reputation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Fluid squeezed from its finger, albeit poisonous, is a significant ingredient in remedies for lower-back pain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks around on its tentacles in search of a tree branch where it can dangle down and ambush prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Swimming and fluttering its two tail fins, it looks like a BEAUTIFLY. At night, the patterns on its tail fins softly shine.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"LUMINEON swimming in the darkness of the deep sea look like stars shining in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it swims close to the surface of the ocean, people aboard ships are able to observe the pattern on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Exposure to a special magnetic field changed MAGNETON’s molecular structure, turning it into MAGNEZONE.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its saliva can decompose anything. It wraps its long tongue around things to coat them with its sticky saliva.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From holes in its palms, it fires out GEODUDE. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it remains still, it appears to be a large shrub. Unsuspecting prey that wander near get ensnared by its vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As everyone knows, it visits peaceful regions, bringing them gifts of kindness and sweet blessings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable of transporting an adult in flight. The wings on its tail help it stay balanced.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When you see LEAFEON asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It causes small ice crystals to form by lowering the temperature of the surrounding atmosphere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A frozen MAMOSWINE was dug from ice dating back 10,000 years. This Pokémon has been around a long, long, long time.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error...","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force. With them, it can attack the foe from three directions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This feared Pokémon is said to travel to worlds unknown. Some even believe that it takes lost spirits along with it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"According to some sources, this Pokémon provided people with the intelligence necessary to solve various problems.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to have endowed the human heart with emotions, such as sorrow and joy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to have endowed humans with the determination needed to face any of life’s difficulties.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon completely controls the flow of time. It uses its power to travel at will through the past and future.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its total control over the boundaries of space enable it to transport itself to faraway places or even other dimensions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Boiling blood, like magma, circulates through its body. It makes its dwelling place in volcanic caves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is believed to have shaped REGIROCK, REGICE, and REGISTEEL out of clay, ice, and magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours, where common knowledge is distorted and strange.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Those who sleep holding CRESSELIA’s feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the water warms, they inflate the flotation sac on their heads and drift languidly on the sea in packs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"According to the legends of Sinnoh, this Pokémon emerged from an egg and shaped all there is in this world.","esFrom":"x"}],"soulsilver":[null,{"en":"It carries a seed on its back right from birth. As it grows older, the seed also grows larger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If the bud on its back starts to smell sweet, it is evidence that the large flower will soon bloom.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is able to convert sunlight into energy. As a result, it is more powerful in the summertime.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flame on its tail indicates CHARMANDER’s life force. If it is healthy, the flame burns brightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a barbaric nature. In battle, it whips its fiery tail around and slashes away with sharp claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Breathing intense, hot flames, it can melt almost anything. Its breath inflicts terrible pain on enemies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shell, which hardens soon after it is born, is resilient. If you poke it, it will bounce back out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cleverly controls its furry ears and tail to maintain its balance while swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The rocket cannons on its shell fire jets of water capable of punching holes through thick steel.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prepares for evolution by hardening its shell as much as possible to protect its soft body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Water-repellent powder on its wings enables it to collect honey, even in the heaviest of rains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using a two-inch poison barb on its head. It can usually be found under the leaves it eats.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From this form, it will grow into an adult. As its body becomes softer, the external shell hardens.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has three poison barbs. The barb on its tail secretes the most powerful poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Common in grassy areas and forests, it is very docile and will chase off enemies by flapping up sand.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It renders its prey immobile using well-developed claws, then carries the prey more than 60 miles to its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spreads its beautiful wings wide to frighten its enemies. It can fly at Mach 2 speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Living wherever there is food available, it ceaselessly scavenges for edibles the entire day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its whiskers help it to maintain balance. Its fangs never stop growing, so it gnaws to pare them down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Very protective of its territory, it flaps its short wings busily to dart around at high speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cleverly uses its thin, long beak to pluck and eat small insects that hide under the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It always hides in grass. When first born, it has no poison, so its bite is painful, but harmless.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With a very vengeful nature, it won’t give up the chase, no matter how far, once it targets its prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its tail to check its surroundings. The tail is sometimes struck by lightning in this pose.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If the electric pouches in its cheeks become fully charged, both ears will stand straight up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Disliking water, it lives in deep burrows in arid areas. It can roll itself instantly into a ball.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it digs at an incredible pace, it may snap off its spikes and claws. They grow back in a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Although not very combative, it will torment its foes with poison spikes if it is threatened in any way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a calm and caring nature. Because its horn grows slowly, it prefers not to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses its scaly, rugged body to seal the entrance of its nest and protect its young from predators.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its big ears to check its surroundings. It will strike first if it senses any danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Quick to anger, it stabs enemies with its horn to inject a powerful poison when it becomes agitated.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can render the victim helpless quite easily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its adorable behavior and cry make it highly popular. However, this cute Pokémon is rarely found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its very sensitive ears let it distinguish distant sounds. As a result, it prefers quiet places.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it is attacked by an enemy that is stronger than itself, it feigns injury to fool the enemy and escapes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nine beautiful tails are filled with a wondrous energy that could keep it alive for 1,000 years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Looking into its cute, round eyes causes it to sing a relaxing melody, inducing its enemies to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very fine fur. Take care not to make it angry, or it may inflate steadily and hit with a body slam.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Capable of flying safely in dark places, it emits ultrasonic cries to check for any obstacles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can drink more than 10 ounces of blood at once. If it has too much, it gets heavy and flies clumsily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If exposed to moonlight, it starts to move. It roams far and wide at night to scatter its seeds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It secretes a sticky, drool-like honey. Although sweet, it smells too repulsive to get very close.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The bud bursts into bloom with a bang. It then starts scattering allergenic, poisonous pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As its body grows, large mushrooms named tochukaso start sprouting out of its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The larger the mushroom on its back grows, the stronger the mushroom spores it scatters.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches and eats small bugs at night that are attracted by light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The powder on its wings is poisonous if it is dark in hue. If it is light in hue, it causes paralysis.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If a DIGLETT digs through a field, it leaves the soil perfectly tilled and ideal for planting crops.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely powerful, they can dig through even the hardest ground to a depth of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves anything that shines. It especially adores coins that it picks up and secretly hoards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its chronic headache peaks, it may exhibit odd powers. It seems unable to recall such an episode.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears by waterways at dusk. It may use telekinetic powers if its forehead glows mysteriously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It becomes wildly furious if it even senses someone looking at it. It chases anyone that meets its glare.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely loyal, it will fearlessly bark at any opponent to protect its own Trainer from harm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its magnificent bark conveys a sense of majesty. Anyone hearing it can’t help but grovel before it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The direction of its belly spiral differs by area. The equator is thought to have an effect on this.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The skin on most of its body is moist. However, the skin on its belly spiral feels smooth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Although an energetic, skilled swimmer that uses all of its muscles, it lives on dry land.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it decides to teleport randomly, it evokes the illusion that it has created copies of itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it uses its abilities, it emits special alpha waves that cause machines to malfunction.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its brain cells multiply continually until it dies. As a result, it remembers everything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to work out and build its muscles. It is never satisfied, even if it trains hard all day long.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The muscles covering its body teem with power. Even when still, it exudes an amazing sense of strength.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses its four powerful arms to pin the limbs of its foe, then throws the victim over the horizon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It plants its feet deep underground to replenish water. It can’t escape its enemy while it’s rooted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its prey is bigger than its mouth, it slices up the victim with sharp leaves, then eats every morsel.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This horrifying plant Pokémon attracts prey with aromatic honey, then melts them in its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts aimlessly in waves. Very difficult to see in water, it may not be noticed until it stings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In battle, it extends all 80 of its tentacles to entrap its opponent inside a poisonous net.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses its arms to steadily climb steep mountain paths. It swings its fists around if angered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A slow walker, it rolls to move. It pays no attention to any object that happens to be in its path.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is capable of blowing itself up. It uses this explosive force to jump from mountain to mountain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its hind legs, which have hooves that are harder than diamond, kick back at any presence it senses behind it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With incredible acceleration, it reaches its top speed of 150 mph after running just 10 steps.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A sweet sap leaks from its tail’s tip. Although not nutritious, the tail is pleasant to chew on.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Naturally dull to begin with, it lost its ability to feel pain due to SHELLDER’s seeping poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The units at the sides of its body generate antigravity energy to keep it aloft in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The MAGNEMITE are united by a magnetism so powerful, it dries all moisture in its vicinity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it eats the plant stalk it carries as emergency rations, it runs off in search of a new stalk.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It races through grassy plains with powerful strides, leaving footprints up to four inches deep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If one of the heads gets to eat, the others will be satisfied, too, and they will stop squabbling.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In daytime, it is often found asleep on the seabed in shallow waters. Its nostrils close while it swims.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves frigid seas with ice floes. It uses its long tail to change swimming direction quickly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Wherever GRIMER has passed, so many germs are left behind that no plants will ever grow again.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of a powerful poison. Touching it accidentally will cause a fever that requires bed rest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Grains of sand trapped in its shells mix with its body fluids to form beautiful pearls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"CLOYSTER that live in seas with harsh tidal currents grow large, sharp spikes on their shells.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of gas. Despite lacking substance, it can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tongue is made of gas. If licked, its victim starts shaking constantly until death eventually comes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To steal the life of its target, it slips into the prey’s shadow and silently waits for an opportunity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rapidly bores through the ground at 50 mph by squirming and twisting its massive, rugged body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It remembers every dream it eats. It rarely eats the dreams of adults because children’s are much tastier.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Always holding a pendulum that it swings at a steady rhythm, it causes drowsiness in anyone nearby.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The pincers break off easily. If it loses a pincer, it somehow becomes incapable of walking sideways.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its pincers grow peculiarly large. If it lifts the pincers too fast, it loses its balance and staggers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was discovered when Poké Balls were introduced. It is said that there is some connection.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stores an overflowing amount of electric energy inside its body. Even a small shock makes it explode.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using telepathy only they can employ, they always form a cluster of six EXEGGCUTE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If a head drops off, it emits a telepathic call in search of others to form an EXEGGCUTE cluster.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It collects bones from an unknown place. Some whisper that a MAROWAK graveyard exists somewhere in the world.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it starts kicking repeatedly, both legs will stretch even longer to strike a fleeing foe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its long tongue, slathered with a gooey saliva, sticks to anything, so it is very useful.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The poisonous gases it contains are a little bit lighter than air, keeping it slightly airborne.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Top-grade perfume is made using its internal poison gases by diluting them to the highest level.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It doesn’t care if there is anything in its way. It just charges and destroys all obstacles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its brain developed when it began walking on hind legs. Its thick hide protects it even in magma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being few in number and difficult to capture, it is said to bring happiness to the Trainer who catches it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect its young, it will never give up during battle, no matter how badly wounded it is.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its big, developed fins move rapidly, allowing it to swim backward while still facing forward.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fin-tips leak poison. Its fins and bones are highly valued as ingredients in herbal medicine.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A strong swimmer, it is capable of swimming nonstop up fast streams at a steady speed of five knots per hour.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its horn, it bores holes in riverbed boulders, making nests to prevent its eggs from washing away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even if its body is torn, it can regenerate as long as the glowing central core remains intact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Regardless of the environment it lives in, its body grows to form a symmetrical geometric shape.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fingertips emit a peculiar force field that hardens air to create an actual wall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it moves, it leaves only a blur. If it hides in grass, its protective coloration makes it invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It speaks a language similar to that of humans. However, it seems to use dancing to communicate.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body constantly discharges electricity. Getting close to it will make your hair stand on end.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fiery surface of its body gives off a wavering, rippling glare that is similar to the sun.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swings its long pincer horns wildly to attack. During cold periods, it hides deep in forests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"After heightening its will to fight by whipping itself with its three tails, it charges at full speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For no reason, it jumps and splashes about, making it easy for predators like PIDGEOTTO to catch it mid-jump.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it appears, it goes on a rampage. It remains enraged until it demolishes everything around it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It ferries people across the sea on its back. It may sing an enchanting cry if it is in a good mood.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its transformation ability is perfect. However, if made to laugh, it can’t maintain its disguise.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its irregularly configured DNA is affected by its surroundings. It evolves if its environment changes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers beautiful shores. With cells similar to water molecules, it could melt in water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Every hair on its body starts to stand sharply on end if it becomes charged with electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fluffs out its fur collar to cool down its body temperature, which can reach 1,650 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A manmade Pokémon that came about as a result of research. It is programmed with only basic motions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon from ancient times is said to have navigated the sea by adeptly twisting its 10 tentacles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once wrapped around its prey, it never lets go. It eats the prey by tearing at it with sharp fangs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon lived in ancient times. On rare occasions, it has been discovered as a living fossil.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With sharp claws, this ferocious, ancient Pokémon rips apart prey and sucks their body fluids.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This vicious Pokémon is said to have flown in ancient skies while shrieking high-pitched cries.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its stomach’s digestive juices can dissolve any kind of poison. It can even eat things off the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon, it chills moisture in the atmosphere to create snow while flying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This legendary bird Pokémon is said to appear only when a thundercloud parts into two halves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This legendary bird Pokémon is said to bring early spring to the wintry lands it visits.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is full of life energy. It continually sheds its skin and grows steadily larger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its crystalline orbs appear to give this Pokémon the power to freely control the weather.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This marine Pokémon has an impressive build that lets it freely fly over raging seas without trouble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually remains motionless to conserve energy, so that it may unleash its full power in battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its DNA is said to contain the genetic codes of all Pokémon, so it can use all kinds of techniques.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its pleasantly aromatic leaf has the ability to check humidity and temperature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A spicy aroma emanates from around its neck. The aroma acts as a stimulant to restore health.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"MEGANIUM’s breath has the power to revive dead grass and plants. It can make them healthy again.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually stays hunched over. If it is angry or surprised, it shoots flames out of its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is fully covered by nonflammable fur. It can withstand any kind of fire attack.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a secret, devastating move. It rubs its blazing fur together to cause huge explosions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is hard for it to support its weight out of water, so it sometimes gets down on all fours. But it moves fast.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stands on its tail so it can see a long way. If it spots an enemy, it cries loudly to warn its kind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is no telling where the tail begins. Despite its short legs, it is quick and likes to chase RATTATA.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a perfect sense of time. Whatever happens, it keeps rhythm by precisely tilting its head in time.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the weather turns cold, lots of LEDYBA gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spot patterns on its back grow larger or smaller depending on the number of stars in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spins a web using fine--but durable--thread. It then waits patiently for prey to be trapped.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A single strand of a special string is endlessly spun out of its rear. The string leads back to its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The development of wings on its legs enables it to fly fast but also makes it tough to stop and rest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On the dark ocean floor, its only means of communication is its constantly flashing lights.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blinds prey with an intense burst of light. With the prey incapacitated, the Pokémon swallows it in a single gulp.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite its small size, it can zap even adult humans. However, if it does so, it also surprises itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When numerous meteors illuminate the night sky, sightings of CLEFFA strangely increase.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its extremely flexible and elastic body makes it bounce continuously--anytime, anywhere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A proverb claims that happiness will come to anyone who can make a sleeping TOGEPI stand up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people. It can float in midair without moving its wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually forages for food on the ground but may, on rare occasions, hop onto branches to peck at shoots.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In South America, it is said that its right eye sees the future and its left eye views the past.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fleece grows continually. In the summer, the fleece is fully shed, but it grows back in a week.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fluffy fleece easily stores electricity. Its rubbery hide keeps it from being electrocuted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The bright light on its tail can be seen far away. It has been treasured since ancient times as a beacon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Plentiful in the tropics. When it dances, its petals rub together and make a pleasant ringing sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The end of its tail serves as a buoy that keeps it from drowning, even in a vicious current.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it plays in water, it rolls up its elongated ears to prevent their insides from getting wet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It disguises itself as a tree to avoid attack. It hates water, so it will disappear if it starts raining.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Whenever three or more of these get together, they sing in a loud voice that sounds like bellowing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spreads its petals to absorb sunlight. It also floats in the air to get closer to the sun.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Drifts on seasonal winds and spreads its cotton-like spores all over the world to make more offspring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives atop tall trees. When leaping from branch to branch, it deftly uses its tail for balance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives by drinking only dewdrops from under the leaves of plants. It is said that it eats nothing else.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the daytime, it rushes about in a hectic manner, but it comes to a complete stop when the sun sets.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its large eyes can scan 360 degrees. It looks in all directions to seek out insects as its prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it walks around on the ground, it coats its body with a slimy, poisonous film.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Due to its relaxed and carefree attitude, it often bumps its head on boulders and boat hulls as it swims.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By reading air currents, it can predict things such as the weather or its foe’s next move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When darkness falls, the rings on the body begin to glow, striking fear in the hearts of anyone nearby.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when chased, it lures its attacker onto dark mountain trails where the foe will get lost.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its head was bitten, toxins entered SLOWPOKE’s head and unlocked an extraordinary power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to bite and yank people’s hair from behind without warning, just to see their shocked reactions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its flat, thin body is always stuck on walls. Its shape appears to have some meaning.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To keep its pitch-black tail hidden, it lives quietly in the darkness. It is never first to attack.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail, which also contains a small brain, may bite on its own if it notices an alluring smell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hangs and waits for flying insect prey to come near. It does not move about much on its own.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It remains immovably rooted to its tree. It scatters pieces of its hard shell to drive its enemies away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If spotted, it escapes by burrowing with its tail. It can float just slightly using its wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually clings to cliffs. When it spots its prey, it spreads its wings and glides down to attack.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s said that if an ONIX lives for 100 years, its composition becomes diamondlike as it evolves into a STEELIX.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has an active, playful nature. Many women like to frolic with it because of its affectionate ways.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because its fangs are too heavy, it always keeps its head tilted down. However, its bite is powerful.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The small spikes covering its body developed from scales. They inject a toxin that causes fainting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stores berries inside its shell. To avoid attacks, it hides beneath rocks and remains completely still.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is usually docile, but if it is disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Vicious in nature, it drives PIDGEY from their nests and scavenges any leftovers it can find.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Before food becomes scarce in wintertime, its habit is to hoard food in many hidden locations.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its ability to distinguish any aroma, it unfailingly finds all food buried deep underground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its brittle shell occasionally spouts intense flames that circulate throughout its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it smells something enticing, it dashes off headlong to find the source of the aroma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it charges at an enemy, the hairs on its back stand up straight. It is very sensitive to sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In a south-sea nation, the people live in communities that are built on groups of these Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its dorsal fin as a suction pad, it clings to a MANTINE’s underside to scavenge for leftovers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It instinctively sneaks into rocky holes. If it gets sleepy, it steals the nest of a fellow OCTILLERY.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It nests at the edge of sharp cliffs. It spends all day carrying food to its awaiting chicks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Swimming freely in open seas, it may fly out of the water and over the waves if it builds up enough speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"After nesting in bramble bushes, the wings of its chicks grow hard from scratches by thorns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To corner prey, they check each other’s location using barks that only they can understand.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Upon hearing its eerie howls, other Pokémon get the shivers and head straight back to their nests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sleeps deep on the ocean floor to build its energy. It is said to cause tornadoes as it wakes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a sign of affection, it bumps with its snout. However, it is so strong, it may send you flying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The longer and bigger its tusks, the higher its rank in its herd. The tusks take long to grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Further research enhanced its abilities. Sometimes, it may exhibit motions that were not programmed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Those who stare at its antlers will gradually lose control of their senses and be unable to stand.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it becomes an adult, it has a tendency to let its comrades plant footprints on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even though it is small, it can’t be ignored because it will slug any handy target without warning.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It always rocks its head slowly backwards and forwards as if it is trying to kiss someone.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even in the most vicious storm, this Pokémon plays happily if thunder rumbles in the sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is found in volcanic craters. Its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit, so don’t underestimate it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it is around babies, the milk it produces contains much more nutrition than usual.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very compassionate nature. If it sees a sick Pokémon, it will nurse the sufferer back to health.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that races across the land while barking a cry that sounds like crashing thunder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that races across the land. It is said that one is born every time a new volcano appears.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon races across the land. It is said that north winds will somehow blow whenever it appears.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is born deep underground. It can’t emerge until it has entirely consumed the soil around it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even sealed in its shell, it can move freely. Hard and fast, it has outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely strong, it can change the landscape. It has an insolent nature that makes it not care about others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to be the guardian of the seas. It is rumored to have been seen on the night of a storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legend says that its body glows in seven colors. A rainbow is said to form behind it when it flies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When CELEBI disappears deep in a forest, it is said to leave behind an egg it brought from the future.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Small hooks on the bottom of its feet catch on walls and ceilings. That is how it can hang from above.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It leaps from tree branch to tree branch quite swiftly. It shows astounding agility.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It agilely leaps about the jungle and uses the sharp leaves on its arms to strike its prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inside its body is a place where it keeps a small flame. Hug it! It will be as warm as a hot-water bottle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"During a battle, the hot flame in its body increases. Its kicks have outstanding destructive power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can clear a 30-story building in a leap. Its fiery punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its power can crush boulders. It rests by covering itself with mud at the bottom of a river.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Living on muddy ground that provides poor footing has made its legs sturdy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its arms are hard as rock. With one swing, it can break a boulder into pieces.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases its prey until the victim becomes exhausted. However, it turns tail if the prey strikes back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gets interested in everything, which is why it zigs and zags. It is good at finding items.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When running in a straight line, it can easily top 60 miles an hour. It has a tough time with curved roads.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives among the tall grass and in forests. It repels attacks by raising up the spikes on its rear.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Having wrapped silk around the branches of a tree, it quiescently awaits evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Vibrantly patterned wings are its prominent feature. It sucks sweet flower nectar with its long mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It endures attacks with patience, because the more pain before evolution, the sturdier it becomes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It scatters its fine dust all over when it is attacked. It is a nocturnal Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its leaf grew too large for it to live on land. That is how it began to live floating in the water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, it begins moving in rhythm in order to amplify its power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attaches itself to a tree branch using the top of its head. Strong winds can sometimes make it fall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives deep in forests. With the leaf on its head, it makes a flute whose song makes listeners uneasy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it gets cold, they migrate, flying over 180 miles a day. It hunts for tasty prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It dives at a steep angle as soon as it spots its prey. It catches its prey with sharp claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It soars on updrafts without flapping its wings. It makes a nest on sheer cliffs at the sea’s edge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It protects its young in its beak. It bobs on waves, resting on them on days when the waters are calm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The horns on its head provide a strong power that enables it to sense people’s emotions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a psychic power that enables it to distort the space around it and see into the future.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It unleashes psychokinetic energy at full power when protecting a Trainer it has bonded closely with.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It secretes a thick, sweet-scented syrup from the tip of its head. It lives on weed-choked ponds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flaps its four wings to hover and fly freely in any direction-- to and fro and sideways.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it senses danger, it scatters spores from the top of its head to protect itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It scatters poisonous spores and throws powerful punches while its foe is hampered by inhaled spores.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The way SLAKOTH lolls around makes anyone who watches it feel like doing the same.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its stress level rises if it cannot keep moving constantly. Too much stress makes it feel sick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. It moves to another spot when there’s no food left within its reach.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cry leaves a lasting headache if heard for too long. It moves so quickly that it is almost invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A strange Pokémon--it flies without moving its wings, has a hollow shell for a body, and does not breathe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shouts loudly by inhaling air, and then uses its well-developed stomach muscles to exhale.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its roar in battle shakes the ground like a tremor--or like an earthquake has struck.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It toughens up by slamming into thick trees over and over. It gains a sturdy body and dauntless spirit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves challenging others to tests of strength. It has the power to stop a train with a slap.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail is packed full of the nutrients it needs to grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If two of these meet, they cannot get too close because their noses repel each other.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s adorable when it chases its own tail. It’s difficult to earn its trust.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chomps with its gaping mouth. Its huge jaws are actually steel horns that have been transformed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it evolves, it sheds the steel carapace that covered its whole body and develops a new one.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves iron ore. Groups of them fight for territory by bashing one another with their steel bodies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"You can tell its age by the length of its iron horns. It claims an entire mountain as its territory.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It meditates to heighten its inner energy and to float in the air. It eats one berry a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Through yoga training, it gained the psychic power to predict its foe’s next move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stores electricity in its fur. It gives off sparks from all over its body in seasons when the air is dry.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nest can be found where a thunderbolt hits. It is discharging electricity from its mane.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It absorbs electricity from telephone poles. It shorts out its body to create crackling noises.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Exposure to electricity from MINUN and PLUSLE promotes blood circulation and relaxes muscles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It emits light from its tail to communicate. It loves the sweet aroma given off by ILLUMISE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fragrance attracts a swarm of VOLBEAT, so they draw over 200 patterns in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"ROSELIA that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a small heart and brain. Its stomach comprises most of its body, with enzymes to dissolve anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gulps anything that fits in its mouth. Its special enzymes can dissolve anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can swim at speeds of 75 mph by jetting seawater through its body. It is the bandit of the sea.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It bounces playfully like a ball. The more seawater it swallows, the higher it bounces.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is the largest of all identified Pokémon. They jump as a pack to herd their prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flaming magma it stores in the hump on its back is the source of its tremendous power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the crater of a volcano. It is well known that the humps on its back erupt every 10 years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"You find abandoned coal mines full of them. They dig tirelessly in search of coal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It bounces around on its tail to keep its heart pumping. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can perform odd dance steps to influence foes. Its style of dancing became hugely popular overseas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The chances of two SPINDA having identical spot patterns is less than one in four billion.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nest is a sloped, bowl-like pit in the desert. Once something has fallen in, there is no escape.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It vibrates its wings vigorously, creating ultrasonic waves that cause serious headaches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nicknamed “The Desert Spirit” because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in arid locations. Its yellow flowers bloom once a year.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Packs of them follow travelers through the desert until the travelers can no longer move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its wings bring cottony clouds to mind. It grooms with springwater and loves to sit on heads.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies gracefully through the sky. Its melodic humming makes you feel like you’re in a dream.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fur would all stand on end if it smelled a SEVIPER nearby. Its sharp claws tear up its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any ZANGOOSE. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was discovered at the site of a meteor strike 40 years ago. Its stare can lull its foes to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it rotates itself, it gives off light similar to the sun, thus blinding its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"BARBOACH uses its whiskers to taste things just as a person uses his or her tongue to taste things.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It claims a large swamp to itself. If a foe comes near it, it sets off tremors by thrashing around.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was originally a Pokémon from afar that escaped to the wild. It can adapt to the dirtiest river.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A brutish Pokémon that loves to battle. It will crash itself into any foe that approaches its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It moves while spinning around on its single foot. Some BALTOY have been seen spinning on their heads.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that it originates from clay dolls made by an ancient civilization.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It disguises its tentacles as flowers to attract and catch prey. It became extinct in ancient times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. Its heavy body weighs it down so it won’t get washed away in rough weather.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An ancestral Pokémon that lived in the ocean. Over time, its eight feet transformed into wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its enormous, retractable claws can cut through most anything. Its entire body is clad in sturdy plates.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is the shabbiest Pokémon of all. It forms in schools and lives at the bottom of rivers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s said that a glimpse of a MILOTIC and its beauty will calm any hostile emotions you’re feeling.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon can change its cells, taking different forms based on the temperature and humidity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It changes its shading to match its surroundings so it can sneak up on prey. Only its belly patterns stay fixed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses its horn to feed on envy and malice, or so it’s said. It’s very active at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon developed from an abandoned doll that amassed a grudge. It is seen in dark alleys.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it finds bad children who won’t listen to their parents, it will spirit them away--or so it’s said.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Anyone who dares peer into its body to see its spectral ball of fire will have their spirit stolen away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The bunch of fruit around its neck ripens twice a year and is delicious. It’s a highly favored tropical snack.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the sucker on its head to hang from a tree or from eaves. It can produce seven different tones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the ability to foretell natural disasters. Its life span is over a hundred years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tends to move in a pack. Individuals squash against one another to toughen their spirits.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s said that if they are seen at midnight, they’ll cause heavy snow. They eat snow and ice to survive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can instantly freeze moisture in the atmosphere. It uses this power to freeze its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It crosses the oceans by rolling itself on drifting ice. Fluffy fur keeps it warm when the temperature is below freezing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very sensitive nose. It touches new things with its nose to examine them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shatters drift ice with its strong tusks. Its thick layer of blubber repels enemy attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it evolves, it makes a mysterious pearl that amplifies psychic powers when it’s held.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives deep in the pitch-dark sea. It attracts prey by moving its tail in mimicry of a small animal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its pink body becomes more vivid with the rise of water temperatures in the springtime.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Discovered by chance during deep-sea explorations, it has not changed since ancient times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its heart-shaped body makes it popular. In some places, you would give a LUVDISC to someone you love.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its well-developed neck muscles and ironlike head can smash boulders into pieces.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It surrounds its body in an iron-hard shell to accumulate enough power to evolve.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s uncontrollable if enraged. It flies around spouting flames and scorching fields and mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The magnetic force generated by its body repels the ground’s natural magnetism, letting it float.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When two BELDUM fuse together, a magnetic nervous system places their brains in union.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It folds its four legs when flying. Its four brains are said to be superior to a supercomputer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have slept in a glacier for thousands of years. Its body can’t be melted, even by magma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It communicates using telepathy. Its body is covered in down that refracts light to make it invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A mythical Pokémon said to have swelled the seas with rain and tidal waves. It battled with GROUDON.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with KYOGRE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies in the ozone layer, way up high in the sky. Until recently, no one had ever seen it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Generations have believed that any wish written on a note on its head will come true when it awakens.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"DNA from a space virus mutated and became a Pokémon. It appears where auroras are seen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Photosynthesis occurs across its body under the sun. The shell on its back is actually hardened soil.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A GROTLE that lives in the forest is said to have its own secret springwater.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Ancient people imagined that beneath the ground, a gigantic TORTERRA dwelled.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The gas made in its belly burns from its rear end. The fire burns weakly when it feels sick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A bigger fire on its tail and a brighter blue pattern on its face means its rank in its pack is higher.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tosses its enemies around with agility. It uses all its limbs to fight in its own unique style.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It doesn’t like to be taken care of. It’s difficult to bond with since it won’t listen to its Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives a solitary life. Its wings deliver wicked blows that can snap even the thickest of trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It avoids unnecessary disputes, but it will decimate anything that threatens its pride.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They flock around mountains and fields, chasing after bug Pokémon. Their singing is noisy and annoying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They maintain huge flocks, although fierce scuffles break out between various flocks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When STARAVIA evolve into STARAPTOR, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in groups by the water. It chews up boulders and trees around its nest with its incisors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It busily makes its nest with stacks of branches and roots it has cut up with its sharp incisors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its antennae hit each other, it sounds like the music of a xylophone.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By allowing its cry to resonate in the hollow of its belly, it produces a captivating sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. Its fur glows when it’s in trouble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By gathering their tails together, they collectively generate powerful electricity from their claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"LUXRAY’s ability to see through objects comes in handy when it’s scouting for danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it feels the sun’s warm touch, it opens its bud to release pollen. It lives alongside clear pools.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its sweet aroma attracts prey. Then it spews poison. The more toxic it is, the sweeter its aroma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"CRANIDOS toughen up their already rock-hard heads by headbutting one another.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was generated from a fossil dug out of a layer of clay that was older than anyone knows. It has a sturdy face.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When attacked, they form a wall. Their rock-hard faces serve to protect them from the attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It covers itself with a cloak to shelter from the cold. When it’s hot, its cloak is thinner.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that a WORMADAM that evolves on a cold day will have a thicker cloak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flutters around at night and steals honey from the COMBEE hive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At night, COMBEE sleep in a group of about a thousand, packed closely together in a lump.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises grubs in the holes in its body. It secretes pheromones to control COMBEE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s one of the kinds of Pokémon with electric cheek pouches. It shoots charges from its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It inflates its flotation sac, keeping its face above water in order to watch for prey movement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its flotation sac inflated, it can carry people on its back. It deflates the sac before it dives.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"During times of strong sunlight, its bud blooms, its petals open fully, and it becomes very active.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its shape and coloration vary, depending on its habitat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its natural enemy attacks, it oozes purple fluid and escapes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is very difficult to dodge the consecutive strikes of its two tails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is whispered that any child who mistakes DRIFLOON for a balloon and holds on to it could wind up missing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can generate and release gas within its body. That’s how it can control the altitude of its drift.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"You can tell how it feels by the way it rolls its ears. When it’s scared, both ears are rolled up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sheds its fur twice a year. Its winter fur is soft and fluffy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries sound like incantations to torment the foe. It appears where you least expect it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it’s happy, GLAMEOW demonstrates beautiful movements of its tail, like a dancing ribbon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It would claim another Pokémon’s nest as its own if it finds a nest sufficiently comfortable.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It emits high-frequency cries that people can’t hear. Once it starts, it can cry for an awfully long time.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The foul fluid from its rear is so revolting that it can make people feel queasy up to a mile and a quarter away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a repugnant fluid from its tail, but the stench dulls after a few squirts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Ancient people believed that the pattern on BRONZOR’s back contained a mysterious power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Ancient people believed that petitioning BRONZONG for rain was the way to make crops grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In order to adjust the level of fluids in its body, it exudes water from its eyes. This makes it appear to be crying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carefully carries a round, white rock that it thinks is an egg. It’s bothered by how curly its hair looks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It mimics the cries of other Pokémon to trick them into thinking it’s one of them. This way they won’t attack it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was formed by uniting 108 spirits. It has been bound to the Odd Keystone to keep it from doing any mischief.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is covered in fine scales that reduce drag, enabling it to fly at high speeds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shrouds itself in sand to ward off germs. It travels easily through the sands of the desert.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It brandishes its gaping mouth in a display of fearsome strength. It raises vast quantities of sand while attacking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It burrows under the sand to lie in wait for prey. Its tail claws can inject its prey with a savage poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks people and Pokémon that cross the desert. This has only furthered its bad reputation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Fluid squeezed from its finger, albeit poisonous, is a significant ingredient in remedies for lower back pain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It walks around on its tentacles in search of a tree branch where it can dangle down and ambush prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Swimming and fluttering its two tail fins, it looks like a BEAUTIFLY. At night, the patterns on its tail fins softly shine.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"LUMINEON swimming in the darkness of the deep sea look like stars shining in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it swims close to the surface of the ocean, people aboard ships are able to observe the pattern on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"During cold seasons, it migrates to the mountain’s lower reaches. It returns to the snow-covered summit in the spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives a quiet life on mountains that are perpetually covered in snow. It hides itself by whipping up blizzards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in snowy regions. It carves patterns in trees with its claws as a signal to others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Exposure to a special magnetic field changed MAGNETON’s molecular structure, turning it into MAGNEZONE.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has space in its throat to store saliva. It can also roll up its tongue and store it in the same spot.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From holes in its palms, it fires out GEODUDE. Its carapace can withstand volcanic eruptions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its vines grow so profusely that, in the warm season, you can’t even see its eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As its electric charge amplifies, blue sparks begin to crackle between its horns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As everyone knows, it visits peaceful regions, bringing them gifts of kindness and sweet blessings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The beat of its wings is so powerful that it accidentally dislodges full-grown trees when it takes off in flight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When you see LEAFEON asleep in a patch of sunshine, you’ll know it is using photosynthesis to produce clean air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It causes small ice crystals to form by lowering the temperature of the surrounding atmosphere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its flight is soundless. It uses its lengthy tail to carry off its prey... Then its elongated fangs do the rest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flourished worldwide during the ice age but its population declined when the masses of ice began to dwindle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error...","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it can sense what its foe is thinking, its attacks burst out first, fast, and fierce.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force. With them, it can attack the foe from three directions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This feared Pokémon is said to travel to worlds unknown. Some even believe that it takes lost spirits along with it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Research continues on this Pokémon, which could be the power source of a unique motor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"According to some sources, this Pokémon provided people with the intelligence necessary to solve various problems.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to have endowed the human heart with emotions, such as sorrow and joy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to have endowed humans with the determination needed to face any of life’s difficulties.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon completely controls the flow of time. It uses its power to travel at will through the past and future.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its total control over the boundaries of space enable it to transport itself to faraway places or even other dimensions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Boiling blood, like magma, circulates through its body. It makes its dwelling place in volcanic caves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is believed to have shaped REGIROCK, REGICE, and REGISTEEL out of clay, ice, and magma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is said to live in a world on the reverse side of ours, where common knowledge is distorted and strange.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Those who sleep holding CRESSELIA’s feather are assured of joyful dreams. It is said to represent the crescent moon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the water warms, they inflate the flotation sac on their heads and drift languidly on the sea in packs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It starts its life with a wondrous power that permits it to bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The blooming of Gracidea flowers confers the power of flight upon it. Feelings of gratitude are the message it delivers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"According to the legends of Sinnoh, this Pokémon emerged from an egg and shaped all there is in this world.","esFrom":"y"}],"black":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that Charizard’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It curls up, then rolls into foes with its back. Its sharp spines inflict severe damage.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very wary and rarely shows itself to people. Its ears can hear a pin drop over half a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Overwhelmed by enigmatic abilities, it suffers a constant headache. It sometimes uses mysterious powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is seen swimming dynamically and elegantly using its well-developed limbs and flippers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its psychic power is such a strain on its brain that it needs to sleep for 18 hours a day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of Geodude at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It happily carries heavy cargo to toughen up. It willingly does hard work for people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its body is almost entirely composed of water, it shrivels up if it is washed ashore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It extends its 80 tentacles to form an encircling poisonous net that is difficult to escape.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls on mountain paths to move. Once it builds momentum, no Pokémon can stop it without difficulty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The faster the units at its sides rotate, the greater the magnetic force they generate.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many mysteriously appear when more sunspots dot the sun. They stop TV sets from displaying properly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives on icebergs. It swims in the sea using the point on its head to break up ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burrows through the ground at a speed of 50 mph while feeding on large boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it extends its over-six-foot-long tongue, its tail quivers. There is a possibility they are connected.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In autumn, its body becomes more fatty in preparing to propose to a mate. It takes on beautiful colors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It windmills its arms to slightly boost its punches. Foes have been known to escape in the meantime.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it breathes deeply, heat waves form around its body, making it hard to see clearly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it can’t tear, it tosses far.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it begins to rampage, a Gyarados will burn everything down, even in a harsh storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the ability to reconstitute its entire cellular structure to transform into whatever it sees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining Mew’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks time precisely. Some countries consider it to be a wise friend, versed in the world’s ways.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lanturn’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind-hearted people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The oil-filled end of its tail floats on water. It keeps Marill from drowning even in a strong current.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can hover in one spot by flapping its wings at high speed. It flits about to guard its territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When walking on land, it covers its body with a poisonous film that keeps its skin from dehydrating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A smart and sneaky Pokémon. A pair may work together to steal eggs by having one lure the parents away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very sensitive nose. It can locate mushrooms, berries, and even hot springs buried under ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It forcefully squirts water. The water jet never misses prey even if the Remoraid is deep in the sea.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to lurk inside holes in rocks. It sometimes sprays ink on prey by sticking out only its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink Miltank’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It soars high in the sky, riding on updrafts like a glider. It carries food tucked in its bill.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heart beats at a tenfold tempo, so it cannot sit still for even a moment.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When endangered, it may protect itself by raising its magnetism and drawing iron objects to its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gains the ability to see the aura of its opponents by honing its mind through starvation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves Illumise’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The more healthy the Roselia, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For many generations, it has feuded with Zangoose. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its appearance changes with the weather. Recently, its molecules were found to be just like water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prevents prey from escaping by instantaneously freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls across ice floes to reach shore because its body is poorly shaped for swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It converses with others by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Some Pokémon are born on a Torterra’s back and spend their entire life there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses unique fighting moves with fire on its hands and feet. It will take on any opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because every Prinplup considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A comparison revealed that Bidoof’s front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it loves floral honey, it won’t gather any itself. Instead, it plots to steal some from Combee.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The trio is together from birth. It constantly gathers honey from flowers to please Vespiquen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and carry off prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It brought rains by opening portals to another world. It was revered as a bringer of plentiful harvests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to carry around a small rock. It may wander around others’ feet and cause them to stumble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As soon as the tail claws close, its needle tips secrete poison. It can survive a year without food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength, taking down foes without using toxins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crawls along the seafloor using its long front fins like legs. It competes for food with Lanturn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"People organize tours to see this Pokémon frolic and skim the tops of waves with Remoraid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A group tried to use scientific means to make Magnezone evolve, but their efforts ended in failure.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shares many blessings with people who respect one another’s rights and avoid needless strife.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its electric-like body can enter some kinds of machines and take control in order to make mischief.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Uxie flew, people gained the ability to solve problems. It was the birth of knowledge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Mesprit flew, people learned the joy and sadness of living. It was the birth of emotions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Azelf flew, people gained the determination to do things. It was the birth of willpower.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that time flows when Dialga’s heart beats.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that space becomes more stable with Palkia’s every breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of rugged steel. However, it is partially melted in spots because of its own heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On nights around the quarter moon, the aurora from its tail extends and undulates beautifully.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have emerged from an egg in a place where there was nothing, then shaped the world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon brings victory. It is said that Trainers with Victini always win, regardless of the type of encounter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very intelligent and calm. Being exposed to lots of sunlight makes its movements swifter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves along the ground as if sliding. Its swift movements befuddle its foes, and it then attacks with a vine whip.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can stop its opponents’ movements with just a glare. It takes in solar energy and boosts it internally.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can deftly dodge its foe’s attacks while shooting fireballs from its nose. It roasts berries before it eats them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its internal fire flares up, its movements grow sharper and faster. When in trouble, it emits smoke.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can throw a fire punch by setting its fists on fire with its fiery chin. It cares deeply about its friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights using the scalchop on its stomach. In response to an attack, it retaliates immediately by slashing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Strict training is how it learns its flowing double-scalchop technique.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One swing of the sword incorporated in its armor can fell an opponent. A simple glare from one of them quiets everybody.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using food stored in cheek pouches, they can keep watch for days. They use their tails to communicate with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they see an enemy, their tails stand high, and they spit the seeds of berries stored in their cheek pouches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It faces strong opponents with great courage. But, when at a disadvantage in a fight, this intelligent Pokémon flees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has black, cape-like fur that is very hard and decreases the amount of damage it receives.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rescues people stranded by blizzards in the mountains. Its shaggy fur shields it from the cold.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They steal from people for fun, but their victims can’t help but forgive them. Their deceptively cute act is perfect.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These Pokémon vanish and appear unexpectedly. Many Trainers are drawn to their beautiful form and fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon dwells deep in the forest. Eating a leaf from its head whisks weariness away as if by magic.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ill tempered, it fights by swinging its barbed tail around wildly. The leaf growing on its head is very bitter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is angered, the temperature of its head tuft reaches 600° F. It uses its tuft to roast berries.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sweets because they become energy for the fire burning inside its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. Plants that receive its water grow large.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tuft on its head holds water. When the level runs low, it replenishes the tuft by siphoning up water with its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Munna always float in the air. People whose dreams are eaten by them forget what the dreams had been about.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The mist emanating from their foreheads is packed with the dreams of people and Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each follows its Trainer’s orders as best it can, but they sometimes fail to understand complicated commands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can return to its Trainer’s location regardless of the distance separating them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Males swing their head plumage to threaten opponents. The females’ flying abilities surpass those of the males.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use their flashing manes to communicate with one another.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They have lightning-like movements. When Zebstrika run at full speed, the sound of thunder reverberates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its ear is hexagonal in shape. Compressed underground, its body is as hard as steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it overflows with power, the orange crystal on its body glows. It looks for underground water in caves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Compressing the energy from its internal core lets it fire off an attack capable of blowing away a mountain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its habitat is dark forests and caves. It emits ultrasonic waves from its nose to learn about its surroundings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It emits sound waves of various frequencies from its nose, including some powerful enough to destroy rocks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can dig through the ground at a speed of 30 mph. It could give a car running aboveground a good race.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can help in tunnel construction. Its drill has evolved into steel strong enough to bore through iron plates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It touches others with the feelers on its ears, using the sound of their heartbeats to tell how they are feeling.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by swinging a piece of lumber around. It is close to evolving when it can handle the lumber without difficulty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon is so muscular and strongly built that even a group of wrestlers could not make it budge an inch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that Conkeldurr taught humans how to make concrete more than 2,000 years ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They warn others of danger by vibrating their cheeks to create a high-pitched sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they vibrate the bumps on their heads, they can make waves in water or earthquake-like vibrations on land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They shoot paralyzing liquid from their head bumps. They use vibration to hurt their opponents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it tightens its belt, it becomes stronger. Wild Throh use vines to weave their own belts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sound of Sawk punching boulders and trees can be heard all the way from the mountains where they train.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Leavanny dress it in clothes they made for it when it hatched. It hides its head in its hood while it is sleeping.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Forests where Swadloon live have superb foliage because the nutrients they make from fallen leaves nourish the plant life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Upon finding a small Pokémon, it weaves clothing for it from leaves, using the cutters on its arms and sticky silk.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its bite injects a potent poison, enough to paralyze large bird Pokémon that try to prey on it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Protected by a hard shell, it spins its body like a wheel and crashes furiously into its enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With quick movements, it chases down its foes, attacking relentlessly with its horns until it prevails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When attacked, it escapes by shooting cotton from its body. The cotton serves as a decoy to distract the attacker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Like the wind, it can slip through any gap, no matter how small. It leaves balls of white fluff behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves on its head are very bitter. Eating one of these leaves is known to refresh a tired body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even veteran Trainers face a challenge in getting its beautiful flower to bloom. This Pokémon is popular with celebrities.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Red and blue Basculin get along so poorly, they’ll start fighting instantly. These Pokémon are very hostile.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They live buried in the sands of the desert. The sun-warmed sands prevent their body temperature from dropping.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They never allow prey to escape. Their jaws are so powerful, they can crush the body of an automobile.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its internal fire is burning, it cannot calm down and it runs around. When the fire diminishes, it falls asleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its internal fire burns at 2,500° F, making enough power that it can destroy a dump truck with one punch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses an up-tempo song and dance to drive away the bird Pokémon that prey on its flower seeds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon can easily melt holes in hard rocks with a liquid secreted from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Competing for territory, Crustle fight viciously. The one whose boulder is broken is the loser of the battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin has a rubbery elasticity, so it can reduce damage by defensively pulling its skin up to its neck.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Groups of them beat up anything that enters their territory. Each can spit acidic liquid from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They never vary the route they fly, because their memories of guarding an ancient city remain steadfast.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each of them carries a mask that used to be its face when it was human. Sometimes they look at it and cry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has been said that they swallow those who get too close and turn them into mummies. They like to eat gold nuggets.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Restored from a fossil, this Pokémon can dive to depths beyond half a mile.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They can live both in the ocean and on land. A slap from one of them is enough to open a hole in the bottom of a tanker.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to be an ancestor of bird Pokémon, they were unable to fly and moved about by hopping from one branch to another.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are intelligent and will cooperate to catch prey. From the ground, they use a running start to take flight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inhaling the gas they belch will make you sleep for a week. They prefer unsanitary places.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It clenches opponents with its left arm and finishes them off with foul-smelling poison gas belched from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It changes into the forms of others to surprise them. Apparently, it often transforms into a silent child.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They greet one another by rubbing each other with their tails, which are always kept well groomed and clean.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their white fur is coated in a special oil that makes it easy for them to deflect attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their ribbonlike feelers increase their psychic power. They are always staring at something.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They use hypnosis to control people and Pokémon. Tales of Gothorita leading people astray are told in every corner.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Starry skies thousands of light-years away are visible in the space distorted by their intense psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They drive away attackers by unleashing psychic power. They can use telepathy to talk with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Since they have two divided brains, at times they suddenly try to take two different actions at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Reuniclus shake hands, a network forms between their brains, increasing their psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These bird Pokémon are excellent divers. They swim around in the water eating their favorite food--peat moss.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Swanna start to dance at dusk. The one dancing in the middle is the leader of the flock.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The temperature of their breath is -58° F. They create snow crystals and make snow fall in the areas around them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Snowy mountains are this Pokémon’s habitat. During an ancient ice age, they moved to southern areas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and attack their foes with violent blizzards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The color and scent of their fur changes to match the mountain grass. When they sense hostility, they hide in the grass.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They migrate according to the seasons. People can tell the season by looking at Sawsbuck’s horns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The energy made in its cheeks’ electric pouches is stored inside its membrane and released while it is gliding.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These mysterious Pokémon evolve when they receive electrical stimulation while they are in the same place as Shelmet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They fly around at high speed, striking with their pointed spears. Even when in trouble, they face opponents bravely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lures people in with its Poké Ball pattern, then releases poison spores. Why it resembles a Poké Ball is unknown.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lures prey close by dancing and waving its arm caps, which resemble Poké Balls, in a swaying motion.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its thin, veil-like arms wrapped around the body of its opponent, it sinks to the ocean floor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fate of the ships and crew that wander into Jellicent’s habitat: all sunken, all lost, all vanished.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The special membrane enveloping Alomomola has the ability to heal wounds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Joltik that live in cities have learned a technique for sucking electricity from the outlets in houses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When attacked, they create an electric barrier by spitting out many electrically charged threads.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When threatened, it attacks by shooting a barrage of spikes, which gives it a chance to escape by rolling away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by swinging around its three spiky feelers. A hit from these steel spikes can reduce a boulder to rubble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The two minigears that mesh together are predetermined. Each will rebound from other minigears without meshing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its red core functions as an energy tank. It fires the charged energy through its spikes into an area.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While one alone doesn’t have much power, a chain of many Tynamo can be as powerful as lightning.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They coil around foes and shock them with electricity-generating organs that seem simply to be circular patterns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They crawl out of the ocean using their arms. They will attack prey on shore and immediately drag it into the ocean.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses its strong psychic power to squeeze its opponent’s brain, causing unendurable headaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can manipulate an opponent’s memory. Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three different-colored fingers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Litwick shines a light that absorbs the life energy of people and Pokémon, which becomes the fuel that it burns.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This ominous Pokémon is feared. Through cities it wanders, searching for the spirits of the fallen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It absorbs a spirit, which it then burns. By waving the flames on its arms, it puts its foes into a hypnotic trance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Since a broken tusk will not grow back, they diligently sharpen their tusks on river rocks after they’ve been fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are kind but can be relentless when defending territory. They challenge foes with tusks that can cut steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is not feeling well, its mucus gets watery and the power of its Ice-type moves decreases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can make its breath freeze at will. Very able in the water, it swims around in northern seas and catches prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its body temperature goes up, it turns into steam and vanishes. When its temperature lowers, it returns to ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When attacked, it defends itself by closing the lid of its shell. It can spit a sticky, poisonous liquid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So, to prevent dehydration, it wraps itself in many layers of thin membrane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is very hard, so it is unhurt even if stepped on by sumo wrestlers. It smiles when transmitting electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wields the fur on its arms like a whip. Its arm attacks come with such rapidity that they cannot even be seen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It warms its body by absorbing sunlight with its wings. When its body temperature falls, it can no longer move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The energy that burns inside it enables it to move, but no one has yet been able to identify this energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies across the sky at Mach speeds. Removing the seal on its chest makes its internal energy go out of control.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Blades comprise this Pokémon’s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It leads a group of Pawniard. It battles to become the boss, but will be driven from the group if it loses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their fluffy fur absorbs damage, even if they strike foes with a fierce headbutt.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They crush berries with their talons. They bravely stand up to any opponent, no matter how strong it is.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They fight for their friends without any thought about danger to themselves. One can carry a car while flying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its wings are too tiny to allow it to fly. As the time approaches for it to evolve, it discards the bones it was wearing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a nest out of bones it finds. It grabs weakened prey in its talons and hauls it to its nest of bones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It breathes through a hole in its tail while it burns with an internal fire. Durant is its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They attack in groups, covering themselves in steel armor to protect themselves from Heatmor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tends to bite everything, and it is not a picky eater. Approaching it carelessly is dangerous.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After it has eaten up all the food in its territory, it moves to another area. Its two heads do not get along.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This brutal Pokémon travels the skies on its six wings. Anything that moves seems like a foe to it, triggering its attack.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon was believed to have been born from the sun. When it evolves, its entire body is engulfed in flames.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon battled against humans to protect Pokémon. Its personality is calm and composed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon came to the defense of Pokémon that had lost their homes in a war among humans.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon fought humans in order to protect its friends. Legends about it continue to be passed down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The lower half of its body is wrapped in a cloud of energy. It zooms through the sky at 200 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Countless charred remains mar the landscape of places through which Thundurus has passed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon appears in legends. It sends flames into the air from its tail, burning up everything around it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Concealing itself in lightning clouds, it flies throughout the Unova region. It creates electricity in its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lands visited by Landorus grant such bountiful crops that it has been hailed as “The Guardian of the Fields.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It generates a powerful, freezing energy inside itself, but its body became frozen when the energy leaked out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By blasting water from its hooves, it can glide across water. It excels at using leg moves while battling.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its melodies are sung with a special vocalization method that can control the feelings of those who hear it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Over 300 million years ago, it was feared as the strongest of hunters. It has been modified by Team Plasma.","esFrom":"x"}],"white":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that Charizard’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell, then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Cautious in the extreme, its hardy vitality lets it live in any kind of environment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It whittles its constantly growing fangs by gnawing on hard things. It can chew apart cinder walls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect itself from attackers, it curls up into a ball. It lives in arid regions with minimal rainfall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It curls up, then rolls into foes with its back. Its sharp spines inflict severe damage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that happiness will come to those who see a gathering of Clefairy dancing under a full moon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is very wary and rarely shows itself to people. Its ears can hear a pin drop over half a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It controls balls of fire. As it grows, its six tails split from their tips to make more tails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nine tails are said to be imbued with a mystic power. It can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it wavers its big, round eyes, it begins singing a lullaby that makes everyone drowsy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels sublime to the touch. It can expand its body by inhaling air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It checks its surroundings and location using reflections of the ultrasonic waves from its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its sharp fangs puncture the toughest of hides and have small holes for greedily sucking blood.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Overwhelmed by enigmatic abilities, it suffers a constant headache. It sometimes uses mysterious powers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is seen swimming dynamically and elegantly using its well-developed limbs and flippers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a loyal nature. It will remain motionless until it is given an order by its Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its proud and regal appearance has captured the hearts of people since long ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its psychic power is such a strain on its brain that it needs to sleep for 18 hours a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of Geodude at once.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It happily carries heavy cargo to toughen up. It willingly does hard work for people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honeylike scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because its body is almost entirely composed of water, it shrivels up if it is washed ashore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It extends its 80 tentacles to form an encircling poisonous net that is difficult to escape.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rolls on mountain paths to move. Once it builds momentum, no Pokémon can stop it without difficulty.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulderlike body. It sheds its hide just once a year.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The faster the units at its sides rotate, the greater the magnetic force they generate.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many mysteriously appear when more sunspots dot the sun. They stop TV sets from displaying properly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives on icebergs. It swims in the sea using the point on its head to break up ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In snow, the pure white coat covering its body obscures it from predators.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A toxic fluid seeps from its body. The fluid instantly kills plants and trees on contact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It burrows through the ground at a speed of 50 mph while feeding on large boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on touch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it extends its over-six-foot-long tongue, its tail quivers. There is a possibility they are connected.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lighter-than-air gases in its body keep it aloft. The gases not only smell, they are also explosive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In autumn, its body becomes more fatty in preparing to propose to a mate. It takes on beautiful colors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its body is torn, it can grow back if the red core remains. The core flashes at midnight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At the center of its body is a red core, which sends mysterious radio signals into the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It windmills its arms to slightly boost its punches. Foes have been known to escape in the meantime.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it breathes deeply, heat waves form around its body, making it hard to see clearly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grips prey with its pincers until the prey is torn in half. What it can’t tear, it tosses far.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it begins to rampage, a Gyarados will burn everything down, even in a harsh storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves crossing the sea with people and Pokémon on its back. It understands human speech.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the ability to reconstitute its entire cellular structure to transform into whatever it sees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because its genetic makeup is irregular, it quickly changes its form due to a variety of causes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can melt away into water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If agitated, it uses electricity to straighten out its fur and launch it in small bunches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inhaled air is heated in the flame sac in its body to an intense fire over 3,000 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining Mew’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It marks time precisely. Some countries consider it to be a wise friend, versed in the world’s ways.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The transformation of its legs into wings made it better at flying, but more clumsy at walking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lanturn’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is often seen when shooting stars fill the night skies. It’s said to arrive riding on a shooting star.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a soft and bouncy body. Once it starts bouncing, it becomes impossible to stop.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind-hearted people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fluffy coat swells to double when static electricity builds up. Touching it can be shocking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its coat becomes fully charged with electricity, its tail lights up. It fires hair that zaps on impact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The oil-filled end of its tail floats on water. It keeps Marill from drowning even in a strong current.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can spend all day in water, since it can inhale and store a large volume of air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. A year after a cold summer, their population explodes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gets energy from warm sunlight and is known for its habit of moving in pursuit of it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can hover in one spot by flapping its wings at high speed. It flits about to guard its territory.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When walking on land, it covers its body with a poisonous film that keeps its skin from dehydrating.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can sense minute shifts in the air and predict the weather.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it gains a mysterious power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it, then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It digs into the ground with its tail and makes a mazelike nest. It can fly just a little.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It glides as if sliding. It startles foes by clamping on to their faces, then jabs with its poison stinger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought its body transformed as a result of iron accumulating internally from swallowing soil.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stores berries in its shell. The berries eventually ferment to become delicious juices.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A smart and sneaky Pokémon. A pair may work together to steal eggs by having one lure the parents away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very sensitive nose. It can locate mushrooms, berries, and even hot springs buried under ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Covered by a shaggy coat, it is strong against the cold. Its tusks of ice thicken when it snows.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many live in the clean seas of the south. They apparently can’t live in polluted waters.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It forcefully squirts water. The water jet never misses prey even if the Remoraid is deep in the sea.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to lurk inside holes in rocks. It sometimes sprays ink on prey by sticking out only its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carries food rolled up in its tail. It has the habit of sharing food with people lost in mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While elegantly swimming in the sea, it ignores Remoraid that cling to its fins seeking food scraps.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite being clad entirely in iron-hard armor, it flies at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up, then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A weak electric current flows between its horns. Sticking a hand there shocks the unwary.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink Miltank’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that eats soil. Once it has eaten a large mountain, it goes to sleep so it can grow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is as hard as bedrock. By venting pressurized gas, it can launch itself like a rocket.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it rampages, it knocks down mountains and buries rivers. Maps must be redrawn afterward.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It soars high in the sky, riding on updrafts like a glider. It carries food tucked in its bill.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a messenger of the skies, carrying small Pokémon and eggs to safety in its bill.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spends nearly all its time in a day sprawled out. Just seeing it makes one drowsy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its heart beats at a tenfold tempo, so it cannot sit still for even a moment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The world’s laziest Pokémon. When it is lounging, it is actually saving energy for striking back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail bounces like a rubber ball. It flings that tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When endangered, it may protect itself by raising its magnetism and drawing iron objects to its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually lives deep in mountains. However, hunger may drive it to eat railroad tracks and cars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For food, it digs up iron ore. It smashes its steely body against others to fight over territory.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While seeking iron for food, it digs tunnels by breaking through bedrock with its steel horns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gains the ability to see the aura of its opponents by honing its mind through starvation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves Illumise’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The more healthy the Roselia, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On sunny days, it lands on beaches to bounce like a ball and play. It spouts water from its nose.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The biggest of all Pokémon. It can dive to a depth of almost 10,000 feet on only one breath.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its humped back stores intensely hot magma. In rain, the magma cools, slowing its movement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has volcanoes on its back. If magma builds up in its body, it shudders, then erupts violently.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It bounces constantly, using its tail like a spring. The shock of bouncing keeps its heart beating.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psycho-power. It does an odd dance to gain control over foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a conical pit in desert sand and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It violently shudders its wings, generating ultrasonic waves to induce headaches in people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t relax if it or its surroundings are not clean. It wipes off dirt with its wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it bonds with a person, it will gently envelop the friend with its soft wings, then hum.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has feuded with Seviper for many generations. Its sharp claws are its biggest weapons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For many generations, it has feuded with Zangoose. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it turns active on nights of the full moon, it is said to have some link to the lunar phases.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A new Pokémon species, rumored to be from the sun. It gives off light while spinning.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its hardy vitality enables it to adapt to any environment. Its pincers will never release prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a ruffian that uses its pincers to pick up and toss out other Pokémon from its pond.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It moves by spinning on its foot. It is a rare Pokémon that was discovered in ancient ruins.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An ancient clay figurine that came to life as a Pokémon from exposure to a mysterious ray of light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its appearance changes with the weather. Recently, its molecules were found to be just like water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves vengeful emotions and hangs in rows under the eaves of houses where vengeful people live.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Delicious fruits grew out from around its neck because it always ate the same kind of fruit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Rumored to sense disasters with its horn, it became a target. It fled deep into the mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prevents prey from escaping by instantaneously freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rolls across ice floes to reach shore because its body is poorly shaped for swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It habitually spins things on its nose. By doing so, it learns textures and odors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shatters ice with its big tusks. Its thick blubber repels not only the cold, but also enemy attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It converses with others by using magnetic pulses. In a swarm, they move in perfect unison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its steel body won’t be scratched if it collides with a jet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Metang combined to form it. With four brains, it has the intelligence of a supercomputer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Some Pokémon are born on a Torterra’s back and spend their entire life there.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses unique fighting moves with fire on its hands and feet. It will take on any opponent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because every Prinplup considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A comparison revealed that Bidoof’s front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Sensitive to changing temperature, the bud is said to bloom when it feels the sun’s warm touch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Each of its hands contains different toxins, but both hands can jab with near-fatal power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it loves floral honey, it won’t gather any itself. Instead, it plots to steal some from Combee.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The trio is together from birth. It constantly gathers honey from flowers to please Vespiquen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It releases various pheromones to make the grubs in its body do its bidding while fighting foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spins its two tails like a screw to propel itself through water. The tails also slice clinging seaweed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and carry off prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because of the way it floats aimlessly, an old folktale calls it a “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At dusk, swarms of them are carried aloft on winds. When noticed, they suddenly vanish.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its ears are always rolled up. They can be forcefully extended to shatter even a large boulder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The ears appear to be delicate. If they are touched roughly, it kicks with its graceful legs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There are researchers who believe this Pokémon reflected like a mirror in the distant past.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It brought rains by opening portals to another world. It was revered as a bringer of plentiful harvests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It likes to carry around a small rock. It may wander around others’ feet and cause them to stumble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around ten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As soon as the tail claws close, its needle tips secrete poison. It can survive a year without food.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Possessing a sturdy build, it takes pride in its strength, taking down foes without using toxins.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rarely fights fairly, but that is strictly to ensure survival. It is popular as a mascot.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It binds itself to trees in marshes. It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling drool and gulps them down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It crawls along the seafloor using its long front fins like legs. It competes for food with Lanturn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"People organize tours to see this Pokémon frolic and skim the tops of waves with Remoraid.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Evolution made it even more devious. It communicates by clawing signs in boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A group tried to use scientific means to make Magnezone evolve, but their efforts ended in failure.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The long tongue is always soggy with slobber. The saliva contains a solvent that causes numbness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its arms are made of plants that bind themselves to things. They grow back right away if cut.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Heedless of enemy attacks, it closes in, shoves its tails onto the foe, then looses high voltage.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shares many blessings with people who respect one another’s rights and avoid needless strife.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its jaw power is incredible. It is adept at biting apart foes while flying by at high speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It basically does not fight. With cells similar to those of plants, it can perform photosynthesis.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By controlling its body heat, it can freeze the atmosphere around it to make a diamond-dust flurry.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it succeeds in catching even a faint breeze properly, it can circle the globe without flapping once.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A frozen one was dug up from soil dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to much amazement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freely controls three small units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its electric-like body can enter some kinds of machines and take control in order to make mischief.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Uxie flew, people gained the ability to solve problems. It was the birth of knowledge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Mesprit flew, people learned the joy and sadness of living. It was the birth of emotions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Azelf flew, people gained the determination to do things. It was the birth of willpower.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that time flows when Dialga’s heart beats.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that space becomes more stable with Palkia’s every breath.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of rugged steel. However, it is partially melted in spots because of its own heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On nights around the quarter moon, the aurora from its tail extends and undulates beautifully.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have emerged from an egg in a place where there was nothing, then shaped the world.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It creates an unlimited supply of energy inside its body, which it shares with those who touch it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They photosynthesize by bathing their tails in sunlight. When they are not feeling well, their tails droop.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They avoid attacks by sinking into the shadows of thick foliage. They retaliate with masterful whipping techniques.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They raise their heads to intimidate opponents but only give it their all when fighting a powerful opponent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blows fire through its nose. When it catches a cold, the fire becomes pitch-black smoke instead.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Whatever it eats becomes fuel for the flame in its stomach. When it is angered, the intensity of the flame increases.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has mastered fast and powerful fighting moves. It grows a beard of fire.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The scalchop on its stomach is made from the same elements as claws. It detaches the scalchop for use as a blade.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Scalchop techniques differ from one Dewott to another. It never neglects maintaining its scalchops.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Part of the armor on its anterior legs becomes a giant sword. Its cry alone is enough to intimidate most enemies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely cautious, they take shifts to maintain a constant watch of their nest. They feel insecure without a lookout.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They make the patterns on their bodies shine in order to threaten predators. Keen eyesight lets them see in the dark.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The long hair around its face provides an amazing radar that lets it sense subtle changes in its surroundings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loyally follows its Trainer’s orders. For ages, they have helped Trainers raise Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This extremely wise Pokémon excels at rescuing people stranded at sea or in the mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cute act is a ruse. When victims let down their guard, they find their items taken. It attacks with sharp claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Stealthily, it sneaks up on its target, striking from behind before its victim has a chance to react.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shares the leaf on its head with weary-looking Pokémon. These leaves are known to relieve stress.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks enemies with strikes of its thorn-covered tail. This Pokémon is wild tempered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon lives in caves in volcanoes. The fire within the tuft on its head can reach 600° F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A flame burns inside its body. It scatters embers from its head and tail to sear its opponents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It does not thrive in dry environments. It keeps itself damp by shooting water stored in its head tuft from its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The high-pressure water expelled from its tail is so powerful, it can destroy a concrete wall.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats the dreams of people and Pokémon. When it eats a pleasant dream, it expels pink-colored mist.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With the mist from its forehead, it can create shapes of things from dreams it has eaten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon live in cities. They are accustomed to people. Flocks often gather in parks and plazas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many people believe that, deep in the forest where Tranquill live, there is a peaceful place where there is no war.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Males have plumage on their heads. They will never let themselves feel close to anyone other than their Trainers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When thunderclouds cover the sky, it will appear. It can catch lightning with its mane and store the electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This ill-tempered Pokémon is dangerous because when it’s angry, it shoots lightning from its mane in all directions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They were discovered a hundred years ago in an earthquake fissure. Inside each one is an energy core.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because its energy was too great to be contained, the energy leaked and formed orange crystals.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The solar energy absorbed by its body’s orange crystals is magnified internally and fired from its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Suction from its nostrils enables it to stick to cave walls during sleep. It leaves a heart-shaped mark behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Anyone who comes into contact with the ultrasonic waves emitted by a courting male experiences a positive mood shift.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its way swiftly through the soil by putting both claws together and rotating at high speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"More than 300 feet below the surface, they build mazelike nests. Their activity can be destructive to subway tunnels.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its auditory sense is astounding. It has a radarlike ability to understand its surroundings through slight sounds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon appear at building sites and help out with construction. They always carry squared logs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They strengthen their bodies by carrying steel beams. They show off their big muscles to their friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They use concrete pillars as walking canes. They know moves that enable them to swing the pillars freely in battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans. It uses the rhythm of these sounds to talk.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to capture prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It increases the power of its punches by vibrating the bumps on its fists. It can turn a boulder to rubble with one punch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When they encounter foes bigger than themselves, they try to throw them. They always travel in packs of five.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Tying their belts gets them pumped and makes their punches more destructive. Disturbing their training angers them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon makes clothes for itself. It chews up leaves and sews them with sticky thread extruded from its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It protects itself from the cold by wrapping up in leaves. It stays on the move, eating leaves in forests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It keeps its eggs warm with heat from fermenting leaves. It also uses leaves to make warm wrappings for Sewaddle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discovers what is going on around it by using the feelers on its head and tail. It is brutally aggressive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is usually motionless, but when attacked, it rotates at high speed and then crashes into its opponent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Highly aggressive, it uses the claws near its neck to dig into its opponents and poison them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They go wherever the wind takes them. On rainy days, their bodies are heavier, so they take shelter beneath big trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Riding whirlwinds, they appear. These Pokémon sneak through gaps into houses and cause all sorts of mischief.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Since they prefer moist, nutrient-rich soil, the areas where Petilil live are known to be good for growing plants.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect. It withers if a Trainer does not take good care of it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Red and blue Basculin usually do not get along, but sometimes members of one school mingle with the other’s school.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It moves along below the sand’s surface, except for its nose and eyes. A dark membrane shields its eyes from the sun.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can expand the focus of its eyes, enabling it to see objects in the far distance as if it were using binoculars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Darumaka’s droppings are hot, so people used to put them in their clothes to keep themselves warm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When weakened in battle, it transforms into a stone statue. Then it sharpens its mind and fights on mentally.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Arid regions are their habitat. They move rhythmically, making a sound similar to maracas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a hole in a suitable rock. If that rock breaks, the Pokémon remains agitated until it locates a replacement.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It possesses legs of enormous strength, enabling it to carry heavy slabs for many days, even when crossing arid land.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It immediately headbutts anyone that makes eye contact with it. Its skull is massively thick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The guardians of an ancient city, they use their psychic power to attack enemies that invade their territory.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves in past ages. Each retains memories of its former life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They pretend to be elaborate coffins to teach lessons to grave robbers. Their bodies are covered in pure gold.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"About 100 million years ago, these Pokémon swam in oceans. It is thought they also went on land to attack prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Incredible jaw strength enables them to chew up steel beams and rocks along with their prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Revived from a fossil, this Pokémon is thought to be the ancestor of all bird Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It runs better than it flies. It catches prey by running at speeds comparable to those of an automobile.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The combination of garbage bags and industrial waste caused the chemical reaction that created this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They absorb garbage and make it part of their bodies. They shoot a poisonous liquid from their right-hand fingertips.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect themselves from danger, they hide their true identities by transforming into people and Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon prefer a tidy habitat. They are always sweeping and dusting, using their tails as brooms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their white fur feels amazing to touch. Their fur repels dust and prevents static electricity from building up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They intently observe both Trainers and Pokémon. Apparently, they are looking at something that only Gothita can see.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Starlight is the source of their power. At night, they mark star positions by using psychic power to float stones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They can predict the future from the placement and movement of the stars. They can see Trainers’ life spans.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because their bodies are enveloped in a special liquid, they can survive in any environment.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When their brains, now divided in two, are thinking the same thoughts, these Pokémon exhibit their maximum power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These remarkably intelligent Pokémon fight by controlling arms that can grip with rock-crushing power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When attacked, it uses its feathers to splash water, escaping under cover of the spray.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It administers sharp, powerful pecks with its bill. It whips its long neck to deliver forceful repeated strikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. It sleeps buried in snow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It conceals itself from enemy eyes by creating many small ice particles and hiding among them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If both heads get angry simultaneously, this Pokémon expels a blizzard, burying everything in snow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The turning of the seasons changes the color and scent of this Pokémon’s fur. People use it to mark the seasons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The plants growing on its horns change according to the season. The leaders of the herd possess magnificent horns.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They live on treetops and glide using the inside of a cape-like membrane while discharging electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When they feel threatened, they spit an acidic liquid to drive attackers away. This Pokémon targets Shelmet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon evolve by wearing the shell covering of a Shelmet. The steel armor protects their whole body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For some reason, this Pokémon resembles a Poké Ball. They release poison spores to repel those who try to catch them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They show off their Poké Ball caps to lure prey, but very few Pokémon are fooled by this.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They paralyze prey with poison, then drag them down to their lairs, five miles below the surface.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They propel themselves by expelling absorbed seawater from their bodies. Their favorite food is life energy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Floating in the open sea is how they live. When they find a wounded Pokémon, they embrace it and bring it to shore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They attach themselves to large-bodied Pokémon and absorb static electricity, which they store in an electric pouch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They employ an electrically charged web to trap their prey. While it is immobilized by shock, they leisurely consume it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They stick their spikes into cave walls and absorb the minerals they find in the rock.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They attach themselves to cave ceilings, firing steel spikes at targets passing beneath them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Interlocking two bodies and spinning around generates the energy they need to live.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Spinning minigears are rotated at high speed and repeatedly fired away. It is dangerous if the gears don’t return.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The gear with the red core is rotated at high speed for a rapid energy charge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon move in schools. They have an electricity-generating organ, so they discharge electricity if in danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon have a big appetite. When they spot their prey, they attack it and paralyze it with electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With their sucker mouths, they suck in prey. Then they use their fangs to shock the prey with electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon had never been seen until it appeared from far in the desert 50 years ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses psychic power to control an opponent’s brain and tamper with its memories.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While shining a light and pretending to be a guide, it leeches off the life force of any who follow it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It arrives near the moment of death and steals spirit from the body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being consumed in Chandelure’s flame burns up the spirit, leaving the body behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their tusks can shatter rocks. Territory battles between Fraxure can be intensely violent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their sturdy tusks will stay sharp even if used to cut steel beams. These Pokémon are covered in hard armor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its nose is always running. It sniffs the snot back up because the mucus provides the raw material for its moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freezes its breath to create fangs and claws of ice to fight with. Cold northern areas are its habitat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They are born in snow clouds. They use chains made of ice crystals to capture prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It evolves when bathed in an electric-like energy along with Karrablast. The reason is still unknown.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Having removed its heavy shell, it becomes very light and can fight with ninja-like movements.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It conceals itself in the mud of the seashore. Then it waits. When prey touch it, it delivers a jolt of electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They have mastered elegant combos. As they concentrate, their battle moves become swifter and more precise.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They use the long fur on their arms as a whip to strike their opponents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It races through narrow caves, using its sharp claws to catch prey. The skin on its face is harder than a rock.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon are thought to have been created by the science of an ancient and mysterious civilization.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that Golurk were ordered to protect people and Pokémon by the ancient people who made them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They fight at Bisharp’s command. They cling to their prey and inflict damage by sinking their blades into it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Bisharp pursues prey in the company of a large group of Pawniard. Then Bisharp finishes off the prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They charge wildly and headbutt everything. Their headbutts have enough destructive force to derail a train.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They will challenge anything, even strong opponents, without fear. Their frequent fights help them become stronger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The more scars they have, the more respect these brave soldiers of the sky get from their peers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They tend to guard their posteriors with suitable bones they have found. They pursue weak Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Watching from the sky, they swoop to strike weakened Pokémon on the ground. They decorate themselves with bones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using their very hot, flame-covered tongues, they burn through Durant’s steel bodies and consume their insides.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Durant dig nests in mountains. They build their complicated, interconnected tunnels into mazes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They cannot see, so they tackle and bite to learn about their surroundings. Their bodies are covered in wounds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Since their two heads do not get along and compete with each other for food, they always eat too much.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The heads on their arms do not have brains. They use all three heads to consume and destroy everything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The base of volcanoes is where they make their homes. They shoot fire from their five horns to repel attacking enemies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a body and heart of steel. Its glare is sufficient to make even an unruly Pokémon obey it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its charge is strong enough to break through a giant castle wall in one blow. This Pokémon is spoken of in legends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Tornadus expels massive energy from its tail, causing severe storms. Its power is great enough to blow houses away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of lightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Reshiram’s tail flares, the heat energy moves the atmosphere and changes the world’s weather.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon appears in legends. In its tail, it has a giant generator that creates electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The energy that comes pouring from its tail increases the nutrition in the soil, making crops grow to great size.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can produce ultracold air. Its body is frozen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many famous songs have been inspired by the melodies that Meloetta plays.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This ancient bug Pokémon was altered by Team Plasma. They upgraded the cannon on its back.","esFrom":"y"}],"black2":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that Charizard’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It searches for food all day. It gnaws on hard objects to wear down its fangs, which grow constantly during its lifetime.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its long fangs, this surprisingly violent Pokémon can gnaw away even thick concrete with ease.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It digs deep burrows to live in. When in danger, it rolls up its body to withstand attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spikes on its body are made up of its hardened hide. It rolls up and attacks foes with its spikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On nights with a full moon, Clefairy gather from all over and dance. Bathing in moonlight makes them float.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their ears are sensitive enough to hear a pin drop from over a mile away, so they’re usually found in quiet places.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As each tail grows, its fur becomes more lustrous. When held, it feels slightly warm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels so pleasant, those who accidentally touch it cannot take their hands away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Flitting around in the dead of night, it sinks its fangs into its prey and drains a nearly fatal amount of blood.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When headaches stimulate its brain cells, which are usually inactive, it can use a mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its forehead shines mysteriously, Golduck can use the full extent of its power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Extremely loyal to its Trainer, it will bark at those who approach the Trainer unexpectedly and run them out of town.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its psychic power is such a strain on its brain that it needs to sleep for 18 hours a day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of Geodude at once.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It happily carries heavy cargo to toughen up. It willingly does hard work for people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honey-like scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because its body is almost entirely composed of water, it shrivels up if it is washed ashore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It extends its 80 tentacles to form an encircling poisonous net that is difficult to escape.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It rolls on mountain paths to move. Once it builds momentum, no Pokémon can stop it without difficulty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulder-like body. It sheds its hide just once a year.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The stronger electromagnetic waves from the three linked Magnemite are enough to dry out surrounding moisture.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The colder it gets, the better it feels. It joyfully swims around oceans so cold that they are filled with floating ice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its streamlined body has low resistance, and it swims around cold oceans at a speed of eight knots.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s so stinky! Muk’s body contains toxic elements, and any plant will wilt when it passes by.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Opening its large mouth, it ingests massive amounts of soil and creates long tunnels.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on contact.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being licked by its long, saliva-covered tongue leaves a tingling sensation. Extending its tongue retracts its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Toxic gas is held within its thin, balloon-shaped body, so it can cause massive explosions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inhaling toxic fumes from trash and mixing them inside its body lets it spread an even fouler stench.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional-medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In autumn, its body becomes more fatty in preparing to propose to a mate. It takes on beautiful colors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As long as its red core remains, it can regenerate its body instantly, even if it’s torn apart.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its core shines in many colors and sends radio signals into space to communicate with something.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Research is progressing on storing lightning in Electabuzz so this energy can be used at any time.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The scorching fire exhaled by Magmar forms heat waves around its body, making it hard to see the Pokémon clearly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grips prey with its powerful pincers and will not let go until the prey is torn in half.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it begins to rampage, a Gyarados will burn everything down, even in a harsh storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Able to understand human speech and very intelligent, it loves to swim in the sea with people on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can reconstitute its entire cellular structure to change into what it sees, but it returns to normal when it relaxes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can’t be seen when it melts away into water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inhaled air is carried to its flame sac, heated, and exhaled as fire that reaches over 3,000 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining Mew’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks time precisely. Some countries consider it to be a wise friend, versed in the world’s ways.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lanturn’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind-hearted people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When cold weather increases static electricity, its wool doubles in size and the tip of its tail glows slightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Not even downy wool will grow on its rubbery, nonconductive patches of skin that prevent electrical shock.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines so brightly it can be used to send sea-navigation beacons to distant foreign shores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The oil-filled tail functions as a buoy, so it’s fine even in rivers with strong currents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. Knowing it’s weak, it simply feeds until it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Since it converts sunlight into energy, it is always looking in the direction of the sun.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its wings at high speed, it can fly freely through the air. Even sudden stops are no problem.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When walking on land, it covers its body with a poisonous film that keeps its skin from dehydrating.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while it’s stunned with surprise.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The iron it ingested with the soil it swallowed transformed its body and made it harder than diamonds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The berries stored in its vaselike shell eventually become a thick, pulpy juice.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A smart and sneaky Pokémon, it makes its opponents flinch by suddenly showing the claws hidden in its paws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rooting the tip of its snout into the ground, it searches for food. Sometimes it even digs up a hot spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its excellent sense of smell, it’s even able to find mushrooms that are buried under frozen ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They prefer unpolluted southern seas. Their coral branches lose their color and deteriorate in dirty water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The water they shoot from their mouths can hit moving prey from more than 300 feet away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a tendency to want to be in holes. It prefers rock crags or pots and sprays ink from them before attacking.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can fly over 300 feet out of the water from the surface of the ocean.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heavy-looking iron body is actually thin and light, so it can fly at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by 10.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Spinning its arms around to generate electricity makes the area between its horns shine light blue.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s small, but its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees F. Embers escape its mouth and nose when it breathes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink Miltank’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The quakes caused when it walks make even great mountains crumble and change the surrounding terrain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes its nest on sheer cliffs. Riding the sea breeze, it glides up into the expansive skies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Skimming the water’s surface, it dips its large bill in the sea, scoops up food and water, and carries it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its heartbeat is fast and its blood so agitated that it can’t sit still for one second.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon lives lying on its side. It only rolls over and moves when there is no more grass to eat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its magnetic nose always faces north and draws iron objects to its body to protect itself better.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The reason it does not have a nest is that it simply searches for a clean, comfortable place then sleeps there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In order to build up its steel body, it eats iron ore. This pesky Pokémon is known to eat railroad tracks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lairon fight over territory, and when their steel bodies collide, sparks fly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It claims an entire mountain as its own. The more wounds it has, the more it has battled, so don’t take it lightly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gains the ability to see the aura of its opponents by honing its mind through starvation.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves Illumise’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It eats one ton of food every day. It plays by shooting stored seawater out its blowholes with great force.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees F. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes’ minds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s Seviper’s archrival. To threaten those it encounters, it fans out the claws on its front paws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It’s active on the night of a full moon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Loving to battle, this Pokémon pinches all Pokémon that enter its territory with its pincers and throws them out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Discovered in ancient ruins, it moves by spinning around and forms a group when it finds others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This mysterious Pokémon started life as an ancient clay figurine made over 20,000 years ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Temperature and weather affect its cellular structure, so this Pokémon changes form according to the weather.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge of being thrown away. It seeks the child who disowned it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves and gives the sweet, delicious fruit around its neck to children.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prevents prey from escaping by instantaneously freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They can’t swim well yet, and they move much faster by rolling. When they’re happy, they clap fins.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice with its prized tusks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cells are all magnetic, and it communicates with others by using magnetic pulses.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With four linked brains, it’s more intelligent than a supercomputer, and it uses calculations to analyze foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Some Pokémon are born on a Torterra’s back and spend their entire life there.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses unique fighting moves with fire on its hands and feet. It will take on any opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because every Prinplup considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A comparison revealed that Bidoof’s front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata’s.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Sensitive to changing temperatures, the bud blooms when it’s warm, releasing toxic pollen.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"While it loves floral honey, it won’t gather any itself. Instead, it plots to steal some from Combee.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon is a set of three. When they sleep, they gather up and form a giant hive of 100 Combee.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and carry off prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These Pokémon are called the “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.” Children holding them sometimes vanish.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By extending its rolled-up ears and striking the ground, it can bound so high it surprises itself.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are found in ancient tombs. The patterns on their backs are said to be imbued with mysterious power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It likes to carry around a small rock. It may wander around others’ feet and cause them to stumble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around 10.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in arid regions and can go without food for a year while waiting for prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can tear foes apart, it finishes them off with powerful poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using its tentacles to lash itself to trees, it lies in wait for prey, luring it close with sweet-smelling drool.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It crawls along the seafloor using its long front fins like legs. It competes for food with Lanturn.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The pattern on its back varies by region. It often swims in a school of Remoraid.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They communicate by clawing signs in boulders and work together to surround enemies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The instant it presses the tips of its tails onto an opponent, it sends over 20,000 volts of electricity into the foe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When shooting 3,600 degree F fireballs from its arms, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shares many blessings with people who respect one another’s rights and avoid needless strife.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With cells similar to those of plants, it performs photosynthesis inside its body and creates pure air.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When the temperature rose at the end of the ice age, most Mamoswine disappeared.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freely controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its electric-like body can enter some kinds of machines and take control in order to make mischief.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Uxie flew, people gained the ability to solve problems. It was the birth of knowledge.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Mesprit flew, people learned the joy and sadness of living. It was the birth of emotions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When Azelf flew, people gained the determination to do things. It was the birth of willpower.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that time flows when Dialga’s heart beats.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that space becomes more stable with Palkia’s every breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is made of rugged steel. However, it is partially melted in spots because of its own heat.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"On nights around the quarter moon, the aurora from its tail extends and undulates beautifully.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It is said to have emerged from an egg in a place where there was nothing then shaped the world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being exposed to sunlight makes its movements swifter. It uses vines more adeptly than its hands.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it gets dirty, its leaves can’t be used in photosynthesis, so it always keeps itself clean.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It only gives its all against strong opponents who are not fazed by the glare from Serperior’s noble eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A flaring beard of fire is proof that it is fired up. It is adept at using many different moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle--it can be used to break open hard berries as well.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and sheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Extremely cautious, one of them will always be on the lookout, but it won’t notice a foe coming from behind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using luminescent matter, it makes its eyes and body glow and stuns attacking opponents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their cute act is a ruse. They trick people and steal their valuables just to see the looks on their faces.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It strikes its enemies with a thorn-covered tail. The leaf on its head is bitter.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Very intelligent, it roasts berries before eating them. It likes to help people.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. It waters plants with it using its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Males swing the plumage on their heads to threaten others, but females are better at flying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When this ill-tempered Pokémon runs wild, it shoots lightning from its mane in all directions.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The hexagonal-shaped hole is its ear. It has a tendency to walk in the direction the sound is coming from.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The heart-shaped mark left on a body after a Woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By spinning its body, it can dig straight through the ground at a speed of 30 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Forming a drill with its steel claws and head, it can bore through a steel plate, no matter how thick it is.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using the feelers on its ears, it can tell how someone is feeling or when an egg might hatch.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans and warns others of danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lives in the water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to immobilize its opponents.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By putting power into its bumps, it creates vibrations and increases the power of its punches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Since this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Preferring dark, damp places, it spends the entire day eating fallen leaves that lie around it.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Upon finding a small Pokémon, it weaves clothing for it from leaves by using the sticky silk secreted from its mouth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its prey’s location and state.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The leaves on its head grow right back even if they fall out. These bitter leaves refresh those who eat them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Red- and blue-striped Basculin are very violent and always fighting. They are also remarkably tasty.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They live hidden under hot desert sands in order to keep their body temperature from dropping.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100° F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it moves rhythmically, it makes a sound similar to maracas, making the surprised Pokémon flee.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its boulder is broken in battles for territory, it feels unsure and begins to weaken.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping watch for invaders.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves. Each retains memories of its former life.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Grave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. It swam skillfully and dove to depths beyond half a mile.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It was revived from an ancient fossil. Not able to fly, it lived in treetops and hopped from one branch to another.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Wanting more garbage, they follow people who litter. They always belch poison gas.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Stories say those who tried to catch Zoroark were trapped in an illusion and punished.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn’t notice attacks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It can see the future from the movement of the stars. When it learns its Trainer’s life span, it cries in sadness.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Because their bodies are enveloped in a special liquid, they are fine in any environment, no matter how severe.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Theoretically, this Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. Their breath is -58° F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It glides on its outstretched membrane while shocking foes with the electricity stored in the pouches on its cheeks.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball then releases poison spores.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It moves the caps on both arms and does a dance to lure prey. It prefers damp places.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"If its veil-like arms stun and wrap a foe, that foe will be dragged miles below the surface, never to return.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its body is mostly seawater. It’s said there’s a castle of ships Jellicent have sunk on the seafloor.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Since it can’t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It creates barriers from electrified silk that stun foes. This works as a weapon as well as a defense.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"By swinging around its three spiky feelers and shooting spikes, it can obliterate an opponent.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Two bodies comprise a fixed pair. They spin around each other to generate energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The minigear spins at high speed. Then the energy from the red core charges the minigear to make it ready to fire.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It wraps itself around its prey and paralyzes it with electricity from the round spots on its sides. Then it chomps.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It latches on to prey with its sucker mouth, sinking in its fangs and shocking the prey with powerful electricity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its flame is usually out, but it starts shining when it absorbs life force from people or Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its large tusks have a tendency to break, but each time they grow back, they grow in harder and sturdier.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Its tusks are incredibly destructive. They can easily slice through a thick, sturdy steel column every time.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When its opponent can’t be paralyzed, it contorts itself with unexpected speed and flops away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It runs through the narrow tunnels formed by Excadrill and Onix. It uses its sharp claws to catch prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Golurk were created to protect people and Pokémon. They run on a mysterious energy.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They are known to charge so wildly that if a train were to enter their territory, they would send it flying.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It stands up to massive opponents, not out of courage, but out of recklessness. But that is how it gets stronger.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Individuals each play different roles in driving Heatmor, their natural predator, away from their colony.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Thought to be an embodiment of the sun, it appeared during a bitterly cold winter and saved Pokémon from freezing.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"It has a body and heart of steel. It worked with its allies to punish people when they hurt Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Spoken of in legend, this Pokémon used its phenomenal power to destroy a castle in its effort to protect Pokémon.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"In every direction it flies, creating winds so powerful, they blow everything away.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"From the forces of lightning and wind, it creates energy to give nutrients to the soil and make the land abundant.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"The melodies sung by Meloetta have the power to make Pokémon that hear them happy or sad.","esFrom":"x"},{"en":"This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.","esFrom":"x"}],"white2":[null,{"en":"For some time after its birth, it grows by gaining nourishment from the seed on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the bud on its back starts swelling, a sweet aroma wafts to indicate the flower’s coming bloom.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"After a rainy day, the flower on its back smells stronger. The scent attracts other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fire on the tip of its tail is a measure of its life. If healthy, its tail burns intensely.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the rocky mountains where Charmeleon live, their fiery tails shine at night like stars.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that Charizard’s fire burns hotter if it has experienced harsh battles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shelters itself in its shell then strikes back with spouts of water at every opportunity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to live 10,000 years. Its furry tail is popular as a symbol of longevity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The jets of water it spouts from the rocket cannons on its shell can punch through thick steel.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A steel-hard shell protects its tender body. It quietly endures hardships while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves the honey of flowers and can locate flower patches that have even tiny amounts of pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats its weight in leaves every day. It fends off attackers with the needle on its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While awaiting evolution, it hides from predators under leaves and in nooks of branches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its best attack involves flying around at high speed, striking with poison needles, then flying off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is docile and prefers to avoid conflict. If disturbed, however, it can ferociously strike back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies over its wide territory in search of prey, downing it with its highly developed claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It searches for food all day. It gnaws on hard objects to wear down its fangs, which grow constantly during its lifetime.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its long fangs, this surprisingly violent Pokémon can gnaw away even thick concrete with ease.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the stamina to fly all day on its broad wings. It fights by using its sharp beak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sneaks through grass without making a sound and strikes unsuspecting prey from behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The pattern on its belly is for intimidation. It constricts foes while they are frozen in fear.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It occasionally uses an electric shock to recharge a fellow Pikachu that is in a weakened state.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tail discharges electricity into the ground, protecting it from getting shocked.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It digs deep burrows to live in. When in danger, it rolls up its body to withstand attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spikes on its body are made up of its hardened hide. It rolls up and attacks foes with its spikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than Nidorino’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One swing of its mighty tail can snap a telephone pole as if it were a matchstick.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On nights with a full moon, Clefairy gather from all over and dance. Bathing in moonlight makes them float.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their ears are sensitive enough to hear a pin drop from over a mile away, so they’re usually found in quiet places.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As each tail grows, its fur becomes more lustrous. When held, it feels slightly warm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Each of its nine tails is imbued with supernatural power, and it can live for a thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Looking into its cute, round eyes makes it start singing a song so pleasant listeners can’t help but fall asleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fine fur feels so pleasant, those who accidentally touch it cannot take their hands away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It does not need eyes, because it emits ultrasonic waves to check its surroundings while it flies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Flitting around in the dead of night, it sinks its fangs into its prey and drains a nearly fatal amount of blood.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It often plants its root feet in the ground during the day and sows seeds as it walks about at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The honey it drools from its mouth smells so atrocious, it can curl noses more than a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its petals are the largest in the world. As it walks, it scatters extremely allergenic pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Mushrooms named tochukaso grow on its back. They grow along with the host Paras.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A mushroom grown larger than the host’s body controls Parasect. It scatters poisonous spores.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flutters its wings to scatter dustlike scales. The scales leach toxins if they contact skin.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that lives underground. Because of its dark habitat, it is repelled by bright sunlight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its three heads move alternately, driving it through tough soil to depths of over 60 miles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is nocturnal in nature. If it spots something shiny, its eyes glitter brightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When headaches stimulate its brain cells, which are usually inactive, it can use a mysterious power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its forehead shines mysteriously, Golduck can use the full extent of its power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows angry if you see its eyes and gets angrier if you run. If you beat it, it gets even madder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely loyal to its Trainer, it will bark at those who approach the Trainer unexpectedly and run them out of town.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sight of it running over 6,200 miles in a single day and night has captivated many people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its skin is so thin, its internal organs are visible. It has trouble walking on its newly grown feet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spiral pattern on its belly subtly undulates. Staring at it gradually causes drowsiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its psychic power is such a strain on its brain that it needs to sleep for 18 hours a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stares at its silver spoon to focus its mind. It emits more alpha waves while doing so.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spoons clutched in its hands are said to have been created by its psychic powers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though small in stature, it is powerful enough to easily heft and throw a number of Geodude at once.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It happily carries heavy cargo to toughen up. It willingly does hard work for people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its four muscled arms slam foes with powerful punches and chops at blinding speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers hot and humid environments. It is quick at capturing prey with its vines.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that appears to be a plant. It captures unwary prey by dousing them with a toxic powder.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It pools in its mouth a fluid with a honey-like scent, which is really an acid that dissolves anything.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because its body is almost entirely composed of water, it shrivels up if it is washed ashore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It extends its 80 tentacles to form an encircling poisonous net that is difficult to escape.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"At rest, it looks just like a rock. Carelessly stepping on it will make it swing its fists angrily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It rolls on mountain paths to move. Once it builds momentum, no Pokémon can stop it without difficulty.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even dynamite can’t harm its hard, boulder-like body. It sheds its hide just once a year.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a newborn, it can barely stand. However, through galloping, its legs are made tougher and faster.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When at an all-out gallop, its blazing mane sparkles, enhancing its beautiful appearance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Although slow, it is skilled at fishing with its tail. It does not feel pain if its tail is bitten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though usually dim witted, it seems to become inspired if the Shellder on its tail bites down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The electromagnetic waves emitted by the units at the sides of its head expel antigravity, which allows it to float.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The stronger electromagnetic waves from the three linked Magnemite are enough to dry out surrounding moisture.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can’t live without the stalk it holds. That’s why it defends the stalk from attackers with its life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Doduo evolves into this odd breed, one of its heads splits into two. It runs at nearly 40 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The colder it gets, the better it feels. It joyfully swims around oceans so cold that they are filled with floating ice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its streamlined body has low resistance, and it swims around cold oceans at a speed of eight knots.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s so stinky! Muk’s body contains toxic elements, and any plant will wilt when it passes by.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swims backward by opening and closing its two shells. Its large tongue is always kept hanging out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights by keeping its shell tightly shut for protection and by shooting spikes to repel foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It likes to lurk in the dark and tap shoulders with a gaseous hand. Its touch causes endless shuddering.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leer that floats in darkness belongs to a Gengar delighting in casting curses on people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Opening its large mouth, it ingests massive amounts of soil and creates long tunnels.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can tell what people are dreaming by sniffing with its big nose. It loves fun dreams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Seeing its swinging pendulum can induce sleep in three seconds, even in someone who just woke up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in burrows dug on sandy beaches. Its pincers fully grow back if they are broken in battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The larger pincer has 10,000-horsepower strength. However, it is so heavy, it is difficult to aim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a Poké Ball. It is dangerous because it may electrocute or explode on contact.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is known to drift on winds if it is bloated to bursting with stored electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called “The Walking Jungle.” If a head grows too big, it falls off and becomes an Exeggcute.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From its birth, this savage Pokémon constantly holds bones. It is skilled in using them as weapons.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs can stretch double. First-time foes are startled by its extensible reach.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being licked by its long, saliva-covered tongue leaves a tingling sensation. Extending its tongue retracts its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Toxic gas is held within its thin, balloon-shaped body, so it can cause massive explosions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inhaling toxic fumes from trash and mixing them inside its body lets it spread an even fouler stench.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its powerful tackles can destroy anything. However, it is too slow witted to help people work.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Standing on its hind legs freed its forelegs and made it smarter. It is very forgetful, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A kindly Pokémon that lays highly nutritious eggs and shares them with injured Pokémon or people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its offspring in its belly pouch. It lets the baby out to play only when it feels safe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its nest in the shade of corals. If it senses danger, it spits murky ink and flees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its spines provide protection. Its fins and bones are prized as traditional-medicine ingredients.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though it appears very elegant when swimming with fins unfurled, it can jab powerfully with its horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In autumn, its body becomes more fatty in preparing to propose to a mate. It takes on beautiful colors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As long as its red core remains, it can regenerate its body instantly, even if it’s torn apart.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its core shines in many colors and sends radio signals into space to communicate with something.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shapes an invisible wall in midair by minutely vibrating its fingertips to stop molecules in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sharp scythes on its forearms become increasingly sharp by cutting through hard objects.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries sound like human speech. However, it is impossible to tell what it is trying to say.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Research is progressing on storing lightning in Electabuzz so this energy can be used at any time.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The scorching fire exhaled by Magmar forms heat waves around its body, making it hard to see the Pokémon clearly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grips prey with its powerful pincers and will not let go until the prey is torn in half.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it takes aim at its foe, it makes a headlong charge. It is famous for its violent nature.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Magikarp living for many years can leap a mountain using Splash. The move remains useless, though.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it begins to rampage, a Gyarados will burn everything down, even in a harsh storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Able to understand human speech and very intelligent, it loves to swim in the sea with people on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can reconstitute its entire cellular structure to change into what it sees, but it returns to normal when it relaxes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Thanks to its unstable genetic makeup, this special Pokémon conceals many different possible evolutions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cell composition is similar to water molecules. As a result, it can’t be seen when it melts away into water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By storing electricity in its body, it can shoot its bristlelike fur like a barrage of missiles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inhaled air is carried to its flame sac, heated, and exhaled as fire that reaches over 3,000 degrees F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A man-made Pokémon created using advanced scientific means. It can move freely in cyberspace.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that was resurrected from a fossil using modern science. It swam in ancient seas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon became extinct because its spiral shell grew too large.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought to have inhabited beaches 300 million years ago. It is protected by a stiff shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is thought that this Pokémon came onto land because its prey adapted to life on land.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that roamed the skies in the dinosaur era. Its teeth are like saw blades.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its belly is full, it becomes too lethargic to even lift a finger, so it is safe to bounce on its belly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary bird Pokémon. It can create blizzards by freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon that is said to live in thunderclouds. It freely controls lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One of the legendary bird Pokémon. It is said that its appearance indicates the coming of spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is called the “Mirage Pokémon” because so few have seen it. Its shed skin has been found.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its body takes on an aura, the weather changes instantly. It is said to live in seas and lakes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to make its home somewhere in the sea. It guides crews of shipwrecks to shore.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon created by recombining Mew’s genes. It’s said to have the most savage heart among Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it can use all kinds of moves, many scientists believe Mew to be the ancestor of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the leaf on its head to determine the temperature and humidity. It loves to sunbathe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its breath has the fantastic ability to revive dead plants and flowers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a timid nature. If it is startled, the flames on its back burn more vigorously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It intimidates foes with the heat of its flames. The fire burns more strongly when it readies to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using blasts of fire. It creates heat shimmers with intense fire to hide itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It usually moves slowly, but it goes at blinding speed when it attacks and bites prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a very nervous nature. It stands up high on its tail so it can scan wide areas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The mother puts its offspring to sleep by curling up around them. It corners foes with speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It marks time precisely. Some countries consider it to be a wise friend, versed in the world’s ways.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses starlight as energy. When more stars appear at night, the patterns on its back grow larger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sets a trap by spinning a web with thin but strong silk. It waits motionlessly for prey to arrive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attaches silk to its prey and sets it free. Later, it tracks the silk to the prey and its friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Having four wings allows it to fly more quickly and quietly so it can sneak up on prey without its noticing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges positive and negative electricity from its antenna tips to shock its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lanturn’s light can shine up from great depths. It is nicknamed “The Deep-Sea Star.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The electric sacs in its cheeks are small. If even a little electricity leaks, it becomes shocked.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"According to local rumors, Cleffa are often seen in places where shooting stars have fallen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body has a faintly sweet scent and is bouncy and soft. If it bounces even once, it cannot stop.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It transforms the kindness and joy of others into happiness, which it stores in its shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To share its happiness, it flies around the world seeking kind-hearted people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It picks food from cactus plants, deftly avoiding buds and spines. It seems to skip about to move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This odd Pokémon can see both the past and the future. It eyes the sun’s movement all day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When cold weather increases static electricity, its wool doubles in size and the tip of its tail glows slightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Not even downy wool will grow on its rubbery, nonconductive patches of skin that prevent electrical shock.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The tip of its tail shines so brightly it can be used to send sea-navigation beacons to distant foreign shores.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the heavy rainfall season ends, it is drawn out by warm sunlight to dance in the open.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The oil-filled tail functions as a buoy, so it’s fine even in rivers with strong currents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its long ears are superb sensors. It can distinguish the movements of things in water and tell what they are.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To avoid being attacked, it does nothing but mimic a tree. It hates water and flees from rain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gathers groups of others as their leader. Its cries make Poliwag obey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It blooms when the weather warms. It floats in the sky to soak up as much sunlight as possible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Blown by seasonal winds, it circles the globe, scattering cotton spores as it goes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives high among the treetops. It can use its tail as freely and cleverly as its hands.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It suddenly falls out of the sky in the morning. Knowing it’s weak, it simply feeds until it evolves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Since it converts sunlight into energy, it is always looking in the direction of the sun.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its wings at high speed, it can fly freely through the air. Even sudden stops are no problem.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When walking on land, it covers its body with a poisonous film that keeps its skin from dehydrating.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has an easygoing nature. It doesn’t care if it bumps its head on boats and boulders while swimming.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fur is so sensitive, it can feel minute shifts in the air and predict the weather...and its foes’ thoughts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When exposed to the moon’s aura, the rings on its body glow faintly and it’s filled with a mysterious power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If spotted, it will lure an unwary person into chasing it then lose the pursuer on mountain trails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being bitten by Shellder gave it intelligence comparable to that of award-winning scientists.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon that startles people in the middle of the night. It gathers fear as its energy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When alone, nothing happens. However, if there are two or more, an odd power is said to emerge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It desperately tries to keep its black tail hidden. It is said to be proof the tail hides a secret.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The head on its tail contains a small brain. It can instinctively fight even while facing backward.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks just like a pinecone. Its shell protects it from bird Pokémon that peck it by mistake.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is encased in a steel shell. Its peering eyes are all that can be seen of its mysterious innards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It creates mazes in dark locations. When spotted, it flees into the ground by digging with its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It clamps on to its chosen prey then jabs the stinger on its tail into the prey while it’s stunned with surprise.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The iron it ingested with the soil it swallowed transformed its body and made it harder than diamonds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Small Pokémon flee from its scary face. It is, however, considered by women to be cute.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is timid in spite of its looks. If it becomes enraged, however, it will strike with its huge fangs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shoots the poison spines on its body in all directions. Its round form makes it a poor swimmer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The berries stored in its vaselike shell eventually become a thick, pulpy juice.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A smart and sneaky Pokémon, it makes its opponents flinch by suddenly showing the claws hidden in its paws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lets honey soak into its paws so it can lick them all the time. Every set of paws tastes unique.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In its territory, it leaves scratches on trees that bear delicious berries or fruits.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body temperature is roughly 18,000 degrees F. Flames spout from gaps in its hardened shell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Rooting the tip of its snout into the ground, it searches for food. Sometimes it even digs up a hot spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its excellent sense of smell, it’s even able to find mushrooms that are buried under frozen ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They prefer unpolluted southern seas. Their coral branches lose their color and deteriorate in dirty water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The water they shoot from their mouths can hit moving prey from more than 300 feet away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a tendency to want to be in holes. It prefers rock crags or pots and sprays ink from them before attacking.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It carries food all day long. When someone is lost in the mountains, it shares that food.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it builds up enough speed swimming, it can fly over 300 feet out of the water from the surface of the ocean.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its heavy-looking iron body is actually thin and light, so it can fly at speeds over 180 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is smart enough to hunt in packs. It uses a variety of cries for communicating with others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flames it breathes when angry contain toxins. If they cause a burn, it will hurt forever.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in caves on the seafloor and creates giant whirlpools every time it moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is strong despite its compact size. It can easily pick up and carry an adult human on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by curling up then rolling into its foe. It can blow apart a house in one hit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was upgraded to enable the exploration of other planets. However, it failed to measure up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It marks its territory by using its tail like a paintbrush. There are more than 5,000 different marks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is famous for its eagerness to fight and always nurses injuries from challenging larger foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by 10.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It tests everything by touching with its lips, which remember what it likes and dislikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Spinning its arms around to generate electricity makes the area between its horns shine light blue.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s small, but its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees F. Embers escape its mouth and nose when it breathes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that kids who drink Miltank’s milk grow up to become hearty, healthy adults.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have fallen with lightning. It can fire thunderbolts from the rain clouds on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when it roars, a volcano erupts somewhere around the globe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It races around the world to purify fouled water. It dashes away with the north wind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Born deep underground, it comes aboveground and becomes a pupa once it has finished eating the surrounding soil.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This pupa flies around wildly by venting with great force the gas pressurized inside its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The quakes caused when it walks make even great mountains crumble and change the surrounding terrain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sleeps in a deep-sea trench. If it flaps its wings, it is said to cause a 40-day storm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its feathers are in seven colors. It is said that anyone seeing it is promised eternal happiness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has the power to travel across time, but it is said to appear only in peaceful times.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The soles of its feet are covered by countless tiny spikes, enabling it to walk on walls and ceilings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in dense jungles. While closing in on its prey, it leaps from branch to branch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leaves that grow on its arms can slice down thick trees. It is without peer in jungle combat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A fire burns inside, so it feels very warm to hug. It launches fireballs of 1,800 degrees F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its kicking mastery lets it loose 10 kicks per second. It emits sharp cries to intimidate foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Flames spout from its wrists, enveloping its knuckles. Its punches scorch its foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To alert it, the fin on its head senses the flow of water. It has the strength to heft boulders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its sturdy legs give it sure footing, even in mud. It burrows into dirt to sleep.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can swim while towing a large ship. It bashes down foes with a swing of its thick arms.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon with a persistent nature, it chases its chosen prey until the prey becomes exhausted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It walks in zigzag fashion. It is good at finding items in the grass and even in the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It charges prey at speeds over 60 mph. However, because it can only run straight, it often fails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Often targeted by bird Pokémon, it desperately resists by releasing poison from its tail spikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It wraps silk around the branches of a tree. It drinks rainwater on its silk while awaiting evolution.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite its looks, it is aggressive. It jabs with its long, thin mouth if disturbed while collecting pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never forgets any attack it endured while in the cocoon. After evolution, it seeks payback.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Toxic powder is scattered with each flap. At night, it is known to strip leaves off trees lining boulevards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It looks like an aquatic plant and serves as a ferry to Pokémon that can’t swim.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it hears festive music, all its muscles fill with energy. It can’t help breaking out into a dance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it dangles from a tree branch, it looks just like an acorn. It enjoys scaring other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a gutsy spirit that makes it bravely take on tough foes. It flies in search of warm climates.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It circles the sky in search of prey. When it spots one, it dives steeply to catch the prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes its nest on sheer cliffs. Riding the sea breeze, it glides up into the expansive skies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Skimming the water’s surface, it dips its large bill in the sea, scoops up food and water, and carries it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its horns capture the warm feelings of people or Pokémon, its body warms up slightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its Trainer becomes happy, it overflows with energy, dancing joyously while spinning about.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect its Trainer, it will expend all its psychic power to create a small black hole.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears as if it is skating on water. It draws prey with a sweet scent from the tip of its head.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its antennae have eye patterns on them. Its four wings enable it to hover and fly in any direction.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It spouts poison spores from the top of its head. These spores cause pain all over if inhaled.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its short arms stretch when it throws punches. Its technique is equal to that of pro boxers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it eats just three leaves in a day, it is satisfied. Other than that, it sleeps for 20 hours a day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its heartbeat is fast and its blood so agitated that it can’t sit still for one second.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon lives lying on its side. It only rolls over and moves when there is no more grass to eat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because it moves so quickly, it sometimes becomes unseeable. It congregates around tree sap.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shock waves from its cries can tip over trucks. It stamps its feet to power up.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its howls can be heard over six miles away. It emits all sorts of noises from the ports on its body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It toughens its body by slamming into thick trees. Many snapped trees can be found near its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to match power with big-bodied Pokémon. It can knock a truck flying with its arm thrusts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swings its large, nutrient-filled tail around to fight opponents bigger than itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its magnetic nose always faces north and draws iron objects to its body to protect itself better.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The reason it does not have a nest is that it simply searches for a clean, comfortable place then sleeps there.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Attached to its head is a huge set of jaws formed by horns. It can chew through iron beams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In order to build up its steel body, it eats iron ore. This pesky Pokémon is known to eat railroad tracks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lairon fight over territory, and when their steel bodies collide, sparks fly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It claims an entire mountain as its own. The more wounds it has, the more it has battled, so don’t take it lightly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gains the ability to see the aura of its opponents by honing its mind through starvation.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using electricity stored in its fur, it stimulates its muscles to heighten its reaction speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It discharges electricity from its mane. It creates a thundercloud overhead to drop lightning bolts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends with pom-poms made of sparks. It drains power from telephone poles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It cheers on friends. If its friends are losing, its body lets off more and more sparks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It communicates with others by lighting up its rear at night. It loves Illumise’s sweet aroma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With its sweet aroma, it guides Volbeat to draw signs with light in the night sky.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Almost all its body is its stomach. Its harsh digestive juices quickly dissolve anything it swallows.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It swallows anything whole. It sweats toxic fluids from its follicles to douse foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its fangs rip through sheet iron. It swims at 75 mph and is known as “The Bully of the Sea.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It eats one ton of food every day. It plays by shooting stored seawater out its blowholes with great force.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can sometimes knock out opponents with the shock created by breaching and crashing its big body onto the water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The magma in its body reaches 2,200 degrees F. Its hump gets smaller when it uses Fire-type moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The volcanoes on its back have a major eruption every 10 years--or whenever it becomes really angry.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It burns coal inside its shell for energy. It blows out black soot if it is endangered.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its tail like a spring, it keeps its heart beating by bouncing constantly. If it stops, it dies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses black pearls to amplify its psychic power. It does a strange dance to control foes’ minds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No two Spinda have the same pattern of spots. Its tottering step fouls the aim of foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes an inescapable conical pit and lies in wait at the bottom for prey to come tumbling down.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The ultrasonic waves it generates by rubbing its two wings together cause severe headaches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By storing water in its body, this desert dweller can survive for 30 days without water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It becomes active at night, seeking prey that is exhausted from the day’s desert heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For some reason, it likes to land on people’s heads softly and act like it’s a hat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On sunny days, it flies freely through the sky and blends into the clouds. It sings in a beautiful soprano.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s Seviper’s archrival. To threaten those it encounters, it fans out the claws on its front paws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The phase of the moon apparently has some effect on its power. It’s active on the night of a full moon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Solar energy is the source of its power, so it is strong during the daytime. When it spins, its body shines.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is extremely protective of its territory. If any foe approaches, it attacks using vicious tremors.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No matter how dirty the water in the river, it will adapt and thrive. It has a strong will to survive.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Loving to battle, this Pokémon pinches all Pokémon that enter its territory with its pincers and throws them out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Discovered in ancient ruins, it moves by spinning around and forms a group when it finds others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This mysterious Pokémon started life as an ancient clay figurine made over 20,000 years ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lived on the seafloor 100 million years ago and was reanimated scientifically.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A Pokémon ancestor that was reanimated from a fossil. It lived in the sea and hunted with claws.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It went ashore after evolving. Its entire body is clad in a sturdy armor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a shabby and ugly Pokémon. However, it is very hardy and can survive on little water.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its lovely scales are described as rainbow colored. They change color depending on the viewing angle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Temperature and weather affect its cellular structure, so this Pokémon changes form according to the weather.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can freely change its body’s color. The zigzag pattern on its belly doesn’t change, however.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It feeds on the dark emotions of sadness and hatred, which make it grow steadily stronger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge of being thrown away. It seeks the child who disowned it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves the crying of children. It startles bad kids by passing through walls and making them cry.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It seeks drifting will-o’-the-wisps and sucks them into its empty body. What happens inside is a mystery.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It flies by flapping its broad leaves and gives the sweet, delicious fruit around its neck to children.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cries echo inside its hollow body to emerge as beautiful notes for startling and repelling foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It appears from deep in the mountains to warn people about upcoming disasters it has sensed with its horn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that several Snorunt gather under giant leaves and live together in harmony.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prevents prey from escaping by instantaneously freezing moisture in the air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They can’t swim well yet, and they move much faster by rolling. When they’re happy, they clap fins.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Be it Spheal or Poké Ball, it will spin any round object on its nose with the greatest of ease.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Not only does its thick blubber keep it warm, it also protects it from attacks. It shatters ice with its prized tusks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It makes a single pearl during its lifetime. The pearl is said to amplify psychic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives at the bottom of the sea. In the springtime, its pink body turns more vivid for some reason.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A rare Pokémon discovered during a deep-sea exploration. It has not changed in over 100 million years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in warm seas. It is said that a couple finding this Pokémon will be blessed with eternal love.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Dreaming of one day flying, it practices by leaping off cliffs every day.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Within its rugged shell, its cells have begun changing. The shell peels off the instant it evolves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a result of its long-held dream of flying, its cellular structure changed, and wings grew out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cells are all magnetic, and it communicates with others by using magnetic pulses.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is formed by two Beldum joining together. Its two brains are linked, amplifying its psychic power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With four linked brains, it’s more intelligent than a supercomputer, and it uses calculations to analyze foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of ice from the ice age. It controls frigid air of -328 degrees Fahrenheit.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is covered with a down that can refract light in such a way that it becomes invisible.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have widened the seas by causing downpours. It had been asleep in a marine trench.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the ozone layer far above the clouds and cannot be seen from the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have the ability to grant any wish for just one week every thousand years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"An alien virus that fell to earth on a meteor underwent a DNA mutation to become this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It knows where pure water wells up. It carries fellow Pokémon there on its back.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Some Pokémon are born on a Torterra’s back and spend their entire life there.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is very agile. Before going to sleep, it extinguishes the flame on its tail to prevent fires.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It skillfully controls the intensity of the fire on its tail to keep its foes at an ideal distance.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses unique fighting moves with fire on its hands and feet. It will take on any opponent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A poor walker, it often falls down. However, its strong pride makes it puff up its chest without a care.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because every Prinplup considers itself to be the most important, they can never form a group.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If anyone were to hurt its pride, it would slash them with wings that can cleave through an ice floe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because they are weak individually, they form groups. However, they bicker if the group grows too big.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Recognizing their own weakness, they always live in a group. When alone, a Staravia cries noisily.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A comparison revealed that Bidoof’s front teeth grow at the same rate as Rattata’s.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A river dammed by Bibarel will never overflow its banks, which is appreciated by people nearby.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its legs are short. Whenever it stumbles, its stiff antennae clack with a xylophone-like sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is a village that hosts a contest based on the amazingly variable cries of this Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The extension and contraction of its muscles generates electricity. It glows when in trouble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Strong electricity courses through the tips of its sharp claws. A light scratch causes fainting in foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can see clearly through walls to track down its prey and seek its lost young.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Sensitive to changing temperatures, the bud blooms when it’s warm, releasing toxic pollen.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Luring prey with a sweet scent, it uses poison whips on its arms to poison, bind, and finish off the prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A lifelong jungle dweller from 100 million years ago, it would snap obstructing trees with head butts.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is outstandingly armored. As a result, it can eat grass and berries without having to fight.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When they lined up side by side, no foe could break through. They shielded their young in that way.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even if it is born where there are no cocooning materials, it somehow always ends up with a cloak.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When evolving, its body takes in surrounding materials. As a result, there are many body variations.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"While it loves floral honey, it won’t gather any itself. Instead, it plots to steal some from Combee.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon is a set of three. When they sleep, they gather up and form a giant hive of 100 Combee.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It houses its colony in cells in its body and releases various pheromones to make those grubs do its bidding.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A pair may be seen rubbing their cheek pouches together in an effort to share stored electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It inflates the flotation sac around its neck and pokes its head out of the water to see what is going on.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is a common sight around fishing ports. It is known to rescue people and carry off prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If it senses strong sunlight, it opens its folded petals to absorb the sun’s rays with its whole body.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Beware of pushing strongly on its squishy body, as it makes a mysterious purple fluid ooze out.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Long ago, its entire back was shielded with a sturdy shell. There are traces of it left in its cells.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon are called the “Signpost for Wandering Spirits.” Children holding them sometimes vanish.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They carry people and Pokémon, but the wind can catch them, so there can’t be a fixed destination.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By extending its rolled-up ears and striking the ground, it can bound so high it surprises itself.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely cautious, it quickly bounds off when it senses danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its cry sounds like an incantation. It is said the cry may rarely be imbued with happiness-giving power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It hides its spiteful tendency of hooking its claws into the nose of its Trainer if it isn’t fed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It binds its body with its tails to make itself look bigger. If it locks eyes, it will glare ceaselessly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"There is an orb inside its mouth. When it hops, the orb bounces all over and makes a ringing sound.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It sprays a foul fluid from its rear. Its stench spreads over a mile radius, driving Pokémon away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks by spraying a horribly smelly fluid from the tip of its tail. Attacks from above confound it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They are found in ancient tombs. The patterns on their backs are said to be imbued with mysterious power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In ages past, this Pokémon was revered as a bringer of rain. It was found buried in the ground.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers an arid atmosphere. It leaks water that looks like tears when adjusting its moisture level.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It likes to carry around a small rock. It may wander around others’ feet and cause them to stumble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tongue is just like a human’s. As a result, it can cleverly mimic human speech.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its constant mischief and misdeeds resulted in it being bound to an Odd Keystone by a mysterious spell.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said that when one runs at high speed, its wings create blades of wind that can fell nearby trees.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shuts its nostrils tight then travels through sand as if walking. They form colonies of around 10.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is surprisingly quick to anger. It holds its mouth agape as a display of its strength.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in arid regions and can go without food for a year while waiting for prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It takes pride in its strength. Even though it can tear foes apart, it finishes them off with powerful poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Inflating its poison sacs, it fills the area with an odd sound and hits flinching opponents with a poison jab.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using its tentacles to lash itself to trees, it lies in wait for prey, luring it close with sweet-smelling drool.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The line running down its side can store sunlight. It shines vividly at night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It crawls along the seafloor using its long front fins like legs. It competes for food with Lanturn.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The pattern on its back varies by region. It often swims in a school of Remoraid.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Seemingly curious about people, they gather around footsteps they find on snowy mountains.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They appear when the snow flowers bloom. When the petals fall, they retreat to places unknown again.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They communicate by clawing signs in boulders and work together to surround enemies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Sometimes the magnetism emitted by Magnezone is too strong, making them attract each other so they cannot move.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their saliva contains lots of components that can dissolve anything. The numbness caused by their lick does not dissipate.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can launch a rock held in its hand like a missile by tightening then expanding muscles instantly.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Even if one of its arms is eaten, it’s fine. The Pokémon regenerates quickly and will go right back to normal.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The instant it presses the tips of its tails onto an opponent, it sends over 20,000 volts of electricity into the foe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When shooting 3,600 degree F fireballs from its arms, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shares many blessings with people who respect one another’s rights and avoid needless strife.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers to battle by biting apart foes’ heads instantly while flying by at high speed.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With cells similar to those of plants, it performs photosynthesis inside its body and creates pure air.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lowers its body heat to freeze its fur. The hairs then become like needles it can fire.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It dances silently through the sky. When it approaches prey, it can land a critical hit in an instant.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When the temperature rose at the end of the ice age, most Mamoswine disappeared.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When trying to protect someone, it extends its elbows as if they were swords and fights savagely.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freely controls three units called Mini-Noses using magnetic force.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to take lost spirits into its pliant body and guide them home.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its electric-like body can enter some kinds of machines and take control in order to make mischief.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Uxie flew, people gained the ability to solve problems. It was the birth of knowledge.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Mesprit flew, people learned the joy and sadness of living. It was the birth of emotions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When Azelf flew, people gained the determination to do things. It was the birth of willpower.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that time flows when Dialga’s heart beats.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A legendary Pokémon of Sinnoh. It is said that space becomes more stable with Palkia’s every breath.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is made of rugged steel. However, it is partially melted in spots because of its own heat.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have made Pokémon that look like itself from a special ice mountain, rocks, and magma.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was banished for its violence. It silently gazed upon the old world from the Distortion World.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"On nights around the quarter moon, the aurora from its tail extends and undulates beautifully.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It drifts in warm seas. It always returns to where it was born, no matter how far it may have drifted.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is born with a wondrous power that lets it bond with any kind of Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The flowers all over its body burst into bloom if it is lovingly hugged and senses gratitude.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It is said to have emerged from an egg in a place where there was nothing then shaped the world.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it shares the infinite energy it creates, that being’s entire body will be overflowing with power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being exposed to sunlight makes its movements swifter. It uses vines more adeptly than its hands.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it gets dirty, its leaves can’t be used in photosynthesis, so it always keeps itself clean.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It only gives its all against strong opponents who are not fazed by the glare from Serperior’s noble eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It loves to eat roasted berries, but sometimes it gets too excited and burns them to a crisp.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The more it eats, the more fuel it has to make the fire in its stomach stronger. This fills it with even more power.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A flaring beard of fire is proof that it is fired up. It is adept at using many different moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The scalchop on its stomach isn’t just used for battle--it can be used to break open hard berries as well.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As a result of strict training, each Dewott learns different forms for using the scalchops.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In the time it takes a foe to blink, it can draw and sheathe the seamitars attached to its front legs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Extremely cautious, one of them will always be on the lookout, but it won’t notice a foe coming from behind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using luminescent matter, it makes its eyes and body glow and stuns attacking opponents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Though it is a very brave Pokémon, it’s also smart enough to check its foe’s strength and avoid battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This very loyal Pokémon helps Trainers, and it also takes care of other Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Being wrapped in its long fur is so comfortable that a person would be fine even overnight on a wintry mountain.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their cute act is a ruse. They trick people and steal their valuables just to see the looks on their faces.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their beautiful form comes from the muscles they have developed. They run silently in the night.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It’s good at finding berries and gathers them from all over. It’s kind enough to share them with friends.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It strikes its enemies with a thorn-covered tail. The leaf on its head is bitter.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Very intelligent, it roasts berries before eating them. It likes to help people.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it gets excited, embers rise from its head and tail and it gets hot. For some reason, it loves sweets.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The water stored inside the tuft on its head is full of nutrients. It waters plants with it using its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It prefers places with clean water. When its tuft runs low, it replenishes it by siphoning up water with its tail.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon appears before people and Pokémon who are having nightmares and eats those dreams.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The dream mist coming from its forehead changes into many different colors depending on the dream that was eaten.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This very forgetful Pokémon will wait for a new order from its Trainer even though it already has one.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"No matter where in the world it goes, it knows where its nest is, so it never gets separated from its Trainer.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Males swing the plumage on their heads to threaten others, but females are better at flying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its mane shines when it discharges electricity. They use the frequency and rhythm of these flashes to communicate.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When this ill-tempered Pokémon runs wild, it shoots lightning from its mane in all directions.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The hexagonal-shaped hole is its ear. It has a tendency to walk in the direction the sound is coming from.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it is healthy, its core sticks out. Always facing the same way, it swiftly moves front to back and left to right.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The solar rays it absorbs are processed in its energy core and fired as a ball of light.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The heart-shaped mark left on a body after a Woobat has been attached to it is said to bring good fortune.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It shakes its tail vigorously when it emits ultrasonic waves strong enough to reduce concrete to rubble.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By spinning its body, it can dig straight through the ground at a speed of 30 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Forming a drill with its steel claws and head, it can bore through a steel plate, no matter how thick it is.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using the feelers on its ears, it can tell how someone is feeling or when an egg might hatch.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Always carrying squared logs, they help out with construction. As they grow, they carry bigger logs.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"With strengthened bodies, they skillfully wield steel beams to take down buildings.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Rather than rely on force, they master moves that utilize the centrifugal force of spinning concrete.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By vibrating its cheeks, it emits sound waves imperceptible to humans and warns others of danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lives in the water and on land. It uses its long, sticky tongue to immobilize its opponents.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By putting power into its bumps, it creates vibrations and increases the power of its punches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it encounters a foe bigger than itself, it wants to throw it. It changes belts as it gets stronger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Desiring the strongest karate chop, they seclude themselves in mountains and train without sleeping.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Since this Pokémon makes its own clothes out of leaves, it is a popular mascot for fashion designers.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Preferring dark, damp places, it spends the entire day eating fallen leaves that lie around it.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Upon finding a small Pokémon, it weaves clothing for it from leaves by using the sticky silk secreted from its mouth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using the feelers on its head and tail, it picks up vibrations in the air to determine its prey’s location and state.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Storing energy for evolution, it sits. But, when predators approach, it moves to stab them with poison spikes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It clasps its prey with the claws on its neck until it stops moving. Then it finishes it off with deadly poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Perhaps because they feel more at ease in a group, they stick to others they find. They end up looking like a cloud.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They appear along with whirlwinds. They pull pranks, such as moving furniture and leaving balls of cotton in homes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The leaves on its head grow right back even if they fall out. These bitter leaves refresh those who eat them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The fragrance of the garland on its head has a relaxing effect, but taking care of it is very difficult.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Red- and blue-striped Basculin are very violent and always fighting. They are also remarkably tasty.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They live hidden under hot desert sands in order to keep their body temperature from dropping.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Very violent Pokémon, they try to clamp down on anything that moves in front of their eyes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it sleeps, it pulls its limbs into its body and its internal fire goes down to 1,100° F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When one is injured in a fierce battle, it hardens into a stone-like form. Then it meditates and sharpens its mind.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it moves rhythmically, it makes a sound similar to maracas, making the surprised Pokémon flee.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it finds a stone of a suitable size, it secretes a liquid from its mouth to open up a hole to crawl into.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its boulder is broken in battles for territory, it feels unsure and begins to weaken.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Proud of its sturdy skull, it suddenly headbutts everything, but its weight makes it unstable, too.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It pulls up its shed skin to protect itself while it kicks. The bigger the crest, the more respected it is.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The guardians of an ancient city, they always fly the same route while keeping watch for invaders.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves. Each retains memories of its former life.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Grave robbers who mistake them for real coffins and get too close end up trapped inside their bodies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon was restored from a fossil. It swam skillfully and dove to depths beyond half a mile.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It could knock out a foe with a slap from one of its developed front appendages and chew it up, shell or bones and all.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It was revived from an ancient fossil. Not able to fly, it lived in treetops and hopped from one branch to another.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It runs better than it flies. It takes off into the sky by running at a speed of 25 mph.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Wanting more garbage, they follow people who litter. They always belch poison gas.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Consuming garbage makes new kinds of poison gases and liquids inside their bodies.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It changes so it looks just like its foe, tricks it, and then uses that opportunity to flee.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Stories say those who tried to catch Zoroark were trapped in an illusion and punished.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Minccino greet each other by grooming one another thoroughly with their tails.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Cinccino’s body is coated in a special oil that helps it deflect attacks, such as punches.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stares intently at everything. It can become so obsessed with watching that it doesn’t notice attacks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"According to many old tales, it creates friends for itself by controlling sleeping children on starry nights.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It can see the future from the movement of the stars. When it learns its Trainer’s life span, it cries in sadness.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Because their bodies are enveloped in a special liquid, they are fine in any environment, no matter how severe.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When their two divided brains think the same thoughts, their psychic power is maximized.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They use psychic power to control their arms, which are made of a special liquid. They can crush boulders psychically.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They are better at swimming than flying, and they happily eat their favorite food, peat moss, as they dive underwater.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Despite their elegant appearance, they can flap their wings strongly and fly for thousands of miles.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Theoretically, this Pokémon formed from icicles bathed in energy from the morning sun. Their breath is -58° F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They cool down the surrounding air and create ice particles, which they use to freeze their foes.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Swallowing large amounts of water, they make snow clouds inside their bodies and, when angry, cause violent blizzards.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their coloring changes according to the seasons and can be slightly affected by the temperature and humidity as well.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They migrate according to the seasons, so some people call Sawsbuck the harbingers of spring.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It glides on its outstretched membrane while shocking foes with the electricity stored in the pouches on its cheeks.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For some reason they evolve when they receive electrical energy while they are attacking Shelmet.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Wearing the shell covering they stole from Shelmet, they defend themselves and attack with two lances.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It lures Pokémon with its pattern that looks just like a Poké Ball then releases poison spores.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It moves the caps on both arms and does a dance to lure prey. It prefers damp places.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"If its veil-like arms stun and wrap a foe, that foe will be dragged miles below the surface, never to return.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its body is mostly seawater. It’s said there’s a castle of ships Jellicent have sunk on the seafloor.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It gently holds injured and weak Pokémon in its fins. Its special membrane heals their wounds.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Since it can’t generate its own electricity, it sticks onto large-bodied Pokémon and absorbs static electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It creates barriers from electrified silk that stun foes. This works as a weapon as well as a defense.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It absorbs the iron it finds in the rock while clinging to the ceiling. It shoots spikes when in danger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"By swinging around its three spiky feelers and shooting spikes, it can obliterate an opponent.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Two bodies comprise a fixed pair. They spin around each other to generate energy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The minigear spins at high speed. Then the energy from the red core charges the minigear to make it ready to fire.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"One alone can emit only a trickle of electricity, so a group of them gathers to unleash a powerful electric shock.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It wraps itself around its prey and paralyzes it with electricity from the round spots on its sides. Then it chomps.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It latches on to prey with its sucker mouth, sinking in its fangs and shocking the prey with powerful electricity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Rumors of its origin are linked to a UFO crash site in the desert 50 years ago.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Apparently, it communicates by flashing its three fingers, but those patterns haven’t been decoded.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its flame is usually out, but it starts shining when it absorbs life force from people or Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spirits it absorbs fuel its baleful fire. It hangs around hospitals waiting for people to pass on.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its large tusks have a tendency to break, but each time they grow back, they grow in harder and sturdier.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"A broken tusk will not grow back, so it diligently sharpens its tusks on river rocks after the end of a battle.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Its tusks are incredibly destructive. They can easily slice through a thick, sturdy steel column every time.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their snot is a barometer of health. When healthy, their snot is sticky and the power of their ice moves increases.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They love the cold seas of the north. They create pathways across the ocean waters by freezing their own breath.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They are composed of ice crystals. They capture prey with chains of ice, freezing the prey at -148° F.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it and Karrablast are together, and both receive electrical stimulation, they both evolve.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its body dries out, it weakens. So it wraps a membrane around itself for protection while it spits poison.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When its opponent can’t be paralyzed, it contorts itself with unexpected speed and flops away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Using the long fur on its arms like whips, it launches into combo attacks that, once started, no one can stop.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It runs through the narrow tunnels formed by Excadrill and Onix. It uses its sharp claws to catch prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Ancient science fashioned this Pokémon from clay. It’s been active for thousands of years.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Golurk were created to protect people and Pokémon. They run on a mysterious energy.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This pitiless Pokémon commands a group of Pawniard to hound prey into immobility. It then moves in to finish the prey off.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They are known to charge so wildly that if a train were to enter their territory, they would send it flying.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It stands up to massive opponents, not out of courage, but out of recklessness. But that is how it gets stronger.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"For the sake of its friends, this brave warrior of the sky will not stop battling, even if injured.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Their wings are too tiny to allow them to fly. They guard their posteriors with bones that were gathered by Mandibuzz.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"They fly in circles around the sky. When they spot prey, they attack and carry it back to their nest with ease.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It draws in air through its tail, transforms it into fire, and uses it like a tongue. It melts Durant and eats them.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Individuals each play different roles in driving Heatmor, their natural predator, away from their colony.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Lacking sight, it’s unaware of its surroundings, so it bumps into things and eats anything that moves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It responds to movement by attacking. This scary, three-headed Pokémon devours everything in its path!","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Said to have been born from the sun, it spews fire from its horns and encases itself in a cocoon of fire when it evolves.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Thought to be an embodiment of the sun, it appeared during a bitterly cold winter and saved Pokémon from freezing.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"It has a body and heart of steel. It worked with its allies to punish people when they hurt Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Spoken of in legend, this Pokémon used its phenomenal power to destroy a castle in its effort to protect Pokémon.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"In every direction it flies, creating winds so powerful, they blow everything away.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"As it flies around, it shoots lightning all over the place and causes forest fires. It is therefore disliked.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with fire. It helps those who want to build a world of truth.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This legendary Pokémon can scorch the world with lightning. It assists those who want to build an ideal world.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"From the forces of lightning and wind, it creates energy to give nutrients to the soil and make the land abundant.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This legendary ice Pokémon waits for a hero to fill in the missing parts of its body with truth or ideals.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"The melodies sung by Meloetta have the power to make Pokémon that hear them happy or sad.","esFrom":"y"},{"en":"This Pokémon existed 300 million years ago. Team Plasma altered it and attached a cannon to its back.","esFrom":"y"}]};
// Spanish text of later official games, keyed by PokeAPI version identifier.
export const DEX_SPANISH={"alphasapphire":[null,"A Bulbasaur es fácil verle echándose una siesta al sol. La semilla que tiene en el lomo va creciendo cada vez más a medida que absorbe los rayos del sol.","Este Pokémon lleva un bulbo en el lomo y, para poder con su peso, tiene unas patas y un tronco gruesos y fuertes. Si empieza a pasar más tiempo al sol, será porque el bulbo está a punto de hacerse una flor grande.","Venusaur tiene una flor enorme en el lomo que, según parece, adquiere unos colores muy vivos si está bien nutrido y le da mucho el sol. El aroma delicado de la flor tiene un efecto relajante en el ánimo de las personas.","La llama que tiene en la punta de la cola arde según sus sentimientos. Llamea levemente cuando está alegre y arde vigorosamente cuando está enfadado.","Charmeleon no tiene reparo en acabar con su rival usando las afiladas garras que tiene. Si su enemigo es fuerte, se vuelve agresivo, y la llama que tiene en el extremo de la cola empieza a arder con mayor intensidad tornándose azulada.","Charizard se dedica a volar por los cielos en busca de oponentes fuertes. Echa fuego por la boca y es capaz de derretir cualquier cosa. No obstante, si su rival es más débil que él, no usará este ataque.","El caparazón de Squirtle no le sirve de protección únicamente. Su forma redondeada y las hendiduras que tiene le ayudan a deslizarse en el agua y le permiten nadar a gran velocidad.","Tiene una cola larga y cubierta de un pelo abundante y grueso que se torna más oscuro a medida que crece. Los arañazos que tiene en el caparazón dan fe de lo buen guerrero que es.","Blastoise lanza chorros de agua con gran precisión por los tubos que le salen del caparazón que tiene en la espalda. Puede disparar chorros de agua con tanta puntería que no fallaría al tirar contra una lata pequeña a 50 m.","Caterpie tiene un apetito voraz. Es capaz de devorar hojas que superen su tamaño en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Atención a la antena que tiene: libera un hedor realmente fuerte.","La capa que recubre el cuerpo de este Pokémon es tan dura como una plancha de hierro. Metapod apenas se mueve. Permanece inmóvil para que las vísceras evolucionen dentro de la coraza que le rodea.","Butterfree tiene una habilidad especial para encontrar delicioso polen en las flores. Puede localizar, extraer y transportar polen de flores que estén floreciendo a 10 km de distancia de su nido.","Weedle tiene un finísimo sentido del olfato. Es capaz de distinguir las hojas que le gustan de las que no le gustan olisqueando un poco con la gran nariz que tiene.","Kakuna permanece prácticamente inmóvil al encaramarse a los árboles, aunque la actividad interna de su organismo tiene un ritmo frenético, pues se prepara para su evolución. Prueba de esto es la alta temperatura de su caparazón.","Los Beedrill defienden su territorio a toda costa. No es conveniente acercarse a su colmena, por seguridad. Si se les molesta, todo un enjambre atacará ferozmente.","Pidgey tiene un sentido de la orientación muy desarrollado. Es capaz de regresar a su nido, por lejos que se encuentre de las zonas que le resultan familiares.","Pidgeotto se apodera de una zona muy vasta como su territorio y la sobrevuela para controlarla. Si alguien invade su espacio vital, no tendrá ningún reparo en castigarlo con sus afiladas garras.","El plumaje de este Pokémon es bonito e hipnótico. Muchos Entrenadores se quedan embobados ante la belleza impactante de las plumas que tiene en la cabeza; lo que les lleva a elegir a Pidgeot como su Pokémon.","Rattata es cauto como él solo. Hasta cuando duerme mueve las orejas para oír todos los ruidos. No es nada delicado a la hora de elegir su hábitat. Cualquier sitio es bueno para cavar su madriguera.","A Raticate le crecen los incisivos firmes y fuertes. Para mantenerlos afilados roe troncos y rocas, e incluso las paredes de las casas.","Spearow pía con tanta fuerza que se le puede oír a 1 km de distancia. Si al agudo chillido le sigue una especie de eco, estaremos oyendo la respuesta de otros Spearow que contestan ante el aviso de peligro.","A Fearow se le reconoce por tener un pescuezo y un pico largos que le permiten cazar en tierra y agua. Tiene una gran habilidad moviendo el fino pico para atrapar a sus presas.","Ekans se enrosca para descansar. Adoptando esta posición puede responder rápidamente a cualquier amenaza que le aceche desde cualquier lugar, levantando la cabeza con una feroz mirada.","Este Pokémon es tremendamente fuerte, puede oprimir cualquier cosa con su cuerpo y hasta es capaz de estrujar un barril de acero. Una vez que Arbok se enrosca a su víctima, no hay forma de escapar de su asfixiante abrazo.","Este Pokémon tiene unas bolsas en las mejillas donde almacena electricidad. Parece ser que se recargan por la noche, mientras Pikachu duerme. A veces, cuando se acaba de despertar y está aún medio dormido, descarga un poco.","Este Pokémon libera una débil carga eléctrica por todo su cuerpo que le hace brillar en la oscuridad. Raichu descarga electricidad plantando la cola en el suelo.","Sandshrew tiene una piel muy seca y tremendamente dura. Tiene la habilidad de hacerse una bola y evitar cualquier ataque. Por las noches, escarba en la arena del desierto y se echa a dormir.","Sandslash puede enroscarse y convertirse en una bola de largas púas. En combate, este Pokémon hace retroceder a sus rivales clavándoselas. Acto seguido, aprovecha para echarse sobre ellos y atacarlos con sus afiladas garras.","Nidoran♀ tiene púas que segregan un veneno muy potente. Se piensa que las desarrolló como protección del cuerpo tan pequeño que tiene. Cuando se enfada, libera una horrible sustancia tóxica por el cuerno.","Cuando están en familia o con sus amigos, esconden las púas para evitar accidentes. Según parece, se alteran bastante si se separan del grupo.","Nidoqueen tiene el cuerpo totalmente recubierto de escamas durísimas. Suele lanzar por los aires a sus rivales de los violentos golpes que les propina. Cuando se trata de defender a sus crías, alcanza su nivel máximo de fuerza.","Nidoran♂ ha desarrollado músculos para mover las orejas y orientarlas en cualquier dirección. De este modo, es capaz de captar hasta el sonido más leve.","Nidorino tiene un cuerno de dureza superior a la del diamante. Si siente una presencia hostil, se le erizan las púas del lomo enseguida y carga contra el enemigo con todas sus fuerzas.","La gruesa cola de Nidoking encierra una fuerza realmente destructora. Con una vez que la agite, es capaz de tumbar una torre metálica de transmisión. Una vez que este Pokémon se desboca, no hay quien lo pare.","Siempre que hay luna llena, salen en grupo para jugar. Al amanecer, los Clefairy, agotados, regresan a sus refugios de montaña para dormir acurrucados unos con otros.","Clefable se mueve dando saltitos como si fuera haciendo uso de las alas. Estos pequeños brincos le permiten caminar por el agua. De todos es sabido que le encanta darse paseos por los lagos en tranquilas noches de luna llena.","En el interior del cuerpo de Vulpix arde una llama que nunca se extingue. Durante el día, cuando suben las temperaturas, este Pokémon libera llamas por la boca para evitar recalentarse.","Cuenta la leyenda que Ninetales nació de la fusión de nueve hechiceros que tenían poderes sagrados. Este Pokémon es realmente inteligente. Entiende el lenguaje humano.","Cuando este Pokémon canta, no para nunca para respirar. Si en combate el enemigo no se queda dormido con facilidad, Jigglypuff no podrá respirar y su vida correrá peligro.","El cuerpo de Wigglytuff es muy flexible. Dicen que, al aspirar aire, puede hincharse sin límites. Y, una vez hinchado, se pone a botar como si fuera una pelota.","Zubat evita la luz del día porque le resulta perjudicial para la salud. Durante el día, permanece en cuevas o bajo los aleros de las casas viejas durmiendo colgado de las patas, cabeza abajo.","Golbat derriba a sus víctimas mordiéndoles con los cuatro colmillos que tiene y chupándoles la sangre. Solo entra en acción en las noches sin luna. Revolotea en la oscuridad para atacar a Pokémon y personas.","Oddish busca los suelos fértiles y ricos en nutrientes para plantarse en la tierra. Durante el día, se cree que le cambia la forma de los pies y se le empiezan a parecer a las raíces de los árboles.","Gloom babea un néctar que tiene un olor realmente horrible, aunque parece ser que a él le gusta. De hecho, aspira los gases nocivos y libera más néctar aún.","Vileplume tiene los mayores pétalos del mundo. Los usa para atraer a sus presas y llenarlas de esporas tóxicas. Una vez que ha inmovilizado a las víctimas, las atrapa y las devora.","Paras lleva dos setas parásitas a cuestas llamadas tochukaso. Estas crecen alimentándose de los nutrientes de este Pokémon de tipo Bicho y Planta que les sirve de huésped. Las setas se usan como elixir de vida.","Parasect es conocido por destruir en plaga grandes árboles, absorbiendo los nutrientes que tienen en la parte baja del tronco y las raíces. Cuando un árbol azotado por la plaga muere, los Parasect van a por el siguiente al instante.","Dicen que durante su evolución Venonat desarrolló una fina capa de espeso pelo alrededor de todo el cuerpo para protegerse. Tiene unos ojos tan grandes que no hay presa que le pase desapercibida.","Venomoth es nocturno, solo actúa en la oscuridad. Su alimento preferido son los pequeños insectos que se concentran cerca de los focos de luz en la oscuridad de la noche.","En la mayoría de las granjas se suelen criar Diglett por la sencilla razón de que, excaven donde excaven, dejan la tierra perfectamente labrada para sembrar. El terreno queda listo para plantar ricas verduras.","Los Dugtrio son trillizos que se originaron a partir de un solo cuerpo, por eso piensan de la misma forma. A la hora de excavar, trabajan en equipo y sin descanso.","Meowth retrae las afiladas uñas de sus zarpas para caminar a hurtadillas, dando sigilosos pasos para pasar inadvertido. No se sabe muy bien por qué, pero este Pokémon adora las monedas brillantes que resplandecen con la luz.","Persian tiene seis llamativos bigotes que le dan un aspecto feroz. Además, le sirven para detectar el movimiento del aire, delator de la presencia cercana de algún Pokémon. Si se le agarra por los bigotes, se vuelve dócil.","Psyduck no se acuerda nunca de haber usado su misterioso poder. Parece ser que no puede registrar en la memoria haber usado el ataque porque se queda inmerso en un estado parecido a un sueño profundo.","Golduck es el nadador más rápido de los Pokémon. Además, nada sin esfuerzo hasta en aguas turbulentas en plena tormenta. En ocasiones, ha rescatado a náufragos en alta mar.","Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria.","Cuando Primeape se enfada, se le acelera el ritmo cardíaco y se le fortalecen los músculos. Con todo, pierde en inteligencia.","Growlithe tiene un sentido del olfato excepcional y una memoria sensitiva tremenda, nunca olvida una esencia. Este Pokémon saca provecho de este don para identificar las sensaciones que tienen otros seres vivos.","Arcanine es conocido por lo veloz que es. Dicen que es capaz de correr 10 000 km en 24 horas. El fuego que arde con vigor en el interior de este Pokémon constituye su fuente de energía.","Poliwag tiene una piel muy fina. Tanto que es posible entrever a través de la misma las vísceras en espiral que tiene. La piel, aunque fina, tiene la ventaja de ser flexible y hacer rebotar hasta los colmillos más afilados.","La piel de Poliwhirl está siempre húmeda y lubricada con un fluido viscoso. Gracias a esta película resbaladiza, puede escapar de las garras del enemigo, resbalándosele de las zarpas en pleno combate.","Poliwrath tiene unos músculos fornidos y muy desarrollados, por lo que nunca se agota. Es tan fuerte e incansable que cruzar el océano a nado no le supone ningún esfuerzo.","Abra necesita dormir 18 horas al día. Si no, pierde la habilidad que tiene de usar poderes de telequinesia. Si le atacan, Abra puede escapar usando Teletransporte mientras duerme.","Kadabra lleva siempre una cuchara de plata en la mano, que usa para amplificar las ondas alfa de su cerebro. Dicen que, sin la cuchara, sus poderes de telequinesia se reducen a la mitad.","El cerebro de Alakazam siempre está creciendo y el número de neuronas no deja de aumentar. Este Pokémon tiene un cociente intelectual de 5000. Tiene archivado en su memoria todo lo que ha ocurrido en el mundo.","Machop se entrena levantando Graveler a modo de pesas. Algunos de estos Pokémon viajan por todo el mundo para aprender distintos tipos de artes marciales.","Machoke realiza sesiones de culturismo todos los días. De entrenamiento le sirven también las veces que ayuda a la gente en tareas de esfuerzo físico. En sus días libres, va al campo o a la montaña para hacer más ejercicio.","Machamp es conocido como el Pokémon que domina todas las artes marciales. Si agarra a su rival con los cuatro brazos que tiene, su enemigo no tendrá nada que hacer. El pobre contrincante saldrá volando hasta perderse en el horizonte.","Bellsprout tiene un cuerpo delgado y flexible que le permite inclinarse y balancearse para esquivar los ataques. Este Pokémon escupe por la boca un fluido corrosivo capaz de hacer que se derrita hasta el hierro.","Weepinbell tiene un gancho a modo de extremidad superior trasera, que usa por la noche para colgarse de una rama y echarse a dormir. Si se mueve mientras duerme, puede acabar en el suelo.","Victreebel tiene una enredadera que le sale de la cabeza y que agita a modo de señuelo para atraer a sus presas y así engullirlas por sorpresa cuando estas se aproximan incautas.","Tentacool absorbe luz solar, la refracta a través del agua que tiene en su interior y la convierte en un rayo de energía. Este Pokémon tiene un órgano que parece de cristal sobre los ojos por el cual dispara los rayos.","Tentacruel tiene unos tentáculos que puede alargar o acortar. Los usa para atrapar a su presa y debilitarla mediante una sustancia muy tóxica. Puede llegar a atrapar hasta a 80 presas a la vez.","Cuando Geodude duerme profundamente, se entierra a medias en el suelo y no se despierta ni aunque lo pisen sin querer. Por la mañana, se dedica a buscar comida rodando ladera abajo.","Las piedras son la comida preferida de Graveler. Este Pokémon sube a la cima de las montañas devorando todas las rocas que va encontrando a su paso. Una vez que alcanza la cumbre, baja rodando hasta la falda.","Golem es conocido por su afición a bajar de las montañas rodando. La gente que vive en la falda de las mismas ha cavado surcos para conducirlo en su descenso por las laderas y evitar que se cuele en sus casas.","Al nacer, Ponyta es muy débil y apenas puede ponerse en pie. Con todo, se va haciendo más fuerte al tropezarse y caerse en su intento por seguir a sus progenitores.","A Rapidash se le suele ver trotando sin rumbo fijo por los campos y llanos. Cuando tiene que ir a algún sitio en concreto, se le aviva el fuego de las melenas y emprende el galope llameante llegando a los 240 km/h.","Slowpoke usa la cola para atrapar a sus presas metiéndola bajo el agua en las riberas de los ríos. Con todo, es olvidadizo, se le puede pasar lo que estaba haciendo y quedarse días enteros holgazaneando en la orilla.","Slowbro lleva en la cola un Shellder enganchado, sujeto por los dientes. Como Slowbro no puede usar la cola para pescar, se mete en el agua de mala gana en busca de sus presas.","Magnemite flota en el aire emitiendo ondas electromagnéticas, a través de las unidades de las extremidades, que bloquean la gravedad. Si se agota su suministro de electricidad interno, es incapaz de mantenerse flotando.","Magneton emite una fuerte energía magnética, fatal para los instrumentos electrónicos y de precisión. Este es el motivo por el que, dicen, mucha gente mantiene a este Pokémon en su Poké Ball.","Al parecer, entre los puerros que suelen llevar los Farfetch’d, los hay mejores y peores. A estos Pokémon se les ha visto luchar entre ellos por los mejores puerros.","Doduo es un Pokémon bicéfalo de cerebros idénticos. Según un estudio científico, podría darse el extraño caso de que hubiera algún Doduo con cerebros distintos.","Según parece, las cabezas no son las únicas partes del cuerpo que tiene triplicadas. Dodrio también tiene tres corazones y tres pares de pulmones. Con esta constitución, puede correr largas distancias sin cansarse.","Seel busca a sus presas en aguas heladas, bajo las capas de hielo. Cuando necesita respirar, abre un agujerito en el hielo con la afilada protuberancia que tiene encima de la cabeza.","A Dewgong le encanta dormitar sobre la frialdad del hielo. Antiguamente, algún que otro marino lo confundió con una sirena al verlo dormido sobre un glaciar.","Grimer emergió del lodo que se formó en una zona contaminada en el fondo del mar. A este Pokémon le encanta todo lo que sea suciedad. Emana continuamente por todo el cuerpo un horrible fluido contaminado por bacterias.","A este Pokémon le encanta comer cosas repulsivas. En ciudades sucias en las que la gente tira la basura por la calle, los Muk tienen, sin duda, su punto de encuentro.","Por la noche, este Pokémon usa la ancha lengua que tiene para hacer un agujero en el fondo del mar y echarse a dormir. Mientras duerme, Shellder cierra la concha, pero deja la lengua por fuera.","Cloyster es capaz de nadar por el mar. Su técnica consiste en tragar agua y expulsarla por el conducto que tiene en la parte trasera. Este mismo sistema es el que usa para lanzar los pinchos que tiene alrededor de la concha.","Gastly está compuesto en gran medida de materia gaseosa. Cuando hay viento, el aire arrastra parte de esta materia y el Pokémon mengua. Suelen agruparse bajo los aleros de las casas para resguardarse del viento.","Haunter es un Pokémon peligroso. Si se ve alguno flotando en la oscuridad y haciendo señas, conviene no acercarse. Este Pokémon intentará robarle la energía a su presa a base de lametazos.","Si alguien ve que su sombra le adelanta de repente en una noche oscura, es muy probable que lo que esté viendo no sea su sombra, sino a un Gengar haciéndose pasar por la misma.","Onix tiene un imán en el cerebro, que actúa como una brújula para no perder la orientación cuando está cavando túneles. A medida que crece, se le redondea y suaviza el cuerpo.","Si a alguien le pica la nariz mientras duerme, seguro que es porque tiene a uno de estos Pokémon cerca de la almohada intentando sacarle los sueños por la nariz para comérselos.","Hypno lleva un péndulo en la mano. El balanceo y el brillo que tiene sumen al rival en un estado de hipnosis profundo. Mientras busca a su presa, saca brillo al péndulo.","Krabby vive en la playa, enterrado en agujeros en la arena. Cuando en las playas de arena fina escasea la comida, es común ver a estos Pokémon echando un pulso panza contra panza en defensa de su territorio.","Kingler tiene una pinza enorme y descomunal que usa agitándola en el aire para comunicarse con otros. Lo malo es que, al pesarle tanto, se cansa enseguida.","Voltorb es tremendamente sensible y a la más mínima sacudida explota. Cuentan que se creó cuando alguien expuso una Poké Ball a una gran descarga eléctrica.","Una de las características de Electrode es la atracción que siente hacia la electricidad. Son Pokémon problemáticos que suelen agruparse cerca de centrales eléctricas para nutrirse de la energía recién generada.","Este Pokémon está compuesto de seis huevos que forman una tupida piña que va girando. Cuando se empiezan a resquebrajar las cáscaras, no hay duda de que Exeggcute está a punto de evolucionar.","Exeggutor es originario del trópico. Cuando se expone a un sol intenso, le empiezan a crecer las cabezas. Hay quien dice que, cuando las cabezas caen al suelo, se unen para formar un Exeggcute.","A Cubone le ahoga la pena porque no volverá a ver jamás a su madre. La luna le recuerda a veces a ella, y se pone a llorar. Los churretes que tiene en el cráneo que lleva puesto son debidos a las lágrimas que derrama.","Marowak es la forma evolucionada de Cubone. Es más fuerte porque ha superado la pena por la pérdida de su madre. El ánimo de este Pokémon, ya curtido y fortalecido, no es muy fácil de alterar.","Hitmonlee tiene la facilidad de encoger y estirar las patas. Con extremidades tan flexibles, propina unas patadas demoledoras. Tras la lucha, se masajea las piernas y relaja los músculos para descansar.","Dicen que Hitmonchan tiene el mismo ímpetu que un boxeador entrenándose para un campeonato mundial. Este Pokémon tiene un espíritu indomable que nunca se doblega ante la adversidad.","Cada vez que Lickitung se encuentra con algo que no conoce, le da un lametazo. Es la forma que tiene de memorizar las cosas, por la textura y el sabor. No soporta los sabores ácidos.","Koffing contiene sustancias tóxicas que mezcla con desperdicios para provocar una reacción química que libera un gas tremendamente venenoso. A mayor temperatura, mayor será la cantidad de gas que cree este Pokémon.","Weezing reduce y agranda el doble cuerpo que tiene para mezclar los gases tóxicos que contiene. Cuantos más gases mezcle, mayor será la toxicidad y el nivel de putrefacción del Pokémon.","Rhyhorn tiene un cerebro muy pequeño. Si se pone a correr, por ejemplo, se le olvida qué le llevó a hacerlo. Lo que sí parece recordar, a veces, es si ha destrozado alguna cosa.","Rhydon tiene un cuerno anillado que le sirve de taladro. Le resulta muy útil para horadar rocas y piedras. A veces, se queda atrapado en corrientes de magma, pero la tosca piel que tiene impide que sienta el calor.","Chansey pone a diario huevos con un valor nutritivo altísimo. Están tan ricos que hasta quien no tenga hambre se los comerá en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.","A Tangela se le desprenden los tentáculos con facilidad en cuanto se los agarras. Y no solo no le duele, sino que le resulta muy útil para escapar rápido. Además, al día siguiente le crecen otros.","No es recomendable molestar ni intentar atrapar a crías de Kangaskhan mientras estén jugando, ya que seguro que su madre anda cerca y reaccionará con enfado y violencia.","Si Horsea siente peligro, echará por la boca una densa tinta negra inconscientemente e intentará huir. Este Pokémon nada muy bien batiendo la aleta que tiene en el lomo.","Seadra gira sobre sí mismo y crea unos remolinos lo suficientemente fuertes como para engullir barcos de pesca. Este Pokémon aprovecha las corrientes que crea para debilitar a su presa y tragársela de una vez.","A Goldeen le encanta nadar libremente y a su aire en ríos y estanques. Si pones a uno de estos Pokémon en un acuario, usará el cuerno que tiene para romper las paredes, independientemente del grosor del cristal, y escapar.","Seaking protege sus huevos con uñas y dientes. Macho y hembra se turnan para vigilar el nido y los huevos. Este período de protección dura más de un mes en el caso de estos Pokémon.","Staryu parece comunicarse por la noche con las estrellas haciendo brillar el núcleo rojo de su cuerpo. Si este Pokémon sufre algún daño en alguna zona de su cuerpo, la regenerará sin problema.","Starmie nada por el agua haciendo girar su cuerpo estrellado a modo de hélice. El núcleo de este Pokémon brilla y llega a tornarse de siete colores.","Mr. Mime es un experto en pantomima. Con sus gestos y movimientos es capaz de convencer a sus espectadores de que algo existe, cuando en realidad no es así. Pero, cuando el público se lo cree, las ilusiones se hacen realidad.","Es espectacular ver lo rápido que es Scyther. Su increíble velocidad refuerza el efecto del par de guadañas que tiene en los brazos, que ya son de por sí contundentes; rebanan gruesos troncos de un tajo.","Jynx camina con ritmo, balanceándose y moviendo las caderas como si estuviera bailando. Realiza unos movimientos tan vistosos y atractivos que no hay quien pueda resistirse a mover las caderas.","Al desatarse una tormenta, bandadas de estos Pokémon se enfrentan entre sí para ver quién alcanza antes sitios altos en los que suelan caer rayos. Hay ciudades que usan Electabuzz en lugar de pararrayos.","Al luchar, Magmar expulsa violentas llamas por todo el cuerpo para intimidar a su rival. Estos estallidos de fuego crean ondas de calor que abrasan la hierba y los árboles que haya en las proximidades.","Pinsir tiene un par de cuernos imponentes recubiertos de pinchos, que se clavan en el cuerpo del rival. Una vez que los ha clavado, no hay quien escape de su abrazo.","Este Pokémon no está contento a menos que esté continuamente de aquí para allá. Si no hay rival que luche contra Tauros, se estampa contra árboles grandes para calmarse y los embiste para echarlos abajo.","Magikarp es prácticamente inútil en combate; solo sirve para salpicar, y se le considera muy débil. Con todo, en realidad es un Pokémon muy resistente. Sobrevive en cualquier medio acuático, aunque esté contaminado.","Una vez que Gyarados se desmanda, la presión incontrolable y enrabiada de la sangre no se le calmará hasta que no haya quemado todo lo que le rodea. Según parece, a este Pokémon le duran los arranques de cólera hasta un mes.","Por culpa de la gente, Lapras está casi en extinción. Dicen que, al anochecer, se pone a cantar quejicoso mientras busca a los miembros de su especie que puedan quedar.","Ditto reorganiza la estructura de sus células para adoptar otras formas. Pero, como intente transformarse en algo guiándose por los datos que tenga almacenados en la memoria, habrá detalles que se le escapen.","La configuración genética de Eevee le permite mutar y adaptarse enseguida a cualquier medio en el que viva. La evolución de este Pokémon suele ser posible gracias a las radiaciones emitidas por varias piedras.","Vaporeon sufrió una mutación repentina y desarrolló aletas y branquias que le permiten vivir bajo el agua. Asimismo, este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de controlar las aguas.","Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos.","La suavidad del pelaje de Flareon tiene una función clara: libera calor para que el Pokémon no se asfixie. La temperatura corporal de este Pokémon puede alcanzar los 900 °C.","Porygon es capaz de convertirse otra vez en datos informáticos y de entrar en el ciberespacio. Tiene protección anticopia, así que es imposible duplicarlo.","Omanyte es uno de esos Pokémon ancestrales que se extinguieron hace muchísimo tiempo y que la gente ha recuperado a partir de fósiles. Si un enemigo le ataca, se esconderá dentro de la dura concha que tiene.","Omastar usa los tentáculos para atrapar a su presa. Se cree que el motivo de su extinción fue el tamaño y el peso que llegó a alcanzar la concha que lleva a cuestas, lo que le entorpeció y ralentizó los movimientos.","Kabuto es un Pokémon regenerado a partir de un fósil, aunque, en raras ocasiones, se han encontrado casos de ejemplares vivos en estado salvaje. En 300 millones de años, este Pokémon no ha cambiado en nada.","Hace mucho tiempo, Kabutops buceaba para atrapar a sus presas. Parece ser que en algún momento cambió de hábitat y se adaptó a vivir en tierra firme. La transformación que se aprecia en las patas y branquias así lo confirma.","Los orígenes de Aerodactyl datan de la era de los dinosaurios. Se regeneró a partir de material genético contenido en ámbar. Se supone que fue el amo de los cielos en épocas pasadas.","Un día cualquiera en la vida de Snorlax consiste en comer y dormir. Es un Pokémon tan dócil que es fácil ver niños usando la gran panza que tiene como lugar de juegos.","Articuno es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que puede controlar el hielo. El batir de sus alas congela el aire. Dicen que consigue hacer que nieve cuando vuela.","Zapdos es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que tiene la habilidad de controlar la electricidad. Suele vivir en nubarrones. Este Pokémon gana mucha fuerza si le alcanzan los rayos.","Moltres es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que tiene la habilidad de controlar el fuego. Dicen que, si resulta herido, se sumerge en el líquido magma de un volcán para arder y curarse.","Dratini muda y se despoja de la vieja piel continuamente. Es algo que necesita hacer porque la energía que tiene en su interior no para de alcanzar niveles incontrolables.","Dragonair acumula grandes cantidades de energía dentro de sí. Dicen que altera el clima de la zona en la que está descargando energía a través de las esferas de cristal que tiene en el cuello y en la cola.","Dragonite es capaz de dar la vuelta al mundo en solo 16 horas. Es un Pokémon de buen corazón que guía hasta tierra a los barcos que se encuentran perdidos en plena tormenta y a punto de zozobrar.","Mewtwo fue creado por manipulación genética. Pero, a pesar de que el hombre creó su cuerpo, dotar a Mewtwo de un corazón compasivo quedó en el olvido.","Dicen que Mew posee el mapa genético de todos los Pokémon. Puede hacerse invisible cuando quiere, así que pasa desapercibido cada vez que se le acerca alguien.","Al luchar, Chikorita agita la hoja que tiene para mantener a raya al rival. Pero, al mismo tiempo, libera una suave fragancia que apacigua el encuentro y crea un ambiente agradable y de amistad.","Bayleef tiene un collar de hojas alrededor del cuello y un brote de un árbol en cada una de ellas. La fragancia que desprenden estos brotes anima a la gente.","La fragancia de la flor de Meganium aplaca y suaviza los ánimos. Al luchar, este Pokémon libera mayor cantidad de esencia para disminuir el ánimo de combate de su oponente.","Cyndaquil se protege soltando llamas por el lomo. Cuando está enfadado, las llamas son fieras, pero, si está cansado, solo consigue echar algunas chispas que no llegan a cuajar en una completa combustión.","Quilava mantiene a sus rivales a raya con la intensidad de sus llamas y las ráfagas de aire ígneo que producen. También aprovecha su espectacular agilidad para esquivar ataques a la vez que abrasa al rival con sus llamas.","Typhlosion se oculta tras un trémulo haz de calor que crea mediante sus intensas y sofocantes llamaradas. Este Pokémon causa explosiones de fuego que reducen todo a cenizas.","Totodile tiene cuerpo pequeño, pero fuertes mandíbulas. A veces, piensa que solo está dando un mordisquito y hace unas heridas bastante considerables.","Una vez que Croconaw le ha clavado los colmillos a su presa, es imposible que escape porque los tiene hacia adentro como si fueran anzuelos. Cuando Croconaw hinca los dientes, no hay escapatoria.","Feraligatr intimida a sus oponentes abriendo las grandes fauces que tiene. En combate, golpea el suelo bruscamente con las gruesas y fuertes patas traseras que tiene para cargar contra su rival a una velocidad de vértigo.","Sentret no duerme a menos que otro haga guardia. El que hace de centinela lo despertará al mínimo signo de peligro. Cuando este Pokémon se separa de su manada, es incapaz de echarse a dormir, presa del miedo.","Furret es de constitución muy delgada. En combate le resulta útil porque puede escabullirse con habilidad por cualquier huequito y escapar. A pesar de que tiene patas cortas, es ágil y veloz.","Hoothoot tiene un órgano interno que identifica y percibe la rotación de la tierra. Gracias a este órgano, el Pokémon ulula todos los días a la misma hora.","Noctowl no falla a la hora de cazar a su presa en la oscuridad. El éxito se lo debe a una vista privilegiada, que le permite ver donde apenas hay luz, y a las ligeras y flexibles alas que tiene, que no hacen ruido alguno al volar.","Ledyba segrega un fluido aromático por los seis puntos de unión que tiene entre las patas y el cuerpo. A través de este fluido se comunica con otros y les informa acerca de sus sentimientos variando la esencia.","Dicen que en zonas en las que el aire está limpio, en las que se ven las estrellas, hay enormes poblaciones de Ledian. La razón es muy sencilla: este Pokémon usa la luz de las estrellas como fuente de energía.","La tela que teje Spinarak puede considerarse como su segundo sistema nervioso. Dicen que puede adivinar qué tipo de presa ha caído en su red con solo observar las leves vibraciones de los hilos de la tela.","Ariados tiene unas patas con forma de garfio que le permiten correr por techos y superficies verticales. Este Pokémon oprime al rival con una tela de araña fina y resistente.","Crobat se acerca hasta su posible presa usando las alas casi sin hacer ruido. La forma de descansar que tiene es colgarse de la rama de un árbol por las patas traseras.","Las dos antenas de Chinchou están llenas de células que generan potente electricidad. Crean tal cantidad que hasta el propio Pokémon siente cierto hormigueo.","Todos saben que Lanturn emite luz. Si echas un ojo al mar desde un barco en una noche cerrada, quizás veas su luz a través de las aguas, brillando desde lo más profundo, por donde suele nadar. Con él, el mar parece un cielo estrellado.","Cuando Pichu juega con otros, puede liberar electricidad y producir una auténtica lluvia de chispas. Cuando esto ocurre, chilla asustado por tanta chispa.","Cuando hay lluvia de estrellas, a los Cleffa se les puede ver danzando en círculos durante toda la noche. Solo paran cuando rompe el día; entonces, dejan de bailar y calman su sed con el rocío de la mañana.","Igglybuff es suave y tierno, parece un merengue. Emana un aroma dulce y agradable que le sirve para calmar los ánimos de sus oponentes en combate.","Togepi usa los sentimientos positivos de compasión y alegría que desprenden las personas y los Pokémon. Este Pokémon almacena sentimientos de felicidad en su interior y después los comparte con otros.","Dicen que Togetic es un Pokémon que trae buena suerte y que, si detecta a alguien que es puro de corazón, sale para compartir su alegría con él.","Natu ha desarrollado tremendamente la habilidad de saltar. Este Pokémon aletea y da brinquitos por las ramas altas a las que no alcanza nadie para hacerse con los nuevos brotes de los árboles.","Xatu es conocido por el hábito que tiene de quedarse todo el día contemplando el sol. Hay mucha gente que lo venera como Pokémon místico, pues piensan que Xatu tiene el poder de ver el futuro.","Mareep tiene un pelaje lanudo suave que produce carga estática por el roce. Cuanto más se carga de electricidad estática, más brilla la bombilla que tiene en el extremo de la cola.","La calidad de la lana de Flaaffy varía para poder generar mucha electricidad estática con muy poca cantidad de lana. Las zonas suaves de la piel en las que no tiene pelaje están protegidas contra la electricidad.","Ampharos desprende tanta luz que es posible verle hasta desde el espacio. Antes, la gente usaba su luz como sistema de comunicación para enviarse señales.","La belleza de las flores que le crecen a Bellossom depende de lo mal que oliera el Gloom a partir del cual evolucionó. A mayor hedor, mayor belleza. Por la noche, este Pokémon cierra los pétalos y se echa a dormir.","Este Pokémon tiene la cola muy flexible y elástica. A la hora de pescar a su presa en una rápida corriente, Marill enrosca la cola en un árbol.","Azumarill puede hacer burbujas de aire si ve a algún Pokémon que esté a punto de ahogarse. Estas burbujas de aire son básicas para que los Pokémon puedan seguir respirando.","Sudowoodo se camufla adoptando la imagen de un árbol para que no le ataque ningún enemigo. El problema viene en invierno, ya que las extremidades superiores tienen color verde y es fácil identificarle.","El mechón rizado de Politoed confirma su condición de rey. Dicen que cuanto más le crece y más se le riza, mayor es el respeto que recibe de sus súbditos.","Este Pokémon flota en el aire y se deja llevar. Cuando percibe que el viento va a cambiar a fuerte, Hoppip entrelaza sus hojas con otros Hoppip para hacer resistencia y evitar salir volando por la fuerza de la corriente.","Skiploom florece cuando la temperatura llega a 18 °C. La apertura de los pétalos varía según la temperatura que haga. Por este motivo, la gente lo usa a veces a modo de termómetro.","Jumpluff se vale de los cálidos vientos del sur para volar a tierras lejanas. Si llega a zonas de aire frío en pleno vuelo, descenderá y tomará tierra.","La cola de Aipom termina en una especie de mano a la que, con un poco de cabeza, se le puede dar muy buen uso. Pero hay un problema: como se ha acostumbrado a usarla mucho, las de verdad se le han vuelto algo torponas.","Sunkern intenta moverse lo menos posible para conservar todos los nutrientes que ha guardado en su interior y poder evolucionar. Ni come siquiera; se alimenta solo del rocío de la mañana.","Sunflora transforma la energía solar en nutrientes. De día, cuando hace calor, está en continuo movimiento. Solo para cuando comienza a anochecer.","Yanma tiene un ángulo de visión de 360° sin mover los ojos. Es un gran volador, experto en hacer repentinas paradas y cambios de dirección en el aire. Aprovecha la habilidad que tiene de volar para lanzarse sobre su presa.","Wooper suele vivir en el agua, pero es posible también verle en tierra en busca de comida. Cuando está en terreno firme, se cubre con una película viscosa tóxica.","Quagsire caza dejando las fauces abiertas en el agua y esperando a que su presa entre sin darse cuenta. Como se queda quieto, el Pokémon no pasa mucha hambre.","Espeon es tremendamente leal al Entrenador al que considera digno de ello. Dicen que este Pokémon desarrolló sus poderes adivinatorios para evitar que su Entrenador sufra daño alguno.","Umbreon evolucionó tras haber estado expuesto a ondas lunares. Suele esconderse en la oscuridad en silencio y esperar a que su presa se mueva. Cuando se lanza al ataque, le brillan los anillos del cuerpo.","Murkrow ha sido temido y repudiado por todos por ser supuestamente fuente de mala suerte. Este Pokémon siente debilidad por todo lo que brilla y resplandece. A las mujeres les roba los anillos.","Slowking dedica cada día tiempo a investigar, en un intento por resolver los misterios del mundo. Aunque, según parece, a este Pokémon se le olvida todo lo que ha aprendido si se separa del Shellder que lleva en la cabeza.","Misdreavus asusta a la gente con un chillido escalofriante y sollozante. Y, al parecer, usa las esferas rojas para absorber los sentimientos de miedo de los enemigos y usarlos como alimento.","Estos Pokémon tienen forma de caracteres antiguos. No se sabe qué surgió primero, si la vieja escritura o los distintos Unown. Esta cuestión sigue siendo objeto de estudio, pero aún no se ha averiguado nada.","Wobbuffet no hace otra cosa que aguantar los golpes que recibe: nunca usa movimientos ofensivos. Pero, si le atacan a la cola, intentará llevarse con él al enemigo usando Mismo Destino.","La cabeza trasera de Girafarig tiene un cerebro muy pequeño para pensar, pero, como no le hace falta dormir, al menos puede hacer de centinela las 24 horas del día.","Pineco permanece colgado de la rama de un árbol esperando pacientemente a su presa. Si alguien sacude el árbol en el que está mientras come y le molesta, se tira al suelo y explota sin dar ningún tipo de aviso.","Forretress se esconde dentro de su concha de acero reforzada. Solo la abre cuando va a atrapar a su presa, pero ocurre tan rápido que no da tiempo de ver su interior.","La cola de Dunsparce es un taladro que usa para enterrarse en el suelo de espaldas. De todos es sabido que este Pokémon hace su nido a gran profundidad y con una forma muy compleja.","Gligar planea por el aire sin hacer ningún ruido, como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se agarra a la cara de su rival con las patas traseras, con forma de garra, y las pinzas de las delanteras y le inyecta veneno por el aguijón.","Steelix vive a mayor profundidad aún que Onix. Se le conoce por su tendencia a excavar hacia el interior del planeta. Hay datos que muestran que este Pokémon ha llegado a alcanzar 1 km de profundidad.","Al tener los colmillos por fuera, Snubbull da miedo y espanta a los Pokémon pequeños, que huyen aterrados. Parece que a él le da un poco de pena que salgan huyendo.","Granbull tiene la mandíbula inferior demasiado desarrollada y colmillos enormes y pesados que le obligan a inclinar la cabeza hacia atrás para compensar el peso. Si no se le asusta, no muerde.","Qwilfish bebe agua y se hincha, y a continuación usa la presión del agua que ha tragado para lanzar púas tóxicas por todo el cuerpo. Para este Pokémon nadar es una especie de desafío.","Scizor tiene un cuerpo duro como el acero que no es fácil de alterar con ningún ataque común. Este Pokémon bate las alas para regular la temperatura corporal.","Shuckle permanece escondido bajo las rocas en silencio y, cuando se pone a comer las bayas que almacena, se encierra en el caparazón. Las bayas se mezclan con sus fluidos corporales y originan zumo.","Heracross tiene unas afiladas garras en los pies que se clavan con firmeza en la tierra o la corteza de los árboles, dando al Pokémon gran estabilidad y seguridad a la hora de embestir y herir a su rival con el cuerno que tiene.","Sneasel trepa por los árboles agarrándose a la corteza con las garras curvas que tiene. Este Pokémon busca nidos desprovistos de vigilancia paterna para robar los huevos y comérselos.","A Teddiursa le encanta chuparse las palmas impregnadas de dulce miel. Este Pokémon fabrica su propia miel mezclando frutos y el polen que recoge Beedrill.","En los bosques habitados por Ursaring, dicen que abundan los arroyos y árboles gigantes en los que guardan su alimento. Este Pokémon se dedica todos los días a pasear por el bosque para buscar comida y guardarla.","Slugma no tiene sangre en su organismo, sino ardiente magma que hace circular por todo el cuerpo los nutrientes y el oxígeno que necesitan sus órganos.","Magcargo tiene una temperatura corporal de 1000 °C aproximadamente. El agua se evapora al contacto con él. Si llueve, las gotas que le rozan se transforman en vapor al instante y crean una densa niebla.","Swinub busca el alimento frotando el hocico contra el suelo. Su comida preferida es una seta que crece bajo la hierba marchita. A veces, al frotar, descubre fuentes termales.","Piloswine está cubierto por un pelaje tupido y de largas cerdas que le permite soportar el frío polar. Este Pokémon usa los colmillos para desenterrar los alimentos que hayan podido quedar bajo el hielo.","Las aguas templadas son el hábitat de Corsola. Allí se agrupan grandes bancos de estos Pokémon que sirven de escondite a Pokémon más pequeños. Cuando la temperatura del agua baja, suelen migrar a los mares del sur.","Remoraid traga agua y usa los abdominales para lanzarla a gran velocidad contra una presa que esté en el aire. Cuando está a punto de evolucionar, este Pokémon nada en los ríos corriente abajo.","Octillery se apodera de su enemigo con los tentáculos y lo deja inmovilizado antes de propinarle el golpe final. Si el enemigo resulta ser demasiado fuerte, Octillery expulsará tinta para escapar.","Delibird usa la cola a modo de saco para llevar su alimento. En una ocasión, un famoso escalador consiguió alcanzar la cima más alta del mundo gracias a que uno de estos Pokémon compartió sus alimentos con él.","En los días que hace sol, es posible ver bancos de Mantine saltando con elegancia por entre las olas del mar. A estos Pokémon no les molestan los Remoraid que se les pegan.","A Skarmory se le quedan las alas abolladas y desgarradas tras varios combates. Una vez al año, le vuelven a crecer completamente con los bordes cortantes que tenían en un principio restaurados.","Houndour sale a cazar con el resto de la manada con total coordinación. Estos Pokémon se comunican unos con otros usando una serie de aullidos para acorralar a su presa. El compañerismo que existe entre ellos es incomparable.","En la manada de Houndoom, el que tiene los cuernos más arqueados hacia atrás tiene un mayor papel de liderazgo. Estos Pokémon suelen elegir al jefe en duelo.","Kingdra duerme en el lecho marino, donde apenas pueden encontrarse otras formas de vida. Cuando estalla una tormenta, dicen que se despierta y se pone a vagar en busca de su presa.","Phanpy se vale de la trompa para ducharse. Cuando varios se agrupan, se dedican a echarse agua unos a otros. Es muy fácil ver a estos Pokémon secándose cerca del agua.","Si Donphan tuviera que dar un golpe con todo el cuerpo, con lo robusto que es echaría abajo hasta una casa. Estos Pokémon usan su fuerza para ayudar a despejar pasos de montaña cuando hay piedras o lodo.","Porygon2 fue creado por el hombre gracias a los avances de la ciencia. Esta obra humana ha sido provista de inteligencia artificial que le permite aprender gestos y sensaciones nuevas por su cuenta.","Hace tiempo, se comerciaba con la magnífica cornamenta de Stantler. Se vendía como obra de arte a alto precio. Los interesados en cornamentas de valor incalculable empezaron a cazarlos y casi provocan su extinción.","Smeargle marca los límites de su territorio liberando un fluido corporal por el extremo de la cola. En la actualidad se han encontrado más de 5000 tipos de marcas distintas dejadas por este Pokémon.","Tyrogue se pone demasiado nervioso si no lo sacan a entrenarse cada día. Su Entrenador debe establecer y mantener ciertos métodos de entrenamiento durante la cría.","Hitmontop hace el pino con la cabeza y se pone a girar rápido al tiempo que reparte patadas. Esta es una técnica ofensiva y defensiva a la vez. Este Pokémon se desplaza más rápido girando sobre sí que caminando.","Smoochum va corriendo por todos lados, pero se cae también con frecuencia. Y, en cuanto tiene ocasión, se mira en algún sitio para ver si se ha manchado la cara.","Elekid acumula electricidad. Si entra en contacto con algo de metal y descarga accidentalmente toda la electricidad almacenada, empieza a agitar los brazos en círculo para volver a cargarse.","El estado de salud de Magby se puede determinar observando el fuego que emana al respirar. Si las llamas que echa por la boca son amarillas, está bien. Pero, si además de las llamas sale humo negro, está cansado.","Miltank da al día 20 l de una leche dulce que es la delicia de pequeños y mayores. Aquellos que no pueden tomarla, se decantan por los yogures.","Blissey es capaz de sentir la tristeza a través del sedoso pelaje. Si detecta que alguien está apenado, irá hasta donde esté y compartirá un Huevo Suerte para devolverle la sonrisa.","Raikou tiene la velocidad del rayo. Los rugidos de este Pokémon emiten ondas de choque que se esparcen vibrando por el aire y sacuden el suelo como si fueran auténticas descargas de rayo.","Entei contiene el fulgor del magma en su interior. Se cree que este Pokémon nació de la erupción de un volcán. Escupe numerosas ráfagas de fuego que devoran y reducen a cenizas todo lo que tocan.","Suicune emana la pureza de los manantiales. Suele corretear por el campo con gran elegancia. Este Pokémon tiene el poder de purificar el agua contaminada.","Larvitar nace bajo tierra a gran profundidad. Para subir a la superficie, este Pokémon debe comer lo que encuentra en su camino para abrirse paso. Y, hasta que no está arriba, no puede verles la cara a sus padres.","Pupitar crea un gas en su interior que comprime y expulsa violentamente a modo de autopropulsión. Tiene un cuerpo resistente que se mantiene inalterable hasta cuando se golpea contra duro acero.","Tyranitar tiene una fuerza imponente; es capaz de echar abajo una montaña para hacer su nido. Este Pokémon suele merodear por las zonas de montaña en busca de nuevos rivales contra los que luchar.","La fuerza que tiene Lugia en las alas es devastadora; con nada que las bata es capaz de derribar edificios enteros. Por eso mismo, prefiere vivir donde no haya nadie, en lo más profundo del mar.","El plumaje de Ho-Oh contiene siete colores que pueden apreciarse según el ángulo desde el que les dé la luz. Dicen que sus plumas dan felicidad a quienes las llevan y, también, que este Pokémon vive a los pies del arco iris.","Este Pokémon vino del futuro haciendo un viaje en el tiempo. Hay quien piensa que, mientras Celebi siga apareciendo, hay un futuro brillante y esperanzador.","Treecko es tranquilo y tiene gran capacidad de autocontrol; no pierde la calma en ninguna situación. Si algún rival se le queda mirando fijamente, le devolverá la mirada sin ceder ni lo más mínimo de su territorio.","Este Pokémon revolotea de rama en rama con maestría. Cuando Grovyle va volando por el bosque, no hay quien lo alcance por muy rápido que sea.","A Sceptile le crecen en la espalda unas semillas llenas de nutrientes que sirven para revitalizar los árboles. De hecho, se dedica a cuidarlos con mimo para que crezcan bien.","Torchic tiene un lugar en el interior de su organismo en el que guarda la llama que posee. Si le das un abrazo, arderá encantado. Este Pokémon está recubierto totalmente de sedoso plumón.","Combusken lucha haciendo uso de las abrasadoras llamas que expulsa por el pico y de unas patadas fulminantes. Este Pokémon emite un sonido muy fuerte y molesto.","Blaziken tiene unas piernas tan fuertes que puede saltar por encima de un edificio de 30 pisos con facilidad. Además, da unos puñetazos fulminantes que dejan al oponente chamuscado y lleno de tizne.","En el agua, Mudkip usa las branquias que tiene en los mofletes para respirar. Cuando tiene que enfrentarse a una situación delicada en combate, desata una fuerza asombrosa con la que puede destruir rocas incluso mayores que él.","Marshtomp se desplaza más rápido por el lodo que por el agua. Los cuartos traseros de este Pokémon muestran un desarrollo más que evidente, lo que le permite andar solo sobre las patas traseras.","Swampert puede predecir tormentas al percibir con las aletas los sutiles cambios que producen las olas y las corrientes. Si está a punto de estallar una tormenta, empezará a apilar piedras para resguardarse.","Poochyena es un Pokémon omnívoro. Se come lo que sea. Le caracteriza el gran tamaño de sus colmillos respecto al resto del cuerpo. Este Pokémon hace que se le erice la cola para intentar intimidar a su rival.","Mightyena se desplaza y vive con su jauría en estado salvaje. Por eso, acostumbrado a esta libertad, obedece al Entrenador al que considere realmente dotado de habilidades superiores al resto.","Zigzagoon tiene erizado el pelo del lomo, y suele frotárselo contra los árboles para marcar su territorio. Este Pokémon hace como si estuviera debilitado para engañar a sus enemigos en combate.","Cuando Linoone caza, va directo hacia su presa a toda velocidad. Si por un lado puede alcanzar 100 km/h, por otro tiene que frenar en seco para poder cambiar de sentido.","Wurmple es la presa preferida de Swellow. La forma que tiene de intentar defenderse es apuntar con las púas del lomo al amenazante enemigo y debilitarlo inyectándole veneno.","Se pensaba que Silcoon podía aguantar el hambre y no consumir nada antes de evolucionar. Sin embargo, ahora se cree que sacia su sed bebiendo el agua de la lluvia que se le queda sobre la seda del capullo.","Beautifly tiene una boca enorme en espiral que parece una aguja y le resulta muy útil para recolectar polen. Este Pokémon va revoloteando de flor en flor para recogerlo.","Si atacan a Cascoon, se queda inmóvil aunque le hayan hecho mucho daño, puesto que, si se moviera, perdería fuerzas para evolucionar. Nunca olvida el daño que le han hecho.","Cuando Dustox bate las alas, libera un polvillo fino que en realidad es un peligroso veneno que puede resultar dañino hasta al más fuerte de los fuertes. Las antenas le sirven de radar para buscar comida.","A Lotad se le atribuye el haber vivido antes en tierra. En cualquier caso, se cree que volvió al agua porque la hoja de la cabeza le creció mucho y le empezó a pesar. Ahora vive flotando en el agua.","Lombre está completamente recubierto por una película viscosa y resbaladiza. La sensación que produce cuando roza a alguien con las manos es muy desagradable. A veces se confunde a este Pokémon con un niño pequeño.","Las células de Ludicolo se revolucionan y llenan de energía cuando oye sonidos rítmicos y alegres. En combate hace gala también de esta cantidad desmesurada de energía.","Seedot es igualito a una bellota colgada de la rama de un árbol. A veces asusta a más de un Pokémon con movimientos repentinos. Seedot suele acicalarse con hojas una vez al día.","Nuzleaf saca la hoja que tiene en la cabeza y la usa como flauta. El sonido que emite infunde miedo e incertidumbre a quien se encuentre perdido por el bosque.","Las grandes manos con forma de hoja que tiene Shiftry generan grandes corrientes de aire que pueden alcanzar 30 m/s y barrer lo que sea. Este Pokémon opta por vivir tranquilo en medio del bosque.","Taillow es pequeño, está recién salido del nido. Por eso, se siente solo con frecuencia y se pone a piar. Este Pokémon se alimenta de los Wurmple que hay por el bosque.","Swellow se preocupa a conciencia del mantenimiento de sus lustrosas alas. Cuando hay dos juntos, el uno se ocupa de limpiarle las alas al otro.","Wingull emerge del mar y asciende desplegando las largas y estrechas alas que posee. Este Pokémon tiene un pico largo que le resulta muy útil para pescar.","Pelipper busca su comida mientras vuela y esquiva las crestas de las olas. Cuando localiza una presa, sumerge el largo pico en el agua para pescarla y se la traga de una vez.","Ralts tiene la habilidad de percibir las sensaciones que tiene la gente. Si su Entrenador está alegre, este Pokémon se pondrá igualmente contento.","Kirlia usa los cuernos para amplificar los poderes de psicoquinesia que tiene. Cuando los usa, altera el ambiente, lo transforma y crea espejismos.","Gardevoir tiene el poder psicoquinético de alterar las dimensiones y crear un agujero negro pequeño. Este Pokémon intenta proteger siempre a su Entrenador aunque tenga que arriesgar su propia vida.","Cuando Surskit siente que hay peligro, segrega un néctar espeso y dulce por la cabeza. Hay Pokémon a los que les encanta bebérselo.","Masquerain tiene unas antenas con ojos dibujados que le dan aspecto de estar enfadado. Si tiene los “ojos” medio cerrados y con aspecto triste, es probable que esté a punto de caer un buen aguacero.","Si Shroomish siente peligro, agita el cuerpo y libera esporas venenosas por la cabeza. Estas esporas son tan tóxicas que pueden hacer que se marchiten los árboles y hasta las malas hierbas.","Las semillas que Breloom tiene prendidas de la cola están formadas por sólidas esporas tóxicas. Comérselas puede resultar fatal. Hasta el más mínimo bocado puede hacerte polvo el estómago.","A Slakoth le late el corazón una vez por minuto. Ya puede pasar lo que pase, que este Pokémon no mueve un dedo. Está todo el día holgazaneando. Es muy raro verlo en movimiento.","A Vigoroth le resulta totalmente imposible estarse quieto. Cuando intenta dormir, la sangre le fluye a velocidad de vértigo y se pone a correr por el bosque de un lado a otro hasta que se calma.","Cuando Slaking se instala a vivir en una zona, aparecen círculos de un metro de radio de terreno baldío, pues se come todo el césped que pilla mientras está tumbado boca abajo.","Nincada vive bajo tierra y usa las garras afiladas que tiene para escarbar y buscar raíces de árboles y absorber humedad y nutrientes. Este Pokémon huye de la luz del sol porque le hace daño.","Si Ninjask no recibe un entrenamiento adecuado, desobedece a su Entrenador y empieza a dar zumbidos sin parar. Por ello, se dice que pone a prueba las habilidades de su Entrenador.","Shedinja es un Pokémon peculiar. Según parece, surge por las buenas en una Poké Ball cuando Nincada evoluciona. Este raro Pokémon no se mueve nada; ni siquiera respira.","Whismur es muy tímido. Si empieza a gritar fuerte, se asusta a sí mismo y chilla más alto todavía. Cuando para por fin, se va a dormir completamente agotado.","Loudred grita a la vez que da pisotones. Una vez que deja de chillar, se queda ensordecido durante un buen rato; lo que se considera su punto débil.","Exploud expresa sus sentimientos a los otros emitiendo una especie de silbidos a través de los tubos que tiene. Este Pokémon solo levanta la voz cuando está en combate.","Makuhita tiene un ánimo inagotable. Nunca pierde la esperanza. Come mucho, duerme bastante y se entrena de forma metódica. Siguiendo estos hábitos de vida, este Pokémon tiene siempre mucha energía.","Puede que parezca que Hariyama está grueso, pero en realidad es una mole de puro músculo. Si este Pokémon hace fuerza y tensa la musculatura, se pone sólido como una roca.","Azurill tiene una especie de pelota en la cola, que contiene los nutrientes necesarios para crecer. Es fácil ver a este Pokémon saltando y jugueteando sentado encima de la misma.","De Nosepass se llegó a decir que era totalmente estático; siempre con su nariz magnética orientada hacia el norte. Sin embargo, tras recientes estudios se ha visto que sí se mueve en realidad, apenas un centímetro al año.","Skitty es conocido por la costumbre que tiene de juguetear y de intentar pillarse la cola. En estado salvaje, habita en las cavidades de los troncos de los árboles del bosque. Es la mascota de muchos por lo dulce que parece.","Delcatty duerme en cualquier lugar sin tener que mantener el nido en un mismo sitio. Si otro Pokémon se le acerca mientras duerme, no se pondrá a luchar con él; simplemente se irá a otro sitio.","Sableye cava en el suelo para buscar con las afiladas garras que tiene rocas para comer. Las sustancias que hay en las rocas que ingiere se solidifican y se le quedan en la piel.","No hay que dejarse engañar por el aspecto tierno de este Pokémon; es un verdadero peligro. Mawile engaña, así, a su rival. Primero, hace que baje la guardia y, después, despliega sus horribles fauces de acero, que antes eran cuernos.","Aron tiene el cuerpo de acero. Con una carga hecha con toda la fuerza es capaz de demoler hasta un camión de basura y, a continuación, comérselo.","Lairon se alimenta del hierro que hay en las rocas y el agua. Hace su nido en las montañas, de donde se saca el hierro. Por eso, se encuentra muchas veces con las personas que están trabajando en las minas extrayéndolo.","Aggron es increíblemente cuidadoso con su hábitat. Si su montaña sufre algún corrimiento de tierras o algún incendio, cargará con tierra nueva, plantará árboles y restaurará con cuidado el terreno.","Meditite aumenta su energía interior mediante meditación. Para subsistir le basta con una baya al día. El comer poco entra dentro de su entrenamiento.","A través de la meditación, Medicham desarrolló su sexto sentido y aprendió a usar poderes psicoquinéticos. Se sabe que este Pokémon puede pasarse un mes meditando y sin comer.","Electrike corre tan rápido que escapa hasta al ojo humano. La fricción que se origina en la carrera se transforma en electricidad que almacena en el pelaje.","Manectric acumula en las melenas la electricidad que hay en el ambiente, y la descarga a través de ellas en grandes dosis. Este Pokémon crea nubarrones que se le quedan por encima de la cabeza.","Cuando Plusle está animando a su compañero, resplandece y provoca un chisporroteo que le rodea todo el cuerpo. Si su compañero pierde, se pone a chillar a voz en grito.","Minun empieza a echar chispas cuando está animando a su compañero en pleno combate. Si su compañero está en peligro, el chisporroteo aumenta su intensidad por momentos.","La cola de Volbeat brilla como una bombilla. Ante otro de su grupo, la usa para dibujar formas geométricas en la oscuridad del cielo por la noche. Este Pokémon adora el dulce aroma que desprende Illumise.","Illumise guía en el vuelo a un grupo de iluminados Volbeat para que hagan dibujos en el oscuro cielo. Según dicen, cuanto más complejos sean los dibujos, más le respetan los miembros de su grupo.","Dicen que, en muy raras ocasiones, aparece un ejemplar de Roselia con las flores de colores muy poco comunes. Las espinas que este Pokémon tiene en la cabeza contienen un veneno extremadamente peligroso.","La mayor parte del cuerpo de Gulpin está ocupado por su estómago. En comparación, el corazón y el cerebro son muy pequeños. Este Pokémon tiene enzimas especiales en el estómago capaces de corroerlo todo.","Swalot no tiene dientes, así que lo que come se lo traga de una vez; da igual lo que sea. A este Pokémon le cabría un neumático en la boca sin problema.","Si algo o alguien invade el territorio de los Carvanha, se acercarán en masa y harán trizas al intruso con los afilados colmillos. Sin embargo, cuando están en solitario, estos Pokémon se vuelven tímidos de repente.","Sharpedo puede alcanzar nadando los 120 km/h agitando la aleta trasera y propulsándose por el agua. El punto flaco de este Pokémon es la imposibilidad que tiene de nadar largas distancias.","Wailmer puede almacenar agua dentro de su organismo para convertirse en una pelota y botar por tierra firme. Cuanta más agua trague, mayor altura alcanzará al saltar.","Wailord caza con otros miembros de su especie. Es espectacular ver cómo saltan y chapotean en el agua para agrupar a sus presas. Realmente impresiona ver cómo impactan contra el agua.","Numel acumula en su interior un magma de 1200 °C. Si se moja, el magma se enfría y se solidifica. Cuando esto ocurre, aumenta su tamaño y se vuelve pesado y lento en sus movimientos.","Las jorobas de Camerupt se originaron por una deformación de los huesos. A veces escupen magma líquido, sobre todo cuando el Pokémon se enfada.","Torkoal genera energía quemando carbón. A medida que se extingue el fuego, se va debilitando. Antes de entrar en combate, quema más carbón de lo habitual.","Spoink lleva una perla en la cabeza, que sirve para amplificar los poderes psicoquinéticos que tiene. Por eso, está continuamente buscando una perla mayor.","Grumpig utiliza las perlas negras que tiene para usar fantásticos poderes mientras baila de forma muy extraña. Las perlas de este Pokémon están consideradas como valiosas obras de arte.","No hay dos Spinda con los mismos dibujos en el pelaje. Este Pokémon se mueve de forma muy curiosa. Da la impresión de estar mareado. Se tambalea y puede llegar a causar confusión a su enemigo.","Trapinch es un cazador paciente. Suele cavar una fosa profunda en el desierto y esperar a que su presa caiga en ella. Este Pokémon puede aguantar toda una semana sin beber nada de agua.","Vibrava no ha desarrollado las alas del todo. Más que para volar y recorrer largas distancias, le resultan útiles para generar ondas ultrasónicas al hacer que vibren.","Flygon puede provocar una tormenta de arena batiendo las alas. Estas, al ser agitadas, crean una melodía. Y, como las “melodías” pueden oírse cuando hay tormenta, dicen que es el espíritu del desierto.","Cuanto más árido y hostil sea el hábitat de Cacnea, más bonita y aromática será la flor que le crece. Este Pokémon lucha agitando violentamente los brazos cargados de pinchos que tiene.","Cuando alguien se adentra en un desierto por la noche, Cacturne le sigue junto con varios de los suyos. Este Pokémon espera pacientemente a que el viajero se fatigue y no pueda continuar más, vencido por el cansancio.","A Swablu le encanta limpiarlo todo. Si ve algo sucio, lo dejará como nuevo y reluciente con las alas de algodón que tiene. Cuando se le ensucian, busca un manantial y las limpia.","Altaria canta de maravilla, como una soprano. Tiene unas alas que parecen nubes de algodón. Este Pokémon aprovecha las corrientes ascendentes y remonta el vuelo con sus flamantes alas hacia la inmensidad del cielo azul.","Zangoose suele caminar a cuatro patas, pero cuando se enfada se pone de pie sobre las traseras y saca las zarpas. Este Pokémon tiene desde hace varias generaciones una áspera rivalidad con Seviper.","Seviper tiene una cola que parece una espada y le sirve para dar un sablazo al enemigo y para envenenarlo. Este Pokémon se mantiene firme en la enemistad que siente hacia Zangoose.","Lunatone entra en actividad en épocas de luna llena más o menos. No camina, se desplaza flotando por el aire. Tiene unos ojos rojos sobrecogedores que cortan la respiración a todo aquel que los ve.","La fuente de energía de Solrock es la luz del sol. Dicen que tiene la habilidad de leer la mente de los demás. Al rotar, libera mucho calor.","Barboach está completamente recubierto por una película viscosa. Si lo atrapan, puede escurrirse fácilmente. Si se le seca la capa viscosa, este Pokémon se debilitará.","Si Whiscash entra en estado de cólera salvaje, provoca un temblor sísmico de un radio de 5 km. Este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de predecir terremotos de verdad.","Corphish atrapa a su presa con finas pinzas. En lo referente a comida no es delicado; se come lo que sea. Tampoco tiene ningún problema en vivir en aguas sucias.","Crawdaunt muda el caparazón regularmente y, en cuanto lo hace, se le queda la piel tersa y suave. Mientras el nuevo caparazón se endurece, permanece escondido en su madriguera para que no le ataquen.","Al ver a más de los suyos, Baltoy se une al grupo y todos se ponen a chillar escandalosamente y al unísono. Este Pokémon duerme manteniendo hábilmente el equilibrio sobre la extremidad inferior que tiene.","Claydol es un enigma, una figura de barro procedente de una civilización antigua de hace más de 20 000 años. Este Pokémon dispara rayos por las manos.","Lileep es un Pokémon antiguo que se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Siempre está anclado a una roca. Desde su percha inmóvil está al acecho y pendiente de que no se le escape su presa.","A Cradily le sirve el cuerpo de ancla y sostén en aguas turbulentas. Gracias a él no es arrastrado por las corrientes. Este Pokémon segrega un fuerte jugo digestivo a través de los tentáculos.","De Anorith dicen que es una especie de Pokémon predecesor. Tiene ocho alas a ambos lados del cuerpo. Gracias a ellas, pudo nadar por las primeras aguas que hubo.","Armaldo es una de las especies de Pokémon que se extinguieron en la era prehistórica. Se cree que caminaban sobre las patas traseras; lo más apropiado para la vida en tierra firme.","Aunque Feebas tenga el cuerpo mellado, posee una tremenda y constante fuerza vital que le permite vivir en cualquier lugar. Con todo, es un Pokémon lento y simplón; es fácil de atrapar.","Milotic vive en lo más profundo de los lagos. Cuando intensifica el color rosa de la piel, libera una fuerte onda de energía que tranquiliza a todo el que tenga el ánimo alterado.","Castform se vale del poder de la naturaleza para tomar el aspecto del sol, la lluvia o nubarrones de nieve. El estado de ánimo de este Pokémon varía según el clima.","Kecleon modifica la coloración de la piel para camuflarse en el medio en el que esté. Así, puede acercarse a hurtadillas a su enemigo sin que se dé cuenta y lanzarle la larga y elástica lengua que tiene para atraparlo por sorpresa.","Shuppet crece alimentándose de sentimientos negativos, como el rencor y la envidia, que nacen en el corazón de las personas. Se dedica a vagar por las ciudades en busca del rencor que contamina a la gente.","Fue un hechizo el que hizo que el relleno de este muñeco de felpa olvidado y abandonado pasara a ser Banette. Si este Pokémon abriera la boca, se quedaría sin energía.","Duskull vaga perdido por la oscuridad de la noche. Cuando los niños se portan mal y desobedecen a sus padres, se les dice que este Pokémon aparecerá y se los llevará con él.","Dusclops absorbe todo lo que pilla, al margen del tamaño que tenga. Este Pokémon hipnotiza a su rival moviendo las manos de forma macabra y usando el ojo de manera implacable. Una vez hipnotizado, el enemigo obedecerá.","Los niños de la zona sur de los trópicos se comen los racimos de fruta que le crecen a Tropius alrededor del cuello. Este Pokémon vuela batiendo las hojas que tiene en el lomo como si fueran alas.","Cuando hay viento fuerte, Chimecho chilla colgado de la rama de un árbol o de los aleros de un edificio por la ventosa que tiene en la cabeza. Este Pokémon usa la larga cola que tiene para agarrar bayas y comérselas.","Absol tiene la habilidad de predecir las catástrofes naturales. Este Pokémon vive en hábitats montañosos, hostiles y accidentados de los que rara vez se aleja.","Los Wynaut se agrupan cuando hay luna para jugar achuchándose unos a otros. Cuanto más se achuchan, más ganan en resistencia y lanzan fuertes contraataques con más facilidad.","Snorunt sobrevive alimentándose solo de nieve y hielo. Se dice que la casa por la que pase este Pokémon estará llena de prosperidad durante generaciones.","Glalie tiene la habilidad de controlar el hielo con total libertad. Por ejemplo, puede dejar a su presa totalmente congelada en un instante. Y, una vez helada, la devora lentamente.","Spheal se desplaza siempre rodando gracias al cuerpo esférico que tiene. Al comenzar la época glacial, es fácil verle rodando por superficies heladas y atravesando el mar.","Sealeo suele balancear y hacer rodar cosas en la punta del morro. Al mismo tiempo, aprovecha para olerlas y detectar la textura que tienen para ver si le gustan o no.","Walrein va nadando por mares glaciales y destrozando icebergs con los enormes e imponentes colmillos que tiene. La gruesa capa de grasa que tiene en el cuerpo hace que los ataques enemigos reboten y no le hagan ningún daño.","Clamperl crece protegido por la sólida concha que tiene. Si vemos que el cuerpo no le cabe, será porque está a punto de evolucionar.","Huntail tiene una cola en forma de pez, que usa para atraer a su presa. Una vez que la tiene cerca, la engulle sin más. Este Pokémon nada haciendo serpentear el cuerpo como si fuera un reptil.","Aunque Gorebyss es la imagen de la elegancia y la belleza al nadar, es también la definición de la crueldad. Al detectar a su presa, este Pokémon le hinca los finos dientes que tiene y le absorbe los fluidos corporales.","Relicanth pertenece a una rara especie descubierta al explorar el fondo marino. Es grande y está cubierto de toscas y duras escamas, con las que puede soportar la presión del fondo oceánico.","Luvdisc tiene forma de corazón y simboliza el amor y el romanticismo. Dicen que la pareja que se encuentre con él mantendrá una relación de amor de por vida.","Bagon sueña siempre con lo mismo: pasar todo un día volando entre las nubes. Frustrado ante la imposibilidad de volar, parece que se desahoga dándose cabezazos contra rocas enormes hasta hacerlas añicos.","Shelgon está recubierto por una especie de capa ósea: una coraza muy dura que hace rebotar los ataques enemigos. Este Pokémon se esconde en las cavernas para evolucionar.","Al evolucionar Shelgon y convertirse por fin en Salamence, ve cumplido el sueño de su vida de tener alas. Para expresar su alegría, Salamence vuela y revolotea por el cielo al tiempo que lanza llamas por la boca.","Beldum se mantiene flotando en el aire gracias a la fuerza magnética que genera y que repele la gravedad. Para dormir, este Pokémon se ancla a los riscos usando los ganchos que tiene.","Cuando se funden dos Beldum, uniendo los cerebros por un sistema nervioso magnético, se forma un Metang. Para desplazarse a mayor velocidad, este Pokémon echa los brazos hacia atrás.","Metagross es el resultado de la fusión de dos Metang. Cuando caza, acorrala a su presa, sujetándola contra el suelo con el cuerpo. Después, devora a la víctima indefensa con la gran boca del estómago.","Regirock está formado en su totalidad por piedras. En un estudio reciente, se descubrió que cada una de las piedras había sido desenterrada en sitios distintos.","Regice se rodea de un aire gélido que llega a -200 °C y deja congelado a todo lo que se le acerca. Es imposible derretir a este Pokémon; tiene una temperatura demasiado baja.","Hace mucho tiempo Registeel estuvo preso. La gente piensa que el metal del que está hecho es una curiosa sustancia extraterrestre.","Latias tiene un nivel de inteligencia tan alto que es capaz de entender el lenguaje humano. Este Pokémon usa el plumón cristalizado del que está cubierto como peto para refractar la luz y cambiar de aspecto.","Latios solo le abre el corazón a los Entrenadores compasivos. A la hora de volar, este Pokémon pliega las patas delanteras para minimizar la resistencia al aire y supera en velocidad a un avión a reacción.","A Kyogre siempre se le ha descrito como el Pokémon que expandió los océanos. Varias leyendas cuentan que libró combates contra Groudon en repetidas ocasiones para tener el control de la energía de la naturaleza.","Groudon se sirve de la energía de la naturaleza para realizar su Regresión Primigenia y recobrar su apariencia primitiva. Con tal poder, puede crear magma para expandir los continentes.","Rayquaza ha vivido en la capa de ozono durante millones de años, alimentándose de meteoritos. La energía de estos meteoritos se acumula en su cuerpo y le permite megaevolucionar.","Jirachi despertará de su letargo de miles de años si se le canta con una voz pura. Dicen que este Pokémon hace realidad cualquier deseo que se tenga.","Deoxys surgió a partir de un virus espacial. Tiene un alto nivel intelectual y poderes psicoquinéticos. Este Pokémon dispara rayos láser por el órgano cristalino que tiene en el torso.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"letsgoeevee":[null,"Puede sobrevivir largo tiempo sin probar bocado gracias a los nutrientes que guarda en el bulbo del lomo.","Su bulbo crece a medida que absorbe nutrientes. Desprende un cierto aroma cuando está a punto de florecer.","La flor que tiene en el lomo puede recoger los rayos solares para transformarlos en energía.","En lugares silenciosos se puede oír el débil chisporroteo de la llama que le arde en la punta de la cola.","Librar combates intensos lo entusiasma tanto que en ocasiones lanza llamas de tono blanco azulado.","Cuando exhala fuego abrasador, la llama de la punta de la cola se aviva y adquiere un intenso color rojo.","Escupe chorros de agua mientras flota para capturar a sus presas. Se esconde en su caparazón cuando se siente en peligro.","Si alguien le golpea la cabeza, se protege escondiéndose en su caparazón, aunque parte de la cola queda al descubierto.","Tras fijar el blanco, ataca disparando un chorro de agua a una presión mayor que la manguera de un bombero.","Cuando le tocan la antena roja que tiene en la frente, se defiende desprendiendo un hedor nauseabundo.","Pese a su constante empeño por endurecer su coraza para protegerse, puede romperse si recibe un fuerte impacto y quedar expuesto.","Sus alas están recubiertas de escamas venenosas impermeables que le permiten volar bajo la lluvia.","El aguijón de la cabeza es muy puntiagudo. Se alimenta de hojas oculto en la espesura de bosques y praderas.","Aunque es casi incapaz de moverse, en caso de sentirse amenazado puede envenenar a los enemigos con su aguijón.","Tiene tres aguijones venenosos, dos en las patas anteriores y uno en la parte baja del abdomen, con los que ataca a sus enemigos una y otra vez.","Su docilidad es tal que suelen defenderse levantando arena en lugar de contraatacar.","Su extraordinaria vitalidad y resistencia le permiten cubrir grandes distancias del territorio que habita en busca de presas.","Este Pokémon vuela a una velocidad de 2 mach en busca de presas. Sus grandes garras son armas muy peligrosas.","Es propenso a hincar los incisivos en cualquier cosa que se le ponga por delante. Si se ve alguno, seguramente haya cuarenta cerca.","Gracias a las pequeñas membranas de las patas traseras, puede nadar por los ríos para capturar presas.","A la hora de proteger su territorio, compensa su incapacidad para volar a gran altura con una increíble velocidad.","Este Pokémon ha existido desde tiempos remotos. Al menor atisbo de peligro, alza el vuelo y huye.","La longitud de este Pokémon aumenta con el tiempo. Por la noche, se enrosca en las ramas de los árboles para descansar.","Se han llegado a identificar hasta seis variaciones distintas de los espeluznantes dibujos de su piel.","Los bosques son su hábitat natural. En las bolsas de las mejillas acumula electricidad, por lo que quien las toque puede recibir una descarga.","Al acumular cierta cantidad de electricidad en el cuerpo, se vuelve agresivo. También brilla en la oscuridad.","Tiene la piel muy seca, aunque, si hace frío por la noche, aparece cubierta de un fino rocío.","Utiliza hábilmente las garras en combate, por lo que suelen rompérsele. Aun así, solo tardan un día en volverle a crecer.","A este dócil Pokémon no le gusta luchar, pero conviene tener cuidado con su pequeño cuerno, ya que segrega veneno.","Mientras se cobija en su madriguera, retrae las púas, señal inequívoca de que se siente a salvo.","Su robusto cuerpo está recubierto de escamas durísimas que se renuevan constantemente.","Mantiene sus grandes orejas levantadas, siempre alerta. Si advierte peligro, ataca con las púas venenosas.","El cuerno de su frente contiene toxinas que se liberan al punzar al rival.","Su piel dura como el acero refuerza el impacto al cargar contra sus enemigos. Su cuerno puede atravesar hasta diamantes.","Su aspecto jovial y sus ademanes lo hacen adorable y muy popular, aunque no suelen verse a menudo, tal vez porque su número sea escaso.","Un Pokémon de aspecto feérico que protege con celo su entorno y muy rara vez se deja ver por los humanos.","Sus colas y pelaje son preciosos. A medida que crece, las colas se dividen y forman otras nuevas.","De acuerdo con una antigua leyenda, este Pokémon es la reencarnación de nueve deidades que se unieron en un solo ser.","Tras fijar su tierna mirada en el objetivo, entona una dulce y misteriosa melodía para adormecerlo.","Su cuerpo es muy elástico. Cuando inhala aire profundamente, puede inflarse sin límite.","Emite ultrasonidos que utiliza como sonar para evitar obstáculos cuando vuela.","Tras aproximarse sigilosamente a su objetivo, utiliza sus afilados colmillos para chuparle la sangre.","En ocasiones lo confunden con una mala hierba y, al tratar de arrancarlo, profiere unos gritos escalofriantes.","Huele bastante mal, pero una de cada mil personas aprecia su fétido olor.","Sacude sus enormes pétalos para propagar polen venenoso, lo cual provoca un verdadero estruendo.","Escarba en el suelo para extraer nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles, que las setas del lomo absorben después casi por completo.","Tras largo tiempo absorbiendo la energía del huésped, la seta parásita del lomo es la que parece controlar la voluntad de este Pokémon.","Sus grandes ojos actúan como radares. A plena luz se percibe que son, en realidad, grupos de ojos diminutos.","Las alas desprenden un polvillo de escamas impregnado de toxinas que se adhiere al contacto y resulta difícil de quitar.","Prefiere los lugares oscuros. Pasa la mayor parte del tiempo bajo tierra, pero también se avista con frecuencia en cuevas.","Estos trillizos combinan su fuerza para excavar hasta una profundidad de 100 km, razón por la que se les atribuyen algunos terremotos.","Al parecer, es más activo por la noche. Adora de tal manera los objetos redondos y brillantes que no puede evitar recogerlos si se los encuentra.","La gema que tiene en la frente brilla por sí misma. Camina con elegancia regia.","Siempre tiene dolores de cabeza. Posee poderes psíquicos, pero se desconoce si los controla a voluntad.","Sus delgadas y largas extremidades terminan en dedos palmeados muy desarrollados que le permiten nadar en los lagos con gracilidad.","Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor.","Solo se calma cuando no hay nadie cerca, por lo que llegar a ver ese momento resulta verdaderamente difícil.","Este Pokémon es muy amistoso. Aun así, ladra con fiereza a cualquiera que invada su territorio.","Este Pokémon es toda una leyenda en oriente. Muchos han quedado cautivados por la belleza y gracilidad que exhibe al correr.","La dirección de la espiral en su vientre varía en función de la región donde nace. Se mueve con más facilidad en el agua que en tierra firme.","Cuando se siente intimidado, usa la espiral del vientre para adormecer al rival y aprovechar para escaparse.","La fuerza que le confiere toda la musculatura del cuerpo le permite nadar con tal impulso que puede rebasar hasta a nadadores profesionales.","Duerme 18 horas al día. Si siente peligro, se teletransporta a un lugar seguro, aun estando dormido.","Hace que sucedan cosas extrañas cuando está cerca, como que los relojes vayan al revés.","Este Pokémon lo recuerda todo y nunca olvida lo que aprende, de ahí que sea tan inteligente.","Es muy fuerte, a pesar de su pequeño tamaño. Su dominio de varias artes marciales lo convierte en un rival duro de pelar.","El cinto antifuerza que lleva puesto limita sus movimientos. Sin él, resultaría imparable.","Un brazo le basta para mover montañas y, si usa los cuatro, asesta puñetazos de una potencia descomunal.","Prefiere lugares cálidos y húmedos. Atrapa pequeños Pokémon insectos con sus lianas para devorarlos.","Cuando tiene hambre, engulle a todo lo que se mueve. La pobre presa acaba disuelta en sus ácidos.","Atrae a su presa con un dulce aroma a miel. Una vez atrapada en la boca, la disuelve en tan solo un día, huesos incluidos.","A veces pueden encontrarse deshidratados en las playas, pero reviven al sumergirlos de nuevo en el agua.","Puede estirar y contraer con total libertad sus 80 tentáculos, con los que atrapa a su presa y le inyecta un veneno debilitante.","Se suele encontrar en senderos de montaña y sitios parecidos. Conviene andar con cuidado para no pisarlo sin querer y provocar su enfado.","Se le suele ver rodando montaña abajo. No evita los obstáculos, sino que los arrolla.","Nada más mudar la piel, su cuerpo se vuelve blando y blanquecino, pero se endurece al poco tiempo de entrar en contacto con el aire.","Es capaz de saltar muy alto. Absorbe el impacto del aterrizaje con sus robustas patas y pezuñas.","Le encanta galopar. Si ve algo más rápido, intentará alcanzarlo a toda velocidad.","Es increíblemente lento y perezoso. Se toma las cosas con calma, sin preocuparse por el paso del tiempo.","Lleva una vida tranquila cerca del mar. Si el Shellder de la cola se desprende, se convierte de nuevo en un Slowpoke.","Puede desafiar la gravedad desde su nacimiento. Flota en el aire gracias a las ondas electromagnéticas que emite.","Es capaz de elevar 2 °C la temperatura en un radio de 1 km emitiendo extrañas ondas electromagnéticas.","Vive cerca de cultivos de puerros. Como estos son cada vez más escasos, se cree que el número de Farfetch’d también ha disminuido.","Las diminutas alas apenas le permiten volar, pero puede correr a gran velocidad gracias a sus patas hiperdesarrolladas.","Este Pokémon surge al dividirse una de las cabezas de Doduo. Es capaz de correr por las praderas a 60 km/h.","Le encantan los lugares gélidos y disfruta nadando en aguas a temperaturas en torno a los -10 °C.","Su cuerpo es blanco como la nieve. Puede nadar plácidamente en mares gélidos gracias a su resistencia al frío.","Está hecho de lodo endurecido. Pocos se atreven a tocarlo debido a su pestilencia y composición nociva. Allá por donde pasa no crece la hierba.","Huele tan mal que puede provocar desmayos. Su nariz se ha atrofiado de tal manera que ha perdido por completo el sentido del olfato.","La dura concha que lo recubre resiste cualquier ataque, por lo que su frágil cuerpo solo queda expuesto cuando esta se abre.","Se protege con su concha, que es más dura que un diamante. Su capacidad de lanzar pinchos lo convierte en un rival temible.","Según dicen, aparece en edificios antiguos y deshabitados. Su cuerpo, de aspecto gaseoso, carece de una forma definida.","Sus lengüetazos le arrebatan la energía vital a su víctima y le causan unos temblores que no cesan hasta que fallece.","Sentir un escalofrío repentino es señal de que hay un Gengar cerca. Quien lo perciba puede convertirse en víctima de su maldición.","Cava a gran velocidad en busca de comida. Los Diglett convierten en su hogar los túneles que deja a su paso.","Si se duerme siempre en compañía de un Pokémon de esta especie, puede mostrar sueños que haya ingerido con anterioridad.","Conviene evitar el contacto visual en caso de encontrarse con este Pokémon, ya que puede hipnotizar con su péndulo.","Sus pinzas son armas muy potentes y, aunque en ocasiones se le rompen al atacar, le crecen de nuevo con rapidez.","Una de sus pinzas, enorme y dura como el acero, tiene 10 000 CV. No obstante, resulta demasiado pesada.","Se dice que se camufla como una Poké Ball. Al más mínimo estímulo se autodestruirá.","Almacena tal cantidad de energía eléctrica en su cuerpo que el más leve impacto puede provocar una gran explosión.","Las cabezas se atraen unas a otras y giran entre sí. Debe tener seis para equilibrarse.","El estrépito que causa se debe a que cada una de las tres cabezas habla y actúa de forma independiente, sin tener en cuenta a las demás.","Siempre lleva puesto el cráneo de su difunta madre. Su llanto resuena dentro como una triste melodía.","Este Pokémon ha dejado atrás su debilidad y se ha vuelto más feroz con el paso del tiempo. Blande su hueso con destreza.","La planta de los pies se le vuelve tan dura como el diamante al dar patadas a su oponente, hasta el punto de aniquilarlo.","Sus puñetazos, semejantes a una taladradora, pueden perforar un muro de hormigón como si nada.","Su lengua puede llegar a medir dos metros y la mueve con más soltura que las patas delanteras. Sus lametazos pueden causar parálisis.","A veces puede explotar sin avisar, ya que en lugares calurosos su gas interno se expande.","Este Pokémon se alimenta de los gases venenosos, los gérmenes y el polvo que encuentra en la basura.","Es algo simple y testarudo, y solo tiene una cosa en la cabeza. Si carga contra algo, no se detiene hasta caer rendido.","Pasar a ser bípedo le ha permitido desarrollar su inteligencia. La piel, rígida como una armadura, resiste incluso el magma.","Este amable Pokémon comparte sus nutritivos huevos con quien encuentre herido.","Se camufla tras una gran masa de lianas azules. Se dice que nunca dejan de crecer.","Cuida de la cría que lleva en la bolsa de su panza y se enfrenta a todo aquel que supone una amenaza para protegerla.","Si se siente en peligro, arrojará un potente chorro de agua o de una tinta especial por la boca.","Tocar sus aletas dorsales causa entumecimiento. Mientras duerme se agarra al coral con la cola para que no se lo lleve la corriente.","Durante la época de desove, se les suele ver nadando a contracorriente en ríos o remontando cascadas en grandes grupos.","Los machos usan el cuerno de la cabeza para horadar rocas en el lecho del río y construir allí su nido.","Aunque haya perdido partes de su cuerpo, le crecerán de nuevo siempre y cuando su parte central se mantenga intacta.","Su parte central se conoce como núcleo. Se cree que, cuando este brilla con siete colores, es señal de que se está comunicando.","Practica constantemente la pantomima. Tal es su maestría que puede convencer a quien lo observe de la existencia de algo que no es real.","Se agazapa en la hierba alta y salta de repente sobre el enemigo para hacerlo trizas con sus afiladas guadañas. Se mueve como un ninja.","Parece moverse como si estuviera bailando un ritmo de su propia invención. Mueve mucho las caderas al andar.","Cuando hay un apagón, es señal inequívoca de que este Pokémon se ha comido la energía de una central eléctrica.","Nace en cráteres de volcanes. Su cuerpo envuelto en llamas parece una bola de fuego.","Atrapa a su presa con las pinzas y aprieta fuerte. Habita en lugares cálidos, ya que el frío puede llegar a inmovilizarlo.","Un Pokémon violento que rebosa energía. Cuando echa a correr, no se detiene hasta que choca con algo.","Famoso por su ineptitud. Nada en todo tipo de aguas, ya sean mares, lagos, ríos o charcas.","Este Pokémon tan salvaje como destructivo es conocido por haber reducido a escombros ciudades enteras en el pasado.","Este amable Pokémon es capaz de comprender el lenguaje humano y deja que las personas monten en él para navegar por el mar.","Cuando se fija en un enemigo, su cuerpo se transforma en una copia casi perfecta del mismo.","Puede evolucionar a varias especies distintas. Su código genético es la clave para descifrar el misterio de dicha evolución.","Su estructura celular se parece a las moléculas de agua, por eso es invisible cuando está en este elemento.","Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor.","La bolsa en el interior de su cuerpo le permite convertir el aire que aspira en llamas a 1700 °C que luego exhala por la boca.","Se creía que sería el único Pokémon capaz de volar por el espacio, pero aún no se ha visto a ninguno que lo haya conseguido.","Este antiguo Pokémon fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Solía nadar en antiguos mares moviendo con destreza sus 10 tentáculos.","Poseía unos colmillos afilados, pero el excesivo tamaño de su concha le impedía moverse con libertad, lo que acabó provocando su extinción.","Este Pokémon se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Usaba los ojos de la espalda para explorar su entorno al ocultarse en el lecho marino.","Este Pokémon es un rápido nadador gracias a su cuerpo esbelto. Con las garras despedaza las presas que atrapa para sorber sus fluidos.","Este Pokémon feroz, extinto hace siglos, fue regenerado a partir de ADN extraído de un ámbar.","Engulle cualquier cosa, incluso comida mohosa, sin que esto le cause dolor de estómago.","Un Pokémon pájaro legendario. En invierno, crea nieve congelando la humedad del aire.","Este Pokémon pájaro legendario solo aparece cuando el cielo se torna oscuro y caen rayos sin cesar.","Un Pokémon pájaro legendario. Cuando aletea sus flamígeras alas, la oscura noche se torna roja.","La existencia de este mítico Pokémon fue confirmada no hace mucho por un pescador que capturó uno.","Según un testigo, está rodeado por una extraña aura, que le da un aspecto misterioso y místico.","Se dice que este Pokémon vive en algún lugar del mar y que también vuela. De todos modos, solo es un rumor.","Su ADN es casi el mismo que el de Mew. Sin embargo, su tamaño y carácter son muy diferentes.","Si se observa a través de un microscopio, puede distinguirse cuán corto, fino y delicado es el pelaje de este Pokémon.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"letsgopikachu":[null,"Puede sobrevivir largo tiempo sin probar bocado gracias a los nutrientes que guarda en el bulbo del lomo.","Su bulbo crece a medida que absorbe nutrientes. Desprende un cierto aroma cuando está a punto de florecer.","La flor que tiene en el lomo puede recoger los rayos solares para transformarlos en energía.","En lugares silenciosos se puede oír el débil chisporroteo de la llama que le arde en la punta de la cola.","Librar combates intensos lo entusiasma tanto que en ocasiones lanza llamas de tono blanco azulado.","Cuando exhala fuego abrasador, la llama de la punta de la cola se aviva y adquiere un intenso color rojo.","Escupe chorros de agua mientras flota para capturar a sus presas. Se esconde en su caparazón cuando se siente en peligro.","Si alguien le golpea la cabeza, se protege escondiéndose en su caparazón, aunque parte de la cola queda al descubierto.","Tras fijar el blanco, ataca disparando un chorro de agua a una presión mayor que la manguera de un bombero.","Cuando le tocan la antena roja que tiene en la frente, se defiende desprendiendo un hedor nauseabundo.","Pese a su constante empeño por endurecer su coraza para protegerse, puede romperse si recibe un fuerte impacto y quedar expuesto.","Sus alas están recubiertas de escamas venenosas impermeables que le permiten volar bajo la lluvia.","El aguijón de la cabeza es muy puntiagudo. Se alimenta de hojas oculto en la espesura de bosques y praderas.","Aunque es casi incapaz de moverse, en caso de sentirse amenazado puede envenenar a los enemigos con su aguijón.","Tiene tres aguijones venenosos, dos en las patas anteriores y uno en la parte baja del abdomen, con los que ataca a sus enemigos una y otra vez.","Su docilidad es tal que suelen defenderse levantando arena en lugar de contraatacar.","Su extraordinaria vitalidad y resistencia le permiten cubrir grandes distancias del territorio que habita en busca de presas.","Este Pokémon vuela a una velocidad de 2 mach en busca de presas. Sus grandes garras son armas muy peligrosas.","Es propenso a hincar los incisivos en cualquier cosa que se le ponga por delante. Si se ve alguno, seguramente haya cuarenta cerca.","Gracias a las pequeñas membranas de las patas traseras, puede nadar por los ríos para capturar presas.","A la hora de proteger su territorio, compensa su incapacidad para volar a gran altura con una increíble velocidad.","Este Pokémon ha existido desde tiempos remotos. Al menor atisbo de peligro, alza el vuelo y huye.","La longitud de este Pokémon aumenta con el tiempo. Por la noche, se enrosca en las ramas de los árboles para descansar.","Se han llegado a identificar hasta seis variaciones distintas de los espeluznantes dibujos de su piel.","Los bosques son su hábitat natural. En las bolsas de las mejillas acumula electricidad, por lo que quien las toque puede recibir una descarga.","Al acumular cierta cantidad de electricidad en el cuerpo, se vuelve agresivo. También brilla en la oscuridad.","Tiene la piel muy seca, aunque, si hace frío por la noche, aparece cubierta de un fino rocío.","Utiliza hábilmente las garras en combate, por lo que suelen rompérsele. Aun así, solo tardan un día en volverle a crecer.","A este dócil Pokémon no le gusta luchar, pero conviene tener cuidado con su pequeño cuerno, ya que segrega veneno.","Mientras se cobija en su madriguera, retrae las púas, señal inequívoca de que se siente a salvo.","Su robusto cuerpo está recubierto de escamas durísimas que se renuevan constantemente.","Mantiene sus grandes orejas levantadas, siempre alerta. Si advierte peligro, ataca con las púas venenosas.","El cuerno de su frente contiene toxinas que se liberan al punzar al rival.","Su piel dura como el acero refuerza el impacto al cargar contra sus enemigos. Su cuerno puede atravesar hasta diamantes.","Su aspecto jovial y sus ademanes lo hacen adorable y muy popular, aunque no suelen verse a menudo, tal vez porque su número sea escaso.","Un Pokémon de aspecto feérico que protege con celo su entorno y muy rara vez se deja ver por los humanos.","Sus colas y pelaje son preciosos. A medida que crece, las colas se dividen y forman otras nuevas.","De acuerdo con una antigua leyenda, este Pokémon es la reencarnación de nueve deidades que se unieron en un solo ser.","Tras fijar su tierna mirada en el objetivo, entona una dulce y misteriosa melodía para adormecerlo.","Su cuerpo es muy elástico. Cuando inhala aire profundamente, puede inflarse sin límite.","Emite ultrasonidos que utiliza como sonar para evitar obstáculos cuando vuela.","Tras aproximarse sigilosamente a su objetivo, utiliza sus afilados colmillos para chuparle la sangre.","En ocasiones lo confunden con una mala hierba y, al tratar de arrancarlo, profiere unos gritos escalofriantes.","Huele bastante mal, pero una de cada mil personas aprecia su fétido olor.","Sacude sus enormes pétalos para propagar polen venenoso, lo cual provoca un verdadero estruendo.","Escarba en el suelo para extraer nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles, que las setas del lomo absorben después casi por completo.","Tras largo tiempo absorbiendo la energía del huésped, la seta parásita del lomo es la que parece controlar la voluntad de este Pokémon.","Sus grandes ojos actúan como radares. A plena luz se percibe que son, en realidad, grupos de ojos diminutos.","Las alas desprenden un polvillo de escamas impregnado de toxinas que se adhiere al contacto y resulta difícil de quitar.","Prefiere los lugares oscuros. Pasa la mayor parte del tiempo bajo tierra, pero también se avista con frecuencia en cuevas.","Estos trillizos combinan su fuerza para excavar hasta una profundidad de 100 km, razón por la que se les atribuyen algunos terremotos.","Al parecer, es más activo por la noche. Adora de tal manera los objetos redondos y brillantes que no puede evitar recogerlos si se los encuentra.","La gema que tiene en la frente brilla por sí misma. Camina con elegancia regia.","Siempre tiene dolores de cabeza. Posee poderes psíquicos, pero se desconoce si los controla a voluntad.","Sus delgadas y largas extremidades terminan en dedos palmeados muy desarrollados que le permiten nadar en los lagos con gracilidad.","Este ágil Pokémon vive en los árboles. Se enfada con facilidad y, cuando lo hace, se abalanza contra todo lo que se encuentre a su alrededor.","Solo se calma cuando no hay nadie cerca, por lo que llegar a ver ese momento resulta verdaderamente difícil.","Este Pokémon es muy amistoso. Aun así, ladra con fiereza a cualquiera que invada su territorio.","Este Pokémon es toda una leyenda en oriente. Muchos han quedado cautivados por la belleza y gracilidad que exhibe al correr.","La dirección de la espiral en su vientre varía en función de la región donde nace. Se mueve con más facilidad en el agua que en tierra firme.","Cuando se siente intimidado, usa la espiral del vientre para adormecer al rival y aprovechar para escaparse.","La fuerza que le confiere toda la musculatura del cuerpo le permite nadar con tal impulso que puede rebasar hasta a nadadores profesionales.","Duerme 18 horas al día. Si siente peligro, se teletransporta a un lugar seguro, aun estando dormido.","Hace que sucedan cosas extrañas cuando está cerca, como que los relojes vayan al revés.","Este Pokémon lo recuerda todo y nunca olvida lo que aprende, de ahí que sea tan inteligente.","Es muy fuerte, a pesar de su pequeño tamaño. Su dominio de varias artes marciales lo convierte en un rival duro de pelar.","El cinto antifuerza que lleva puesto limita sus movimientos. Sin él, resultaría imparable.","Un brazo le basta para mover montañas y, si usa los cuatro, asesta puñetazos de una potencia descomunal.","Prefiere lugares cálidos y húmedos. Atrapa pequeños Pokémon insectos con sus lianas para devorarlos.","Cuando tiene hambre, engulle a todo lo que se mueve. La pobre presa acaba disuelta en sus ácidos.","Atrae a su presa con un dulce aroma a miel. Una vez atrapada en la boca, la disuelve en tan solo un día, huesos incluidos.","A veces pueden encontrarse deshidratados en las playas, pero reviven al sumergirlos de nuevo en el agua.","Puede estirar y contraer con total libertad sus 80 tentáculos, con los que atrapa a su presa y le inyecta un veneno debilitante.","Se suele encontrar en senderos de montaña y sitios parecidos. Conviene andar con cuidado para no pisarlo sin querer y provocar su enfado.","Se le suele ver rodando montaña abajo. No evita los obstáculos, sino que los arrolla.","Nada más mudar la piel, su cuerpo se vuelve blando y blanquecino, pero se endurece al poco tiempo de entrar en contacto con el aire.","Es capaz de saltar muy alto. Absorbe el impacto del aterrizaje con sus robustas patas y pezuñas.","Le encanta galopar. Si ve algo más rápido, intentará alcanzarlo a toda velocidad.","Es increíblemente lento y perezoso. Se toma las cosas con calma, sin preocuparse por el paso del tiempo.","Lleva una vida tranquila cerca del mar. Si el Shellder de la cola se desprende, se convierte de nuevo en un Slowpoke.","Puede desafiar la gravedad desde su nacimiento. Flota en el aire gracias a las ondas electromagnéticas que emite.","Es capaz de elevar 2 °C la temperatura en un radio de 1 km emitiendo extrañas ondas electromagnéticas.","Vive cerca de cultivos de puerros. Como estos son cada vez más escasos, se cree que el número de Farfetch’d también ha disminuido.","Las diminutas alas apenas le permiten volar, pero puede correr a gran velocidad gracias a sus patas hiperdesarrolladas.","Este Pokémon surge al dividirse una de las cabezas de Doduo. Es capaz de correr por las praderas a 60 km/h.","Le encantan los lugares gélidos y disfruta nadando en aguas a temperaturas en torno a los -10 °C.","Su cuerpo es blanco como la nieve. Puede nadar plácidamente en mares gélidos gracias a su resistencia al frío.","Está hecho de lodo endurecido. Pocos se atreven a tocarlo debido a su pestilencia y composición nociva. Allá por donde pasa no crece la hierba.","Huele tan mal que puede provocar desmayos. Su nariz se ha atrofiado de tal manera que ha perdido por completo el sentido del olfato.","La dura concha que lo recubre resiste cualquier ataque, por lo que su frágil cuerpo solo queda expuesto cuando esta se abre.","Se protege con su concha, que es más dura que un diamante. Su capacidad de lanzar pinchos lo convierte en un rival temible.","Según dicen, aparece en edificios antiguos y deshabitados. Su cuerpo, de aspecto gaseoso, carece de una forma definida.","Sus lengüetazos le arrebatan la energía vital a su víctima y le causan unos temblores que no cesan hasta que fallece.","Sentir un escalofrío repentino es señal de que hay un Gengar cerca. Quien lo perciba puede convertirse en víctima de su maldición.","Cava a gran velocidad en busca de comida. Los Diglett convierten en su hogar los túneles que deja a su paso.","Si se duerme siempre en compañía de un Pokémon de esta especie, puede mostrar sueños que haya ingerido con anterioridad.","Conviene evitar el contacto visual en caso de encontrarse con este Pokémon, ya que puede hipnotizar con su péndulo.","Sus pinzas son armas muy potentes y, aunque en ocasiones se le rompen al atacar, le crecen de nuevo con rapidez.","Una de sus pinzas, enorme y dura como el acero, tiene 10 000 CV. No obstante, resulta demasiado pesada.","Se dice que se camufla como una Poké Ball. Al más mínimo estímulo se autodestruirá.","Almacena tal cantidad de energía eléctrica en su cuerpo que el más leve impacto puede provocar una gran explosión.","Las cabezas se atraen unas a otras y giran entre sí. Debe tener seis para equilibrarse.","El estrépito que causa se debe a que cada una de las tres cabezas habla y actúa de forma independiente, sin tener en cuenta a las demás.","Siempre lleva puesto el cráneo de su difunta madre. Su llanto resuena dentro como una triste melodía.","Este Pokémon ha dejado atrás su debilidad y se ha vuelto más feroz con el paso del tiempo. Blande su hueso con destreza.","La planta de los pies se le vuelve tan dura como el diamante al dar patadas a su oponente, hasta el punto de aniquilarlo.","Sus puñetazos, semejantes a una taladradora, pueden perforar un muro de hormigón como si nada.","Su lengua puede llegar a medir dos metros y la mueve con más soltura que las patas delanteras. Sus lametazos pueden causar parálisis.","A veces puede explotar sin avisar, ya que en lugares calurosos su gas interno se expande.","Este Pokémon se alimenta de los gases venenosos, los gérmenes y el polvo que encuentra en la basura.","Es algo simple y testarudo, y solo tiene una cosa en la cabeza. Si carga contra algo, no se detiene hasta caer rendido.","Pasar a ser bípedo le ha permitido desarrollar su inteligencia. La piel, rígida como una armadura, resiste incluso el magma.","Este amable Pokémon comparte sus nutritivos huevos con quien encuentre herido.","Se camufla tras una gran masa de lianas azules. Se dice que nunca dejan de crecer.","Cuida de la cría que lleva en la bolsa de su panza y se enfrenta a todo aquel que supone una amenaza para protegerla.","Si se siente en peligro, arrojará un potente chorro de agua o de una tinta especial por la boca.","Tocar sus aletas dorsales causa entumecimiento. Mientras duerme se agarra al coral con la cola para que no se lo lleve la corriente.","Durante la época de desove, se les suele ver nadando a contracorriente en ríos o remontando cascadas en grandes grupos.","Los machos usan el cuerno de la cabeza para horadar rocas en el lecho del río y construir allí su nido.","Aunque haya perdido partes de su cuerpo, le crecerán de nuevo siempre y cuando su parte central se mantenga intacta.","Su parte central se conoce como núcleo. Se cree que, cuando este brilla con siete colores, es señal de que se está comunicando.","Practica constantemente la pantomima. Tal es su maestría que puede convencer a quien lo observe de la existencia de algo que no es real.","Se agazapa en la hierba alta y salta de repente sobre el enemigo para hacerlo trizas con sus afiladas guadañas. Se mueve como un ninja.","Parece moverse como si estuviera bailando un ritmo de su propia invención. Mueve mucho las caderas al andar.","Cuando hay un apagón, es señal inequívoca de que este Pokémon se ha comido la energía de una central eléctrica.","Nace en cráteres de volcanes. Su cuerpo envuelto en llamas parece una bola de fuego.","Atrapa a su presa con las pinzas y aprieta fuerte. Habita en lugares cálidos, ya que el frío puede llegar a inmovilizarlo.","Un Pokémon violento que rebosa energía. Cuando echa a correr, no se detiene hasta que choca con algo.","Famoso por su ineptitud. Nada en todo tipo de aguas, ya sean mares, lagos, ríos o charcas.","Este Pokémon tan salvaje como destructivo es conocido por haber reducido a escombros ciudades enteras en el pasado.","Este amable Pokémon es capaz de comprender el lenguaje humano y deja que las personas monten en él para navegar por el mar.","Cuando se fija en un enemigo, su cuerpo se transforma en una copia casi perfecta del mismo.","Puede evolucionar a varias especies distintas. Su código genético es la clave para descifrar el misterio de dicha evolución.","Su estructura celular se parece a las moléculas de agua, por eso es invisible cuando está en este elemento.","Un Pokémon muy sensible que se entristece o enfada con mucha facilidad. Se carga de electricidad cada vez que cambia de humor.","La bolsa en el interior de su cuerpo le permite convertir el aire que aspira en llamas a 1700 °C que luego exhala por la boca.","Se creía que sería el único Pokémon capaz de volar por el espacio, pero aún no se ha visto a ninguno que lo haya conseguido.","Este antiguo Pokémon fue regenerado a partir de un fósil. Solía nadar en antiguos mares moviendo con destreza sus 10 tentáculos.","Poseía unos colmillos afilados, pero el excesivo tamaño de su concha le impedía moverse con libertad, lo que acabó provocando su extinción.","Este Pokémon se regeneró a partir de un fósil. Usaba los ojos de la espalda para explorar su entorno al ocultarse en el lecho marino.","Este Pokémon es un rápido nadador gracias a su cuerpo esbelto. Con las garras despedaza las presas que atrapa para sorber sus fluidos.","Este Pokémon feroz, extinto hace siglos, fue regenerado a partir de ADN extraído de un ámbar.","Engulle cualquier cosa, incluso comida mohosa, sin que esto le cause dolor de estómago.","Un Pokémon pájaro legendario. En invierno, crea nieve congelando la humedad del aire.","Este Pokémon pájaro legendario solo aparece cuando el cielo se torna oscuro y caen rayos sin cesar.","Un Pokémon pájaro legendario. Cuando aletea sus flamígeras alas, la oscura noche se torna roja.","La existencia de este mítico Pokémon fue confirmada no hace mucho por un pescador que capturó uno.","Según un testigo, está rodeado por una extraña aura, que le da un aspecto misterioso y místico.","Se dice que este Pokémon vive en algún lugar del mar y que también vuela. De todos modos, solo es un rumor.","Su ADN es casi el mismo que el de Mew. Sin embargo, su tamaño y carácter son muy diferentes.","Si se observa a través de un microscopio, puede distinguirse cuán corto, fino y delicado es el pelaje de este Pokémon.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"omegaruby":[null,"A Bulbasaur es fácil verle echándose una siesta al sol. La semilla que tiene en el lomo va creciendo cada vez más a medida que absorbe los rayos del sol.","Este Pokémon lleva un bulbo en el lomo y, para poder con su peso, tiene unas patas y un tronco gruesos y fuertes. Si empieza a pasar más tiempo al sol, será porque el bulbo está a punto de hacerse una flor grande.","Venusaur tiene una flor enorme en el lomo que, según parece, adquiere unos colores muy vivos si está bien nutrido y le da mucho el sol. El aroma delicado de la flor tiene un efecto relajante en el ánimo de las personas.","La llama que tiene en la punta de la cola arde según sus sentimientos. Llamea levemente cuando está alegre y arde vigorosamente cuando está enfadado.","Charmeleon no tiene reparo en acabar con su rival usando las afiladas garras que tiene. Si su enemigo es fuerte, se vuelve agresivo, y la llama que tiene en el extremo de la cola empieza a arder con mayor intensidad tornándose azulada.","Charizard se dedica a volar por los cielos en busca de oponentes fuertes. Echa fuego por la boca y es capaz de derretir cualquier cosa. No obstante, si su rival es más débil que él, no usará este ataque.","El caparazón de Squirtle no le sirve de protección únicamente. Su forma redondeada y las hendiduras que tiene le ayudan a deslizarse en el agua y le permiten nadar a gran velocidad.","Tiene una cola larga y cubierta de un pelo abundante y grueso que se torna más oscuro a medida que crece. Los arañazos que tiene en el caparazón dan fe de lo buen guerrero que es.","Blastoise lanza chorros de agua con gran precisión por los tubos que le salen del caparazón que tiene en la espalda. Puede disparar chorros de agua con tanta puntería que no fallaría al tirar contra una lata pequeña a 50 m.","Caterpie tiene un apetito voraz. Es capaz de devorar hojas que superen su tamaño en un abrir y cerrar de ojos. Atención a la antena que tiene: libera un hedor realmente fuerte.","La capa que recubre el cuerpo de este Pokémon es tan dura como una plancha de hierro. Metapod apenas se mueve. Permanece inmóvil para que las vísceras evolucionen dentro de la coraza que le rodea.","Butterfree tiene una habilidad especial para encontrar delicioso polen en las flores. Puede localizar, extraer y transportar polen de flores que estén floreciendo a 10 km de distancia de su nido.","Weedle tiene un finísimo sentido del olfato. Es capaz de distinguir las hojas que le gustan de las que no le gustan olisqueando un poco con la gran nariz que tiene.","Kakuna permanece prácticamente inmóvil al encaramarse a los árboles, aunque la actividad interna de su organismo tiene un ritmo frenético, pues se prepara para su evolución. Prueba de esto es la alta temperatura de su caparazón.","Los Beedrill defienden su territorio a toda costa. No es conveniente acercarse a su colmena, por seguridad. Si se les molesta, todo un enjambre atacará ferozmente.","Pidgey tiene un sentido de la orientación muy desarrollado. Es capaz de regresar a su nido, por lejos que se encuentre de las zonas que le resultan familiares.","Pidgeotto se apodera de una zona muy vasta como su territorio y la sobrevuela para controlarla. Si alguien invade su espacio vital, no tendrá ningún reparo en castigarlo con sus afiladas garras.","El plumaje de este Pokémon es bonito e hipnótico. Muchos Entrenadores se quedan embobados ante la belleza impactante de las plumas que tiene en la cabeza; lo que les lleva a elegir a Pidgeot como su Pokémon.","Rattata es cauto como él solo. Hasta cuando duerme mueve las orejas para oír todos los ruidos. No es nada delicado a la hora de elegir su hábitat. Cualquier sitio es bueno para cavar su madriguera.","A Raticate le crecen los incisivos firmes y fuertes. Para mantenerlos afilados roe troncos y rocas, e incluso las paredes de las casas.","Spearow pía con tanta fuerza que se le puede oír a 1 km de distancia. Si al agudo chillido le sigue una especie de eco, estaremos oyendo la respuesta de otros Spearow que contestan ante el aviso de peligro.","A Fearow se le reconoce por tener un pescuezo y un pico largos que le permiten cazar en tierra y agua. Tiene una gran habilidad moviendo el fino pico para atrapar a sus presas.","Ekans se enrosca para descansar. Adoptando esta posición puede responder rápidamente a cualquier amenaza que le aceche desde cualquier lugar, levantando la cabeza con una feroz mirada.","Este Pokémon es tremendamente fuerte, puede oprimir cualquier cosa con su cuerpo y hasta es capaz de estrujar un barril de acero. Una vez que Arbok se enrosca a su víctima, no hay forma de escapar de su asfixiante abrazo.","Cada vez que un Pikachu se encuentra con algo nuevo, le lanza una descarga eléctrica. Cuando se ve alguna baya chamuscada, es muy probable que sea obra de un Pikachu, ya que a veces no controlan la intensidad de la descarga.","Si las bolsas de los mofletes se le cargan demasiado, Raichu planta la cola en el suelo para liberar electricidad. Es común encontrar zonas chamuscadas cerca de la madriguera de este Pokémon.","Sandshrew es capaz de absorber agua y no perder ni una gota, algo que le permite sobrevivir en el desierto. Este Pokémon se enrosca para defenderse de los enemigos.","Sandslash está recubierto de duras púas que son partes endurecidas de la piel. Suele mudarlas una vez al año; debajo de las viejas púas crecen unas nuevas que las sustituyen.","Nidoran♀ tiene púas que segregan un veneno muy potente. Se piensa que las desarrolló como protección del cuerpo tan pequeño que tiene. Cuando se enfada, libera una horrible sustancia tóxica por el cuerno.","Cuando están en familia o con sus amigos, esconden las púas para evitar accidentes. Según parece, se alteran bastante si se separan del grupo.","Nidoqueen tiene el cuerpo totalmente recubierto de escamas durísimas. Suele lanzar por los aires a sus rivales de los violentos golpes que les propina. Cuando se trata de defender a sus crías, alcanza su nivel máximo de fuerza.","Nidoran♂ ha desarrollado músculos para mover las orejas y orientarlas en cualquier dirección. De este modo, es capaz de captar hasta el sonido más leve.","Nidorino tiene un cuerno de dureza superior a la del diamante. Si siente una presencia hostil, se le erizan las púas del lomo enseguida y carga contra el enemigo con todas sus fuerzas.","La gruesa cola de Nidoking encierra una fuerza realmente destructora. Con una vez que la agite, es capaz de tumbar una torre metálica de transmisión. Una vez que este Pokémon se desboca, no hay quien lo pare.","Siempre que hay luna llena, salen en grupo para jugar. Al amanecer, los Clefairy, agotados, regresan a sus refugios de montaña para dormir acurrucados unos con otros.","Clefable se mueve dando saltitos como si fuera haciendo uso de las alas. Estos pequeños brincos le permiten caminar por el agua. De todos es sabido que le encanta darse paseos por los lagos en tranquilas noches de luna llena.","Al nacer, Vulpix tiene una cola blanca que se divide en seis si recibe cariño por parte de su Entrenador. Las seis colas se le rizan de forma majestuosa.","Ninetales emite una siniestra luz a través de los brillantes ojos rojos que tiene, para conseguir controlar del todo la mente de su rival. Dicen que este Pokémon llega a vivir mil años.","Jigglypuff tiene unas cuerdas vocales que ajustan sin problema la longitud de onda de su voz. Este Pokémon usa la habilidad que tiene para cantar con la longitud de onda necesaria para adormecer a su rival.","Wigglytuff tiene unos ojos enormes con forma de platillo, que siempre están cubiertos de lágrimas. Si se le metiera algo en el ojo, enseguida se le saldría solo.","Durante el día, Zubat permanece inmóvil y a oscuras. Si este Pokémon pasara mucho tiempo expuesto al sol, correría el peligro de sufrir quemaduras.","A Golbat le encanta chuparles la sangre a los seres vivos. Este Pokémon es más activo en la oscuridad de la noche. Es al caer la noche cuando sale a revolotear y a buscar sangre fresca.","Durante el día, Oddish se entierra en el suelo para absorber nutrientes valiéndose de todo el cuerpo. Cuanto más fértil sea el suelo, mayor brillo tendrá en las hojas.","Gloom libera un fétido olor por el pistilo de la flor. Cuando está en peligro, el hedor se intensifica. Si este Pokémon está tranquilo y no se siente amenazado, no libera el desagradable olor.","El polen que contienen las esporas tóxicas de Vileplume causa unos ataques de alergia muy agudos. Por eso, no es aconsejable acercarse a ninguna flor selvática, por muy bonita que sea.","Paras lleva dos setas parásitas a cuestas llamadas tochukaso. Estas crecen alimentándose de los nutrientes de este Pokémon de tipo Bicho y Planta que les sirve de huésped. Las setas se usan como elixir de vida.","Parasect es conocido por destruir en plaga grandes árboles, absorbiendo los nutrientes que tienen en la parte baja del tronco y las raíces. Cuando un árbol azotado por la plaga muere, los Parasect van a por el siguiente al instante.","Dicen que durante su evolución Venonat desarrolló una fina capa de espeso pelo alrededor de todo el cuerpo para protegerse. Tiene unos ojos tan grandes que no hay presa que le pase desapercibida.","Venomoth es nocturno, solo actúa en la oscuridad. Su alimento preferido son los pequeños insectos que se concentran cerca de los focos de luz en la oscuridad de la noche.","En la mayoría de las granjas se suelen criar Diglett por la sencilla razón de que, excaven donde excaven, dejan la tierra perfectamente labrada para sembrar. El terreno queda listo para plantar ricas verduras.","Los Dugtrio son trillizos que se originaron a partir de un solo cuerpo, por eso piensan de la misma forma. A la hora de excavar, trabajan en equipo y sin descanso.","Meowth retrae las afiladas uñas de sus zarpas para caminar a hurtadillas, dando sigilosos pasos para pasar inadvertido. No se sabe muy bien por qué, pero este Pokémon adora las monedas brillantes que resplandecen con la luz.","Persian tiene seis llamativos bigotes que le dan un aspecto feroz. Además, le sirven para detectar el movimiento del aire, delator de la presencia cercana de algún Pokémon. Si se le agarra por los bigotes, se vuelve dócil.","Psyduck tiene un extraño poder, que consiste en generar ondas cerebrales iguales a las que se generan cuando se está dormido. Este descubrimiento levantó una gran polémica entre eruditos.","Golduck alcanza una velocidad de vértigo gracias a las aletas palmípedas de las extremidades y a la forma aerodinámica de su cuerpo. Realmente, la velocidad de este Pokémon supera la de cualquier nadador.","Cuando Mankey empieza a temblar y a respirar con más intensidad, seguro que va a enfadarse. Aunque prever su enfado no sirve de nada porque alcanza un estado de rabia tan rápido que no hay escapatoria.","Cuando Primeape se enfada, se le acelera el ritmo cardíaco y se le fortalecen los músculos. Con todo, pierde en inteligencia.","Growlithe tiene un sentido del olfato excepcional y una memoria sensitiva tremenda, nunca olvida una esencia. Este Pokémon saca provecho de este don para identificar las sensaciones que tienen otros seres vivos.","Arcanine es conocido por lo veloz que es. Dicen que es capaz de correr 10 000 km en 24 horas. El fuego que arde con vigor en el interior de este Pokémon constituye su fuente de energía.","Poliwag tiene una piel muy fina. Tanto que es posible entrever a través de la misma las vísceras en espiral que tiene. La piel, aunque fina, tiene la ventaja de ser flexible y hacer rebotar hasta los colmillos más afilados.","La piel de Poliwhirl está siempre húmeda y lubricada con un fluido viscoso. Gracias a esta película resbaladiza, puede escapar de las garras del enemigo, resbalándosele de las zarpas en pleno combate.","Poliwrath tiene unos músculos fornidos y muy desarrollados, por lo que nunca se agota. Es tan fuerte e incansable que cruzar el océano a nado no le supone ningún esfuerzo.","Abra duerme 18 horas al día, pero puede detectar a cualquier enemigo que se le acerque mientras duerme. En una situación así, usa Teletransporte para protegerse.","Kadabra emite unas ondas alfa muy particulares que provocan dolores de cabeza a los demás. Solo aquellos que tengan gran poder mental podrán optar a ser Entrenador de este Pokémon.","El cerebro de Alakazam nunca deja de crecer y por eso al cuello le cuesta sostener el peso de la cabeza. Este Pokémon usa sus poderes psicoquinéticos para mantener en alto la cabeza.","Gracias a su portentosa musculatura, Machop no se agota por mucho esfuerzo que haga. Este Pokémon es tan fuerte que puede derrotar a cien personas adultas de una sola vez.","Los entrenados músculos de Machoke son tan fuertes como el acero. Este Pokémon es tan fuerte que puede levantar con un solo dedo a un luchador de sumo.","Machamp es tan fuerte que puede derribar lo que quiera. Sin embargo, cuando tiene que realizar una tarea que requiere delicadeza y destreza, se le enredan los brazos. Este Pokémon pasa a la acción sin pensar.","Bellsprout tiene un cuerpo delgado y flexible que le permite inclinarse y balancearse para esquivar los ataques. Este Pokémon escupe por la boca un fluido corrosivo capaz de hacer que se derrita hasta el hierro.","Weepinbell tiene un gancho a modo de extremidad superior trasera, que usa por la noche para colgarse de una rama y echarse a dormir. Si se mueve mientras duerme, puede acabar en el suelo.","Victreebel tiene una enredadera que le sale de la cabeza y que agita a modo de señuelo para atraer a sus presas y así engullirlas por sorpresa cuando estas se aproximan incautas.","Tentacool está compuesto en su mayor parte por agua. Si se le saca del mar, se secará y se quedará acartonado. Si este Pokémon se deshidrata, hay que echarlo inmediatamente de vuelta al mar.","Tentacruel tiene unas enormes esferas rojas en la cabeza, que brillan antes de lanzar una descarga ultrasónica a lo que le rodea. Este estallido crea unas olas tremendas a su alrededor.","Cuanto más larga es la vida de Geodude, mayor es el desgaste y la erosión que sufre, y más redondeada la forma que va adquiriendo. Sin embargo, el corazón permanece siempre duro, rocoso y tosco.","Graveler crece alimentándose a base de piedras. Y, según parece, las prefiere cubiertas de musgo. Cada día se abre camino comiéndose una tonelada de rocas.","Golem vive en las montañas. Si se produce un gran terremoto, estos Pokémon descienden rodando en masa por las laderas.","Al nacer, Ponyta es muy débil y apenas puede ponerse en pie. Con todo, se va haciendo más fuerte al tropezarse y caerse en su intento por seguir a sus progenitores.","A Rapidash se le suele ver trotando sin rumbo fijo por los campos y llanos. Cuando tiene que ir a algún sitio en concreto, se le aviva el fuego de las melenas y emprende el galope llameante llegando a los 240 km/h.","Slowpoke usa la cola para atrapar a sus presas metiéndola bajo el agua en las riberas de los ríos. Con todo, es olvidadizo, se le puede pasar lo que estaba haciendo y quedarse días enteros holgazaneando en la orilla.","Slowbro lleva en la cola un Shellder enganchado, sujeto por los dientes. Como Slowbro no puede usar la cola para pescar, se mete en el agua de mala gana en busca de sus presas.","Magnemite se engancha a las líneas de tensión para nutrirse de electricidad. Cuando se producen apagones en las casas, es aconsejable revisar el automático y comprobar que no hay Pokémon de este tipo colgados de la caja de fusibles.","Magneton emite una fuerte energía magnética que causa estragos en los instrumentos mecánicos. Por ello, en las ciudades se avisa con sirenas cuando hay concentraciones de estos Pokémon.","Al parecer, entre los puerros que suelen llevar los Farfetch’d, los hay mejores y peores. A estos Pokémon se les ha visto luchar entre ellos por los mejores puerros.","Las dos cabezas de Doduo duermen de forma independiente, siempre por turnos. Mientras una duerme, la otra hace de centinela por si aparecen enemigos.","Según parece, las cabezas no son las únicas partes del cuerpo que tiene triplicadas. Dodrio también tiene tres corazones y tres pares de pulmones. Con esta constitución, puede correr largas distancias sin cansarse.","Seel busca a sus presas en aguas heladas, bajo las capas de hielo. Cuando necesita respirar, abre un agujerito en el hielo con la afilada protuberancia que tiene encima de la cabeza.","A Dewgong le encanta dormitar sobre la frialdad del hielo. Antiguamente, algún que otro marino lo confundió con una sirena al verlo dormido sobre un glaciar.","El elástico cuerpo de lodo de Grimer le permite colarse por cualquier orificio, sea del tamaño que sea. Este Pokémon entra en los bajantes de las cloacas para beberse el agua sucia.","Muk emana por todo el cuerpo un fluido maloliente que obliga a taparse la nariz. Con solo una gota de la sustancia que exuda este Pokémon, se podría contaminar un estanque.","Por la noche, este Pokémon usa la ancha lengua que tiene para hacer un agujero en el fondo del mar y echarse a dormir. Mientras duerme, Shellder cierra la concha, pero deja la lengua por fuera.","Cloyster es capaz de nadar por el mar. Su técnica consiste en tragar agua y expulsarla por el conducto que tiene en la parte trasera. Este mismo sistema es el que usa para lanzar los pinchos que tiene alrededor de la concha.","Gastly está compuesto en gran medida de materia gaseosa. Cuando hay viento, el aire arrastra parte de esta materia y el Pokémon mengua. Suelen agruparse bajo los aleros de las casas para resguardarse del viento.","Haunter es un Pokémon peligroso. Si se ve alguno flotando en la oscuridad y haciendo señas, conviene no acercarse. Este Pokémon intentará robarle la energía a su presa a base de lametazos.","Si alguien ve que su sombra le adelanta de repente en una noche oscura, es muy probable que lo que esté viendo no sea su sombra, sino a un Gengar haciéndose pasar por la misma.","Onix tiene un imán en el cerebro, que actúa como una brújula para no perder la orientación cuando está cavando túneles. A medida que crece, se le redondea y suaviza el cuerpo.","Si a alguien le pica la nariz mientras duerme, seguro que es porque tiene a uno de estos Pokémon cerca de la almohada intentando sacarle los sueños por la nariz para comérselos.","Hypno lleva un péndulo en la mano. El balanceo y el brillo que tiene sumen al rival en un estado de hipnosis profundo. Mientras busca a su presa, saca brillo al péndulo.","Krabby vive en la playa, enterrado en agujeros en la arena. Cuando en las playas de arena fina escasea la comida, es común ver a estos Pokémon echando un pulso panza contra panza en defensa de su territorio.","Kingler tiene una pinza enorme y descomunal que usa agitándola en el aire para comunicarse con otros. Lo malo es que, al pesarle tanto, se cansa enseguida.","Voltorb fue visto por primera vez en una empresa encargada de comercializar Poké Balls. La conexión que existe entre aquella primera vez que se le vio y el hecho de que se parece mucho a una Poké Ball sigue siendo un misterio.","Los Electrode se alimentan de la electricidad de la atmósfera. En días de tormenta con rayos, es fácil verlos explotando por todos lados tras haber consumido demasiada electricidad.","Este Pokémon está compuesto de seis huevos que forman una tupida piña que va girando. Cuando se empiezan a resquebrajar las cáscaras, no hay duda de que Exeggcute está a punto de evolucionar.","Exeggutor es originario del trópico. Cuando se expone a un sol intenso, le empiezan a crecer las cabezas. Hay quien dice que, cuando las cabezas caen al suelo, se unen para formar un Exeggcute.","A Cubone le ahoga la pena porque no volverá a ver jamás a su madre. La luna le recuerda a veces a ella, y se pone a llorar. Los churretes que tiene en el cráneo que lleva puesto son debidos a las lágrimas que derrama.","Marowak es la forma evolucionada de Cubone. Es más fuerte porque ha superado la pena por la pérdida de su madre. El ánimo de este Pokémon, ya curtido y fortalecido, no es muy fácil de alterar.","Hitmonlee tiene la facilidad de encoger y estirar las patas. Con extremidades tan flexibles, propina unas patadas demoledoras. Tras la lucha, se masajea las piernas y relaja los músculos para descansar.","Dicen que Hitmonchan tiene el mismo ímpetu que un boxeador entrenándose para un campeonato mundial. Este Pokémon tiene un espíritu indomable que nunca se doblega ante la adversidad.","Cada vez que Lickitung se encuentra con algo que no conoce, le da un lametazo. Es la forma que tiene de memorizar las cosas, por la textura y el sabor. No soporta los sabores ácidos.","Si Koffing se pone nervioso, aumenta el nivel de toxicidad de los gases que tiene y los expulsa por todo el cuerpo. También suele hincharse mucho hasta llegar a explotar.","A Weezing le encantan los gases que emanan de los desperdicios que quedan en la cocina. Este Pokémon busca casas sucias y descuidadas para crear su hogar. De noche, cuando los habitantes de la casa duermen, va a por la basura.","Rhyhorn corre en línea recta arrasando todo lo que encuentra en su camino. Aun estrellándose de cabeza contra un bloque de acero, no se vería afectado; a lo sumo, notaría algo de dolor al día siguiente.","Rhydon tiene un cuerno capaz de horadar hasta un diamante en bruto y con una sacudida de la cola puede derribar un edificio. La piel de este Pokémon es muy fuerte; ni los disparos de un cañón le arañarían.","Chansey pone a diario huevos con un valor nutritivo altísimo. Están tan ricos que hasta quien no tenga hambre se los comerá en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.","A Tangela se le desprenden los tentáculos con facilidad en cuanto se los agarras. Y no solo no le duele, sino que le resulta muy útil para escapar rápido. Además, al día siguiente le crecen otros.","No es recomendable molestar ni intentar atrapar a crías de Kangaskhan mientras estén jugando, ya que seguro que su madre anda cerca y reaccionará con enfado y violencia.","Horsea come insectos pequeños y el musgo de las rocas. Si las corrientes del océano cobran fuerza, este Pokémon se anclará con la cola a rocas o corales para evitar que las aguas lo arrastren.","Seadra se echa a dormir tras abrirse un hueco entre las ramas de los corales. Los pescadores de coral suelen pincharse con las púas venenosas de estos Pokémon si no los ven.","Goldeen es un bello Pokémon que mueve con elegancia las aletas en el agua. Con todo, no hay que bajar la guardia, en cualquier momento puede embestir con el cuerno.","En otoño, se ven ejemplares de Seaking macho danzando en las riberas de los ríos para cortejar a las hembras. En esta época, la coloración de este Pokémon alcanza sus niveles máximos de belleza.","Staryu posee un órgano central, conocido como su núcleo, que brilla con una luz roja. A finales de verano, pueden verse en la playa los núcleos de estos Pokémon brillando como las estrellas del cielo.","La parte central de Starmie, el núcleo brillante, resplandece con siete colores distintos. Debido a su naturaleza luminosa, a este Pokémon se le ha dado el apelativo de la Gema del Mar.","Mr. Mime es un experto en pantomima. Con sus gestos y movimientos es capaz de convencer a sus espectadores de que algo existe, cuando en realidad no es así. Pero, cuando el público se lo cree, las ilusiones se hacen realidad.","Es espectacular ver lo rápido que es Scyther. Su increíble velocidad refuerza el efecto del par de guadañas que tiene en los brazos, que ya son de por sí contundentes; rebanan gruesos troncos de un tajo.","Jynx camina con ritmo, balanceándose y moviendo las caderas como si estuviera bailando. Realiza unos movimientos tan vistosos y atractivos que no hay quien pueda resistirse a mover las caderas.","Al desatarse una tormenta, bandadas de estos Pokémon se enfrentan entre sí para ver quién alcanza antes sitios altos en los que suelan caer rayos. Hay ciudades que usan Electabuzz en lugar de pararrayos.","Al luchar, Magmar expulsa violentas llamas por todo el cuerpo para intimidar a su rival. Estos estallidos de fuego crean ondas de calor que abrasan la hierba y los árboles que haya en las proximidades.","Pinsir es sorprendentemente fuerte. Puede agarrar con los cuernos a un rival que pese el doble que él y levantarlo por los aires. En zonas frías, los movimientos de este Pokémon se vuelven lentos.","Este Pokémon no está contento a menos que esté continuamente de aquí para allá. Si no hay rival que luche contra Tauros, se estampa contra árboles grandes para calmarse y los embiste para echarlos abajo.","Magikarp es el triste ejemplo de un Pokémon capaz únicamente de saltar y salpicar. Esta conducta llevó a científicos a estudiarlo en profundidad.","Cuando Magikarp evoluciona y se convierte en Gyarados, sufre un cambio estructural en las células del cerebro. Dicen que esa transformación es la causa de la naturaleza violenta y salvaje de este Pokémon.","Por culpa de la gente, Lapras está casi en extinción. Dicen que, al anochecer, se pone a cantar quejicoso mientras busca a los miembros de su especie que puedan quedar.","Ditto reorganiza la estructura de sus células para adoptar otras formas. Pero, como intente transformarse en algo guiándose por los datos que tenga almacenados en la memoria, habrá detalles que se le escapen.","La configuración genética de Eevee le permite mutar y adaptarse enseguida a cualquier medio en el que viva. La evolución de este Pokémon suele ser posible gracias a las radiaciones emitidas por varias piedras.","Vaporeon sufrió una mutación repentina y desarrolló aletas y branquias que le permiten vivir bajo el agua. Asimismo, este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de controlar las aguas.","Las células de Jolteon generan un nivel bajo de electricidad, cuya intensidad aumenta con la electricidad estática que acumula en un pelaje formado por agujas cargadas de electricidad. Esta característica le permite lanzar rayos.","La suavidad del pelaje de Flareon tiene una función clara: libera calor para que el Pokémon no se asfixie. La temperatura corporal de este Pokémon puede alcanzar los 900 °C.","Porygon es capaz de convertirse otra vez en datos informáticos y de entrar en el ciberespacio. Tiene protección anticopia, así que es imposible duplicarlo.","Omanyte es uno de esos Pokémon ancestrales que se extinguieron hace muchísimo tiempo y que la gente ha recuperado a partir de fósiles. Si un enemigo le ataca, se esconderá dentro de la dura concha que tiene.","Omastar usa los tentáculos para atrapar a su presa. Se cree que el motivo de su extinción fue el tamaño y el peso que llegó a alcanzar la concha que lleva a cuestas, lo que le entorpeció y ralentizó los movimientos.","Kabuto es un Pokémon regenerado a partir de un fósil, aunque, en raras ocasiones, se han encontrado casos de ejemplares vivos en estado salvaje. En 300 millones de años, este Pokémon no ha cambiado en nada.","Hace mucho tiempo, Kabutops buceaba para atrapar a sus presas. Parece ser que en algún momento cambió de hábitat y se adaptó a vivir en tierra firme. La transformación que se aprecia en las patas y branquias así lo confirma.","Los orígenes de Aerodactyl datan de la era de los dinosaurios. Se regeneró a partir de material genético contenido en ámbar. Se supone que fue el amo de los cielos en épocas pasadas.","Un día cualquiera en la vida de Snorlax consiste en comer y dormir. Es un Pokémon tan dócil que es fácil ver niños usando la gran panza que tiene como lugar de juegos.","Articuno es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que puede controlar el hielo. El batir de sus alas congela el aire. Dicen que consigue hacer que nieve cuando vuela.","Zapdos es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que tiene la habilidad de controlar la electricidad. Suele vivir en nubarrones. Este Pokémon gana mucha fuerza si le alcanzan los rayos.","Moltres es un Pokémon pájaro legendario que tiene la habilidad de controlar el fuego. Dicen que, si resulta herido, se sumerge en el líquido magma de un volcán para arder y curarse.","Dratini muda y se despoja de la vieja piel continuamente. Es algo que necesita hacer porque la energía que tiene en su interior no para de alcanzar niveles incontrolables.","Dragonair acumula grandes cantidades de energía dentro de sí. Dicen que altera el clima de la zona en la que está descargando energía a través de las esferas de cristal que tiene en el cuello y en la cola.","Dragonite es capaz de dar la vuelta al mundo en solo 16 horas. Es un Pokémon de buen corazón que guía hasta tierra a los barcos que se encuentran perdidos en plena tormenta y a punto de zozobrar.","Mewtwo fue creado por manipulación genética. Pero, a pesar de que el hombre creó su cuerpo, dotar a Mewtwo de un corazón compasivo quedó en el olvido.","Dicen que Mew posee el mapa genético de todos los Pokémon. Puede hacerse invisible cuando quiere, así que pasa desapercibido cada vez que se le acerca alguien.","Al luchar, Chikorita agita la hoja que tiene para mantener a raya al rival. Pero, al mismo tiempo, libera una suave fragancia que apacigua el encuentro y crea un ambiente agradable y de amistad.","Bayleef tiene un collar de hojas alrededor del cuello y un brote de un árbol en cada una de ellas. La fragancia que desprenden estos brotes anima a la gente.","La fragancia de la flor de Meganium aplaca y suaviza los ánimos. Al luchar, este Pokémon libera mayor cantidad de esencia para disminuir el ánimo de combate de su oponente.","Cyndaquil se protege soltando llamas por el lomo. Cuando está enfadado, las llamas son fieras, pero, si está cansado, solo consigue echar algunas chispas que no llegan a cuajar en una completa combustión.","Quilava mantiene a sus rivales a raya con la intensidad de sus llamas y las ráfagas de aire ígneo que producen. También aprovecha su espectacular agilidad para esquivar ataques a la vez que abrasa al rival con sus llamas.","Typhlosion se oculta tras un trémulo haz de calor que crea mediante sus intensas y sofocantes llamaradas. Este Pokémon causa explosiones de fuego que reducen todo a cenizas.","Totodile tiene cuerpo pequeño, pero fuertes mandíbulas. A veces, piensa que solo está dando un mordisquito y hace unas heridas bastante considerables.","Una vez que Croconaw le ha clavado los colmillos a su presa, es imposible que escape porque los tiene hacia adentro como si fueran anzuelos. Cuando Croconaw hinca los dientes, no hay escapatoria.","Feraligatr intimida a sus oponentes abriendo las grandes fauces que tiene. En combate, golpea el suelo bruscamente con las gruesas y fuertes patas traseras que tiene para cargar contra su rival a una velocidad de vértigo.","Sentret no duerme a menos que otro haga guardia. El que hace de centinela lo despertará al mínimo signo de peligro. Cuando este Pokémon se separa de su manada, es incapaz de echarse a dormir, presa del miedo.","Furret es de constitución muy delgada. En combate le resulta útil porque puede escabullirse con habilidad por cualquier huequito y escapar. A pesar de que tiene patas cortas, es ágil y veloz.","Hoothoot tiene un órgano interno que identifica y percibe la rotación de la tierra. Gracias a este órgano, el Pokémon ulula todos los días a la misma hora.","Noctowl no falla a la hora de cazar a su presa en la oscuridad. El éxito se lo debe a una vista privilegiada, que le permite ver donde apenas hay luz, y a las ligeras y flexibles alas que tiene, que no hacen ruido alguno al volar.","Ledyba segrega un fluido aromático por los seis puntos de unión que tiene entre las patas y el cuerpo. A través de este fluido se comunica con otros y les informa acerca de sus sentimientos variando la esencia.","Dicen que en zonas en las que el aire está limpio, en las que se ven las estrellas, hay enormes poblaciones de Ledian. La razón es muy sencilla: este Pokémon usa la luz de las estrellas como fuente de energía.","La tela que teje Spinarak puede considerarse como su segundo sistema nervioso. Dicen que puede adivinar qué tipo de presa ha caído en su red con solo observar las leves vibraciones de los hilos de la tela.","Ariados tiene unas patas con forma de garfio que le permiten correr por techos y superficies verticales. Este Pokémon oprime al rival con una tela de araña fina y resistente.","Cuando este Pokémon vuela batiendo solo las alas delanteras o traseras, es porque lleva volando bastante tiempo. Cuando se cansa, Crobat alterna las alas.","Chinchou libera cargas eléctricas positivas y negativas a través de las dos antenas que tiene para que su rival pierda el conocimiento. Asimismo, usa los destellos de electricidad para comunicarse con otros.","A Lanturn lo llaman la Estrella del Fondo del Mar por la antena iluminada que tiene. Este Pokémon produce luz creando una reacción química entre una bacteria y los fluidos corporales de la antena.","A Pichu le resulta más fácil cargarse de electricidad en días de nubarrones o cuando sopla un aire muy seco. Es posible oír la electricidad estática que emana de este Pokémon.","Cuando hay lluvia de estrellas, a los Cleffa se les puede ver danzando en círculos durante toda la noche. Solo paran cuando rompe el día; entonces, dejan de bailar y calman su sed con el rocío de la mañana.","Las cuerdas vocales de Igglybuff no están suficientemente desarrolladas. Si tuviera que cantar mucho, se haría daño en la garganta. Este Pokémon suele hacer gárgaras con agua pura de manantial.","Togepi usa los sentimientos positivos de compasión y alegría que desprenden las personas y los Pokémon. Este Pokémon almacena sentimientos de felicidad en su interior y después los comparte con otros.","Dicen que Togetic es un Pokémon que trae buena suerte y que, si detecta a alguien que es puro de corazón, sale para compartir su alegría con él.","Natu no puede volar porque las alas no le han crecido lo suficiente. Si alguien cruza la mirada con él, se la devolverá fijamente, aunque, si hace el mínimo movimiento, huirá dando saltitos para ponerse a salvo.","Xatu permanece de pie inmóvil y tranquilo en el mismo sitio durante todo el día. Se cree que no se mueve por temor a lo que ha visto que ocurrirá en el futuro.","Mareep tiene un pelaje lanudo suave que produce carga estática por el roce. Cuanto más se carga de electricidad estática, más brilla la bombilla que tiene en el extremo de la cola.","La calidad de la lana de Flaaffy varía para poder generar mucha electricidad estática con muy poca cantidad de lana. Las zonas suaves de la piel en las que no tiene pelaje están protegidas contra la electricidad.","Ampharos desprende tanta luz que es posible verle hasta desde el espacio. Antes, la gente usaba su luz como sistema de comunicación para enviarse señales.","Cuando Bellossom se expone a gran cantidad de luz solar, le empiezan a girar las hojas que le rodean. La danza de este Pokémon es famosa en las zonas del sur.","La cola de Marill contiene un aceite que hace las veces de chaleco salvavidas. Si ves una moviéndose en el agua, seguro que debajo hay un Marill medio sumergido buscando plantas acuáticas para comer.","Azumarill puede hacer burbujas de aire si ve a algún Pokémon que esté a punto de ahogarse. Estas burbujas de aire son básicas para que los Pokémon puedan seguir respirando.","Sudowoodo se camufla adoptando la imagen de un árbol para que no le ataque ningún enemigo. El problema viene en invierno, ya que las extremidades superiores tienen color verde y es fácil identificarle.","El mechón rizado de Politoed confirma su condición de rey. Dicen que cuanto más le crece y más se le riza, mayor es el respeto que recibe de sus súbditos.","Este Pokémon flota en el aire y se deja llevar. Cuando percibe que el viento va a cambiar a fuerte, Hoppip entrelaza sus hojas con otros Hoppip para hacer resistencia y evitar salir volando por la fuerza de la corriente.","Skiploom florece cuando la temperatura llega a 18 °C. La apertura de los pétalos varía según la temperatura que haga. Por este motivo, la gente lo usa a veces a modo de termómetro.","Jumpluff se vale de los cálidos vientos del sur para volar a tierras lejanas. Si llega a zonas de aire frío en pleno vuelo, descenderá y tomará tierra.","La cola de Aipom termina en una especie de mano a la que, con un poco de cabeza, se le puede dar muy buen uso. Pero hay un problema: como se ha acostumbrado a usarla mucho, las de verdad se le han vuelto algo torponas.","Sunkern intenta moverse lo menos posible para conservar todos los nutrientes que ha guardado en su interior y poder evolucionar. Ni come siquiera; se alimenta solo del rocío de la mañana.","Sunflora transforma la energía solar en nutrientes. De día, cuando hace calor, está en continuo movimiento. Solo para cuando comienza a anochecer.","Yanma tiene un ángulo de visión de 360° sin mover los ojos. Es un gran volador, experto en hacer repentinas paradas y cambios de dirección en el aire. Aprovecha la habilidad que tiene de volar para lanzarse sobre su presa.","Wooper suele vivir en el agua, pero es posible también verle en tierra en busca de comida. Cuando está en terreno firme, se cubre con una película viscosa tóxica.","Quagsire caza dejando las fauces abiertas en el agua y esperando a que su presa entre sin darse cuenta. Como se queda quieto, el Pokémon no pasa mucha hambre.","Espeon es tremendamente leal al Entrenador al que considera digno de ello. Dicen que este Pokémon desarrolló sus poderes adivinatorios para evitar que su Entrenador sufra daño alguno.","Umbreon evolucionó tras haber estado expuesto a ondas lunares. Suele esconderse en la oscuridad en silencio y esperar a que su presa se mueva. Cuando se lanza al ataque, le brillan los anillos del cuerpo.","Murkrow ha sido temido y repudiado por todos por ser supuestamente fuente de mala suerte. Este Pokémon siente debilidad por todo lo que brilla y resplandece. A las mujeres les roba los anillos.","Slowking dedica cada día tiempo a investigar, en un intento por resolver los misterios del mundo. Aunque, según parece, a este Pokémon se le olvida todo lo que ha aprendido si se separa del Shellder que lleva en la cabeza.","Misdreavus asusta a la gente con un chillido escalofriante y sollozante. Y, al parecer, usa las esferas rojas para absorber los sentimientos de miedo de los enemigos y usarlos como alimento.","Estos Pokémon tienen forma de caracteres antiguos. No se sabe qué surgió primero, si la vieja escritura o los distintos Unown. Esta cuestión sigue siendo objeto de estudio, pero aún no se ha averiguado nada.","Si dos o más Wobbuffet se encuentran, se volverán competitivos e intentarán superarse en resistencia. Pero también puede que intenten aguantar sin comer; algo que los Entrenadores deben tener muy en cuenta.","Girafarig tiene un cerebro también en la cabeza de la cola que reacciona atacando ante olores y sonidos. Cuando alguien se acerca a este Pokémon por la espalda, puede provocar que la cabeza trasera se abalance y lo muerda.","Pineco permanece colgado de la rama de un árbol esperando pacientemente a su presa. Si alguien sacude el árbol en el que está mientras come y le molesta, se tira al suelo y explota sin dar ningún tipo de aviso.","Forretress se esconde dentro de su concha de acero reforzada. Solo la abre cuando va a atrapar a su presa, pero ocurre tan rápido que no da tiempo de ver su interior.","La cola de Dunsparce es un taladro que usa para enterrarse en el suelo de espaldas. De todos es sabido que este Pokémon hace su nido a gran profundidad y con una forma muy compleja.","Gligar planea por el aire sin hacer ningún ruido, como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se agarra a la cara de su rival con las patas traseras, con forma de garra, y las pinzas de las delanteras y le inyecta veneno por el aguijón.","Steelix vive a mayor profundidad aún que Onix. Se le conoce por su tendencia a excavar hacia el interior del planeta. Hay datos que muestran que este Pokémon ha llegado a alcanzar 1 km de profundidad.","Al tener los colmillos por fuera, Snubbull da miedo y espanta a los Pokémon pequeños, que huyen aterrados. Parece que a él le da un poco de pena que salgan huyendo.","Granbull tiene la mandíbula inferior demasiado desarrollada y colmillos enormes y pesados que le obligan a inclinar la cabeza hacia atrás para compensar el peso. Si no se le asusta, no muerde.","Qwilfish bebe agua y se hincha, y a continuación usa la presión del agua que ha tragado para lanzar púas tóxicas por todo el cuerpo. Para este Pokémon nadar es una especie de desafío.","Scizor tiene un cuerpo duro como el acero que no es fácil de alterar con ningún ataque común. Este Pokémon bate las alas para regular la temperatura corporal.","Shuckle permanece escondido bajo las rocas en silencio y, cuando se pone a comer las bayas que almacena, se encierra en el caparazón. Las bayas se mezclan con sus fluidos corporales y originan zumo.","Heracross carga en línea recta contra el enemigo, se le queda encajado por debajo, lo agarra y lo lanza con ayuda del fuerte cuerno que tiene. Este Pokémon tiene fuerza hasta para echar abajo un árbol descomunal.","Sneasel trepa por los árboles agarrándose a la corteza con las garras curvas que tiene. Este Pokémon busca nidos desprovistos de vigilancia paterna para robar los huevos y comérselos.","A Teddiursa le encanta chuparse las palmas impregnadas de dulce miel. Este Pokémon fabrica su propia miel mezclando frutos y el polen que recoge Beedrill.","En los bosques habitados por Ursaring, dicen que abundan los arroyos y árboles gigantes en los que guardan su alimento. Este Pokémon se dedica todos los días a pasear por el bosque para buscar comida y guardarla.","Por el sistema circulatorio de Slugma corre magma líquido. Si este Pokémon se enfriara, el magma perdería el calor y se solidificaría, por lo que se resquebrajaría por completo, perdería algunos trozos y reduciría su tamaño.","La coraza de Magcargo es en realidad su propia piel que quedó endurecida al enfriarse. Está muy resquebrajada y es muy frágil; se desharía solo con tocarla. Este Pokémon debe sumergirse en magma para recuperar su forma.","Swinub busca el alimento frotando el hocico contra el suelo. Su comida preferida es una seta que crece bajo la hierba marchita. A veces, al frotar, descubre fuentes termales.","Piloswine está cubierto por un pelaje tupido y de largas cerdas que le permite soportar el frío polar. Este Pokémon usa los colmillos para desenterrar los alimentos que hayan podido quedar bajo el hielo.","Las ramas de Corsola brillan con belleza hasta en siete colores cuando les da el sol. Si se le rompe alguna, el Pokémon la regenera en tan solo una noche.","Remoraid traga agua y usa los abdominales para lanzarla a gran velocidad contra una presa que esté en el aire. Cuando está a punto de evolucionar, este Pokémon nada en los ríos corriente abajo.","Octillery se apodera de su enemigo con los tentáculos y lo deja inmovilizado antes de propinarle el golpe final. Si el enemigo resulta ser demasiado fuerte, Octillery expulsará tinta para escapar.","Delibird usa la cola a modo de saco para llevar su alimento. En una ocasión, un famoso escalador consiguió alcanzar la cima más alta del mundo gracias a que uno de estos Pokémon compartió sus alimentos con él.","En los días que hace sol, es posible ver bancos de Mantine saltando con elegancia por entre las olas del mar. A estos Pokémon no les molestan los Remoraid que se les pegan.","Skarmory está totalmente encerrado en el interior de una fuerte coraza protectora. En vuelo, puede llegar a alcanzar los 300 km/h y usa las afiladas alas que tiene para azotar al rival.","Houndour sale a cazar con el resto de la manada con total coordinación. Estos Pokémon se comunican unos con otros usando una serie de aullidos para acorralar a su presa. El compañerismo que existe entre ellos es incomparable.","En la manada de Houndoom, el que tiene los cuernos más arqueados hacia atrás tiene un mayor papel de liderazgo. Estos Pokémon suelen elegir al jefe en duelo.","Kingdra vive en lo más profundo del océano, donde no habita ninguna otra especie. Siempre se ha pensado que su bostezo causaba las corrientes en remolino que se dan en el océano.","Phanpy cava un agujero profundo para hacer su nido en el suelo, en la ribera de los ríos, y marca con la trompa la zona para que el resto vea que ese terreno ya está ocupado.","A Donphan le encanta enrollarse como una pelota y cargar contra el enemigo rodando a toda velocidad. Una vez que ha comenzado a rodar, no es fácil pararlo.","Porygon2 fue creado por el hombre gracias a los avances de la ciencia. Esta obra humana ha sido provista de inteligencia artificial que le permite aprender gestos y sensaciones nuevas por su cuenta.","Hace tiempo, se comerciaba con la magnífica cornamenta de Stantler. Se vendía como obra de arte a alto precio. Los interesados en cornamentas de valor incalculable empezaron a cazarlos y casi provocan su extinción.","Smeargle marca los límites de su territorio liberando un fluido corporal por el extremo de la cola. En la actualidad se han encontrado más de 5000 tipos de marcas distintas dejadas por este Pokémon.","Tyrogue se pone demasiado nervioso si no lo sacan a entrenarse cada día. Su Entrenador debe establecer y mantener ciertos métodos de entrenamiento durante la cría.","Hitmontop hace el pino con la cabeza y se pone a girar rápido al tiempo que reparte patadas. Esta es una técnica ofensiva y defensiva a la vez. Este Pokémon se desplaza más rápido girando sobre sí que caminando.","Smoochum va corriendo por todos lados, pero se cae también con frecuencia. Y, en cuanto tiene ocasión, se mira en algún sitio para ver si se ha manchado la cara.","Elekid acumula electricidad. Si entra en contacto con algo de metal y descarga accidentalmente toda la electricidad almacenada, empieza a agitar los brazos en círculo para volver a cargarse.","El estado de salud de Magby se puede determinar observando el fuego que emana al respirar. Si las llamas que echa por la boca son amarillas, está bien. Pero, si además de las llamas sale humo negro, está cansado.","Miltank da al día 20 l de una leche dulce que es la delicia de pequeños y mayores. Aquellos que no pueden tomarla, se decantan por los yogures.","Blissey es capaz de sentir la tristeza a través del sedoso pelaje. Si detecta que alguien está apenado, irá hasta donde esté y compartirá un Huevo Suerte para devolverle la sonrisa.","Raikou tiene la velocidad del rayo. Los rugidos de este Pokémon emiten ondas de choque que se esparcen vibrando por el aire y sacuden el suelo como si fueran auténticas descargas de rayo.","Entei contiene el fulgor del magma en su interior. Se cree que este Pokémon nació de la erupción de un volcán. Escupe numerosas ráfagas de fuego que devoran y reducen a cenizas todo lo que tocan.","Suicune emana la pureza de los manantiales. Suele corretear por el campo con gran elegancia. Este Pokémon tiene el poder de purificar el agua contaminada.","Larvitar nace bajo tierra a gran profundidad. Para subir a la superficie, este Pokémon debe comer lo que encuentra en su camino para abrirse paso. Y, hasta que no está arriba, no puede verles la cara a sus padres.","Pupitar crea un gas en su interior que comprime y expulsa violentamente a modo de autopropulsión. Tiene un cuerpo resistente que se mantiene inalterable hasta cuando se golpea contra duro acero.","Tyranitar tiene una fuerza imponente; es capaz de echar abajo una montaña para hacer su nido. Este Pokémon suele merodear por las zonas de montaña en busca de nuevos rivales contra los que luchar.","La fuerza que tiene Lugia en las alas es devastadora; con nada que las bata es capaz de derribar edificios enteros. Por eso mismo, prefiere vivir donde no haya nadie, en lo más profundo del mar.","El plumaje de Ho-Oh contiene siete colores que pueden apreciarse según el ángulo desde el que les dé la luz. Dicen que sus plumas dan felicidad a quienes las llevan y, también, que este Pokémon vive a los pies del arco iris.","Este Pokémon vino del futuro haciendo un viaje en el tiempo. Hay quien piensa que, mientras Celebi siga apareciendo, hay un futuro brillante y esperanzador.","Treecko tiene unos ganchos pequeños en las plantas de los pies con los que puede escalar superficies verticales. Este Pokémon ataca dando un golpetazo con la cola.","Las hojas que Grovyle tiene por el cuerpo le resultan muy útiles para camuflarse en el bosque y esconderse de los enemigos. A este Pokémon no hay quien lo supere subiendo a los árboles del bosque.","Las hojas que le salen a Sceptile del cuerpo tienen unos bordes muy afilados. Este Pokémon es muy ágil, va saltando de rama en rama y se lanza sobre el enemigo por la espalda.","Torchic no se separa de su Entrenador. Siempre va tras él con sus pasitos inseguros. Este Pokémon escupe bolas de fuego que pueden alcanzar los 1000 °C y carbonizar al enemigo.","Combusken fortalece las piernas corriendo por llanos y montañas. Este Pokémon tiene en las extremidades inferiores tanto fuerza como velocidad. Puede dar hasta diez patadas por segundo.","En combate, Blaziken expulsa vivas llamas por las muñecas y ataca al enemigo con fiereza. Cuanto más fuerte sea el enemigo, más intensas serán las llamas.","La aleta que tiene Mudkip en la cabeza actúa de radar y es muy sensible. Puede captar movimientos que se produzcan en el agua y en el aire, y todo lo que ocurra a su alrededor, sin necesidad de abrir los ojos.","El cuerpo de Marshtomp está cubierto por una fina película pegajosa gracias a la cual puede vivir en tierra. Cuando la marea está baja, a este Pokémon le encanta jugar en el fango.","Swampert es muy fuerte. Puede arrastrar una roca que pese más de una tonelada sin ningún problema. Este Pokémon tiene el sentido de la vista muy desarrollado. Es capaz de ver hasta en aguas cenagosas.","La primera reacción que Poochyena tiene al ver algo moverse es darle un mordisco. Este Pokémon persigue a su presa hasta que cae agotada. Aunque, a veces, sale huyendo si su presa le responde con un ataque.","Es muy fácil prever cuándo va a atacar Mightyena; se pone a gruñir con fuerza y se estira. Este Pokémon da unos mordiscos tremendos con los afilados colmillos que tiene.","Zigzagoon está todo el día dando vueltas de aquí para allá. Es un Pokémon muy inquieto. Se interesa por todo lo que se encuentra en su camino.","Linoone siempre corre todo lo rápido que puede y solo en línea recta. Si encuentra un obstáculo en el camino, girará en ángulo recto para esquivarlo. Correr bien por caminos tortuosos es todo un reto para él.","Wurmple usa las púas del lomo para raspar los troncos de los árboles, quitarles la corteza y beber la savia que emanan. Este Pokémon tiene unas ventosas rematándole los pies, con las que se adhiere al cristal sin resbalarse.","Silcoon usa la seda que produce para aferrarse a la rama de un árbol y sujetarse bien. Se queda ahí colgado a la espera de su evolución, mientras lo observa todo a través de dos pequeños agujeros en su capullo de seda.","La comida favorita de Beautifly es el dulce polen de las flores. Si quieres ver a este Pokémon, deja una maceta con flores al lado de la ventana y verás cómo aparece un ejemplar de Beautifly en busca de polen.","Cascoon forma el capullo que lo protege enrollándose por completo en la seda que libera por la boca. Cuando está totalmente recubierto, se prepara para evolucionar en el interior del capullo.","Los Dustox se acercan a la luz de forma instintiva. De hecho, se agrupan en enjambres alrededor de las luces de las ciudades y causan estragos en las hojas de los árboles que están a pie de calle para alimentarse.","Lotad vive en estanques y lagos, donde permanece flotando. Si se le marchita la ancha hoja que tiene en la cabeza, se debilitará. De vez en cuando, se desplaza en busca de agua limpia.","Lombre es, además de travieso, nocturno; entra en acción de noche. Cuando ve a gente pescando, se pone a tirar del sedal por debajo del agua y se divierte viendo la cara de enfado que se les queda.","Ludicolo empieza a bailar en cuanto oye música alegre y de fiesta. Dicen que este Pokémon aparece cuando oye cantar a los niños que van de excursión para hacer senderismo.","Seedot se queda enganchado a las ramas de los árboles por el extremo que tiene en la cabeza. Mientras está ahí colgado, aprovecha para tomar la humedad del árbol. Cuanta más agua bebe, más lustroso se le ve.","Nuzleaf habita bosques muy poblados y, en ocasiones, se atreve a salir para asustar a la gente. A este Pokémon no le gusta nada que le pellizquen la nariz.","Shiftry es un enigmático Pokémon que vive, dicen, en las copas de los árboles milenarios. Este Pokémon genera fuertes corrientes de aire con los abanicos que lleva en las manos.","Taillow se mantiene firme ante sus rivales, sean lo fuertes que sean. Este valiente Pokémon seguirá mostrándose desafiante, aunque pierda en combate. Además, si se enfada, se pondrá a gritar con energía.","Swellow vuela muy alto dibujando elegantes arcos en el cielo. Este Pokémon se sumerge en el agua con rapidez y eficacia en cuanto detecta una presa. Con las garras, atrapa a la desdichada víctima y no la deja huir.","Wingull tiene la costumbre de llevar a su presa y objetos de valor en el pico, y esconderlos en distintos sitios. Este Pokémon vuela dejándose llevar por las corrientes de aire como si fuera patinando por el cielo.","Pelipper vuela transportando pequeños huevos y Pokémon dentro del descomunal pico que tiene. Este Pokémon construye su nido en escarpados acantilados frente al mar.","Ralts percibe las sensaciones de la gente por los cuernos que tiene encima y detrás de la cabeza. No es común que este Pokémon aparezca en público, pero cuando lo hace, se acerca si ve buena disposición en la gente.","Dicen que, al recibir los sentimientos positivos de su Entrenador, Kirlia crece con gran belleza. Este Pokémon controla poderes psicoquinéticos gracias al desarrollado cerebro que tiene.","Gardevoir es capaz de leer el futuro. Si siente que su Entrenador está en peligro inminente, dicen que libera automáticamente toda su energía psicoquinética.","Surskit segrega un aceite por la punta de las patas que le permite caminar sobre el agua como si fuera patinando. Este Pokémon se alimenta de microorganismos en charcas y lagos.","Masquerain intimida a sus enemigos con los ojos que tiene dibujados en las antenas. Este Pokémon bate las cuatro alas que tiene para volar libremente en cualquier dirección, hasta de lado y hacia atrás, como un helicóptero.","Los Shroomish viven en zonas húmedas en la profunda oscuridad del bosque. Suelen quedarse tranquilamente bajo las hojas caídas. Se alimentan del abono que estas generan al empezar a pudrirse.","Breloom se acerca al enemigo realizando un juego de piernas ágil y enérgico. Y, a continuación, le da unos puñetazos con los brazos elásticos que tiene. Las técnicas de lucha que usa dejan en ridículo al boxeador más profesional.","Slakoth se pasa más de veinte horas al día tumbado. Como se mueve tan poco, necesita muy poca comida. De hecho, la única toma que hace al día la componen tan solo tres hojas.","Vigoroth está continuamente inquieto, rabiando por salir corriendo sin control. Estar quieto un solo minuto es superior a sus fuerzas. Si no puede estar en continuo movimiento, el nivel de estrés de este Pokémon se dispara.","Slaking se pasa todo el día tumbado vagueando. Se come la hierba que tiene a su alcance y, una vez que ha acabado con ella, se va de mala gana a otro sitio.","Nincada vive bajo tierra en la más absoluta oscuridad durante años. Este Pokémon absorbe nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles y permanece inmóvil a la espera de su evolución.","Ninjask se mueve de un lado a otro a tal velocidad que es imposible verlo. Sin embargo, como su zumbido no deja de oírse, se pensó durante mucho tiempo que este Pokémon era invisible.","Shedinja tiene un cuerpo robusto que no mueve en absoluto. De hecho, parece una especie de caparazón hueco. Se cree que, si alguien se atreviera a mirarle por la espalda lo que tiene en su interior, Shedinja le robaría el alma.","Normalmente, Whismur tiene una voz tenue, casi inaudible, aunque se preste atención. No obstante, si este Pokémon siente que el peligro acecha, puede ponerse a chillar con un volumen ensordecedor.","Los bramidos de Loudred pueden echar abajo una casa reforzada con vigas de madera. Este Pokémon usa el vozarrón que tiene para castigar a sus rivales. Las orejas redondas le sirven de altavoces.","Exploud provoca terremotos con el temblor que causa al levantar la voz. Cuando inhala aire por los tubos, hay que prestar atención, ya que está a punto de soltar un buen bramido.","Makuhita es tenaz. Da igual las veces que le venzan; volverá a ponerse en pie y a atacar. De hecho, cada vez que se recupera, acumula más energía para poder evolucionar.","Hariyama practica los empujones que da estirando los brazos allá por donde va. Este Pokémon puede partir por la mitad un poste de teléfono de un enérgico golpe con los brazos estirados y las manos abiertas.","Azurill enrolla la cola como si fuera un lazo y la despliega a continuación todo lo que puede. De esta forma, un Azurill llegó a lanzarse a sí mismo hasta 10 m.","Nosepass siempre está con la nariz magnética que tiene orientada hacia el norte. Si se encuentra con otro ejemplar de su especie, no puede mirarle de frente porque sus polos magnéticos se repelen.","A Skitty le encanta mover cosas e ir detrás de ellas. Es de todos sabido que se dedica a ir detrás de su propia cola y que, al final, acaba mareándose.","Delcatty prefiere llevar una vida independiente y hacer lo que se le antoje. Como este Pokémon come y duerme según vea en cada momento, no se puede decir que tenga unos hábitos regulares en el día a día.","Los Sableye hacen una vida muy tranquila en cavernas, pero son muy temidos. Se dice que, cuando los ojos les brillan de manera siniestra, están robándole el alma a alguien.","Las descomunales fauces de acero de Mawile son la evolución de unos cuernos que tuvo en su día. Con su expresión dócil puede engañar al enemigo y hacer que baje la guardia para sorprenderle con las fauces.","Este Pokémon tiene el cuerpo de acero. Para mantenerlo, se alimenta del hierro que saca de las montañas. A veces, causa verdaderos problemas, pues se come puentes y vías de tren.","Lairon templa su cuerpo de acero bebiendo agua mineral muy rica en nutrientes hasta que no puede más. Este Pokémon suele crear su nido cerca de manantiales de rica agua.","Aggron marca una montaña entera como su territorio y acaba con todo lo que pueda ponerlo en peligro. Este Pokémon está continuamente patrullando la zona en defensa de su terreno.","Meditite lleva a cabo un entrenamiento mental exhaustivo en lo más profundo de las montañas. Aunque, cuando medita, pierde toda la concentración y se descentra. Por eso, no deja nunca de entrenarse.","Dicen que, a través de la meditación, Medicham aumenta su energía interior y agudiza su sexto sentido. Este Pokémon suele pasar desapercibido mimetizándose con el campo y las montañas.","Electrike acumula electricidad en el largo pelaje que tiene. Este Pokémon estimula los músculos de las patas mediante descargas eléctricas. Estas explosiones de energía le permiten acelerar de forma increíble.","Manectric está continuamente descargando electricidad por las melenas, y a veces causa incendios en el bosque con las chispas que suelta. Cuando entra en combate, este Pokémon crea nubarrones.","Plusle siempre anima a sus compañeros. Cuando algún miembro de su grupo hace un gran esfuerzo en combate, causa un cortocircuito en su interior para mostrar con el chisporroteo su alegría.","Minun se preocupa más por alentar a sus compañeros de equipo que por su propia seguridad. Para animar a los miembros de su grupo, crea un cortocircuito en su interior y libera un chisporroteo espectacular.","Cuando llega la noche, Volbeat emite luz por la cola y regula la intensidad y el destello para comunicarse con el resto. A este Pokémon le atrae el dulce aroma de Illumise.","Illumise atrae mediante su dulce aroma a enjambres de Volbeat. Una vez que los ha agrupado, les guía en el vuelo para que dibujen formas geométricas en el lienzo del oscuro cielo.","Roselia lanza finas espinas a todo el que se le acerca con intención de robarle las flores de los brazos. El aroma de este Pokémon resulta relajante a los seres vivos.","Casi la totalidad del cuerpo de Gulpin está compuesto por el estómago. Por eso, puede tragarse todo lo que tenga su tamaño. En el interior del estómago tiene un fluido capaz de corroerlo todo.","Cuando Swalot detecta una presa, echa por los poros, y a borbotones, un fluido tóxico espantoso con el que rocía a su víctima. Una vez que la debilita, se la traga entera gracias a la gigantesca boca que tiene.","Carvanha, gracias a las descomunales fauces de afilados colmillos que tiene, es capaz de hacer trizas un barco. Son muchas las naves que han sufrido el ataque de este Pokémon y han acabado naufragando.","Conocido como el Terror de los Mares, Sharpedo es temido por todos. Si este Pokémon pierde los escalofriantes colmillos que tiene, los recupera en breve. Basta con un Sharpedo para destrozar un buque-cisterna.","Wailmer tiene los espiráculos encima de la cabeza. A este juguetón Pokémon le encanta asustar a la gente expulsando el agua que acumula a través de estos orificios.","Wailord es el mayor Pokémon registrado hasta la fecha. Este coloso va nadando lánguidamente por el ancho mar con la boca abierta para que penetre la mayor cantidad posible de alimento.","Numel tarda en percibir las cosas, no se entera ni cuando lo golpean, pero se da cuenta enseguida de si tiene hambre. El cuerpo de este Pokémon es un caldero de magma hirviendo.","Camerupt encierra un volcán en su interior y magma de 10 000 °C le recorre el cuerpo. A veces, las jorobas de la espalda entran en erupción y escupen el abrasivo magma.","Torkoal va cavando por las montañas en busca de carbón. Cuando lo encuentra, rellena los huecos que tiene dentro del caparazón y lo quema. Si le atacan, este Pokémon echa un humo negro que le permite la retirada.","Spoink se pasa todo el día saltando sobre la cola. Cada salto hace que le lata el corazón. Por eso, no puede permitirse dejar de saltar. Si lo hiciera, se le pararía.","Grumpig usa las perlas negras que tiene para amplificar las ondas de su poder psíquico y controlar del todo al rival. Cuando usa su poder especial, le cuesta respirar y resopla con pesadez.","Dicen que no hay dos Spinda que tengan los mismos dibujos en el pelaje. Este Pokémon tiene una forma de andar inestable, va tambaleándose. Da la sensación de ir bailando.","El nido de Trapinch está situado bajo la arena, en una zona cóncava. Este Pokémon espera con paciencia a que su presa caiga en la misma. Con las fauces que tiene puede destruir hasta piedras.","Para debilitar a su víctima, Vibrava genera ondas ultrasónicas haciendo vibrar con fuerza las alas. Las ondas que crea son tan fuertes que pueden dar dolor de cabeza a la gente.","A Flygon se le conoce como el Espíritu del Desierto. Al volar, como levanta una nube de arena al batir las alas, está siempre envuelto en una tormenta de arena.","Cacnea habita en desiertos y otras zonas áridas. Para atraer a su presa, libera un fuerte aroma por la flor y, cuando se le acerca, le lanza pinchos por todo el cuerpo para reducirla.","Durante el día, Cacturne permanece inmóvil para no perder nada de humedad bajo el sol de justicia del desierto. Este Pokémon entra en acción por la noche, cuando bajan las temperaturas.","Swablu tiene unas alas ligeras y esponjosas que parecen nubes de algodón. A este Pokémon no le asusta la gente. De hecho, puede llegar a posarse en la cabeza de alguien y servirle de gorro sedoso.","Altaria baila y revolotea por el cielo entre ondeantes nubes que parecen de algodón. Al entonar melodías con su voz cristalina, este Pokémon deja a sus oyentes embobados y admirados.","Los ecos del combate mantenido con su rival más feroz, Seviper, resuenan aún en cada célula de Zangoose. Este Pokémon esquiva los ataques con auténtica destreza.","Seviper lleva años de gran enemistad con Zangoose. Las cicatrices que tiene por todo el cuerpo dan buena muestra de los encarnizados combates en los que se han enfrentado. Seviper ataca usando su cola con forma de espada.","Lunatone fue descubierto en el lugar de impacto de un meteorito. Por eso, hay quien especula con la idea de que procede del espacio. Con todo, hasta el día de hoy nadie ha podido probar esta teoría.","Solrock pertenece a una nueva especie de Pokémon a la que se le atribuye una procedencia extraterrestre. Este Pokémon permanece flotando en el aire y se mueve muy despacio. Al luchar, desprende una luz viva e intensa.","Barboach tiene unos bigotes sensibles que le sirven de infalible radar. Este Pokémon se sumerge en lodo y solo deja los bigotes por fuera de la superficie, al acecho, mientras espera a que llegue su presa.","Whiscash defiende su territorio a toda costa. Es capaz de apoderarse de un estanque entero para sí solo. Si alguien se le acerca, se revolverá y provocará un terremoto devastador.","En un principio, se importaban Corphish como mascota. Pero, al final, se hicieron salvajes. Este Pokémon es muy resistente y ha aumentado su población de forma considerable.","Crawdaunt es de una naturaleza extremadamente violenta que le lleva a desafiar a otros seres vivos. Hay formas de vida que se niegan a vivir en los estanques donde habitan estos Pokémon, y los dejan medio vacíos.","Baltoy se mueve girando alrededor de sí mismo sobre la extremidad inferior que tiene. En unas ruinas antiguas, descubrieron pinturas rupestres en las que aparecía este Pokémon conviviendo con personas.","Se cree que los Claydol son figuras de barro hechas por humanos primitivos y que un misterioso rayo les hizo cobrar vida. Este Pokémon se desplaza levitando.","Los Lileep se extinguieron hace unos cien millones de años aproximadamente. Este Pokémon se ancla a una roca en el fondo del mar y atrapa a las presas que se le acercan con los tentáculos que tiene en forma de pétalos de flor.","Cradily va por el fondo oceánico sin rumbo fijo en busca de comida. El cuello de este Pokémon se parece al tronco de un árbol. Cuando quiere atrapar a su presa desprevenida, lo estira y usa los ocho tentáculos que tiene.","Anorith se regeneró a partir de un fósil prehistórico. Este Pokémon primitivo vivía en mares cálidos. Gracias a sus enormes pinzas puede agarrar a su presa con firmeza.","Armaldo tiene una sólida armadura que repele cualquier ataque. Este Pokémon puede estirar o encoger todo lo que quiera las pinzas que tiene. Con ellas, puede atravesar una plancha de acero.","Feebas tiene las aletas melladas y rasgadas desde que nace. Debido a este aspecto poco imponente, son pocos los que lo tienen en cuenta. Este Pokémon puede vivir tanto en agua salada como dulce.","De Milotic se dice que es el Pokémon más bello. Tiene la capacidad de calmar sentimientos tales como el miedo y la hostilidad, y apaciguar las relaciones de áspera enemistad.","La forma de Castform cambia con las variaciones del tiempo. Este Pokémon consiguió aprender a usar el gran poder de la naturaleza para proteger el pequeño cuerpo que tiene.","Kecleon puede alterar la pigmentación de la piel para mezclarse con su entorno. Lo único que no es capaz de cambiar es el trazado en zigzag que tiene en la panza.","A Shuppet le atraen los sentimientos de celos y rencor. Si alguien desarrolla fuertes sentimientos de venganza, aparecerá una multitud de Shuppet que se quedará bajo los aleros de su casa.","Banette genera energía para echar un infalible hechizo clavándose púas a sí mismo. Los orígenes de este Pokémon son algo tristes: era un muñeco de felpa al que tiraron a la basura.","Duskull puede atravesar los muros, sea cual sea el grosor que tengan. Cuando este Pokémon elige su objetivo, lo persigue hábilmente hasta el amanecer.","Dusclops está completamente hueco por dentro. Dicen que su cuerpo es como un agujero negro. Este Pokémon es capaz de absorber cualquier cosa, pero cosa que absorba, cosa que no dejará salir nunca más.","A los niños les encantan los racimos de fruta que Tropius tiene en el cuello. Este Pokémon siempre come fruta; le encanta. De hecho, ese parece ser el motivo por el que él mismo da fruta.","Chimecho hace que sus gritos resuenen con eco en su interior. Cuando se enfada, los chillidos se convierten en ondas ultrasónicas capaces de derribar a los enemigos voladores.","Cada vez que Absol aparece ante la gente, ocurre una catástrofe natural como un terremoto o un maremoto. Por esta razón se le conoce como el Pokémon de las catástrofes.","Wynaut está siempre con una gran sonrisa puesta. Para ver si está enfadado, basta con mirarle la cola. Cuando se le molesta, se pone a dar golpetazos en el suelo.","Snorunt vive en zonas de grandes nevadas. En primavera y verano, cuando no nieva, se retira a las cavernas para vivir tranquilamente entre estalactitas y estalagmitas.","Glalie endurece el cuerpo rocoso que tiene con una coraza de hielo. Este Pokémon tiene la habilidad de congelar la humedad del ambiente y formar la figura que se le antoje.","Spheal se desplaza por el suelo más rápido rodando que caminando. Cuando come con otros de su especie, todos se ponen a aplaudir para expresar su alegría. Por eso, a veces son algo escandalosos.","Cada vez que Sealeo ve algo nuevo, se lo pone en el morro y empieza a darle vueltas. A veces, para entretenerse, hace lo mismo con un Spheal.","Walrein tiene unos exagerados colmillos con los que puede hacer añicos bloques de hielo de hasta 10 toneladas de una sola dentellada. La gruesa capa de grasa que lo recubre le protege de temperaturas inferiores a 0 °C.","La sólida concha que rodea a Clamperl no solo le sirve para protegerse, sino también de cepo para atrapar a su presa. Cuando la concha alcanza su mayor tamaño, presenta muescas y rasguños por todas partes.","Huntail ha pasado desapercibido durante mucho tiempo por vivir en las profundidades del mar. El sentido de la vista de este Pokémon le permite ver en las oscuras y turbias aguas submarinas.","Gorebyss vive en los mares del sur, en lo más profundo; de ahí que tenga el cuerpo preparado para soportar la presión tan grande que hay en el fondo marino, y que no le hagan daño los ataques comunes.","Relicanth pertenece a una especie de Pokémon que lleva millones de años sin cambiar de forma. Este ancestral Pokémon se alimenta de microorganismos por la boca desdentada que tiene.","Luvdisc vive en aguas tropicales poco profundas. Este Pokémon con forma de corazón se ha ganado la reputación que tiene por ir nadando detrás de las parejas de enamorados que veía entre las olas del océano.","Bagon sueña con poder pasar un día volando por el cielo. En vanos intentos por volar, ha llegado a tirarse desde riscos. Como resultado de estas caídas en picado, se le ha puesto la cabeza dura como las piedras.","Dentro de la capa acorazada de Shelgon, las células están en pleno proceso de creación de un cuerpo nuevo. El peso de la coraza le hace tener unos movimientos lentos.","Salamence surgió del profundo deseo de tener alas. Dicen que este fuerte deseo fue lo que causó la repentina mutación de las células y el crecimiento de las alas.","En lugar de sangre, Beldum tiene una poderosa fuerza magnética corriéndole por las venas. Este Pokémon se comunica enviando controlados impulsos magnéticos.","Cuando dos Beldum se fusionan, forman un Metang. Los cerebros de los Beldum se unen mediante un sistema nervioso magnético y generan potente energía psicoquinética.","Metagross tiene cuatro cerebros en total que, combinados, son capaces de resolver cálculos complicados más rápido que el mejor ordenador que haya. Metagross puede flotar en el aire si mete las patas hacia adentro.","A Regirock lo mantuvieron encerrado y aislado hace tiempo. Dicen que, si resulta dañado en combate, se pone él mismo a buscar piedras parecidas a las suyas y se las pone para recomponerse.","Regice surgió durante la edad de hielo. El cuerpo de este Pokémon está totalmente congelado, ni siquiera el fuego puede derretirlo. Regice libera y regula un aire gélido de -200 °C.","No hay metal que supere en dureza el cuerpo de Registeel, que tiene aspecto de estar hueco. Nadie sabe de qué se alimenta este Pokémon.","Latias es muy sensible a los sentimientos de la gente. Si detecta algún ápice de hostilidad, desplegará las plumas que tiene por todo el cuerpo y se pondrá a chillar para intimidar al enemigo.","Latios tiene la habilidad de hacer que los demás vean algo que él ha visto o imaginado. Este Pokémon es muy inteligente. Es capaz de entender el lenguaje humano.","Kyogre se sirve de la energía de la naturaleza para realizar su Regresión Primigenia y recobrar su apariencia primitiva. Con tal poder, puede desencadenar tempestades para expandir los océanos.","A Groudon siempre se le ha descrito como el Pokémon que expandió los continentes. Varias leyendas cuentan que libró combates contra Kyogre en repetidas ocasiones para tener el control de la energía de la naturaleza.","Dicen que Rayquaza ha vivido durante millones de años. Las leyendas cuentan que puso fin al continuo enfrentamiento entre Groudon y Kyogre.","Cuenta la leyenda que Jirachi hará realidad cualquier deseo que se le escriba en las notas que lleva en la cabeza cuando las lea tras salir de su letargo. Si este Pokémon siente peligro, luchará sin haber llegado a despertarse.","Tras estar expuesto a un rayo láser, el ADN de un virus espacial sufrió una mutación y dio origen a Deoxys. Según parece, el órgano cristalino que este Pokémon tiene en el torso es el cerebro.",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"x":[null,"Una rara semilla le fue plantada en el lomo al nacer. La planta brota y crece con este Pokémon.","Este Pokémon tiene un bulbo en el lomo. Dicen que, al absorber nutrientes, el bulbo se transforma en una flor grande.","Llena su cuerpo de energía con los rayos solares que captan los anchos pétalos de su flor.","La llama de su cola indica la fuerza vital de Charmander. Será brillante si está sano.","Suele usar la cola para derribar a su rival. Cuando lo tira, se vale de sus afiladas garras para acabar con él.","Cuando lanza una descarga de fuego supercaliente, la roja llama de su cola brilla más intensamente.","Se protege con su caparazón y luego contraataca lanzando agua a presión cuando tiene oportunidad.","Si es golpeado, esconderá su cabeza. Aun así, su cola puede seguir golpeando.","Para acabar con su enemigo, lo aplasta con el peso de su cuerpo. En momentos de apuro, se esconde en el caparazón.","Para protegerse despide un hedor horrible de sus antenas, con el que repele a sus enemigos.","Su frágil cuerpo está recubierto de una coraza dura como el acero. Permanece quieto en su desarrollo.","Adora el néctar de las flores. Puede localizar hasta las más pequeñas cantidades de polen.","Suele habitar bosques y praderas. Tiene un afilado y venenoso aguijón de unos 5 cm encima de la cabeza.","Casi incapaz de moverse, este Pokémon solo puede endurecer su caparazón para protegerse.","Tiene 3 aguijones venenosos en sus patas y cola. Suelen pinchar a sus enemigos repetidas veces.","Muy común en bosques y selvas. Aletea al nivel del suelo para levantar la gravilla.","Tiene unas garras desarrolladas. Puede atrapar un Exeggcute y transportarlo desde una distancia de casi 100 km.","Cuando caza, vuela muy deprisa a ras del agua y sorprende a inocentes presas como Magikarp.","Vive allí donde haya comida disponible. Busca todo el día, sin descanso, algo comestible.","Lima sus colmillos royendo objetos duros. Con ellos puede destruir incluso paredes de hormigón.","Muy protector de su territorio, mueve sus cortas alas sin descanso para lanzarse a toda velocidad.","Con sus enormes y magníficas alas, puede seguir volando sin tener que aterrizar para descansar.","Cuanto más viejo, más crece este Pokémon. Por la noche, descansa en las ramas de los árboles.","El dibujo que tiene en la panza aterroriza. Los rivales más débiles salen huyendo al verlo.","Levanta su cola para vigilar los alrededores. A veces, puede ser alcanzado por un rayo en esa pose.","Cuando se carga de electricidad, sus músculos se tensan y se vuelve más agresivo de lo normal.","Este Pokémon permanece bajo tierra. Si se siente amenazado, se enrosca para defenderse.","Si cava a gran velocidad, puede que se le caigan las garras y púas. Vuelven a crecerle en un día.","Aunque pequeñas, sus venenosas púas son muy peligrosas. Tienen un cuerno más pequeño que los machos.","Tiene un carácter afable. Emite ondas ultrasónicas para confundir al enemigo.","Usa su cuerpo duro y escamoso para sellar la entrada a su madriguera y protegerse de los depredadores.","Saca las orejas por encima de la hierba para explorar el territorio. Le protege su cuerno venenoso.","Levanta sus grandes orejas para vigilar. Si detecta algo, atacará de inmediato.","Es fácil reconocerlo por tener una dura piel y un gran cuerno lleno de peligrosísimo veneno.","Se dice que la felicidad llegará a quien vea a un grupo de Clefairy bailando a la luz de la luna llena.","Su oído es tan agudo que puede oír una aguja caer a 1 km. Vive en montañas solitarias.","Cuando nace solo tiene una cola, pero a medida que crece, esta se va dividiendo desde la punta.","Tiene nueve colas y un pelaje de color dorado. Dicen que este Pokémon llega a vivir 1000 años.","Cautiva con la mirada a su enemigo y hace que se quede profundamente dormido mientras entona una dulce melodía.","Su piel es tan suave que si dos de ellos se acurrucan juntos, no querrán separarse nunca.","Aunque carezca de ojos, puede detectar obstáculos con las ondas ultrasónicas que emite su boca.","Cuando ataque, seguirá chupando energía de su víctima, aunque pese tanto que ya no pueda volar.","Durante el día, se agazapa en el frío subsuelo huyendo del sol. La luz de la luna le hace crecer mucho.","¡Huele bastante mal! De todas formas, una de cada mil personas aprecian su fétido olor.","Cuanto mayores son sus pétalos, más tóxico es su polen. Le pesa la cabeza y le cuesta mantenerla erguida.","Lleva en el lomo dos setas parásitas llamadas tochukaso, que crecen con él.","Parasect está dominado por una seta parásita mayor que él. Dispersa esporas venenosas.","Sus grandes ojos son en realidad grupos de ojos diminutos. Por la noche se siente atraído por la luz.","Lanza unas escamas que paralizan a cualquiera. Quien las toque, no podrá ni ponerse de pie.","Vive un metro por debajo del suelo, donde se alimenta de raíces. También aparece en la superficie.","En combate, cava la tierra, se esconde y sale de repente para golpear a su rival. Nunca se sabe por dónde puede aparecer.","Es de naturaleza nocturna. Le atraen los objetos brillantes.","Aunque es muy admirado por el pelo, es difícil de entrenar como mascota, porque es un poco travieso.","Padece continuamente dolores de cabeza. Cuando son muy fuertes, empieza a usar misteriosos poderes.","Aparece en ríos al anochecer. Puede usar poderes telequinéticos si su frente brilla misteriosamente.","Es peligroso acercarse si se enfada sin razón aparente, ya que no distingue entre amigos y enemigos.","Solo se calma cuando nadie está cerca. Llegar a ver ese momento es realmente difícil.","Es muy agradable y leal. Para ahuyentar al enemigo, se pone a ladrar y a dar bocados.","Un Pokémon muy admirado desde la antigüedad por su belleza. Corre ágilmente como si tuviera alas.","Tiene una piel extraordinaria, fina y húmeda, que deja entrever las vísceras que tiene dispuestas en espiral.","Capaz de vivir dentro o fuera del agua. Fuera del agua suda para mantener baboso su cuerpo.","Tiene músculos muy desarrollados. Es capaz de nadar en el océano sin descanso.","Duerme 18 horas al día y mientras lo hace es capaz de usar una serie de poderes extrasensoriales.","Cuando utiliza su poder psíquico, emite poderosas ondas alfa que pueden destruir dispositivos.","Sus neuronas se multiplican continuamente durante su vida. Por eso, siempre lo recuerda todo.","Levanta un Graveler para mantener sus músculos en forma. Domina todas las artes marciales.","Su musculoso cuerpo es tan fuerte que usa un cinto antifuerza para controlar sus movimientos.","Tiene cuatro brazos tan bien desarrollados que puede dar una serie de 1000 puñetazos en cuestión de dos segundos.","Aunque su cuerpo es extremadamente delgado, es muy rápido a la hora de capturar sus presas.","Las hojas que tiene actúan como cuchillas en combate. Otra de sus armas es el corrosivo fluido que expulsa.","Dicen que vive en grandes colonias en el interior de las junglas, aunque nadie ha podido verificarlo.","Su cuerpo se compone casi en exclusiva de agua. Lanza extraños rayos con sus ojos cristalinos.","Cuando caza, extiende los cortos tentáculos que tiene para atrapar e inmovilizar a su presa.","Aparecen en llanos y montañas. Como parecen rocas, la gente se tropieza con ellos o los pisa.","De naturaleza descuidada y libre, no le importa dañarse cuando baja rodando montañas.","Se lanza montaña abajo y deja un surco desde la cima hasta el pie. Es mejor mantenerse alejado.","Cuando nace, apenas puede tenerse en pie. Pero va fortaleciendo las patas en cuanto empieza a galopar.","Muy competitivo, este Pokémon perseguirá a todo lo que se mueva rápido e intentará salir airoso.","Está siempre en su mundo, pero nadie sabe en qué piensa. Suele pescar con la cola.","Tiene una cola tan apetecible, que el Shellder que va enganchado a ella no se soltará por nada del mundo.","Las unidades a los lados de su cuerpo generan energía antigravitatoria para mantenerlo en el aire.","Lo constituye un grupo de Magnemite. Descarga potentes ondas magnéticas de alto voltaje.","El puerro que lleva es su mejor arma. Suele usarlo como espada para cortar cosas.","Este Pokémon de dos cabezas es el resultado de una mutación. Cuando corre, puede alcanzar casi 100 km por hora.","Más vale no perder de vista ninguna de las tres cabezas. De lo contrario, el número de picotazos será enorme.","Este Pokémon vive en icebergs. Nada en el mar y usa el cuerno de su cabeza para romper el hielo.","Está recubierto de un luminoso pelaje blanco. Este Pokémon aumenta su actividad cuando bajan las temperaturas.","Nace de lodo alterado al filtrarse en el agua los rayos X reflejados por la Luna. Se alimenta de sustancias desagradables.","Les encanta reunirse en zonas apestosas donde se acumula el lodo, haciendo su olor más insoportable.","La concha lo protege de cualquier tipo de ataque. Solo es vulnerable cuando se abre.","A los Cloyster que viven en las fuertes corrientes marinas les crecen largas y afiladas púas en la concha.","Su etéreo cuerpo está hecho de gas. Puede envolver a un oponente de cualquier tamaño hasta ahogarlo.","Cuando tienes la sensación de que te están observando, seguro que es porque Haunter está cerca.","Se esconde entre las sombras. Se dice que donde Gengar acecha, la temperatura baja 5 °C.","Cava a gran velocidad en busca de comida. Los túneles que deja son usados por los Diglett.","Adormece a sus enemigos y se come sus sueños. A veces se pone enfermo si come pesadillas.","Lleva un péndulo en la mano. Una vez, hizo desaparecer a un niño al que había hipnotizado.","Ante el peligro, se camufla con las burbujas que desprende su boca, para parecer más grande.","La pinza tan grande que tiene posee una fuerza de 10 000 caballos de potencia. Pero, por su gran tamaño, cuesta moverla.","Fue descubierto cuando se crearon las Poké Balls. Se dice que tiene algo que ver con ellas.","Explotan a la mínima. Por eso se les tiene mucho miedo. Estos Pokémon reciben el mote de Bomba Ball.","Estos seis huevos se comunican por telepatía. Si se separan, se pueden reunir rápidamente.","Sus tres cabezas piensan de forma independiente. Sin embargo, son amigas y no suelen discutir nunca.","Lleva puesto el cráneo de su madre. Cuando se siente solo se pone a gritar muy fuerte.","Es pequeño y siempre ha sido muy débil. Cuando empezó a usar huesos, se volvió más violento.","Encoge y estira las patas a su antojo. Cuando las estira, es capaz de propinar una buena patada al enemigo.","Los potentes golpes de sus brazos pueden pulverizar el hormigón. Descansa tras luchar tres minutos.","Su larga lengua, recubierta de saliva pegajosa, se pega a todo, por lo que es muy útil.","Tiene forma de globo y es muy ligero. Está compuesto por gases tóxicos y apesta.","Si uno de los gemelos Koffing se infla, el otro se desinfla. Mezclan constantemente sus venenosos gases.","Es muy fuerte, pero no especialmente listo. Es capaz de derribar rascacielos usando Placaje varias veces.","La piel le sirve de escudo protector. Puede vivir en lava líquida a 2000 °C de temperatura.","Se dice que reparte felicidad. Se caracteriza por su compasión y reparte sus huevos entre la gente herida.","Se camufla con la multitud de lianas que envuelven su cuerpo y que no dejan de crecer a lo largo de toda su vida.","Lleva a su cría en la bolsa de su panza. Solo deja que su cría salga a jugar cuando no siente peligro.","Es famoso por derribar a bichos voladores lanzando tinta desde la superficie del agua.","Las afiladas púas que le recubren el cuerpo se le erizan y pueden causar el debilitamiento con solo tocarlo.","Nada a una velocidad de cinco nudos. Si siente peligro, golpea con su afilado cuerno.","En otoño, cuando se reproducen, se les puede ver nadando con energía por ríos y arroyos.","Aunque sus brazos se rompan podrán regenerarse, siempre y cuando su núcleo siga intacto.","Su núcleo central brilla con los colores del arcoíris. Para algunos tiene el valor de una gema.","Para repeler ataques, solidifica el aire y crea muros invisibles con emanaciones de sus dedos.","Destroza a su presa con las guadañas que tiene. No es común que use las alas para volar.","Camina moviendo las caderas de forma llamativa. Puede hacer que la gente baile a su ritmo.","Por la superficie de su piel corre la electricidad. En la oscuridad, su cuerpo se torna blanquecino.","A este Pokémon se lo encontraron cerca de un volcán. Esta criatura ígnea tiene una temperatura corporal de unos 1200 °C.","Atrapa presas con sus pinzas hasta que las parte en dos. Lanza lejos lo que no puede quebrar.","Después de animarse a luchar fustigándose con sus tres colas, carga a toda velocidad.","No es precisamente rápido ni fuerte. Es el Pokémon más debilucho y simplón de todos los que hay.","En la literatura antigua se dice que un Gyarados rebosante de violencia arrasó un poblado.","Son buenos de corazón. Muchos fueron capturados por ser tan pacíficos. Ahora hay muchos menos.","Puede alterar por completo su estructura celular para emular cualquier objeto que vea.","Un extraño Pokémon que se adapta a los entornos más hostiles gracias a sus diferentes evoluciones.","Prefiere las bellas costas. Con células parecidas al agua, podría fundirse en la misma.","Todos los pelos de su cuerpo se ponen de punta si empieza a cargarse de electricidad.","Almacena llamas en su cuerpo, que alcanza una temperatura de 900 °C antes de un combate.","Pokémon creado por el hombre tras muchas investigaciones. Sus habilidades son básicas.","Pokémon prehistórico que vivió en el océano primordial. Para nadar se valía de sus 10 tentáculos.","Tiene los tentáculos tan desarrollados que le sirven de manos y pies. Con ellos atrapa a su presa y le da un bocado.","Se cree que habitó las playas hace 300 millones de años. Se protege con una dura concha.","Repliega sus extremidades en el agua para hacerse más compacto, y mueve su concha para nadar rápido.","Se regeneró a partir de material genético de un dinosaurio encontrado en ámbar. Cuando vuela emite escandalosos alaridos.","No se encuentra satisfecho hasta que no se come 400 kg de comida cada día. Cuando acaba de comer, se queda dormido.","Legendario Pokémon pájaro capaz de generar ventiscas congelando la humedad del aire.","Es un legendario pájaro Pokémon. Dicen que aparece entre las nubes lanzando enormes rayos brillantes.","Es más conocido como el legendario pájaro de fuego. Con cada aleteo crea brillantes llamas.","Se le llama el Pokémon Espejismo porque son muy pocos los que lo han visto. Se encontró su muda.","Sus cristalinos orbes parecen darle al Pokémon el poder de controlar el clima libremente.","A pesar del tamaño que tiene y de lo pesado que es, puede volar. Es capaz de dar la vuelta al mundo en solo 16 horas.","Fue creado por un científico tras años de horribles experimentos de ingeniería genética.","Varios científicos lo consideran el antecesor de los Pokémon porque usa todo tipo de movimientos.","Un dulce aroma se desprende de la hoja de su cabeza. Es dócil y le encanta absorber los rayos de sol.","Emana un aroma picante de su cuello. El aroma actúa como estimulante para recuperar salud.","El olor que desprenden sus pétalos contiene una sustancia que calma el instinto agresivo.","Es tímido y siempre se enrosca como una pelota. Si es atacado, enciende su lomo para protegerse.","Antes de empezar a luchar, se gira ante su rival para alardear del alcance y la fuerza de sus llamas.","Si su furia crece, se calienta tanto que cualquier cosa que toque se prenderá al instante.","Es pequeño pero violento. No dudará en morder cualquier cosa que se mueva cerca.","Si pierde un colmillo, le crecerá otro en su lugar. Siempre tiene 48 colmillos en su boca.","Se suele mover lento, pero alcanza velocidades de vértigo al atacar y morder a sus enemigos.","Cuando hace de centinela, avisa del peligro a los demás, chillando y dando golpes al suelo con la cola.","Acurruca a sus crías para que duerman. Acorrala a los enemigos con su enorme velocidad.","Su percepción del tiempo es exacta. Ocurra lo que ocurra, lleva el ritmo moviendo la cabeza.","Sus ojos están especialmente adaptados. Concentran la luz para poder ver en la oscuridad.","Cuando llega el frío, se reúnen muchos Ledyba de todas partes para darse calor.","Cuando parpadean las estrellas en el cielo nocturno, se mece desprendiendo un polvo brillante.","Teje su telaraña con hilo fino pero resistente. Espera pacientemente a que caiga su presa.","Teje su telaraña desde atrás y desde su boca. Es muy difícil saber dónde está cada cual.","Es tan silencioso cuando vuela en la oscuridad con sus cuatro alas, que cuesta percibirlo cuando se acerca.","En el oscuro fondo del océano, su único modo de comunicarse es emitiendo luces parpadeantes.","La luz de Lanturn se puede ver desde lo más profundo. Se le llama la Estrella de Alta Mar.","Cuando juegan, se tocan las colas y emiten chispas. Al parecer, es una prueba de valor.","Por su inusual forma estrellada, la gente cree que procede de un meteorito que cayó a la tierra.","Para caminar, en lugar de usar los pies que tiene, opta por dar botes con su cuerpo redondo y blandito.","El cascarón parece estar lleno de alegría. Dicen que trae buena suerte si es tratado con cariño.","Si no está con gente amable, se entristece. Puede flotar en el aire sin mover las alas.","Va dando saltitos porque sus alas no han crecido lo suficiente. Siempre está pendiente de algo.","Cuando se pone a meditar al amanecer, pierde la noción del tiempo. Puede pasarse así todo el día.","Su pelaje lanudo dobla su volumen al acumular electricidad estática. Tocarlo puede dar calambre.","Su esponjosa lana almacena electricidad. Su piel gomosa evita que sea electrocutado.","La punta de su cola reluce brillantemente y puede ser vista desde lejos. Es usado como faro.","Los Bellossom suelen reunirse para bailar. Dicen que sus danzas son un ritual para invocar al sol.","Tiene una piel que repele el agua. De hecho, puede pasarse horas jugando en el agua sin mojarse.","Sus largas orejas son sensores que pueden percibir movimientos de seres vivos en el lecho del río.","Aunque pretende ser un árbol, en su composición se parece más a una roca que a una planta.","Cuando tres o más de estos se juntan, emiten un sonido muy fuerte parecido a un bramido.","Su cuerpo es tan ligero, que debe agarrarse bien al suelo con las patas para no irse con el viento.","La flor de su cabeza se abre y cierra según suba o baje la temperatura.","Los vientos estacionales lo llevan por todo el mundo, donde va soltando sus esporas.","Vive en lo alto de los árboles. Cuando salta de rama en rama, usa su cola para equilibrarse.","Puede caer del cielo de repente. Si le ataca un Spearow, moverá violentamente sus hojas.","A medida que se acerca el verano, va adquiriendo un color más vivo e intenso en los pétalos de la cara.","Su campo visual es de 360° sin girar la cabeza. Detecta hasta las presas que están a su espalda.","Este Pokémon vive en aguas frías. Sale del agua para buscar comida cuando refresca el ambiente.","Es un Pokémon bastante perezoso. Para pescar permanece en el fondo del río con la boca abierta.","Al predecir el siguiente movimiento de su rival, chasquea el extremo de la cola bífida que tiene.","Creado cuando la luz lunar alteró la estructura genética de Eevee. Busca presas en la oscuridad.","Esconde objetos brillantes en un lugar secreto. Meowth y Murkrow suelen saquear su escondite.","Su intelecto e intuición son increíbles. No pierde la compostura en ninguna situación.","Se deleita con el miedo, que absorbe con sus esferas rojas. Por el día, duerme en la oscuridad.","Su cuerpo fino y plano aparece siempre en los muros. Su forma parece tener algún significado.","Odia la luz y las sacudidas. Si le atacan, infla su cuerpo para aumentar su contraataque.","Cuando duerme, la cabeza de su cola se queda vigilando, ya que ella no necesita dormir.","Le gusta engrosar su coraza añadiendo cortezas de árbol. El aumento de peso no le molesta.","Se protege con su concha de acero de tal manera que solo se pueden ver sus ojos.","Este Pokémon escapa hacia atrás perforando el suelo con su cola, si es descubierto.","A veces se sujeta a los precipicios. Cuando divisa una presa, despliega sus alas y planea para atacar.","Su cuerpo es más duro que cualquier metal debido a la gran presión y calor de su hábitat.","Muy travieso por naturaleza, a muchas mujeres les gusta jugar con él porque es muy cariñoso.","A pesar de su aspecto, es muy tímido. Sin embargo, cuando se enfada, ataca con sus colmillos.","Para arrojar sus venenosas púas, infla su cuerpo bebiendo hasta diez litros de agua de una sola vez.","Las pinzas que posee tienen acero. Con ellas, no hay nada que se le resista. Rompen todo lo que pillan.","Las bayas que almacena en su caparazón con forma de tarro se convierten al final en un espeso zumo.","Este fuerte Pokémon clava su preciado cuerno en la tripa del enemigo, lo eleva y luego lo arroja.","Se alimenta de huevos robados en nidos. Clava sus afiladas garras en los puntos débiles de sus rivales.","Si encuentra miel, brillará la marca de su frente. Se lame las garras cuando están llenas de miel.","Capaz de percibir cualquier tipo de aroma, encuentra sin problemas todo alimento enterrado bajo tierra.","Asiduo a las zonas volcánicas, se desliza lentamente en busca de lugares calientes.","En ocasiones, su resbaladiza concha lanza intensas llamaradas que recorren todo su cuerpo.","Frota su hocico contra el suelo para desenterrar comida. A veces descubre aguas termales.","Aunque tiene las patas cortas, las fuertes pezuñas le permiten agarrarse bien al suelo, a pesar del hielo.","Crece y muda continuamente. La parte superior de su cabeza es muy apreciada por su belleza.","Tiene muy buena puntería. Dispara agua a sus presas, hasta si se están moviendo, a más de 100 metros.","Tiene querencia por los agujeros. Ataca escupiendo tinta metido en las grietas de rocas o en recipientes.","Transporta alimentos en su cola enrollada. Le gusta compartir su comida con los montañistas perdidos.","Acumula velocidad nadando y puede saltar fuera del agua, alcanzando 100 metros de altura, para descender luego planeando.","Después de anidar en zarzas, las alas de sus polluelos crecen fortalecidas por los rasguños.","Al amanecer, resuena por la zona su inquietante aullido para anunciar que es su territorio.","Hace mucho, la gente creía que sus horripilantes aullidos eran de la muerte personificada.","Dicen que suele esconderse en cuevas submarinas. Puede crear torbellinos al bostezar.","Como muestra de afecto, golpea con su trompa. Aunque es tan fuerte que te mandará lejos.","Tiene afilados y duros colmillos, y una gruesa piel. Su Placaje es tan fuerte que puede derribar una casa.","La investigación mejoró sus habilidades. A veces, puede actuar de forma no programada.","Mirar a su cornamenta provoca una extraña sensación de pérdida de equilibrio.","Marca su territorio usando su cola a modo de pincel. Ha hecho más de 5000 marcas diferentes.","Ataca siempre con mucha energía. Para fortalecerse a sí mismo, sigue luchando aunque pierda.","Gira a gran velocidad al luchar. La fuerza centrífuga multiplica su poder de destrucción por diez.","Sus labios son la parte más sensible de su cuerpo. Siempre los usa para examinar las cosas.","Genera electricidad girando los brazos. No obstante, es incapaz de almacenar la energía creada.","Es pequeño, pero su cuerpo puede llegar a alcanzar 600 °C. Cuando inspira y espira, expulsa llamas por la nariz y por la boca.","Si tiene crías, la leche que produce contiene muchos más nutrientes de lo normal.","Los huevos que pone están llenos de felicidad. Solo con probar un poquito de uno, cualquiera sonríe.","Las nubes de lluvia que lleva le permiten lanzar rayos a voluntad. Dicen que apareció con un rayo.","Un Pokémon que corre por la tierra. Dicen que siempre nace uno cuando aparece un nuevo volcán.","Recorre el mundo para purificar agua contaminada. Corre veloz con el viento del norte.","Se alimenta de tierra. Después de comer una gran montaña, se duerme y empieza a crecer.","Su cuerpo es duro como la roca. Se autopropulsa como un cohete soltando los gases de su interior.","En una de sus poderosas garras tiene el poder de hacer temblar la tierra y las montañas.","Duerme en una dorsal marina. Si bate sus alas, puede causar tormentas de 40 días.","Cuenta la leyenda que brilla en siete colores. Dicen que deja un arcoíris tras de sí al volar.","Este Pokémon vaga por el tiempo. La hierba y los árboles crecen por los campos por donde pasa.","Escala superficies verticales muy rápido. Con la cola detecta la humedad y prevé el tiempo que va a hacer.","Los desarrollados músculos que tiene en las extremidades inferiores le hacen ser muy ágil y le permiten dar grandes saltos.","Las hojas de sus brazos pueden cortar gruesos árboles. Invencible en los combates en la jungla.","En su interior, guarda una llama que arde sin cesar. Si se le abraza, se nota que tiene una temperatura muy alta.","Su habilidad le permite dar diez patadas por segundo. Lanza potentes gritos para intimidar.","Puede saltar edificios de 30 plantas. Con sus golpes de fuego quema a sus rivales.","Tiene una larga cola que le propulsa por el agua con mucha potencia. A pesar de ser pequeño, tiene mucha fuerza.","Sus piernas robustas impiden que pierda el equilibrio y caiga, incluso en el barro. Duerme bajo la arena.","Con sus brazos duros como el acero puede partir rocas gigantescas en mil pedazos de un solo golpe.","Es muy persistente. Si se fija en una presa, no la dejará hasta que caiga agotada.","Siempre obedece a los buenos Entrenadores. Está acostumbrado a vivir en jaurías en estado salvaje.","Se mueve en zigzag. Se le da bien encontrar objetos ocultos en la hierba e incluso enterrados.","En línea recta corre a algo más de 100 km/h, pero no es tan hábil si hay curvas de por medio.","Le encanta comer hojas. Si le ataca un Starly, se defenderá con sus púas.","Se agarra con su seda a las ramas de un árbol y espera su evolución bebiendo agua de lluvia.","Los dibujos de sus coloridas alas son muy peculiares. Liba el néctar de las flores con su fina trompa.","Está formado por seda que se endurece poco a poco. Si se resquebraja el capullo, está a punto de evolucionar.","Pokémon nocturno. Atraído por las luces de la ciudad, se come las hojas y arbustos de las avenidas.","Parece una planta acuática. Hace de ferry para los Pokémon que no saben nadar.","Vive en el agua y, cuando hace sol, se queda en la orilla. De día duerme sobre las algas y de noche entra en acción.","Cuando oye música alegre, sus músculos se llenan de energía, y no puede evitar ponerse a bailar.","Se cuelga de las ramas con el extremo de su cabeza. A veces se cae cuando soplan vientos fuertes.","Cuando usa la hoja de su cabeza como flauta, asusta a la gente. Vive en lo más profundo de los bosques.","Habita los bosques y se le tiene miedo. Es capaz de leer los pensamientos del rival y actuar en consecuencia.","Es un Pokémon valiente que no teme a los rivales fuertes. Vuela en busca de climas templados.","Cuando se encuentra bien, pone firmes las plumas de la cola doble que tiene. Remonta el vuelo de forma muy elegante.","Sus largas alas aprovechan los vientos marinos para planear. Cuando descansa, las pliega.","Hunde su gran pico en el mar para sacar numerosas presas junto con mucha agua.","Si sus cuernos perciben emociones positivas de personas o Pokémon, su cuerpo se calienta un poco.","Al percibir la alegría de su Entrenador refuerza sus ataques psicoquinéticos. Cuando está contento, da vueltas y baila.","Para proteger a su Entrenador, emplea todo su poder psíquico en crear un pequeño agujero negro.","Vive en estanques, pero cuando se desata una tormenta puede aparecer en los charcos que se forman en las ciudades.","Sus antenas tienen dibujos de ojos, mientras que sus alas le permiten volar en cualquier dirección.","Prefiere los sitios húmedos. De día está tranquilamente en el bosque, a la sombra. Expulsa polvo tóxico por la cabeza.","Sus cortos brazos se expanden cuando da puñetazos. Tiene una técnica pugilística muy depurada.","Slakoth se pasa todo el día holgazaneando y solo con verlo a uno le entra mucha pereza.","Su corazón palpita a un ritmo frenético, haciendo que su sangre bulla, así que no puede estarse quieto ni un segundo.","El Pokémon más perezoso del mundo. Cambia de lugar para coger la comida al alcance de su mano.","Como se ha pasado casi toda la vida viviendo bajo tierra, no ve bien. Las antenas que tiene le ayudan a orientarse.","Escuchar su zumbido de forma continuada provoca jaquecas. Casi no se le ve de lo rápido que es.","Es el caparazón de un bicho que cobró vida. Si alguien lo mira por la espalda, le robará el alma.","Normalmente murmulla, pero cuando siente que hay peligro se pone a chillar. Solo para cuando se le cierran las orejas.","Aspira profundamente y luego, usando sus fuertes abdominales, suelta un potente vozarrón.","Su aullido se puede oír a 10 km. Emite todo tipo de sonidos desde los tubos de su cuerpo.","Endurece su cuerpo golpeando grandes árboles sin perder jamás el ánimo.","Para aumentar su fuerza, da un pisotón en el suelo. Puede lanzar un camión de 10 toneladas por los aires de un puñetazo.","Vive cerca del agua. En la tierra se mueve muy rápido botando sobre su gran cola.","Siempre apunta al norte con su nariz imantada. Con ella reviste su cuerpo de objetos metálicos para protegerse.","No puede evitar ir tras las cosas que se mueven. Hasta corre en círculos persiguiéndose la cola.","No soporta los lugares sucios. Le encanta acicalarse el pelaje cuando está a gusto en un sitio.","Se oculta en cavernas oscuras. De tanto comer gemas, sus ojos son piedras preciosas.","Engaña con su aspecto dócil; hace que el rival se confíe y le da un mordisco con sus enormes e implacables mandíbulas.","Suele vivir en lugares inaccesibles de las montañas, pero el hambre lo empuja a comer raíles y coches.","Le encanta comer hierro. Lucha por su territorio embistiendo a sus rivales con su cuerpo de acero.","Hacen de toda una montaña su territorio. Cuantas más cicatrices tienen, más curtidos en disputas. ¡Mucha atención!","Se entrena en la profundidad de las montañas. Cuando aumenta su poder espiritual con meditación, levita.","Evita los ataques moviéndose de forma elegante, como si bailara. Ataca dando un golpe devastador y moviéndose igual.","Estimula sus músculos y aumenta sus reflejos con la electricidad que almacena su pelaje.","No suele aparecer ante la gente. Dicen que suele colocar su nido donde caen los rayos.","Anima a sus compañeros con pompones de chispas. Roba energía de los postes telefónicos.","La electricidad de Minun y Plusle es buena para la circulación y para desentumecer músculos.","Se comunica con otros iluminando su cola por la noche. Le encanta el suave aroma de Illumise.","Con su dulce aroma guía a grupos de Volbeat para que tracen hasta 200 dibujos distintos en el cielo nocturno.","Ataca con sus manos, en las que tiene un tipo de veneno diferente en cada una. Cuanto más aroma, mejor salud tiene.","Sus sesos y corazón son diminutos; es casi todo estómago. Sus jugos gástricos disuelven lo que sea.","Se traga cualquier cosa de una pieza. Sus poros segregan fluidos tóxicos que dañan a sus enemigos.","Atacan en grupo a los barcos y los hunden a base de bocados. Habitan en los ríos de la jungla.","Con sus colmillos puede atravesar el acero. Nada a 120 km/h. Le llaman el Terror de los Mares.","Le gusta botar como una pelota de playa. Cuanta más agua de mar traga, más alto puede llegar.","Puede dejar fuera de combate a sus oponentes con el impacto de su enorme cuerpo al caer en el agua tras un salto.","En su joroba almacena magma ardiente que se enfría cuando llueve y lo ralentiza.","Los volcanes de su joroba entran en erupción cada 10 años o cuando Camerupt se enfada mucho.","Trabaja sin descanso en minas en desuso localizando y extrayendo carbón.","Bota continuamente usando su cola como muelle. Salta para mantener el latido de su corazón.","Las perlas negras aumentan sus poderes psíquicos. Controla las mentes de sus rivales con un extraño baile.","No hay dos Spinda que tengan idénticos pelajes. Su tambaleo al bailar confunde a los rivales.","Habita desiertos áridos. Cava fosas profundas, en las que espera que caiga su presa.","Al agitar a gran velocidad ambas alas, emite ondas ultrasónicas que provocan fuertes dolores de cabeza.","Su medio es el desierto. Para esconderse, levanta arena con las patas. Tiene los ojos protegidos con mallas rojas.","Vive en regiones secas y con pocas lluvias. Una vez al año, le brota una flor amarilla.","Es un Pokémon nocturno. Busca presas agotadas por el calor diurno del desierto.","Se desconoce el porqué, pero le encanta posarse sobre la cabeza de los humanos y fingir que es un gorro.","Vuela pausadamente por el cielo azul. Su hermoso trino cautiva a todo aquel que lo escucha.","Hace muchos años que se enfrenta a Seviper. Su arma más eficaz son sus zarpas afiladas.","Hace frente a Zangoose con su agilidad y su afilada cola, que está cargada con un veneno letal.","Se piensa que está muy influido por las fases lunares, ya que solo actúa en noches de luna llena.","Usa el sol como fuente de energía, por lo que es más poderoso de día. Brilla al rotar.","Recubre su cuerpo de una película viscosa que le permite escapar si alguien lo agarra.","Habita en grandes pantanos. Si se acerca un enemigo, se alborota y causa temblores monumentales.","Por sucio o contaminado que esté el río, se adaptan rápido y se multiplican. Poseen una gran fuerza vital.","Este malandrín usa sus pinzas para atosigar y expulsar a los otros Pokémon que viven en su estanque.","Se mueve girando sobre su eje. También se le puede ver girando cabeza abajo.","Este Pokémon es una vieja figurilla de barro que cobró vida mediante la exposición a extraños rayos de luz.","Se extinguió hace 100 millones de años. Sus tentáculos parecen pétalos para atraer a sus presas.","Vive en el fondo de los mares de aguas templadas. Emerge para cazar cuando baja la marea.","Es una especie de Pokémon predecesor. Estira las pinzas para cazar a sus presas, que se esconden en las rocas del mar.","Ensarta a sus presas con sus gigantescas garras elásticas. Una fuerte coraza cubre su cuerpo.","Come de todo, por lo que puede vivir en aguas contaminadas. Nadie le presta atención.","Milotic es impresionantemente bello. Quienes lo ven, temen perder las ganas de luchar contra él.","Sus células son muy sensibles a los cambios de temperatura y humedad y se adapta sin problema.","Puede mudar el color de su cuerpo a voluntad, pero el dibujo en zigzag de su panza nunca desaparece.","Dicen que con su cuerno se alimenta de sentimientos de celos y envidia. Es muy activo a medianoche.","Este muñeco se convirtió en un Pokémon cuando lo tiraron a la basura. Busca a su antiguo dueño.","Persigue a su presa sin descanso allá donde vaya. No obstante, abandona la caza al amanecer.","Si alguien mira los fuegos fatuos del interior de Dusclops, perderá su alma irremediablemente.","Puede volar al agitar sus grandes hojas. Reparte entre los niños la codiciada fruta dulce que crece de su cuello.","Se cuelga de ramas y aleros con la ventosa de su cabeza. Tiene siete tipos de gritos diferentes.","Presiente desastres inminentes y se aparece a la gente para advertir del peligro.","Suelen ir en grupo y a la hora de dormir se resguardan en una cueva.","Se dice que se reúnen en grupos bajo hojas gigantescas y viven allí en total armonía.","Se protege con una armadura de hielo creada por congelación de la humedad del aire.","Como no saben nadar muy bien, se mueven rápidamente rodando. Cuando están alegres, dan palmadas con las aletas.","Su nariz es muy sensible. Cuando ve algo por primera vez, lo toca con ella para recordarlo después.","Rompe el hielo con sus colmillos. Su gruesa capa de grasa le protege del frío y de los enemigos.","Produce durante su vida una sola perla que aumenta los poderes psíquicos al evolucionar.","Vive en los abismos marinos, donde no se filtra la luz. Tiene una cola en forma de pez, que enciende para atraer a su presa.","Vive en el fondo del mar. En primavera, su cuerpo rosado adquiere colores más vivos.","No ha sufrido ningún cambio desde hace 100 millones de años. Fue descubierto durante una expedición marina.","Vive en mares cálidos. Se dice que, si una pareja lo encuentra, será bendecida con amor eterno.","Su desarrollado cuello y su cabeza dura como el acero le permiten reducir a añicos rocas enormes.","Las células han empezado a cambiar dentro de su dura concha, que se separa cuando evoluciona.","Si se enfada, no hay forma de calmarlo; lo destruye todo lanzando arañazos y llamas.","Los pulsos magnéticos de su cuerpo repelen la gravedad, lo que le permite flotar en el aire.","Lo forman dos Beldum unidos. Puede chocarse con un avión sin que su cuerpo de acero sufra ni un rasguño.","Gracias a sus cuatro cerebros, es más inteligente que un superordenador y analiza con precisión al enemigo.","Su cuerpo está hecho de roca. Si se astilla durante el combate, emplea piedras para repararlo.","Dicen que ha yacido durmiendo en un glaciar durante milenios. Ni el magma puede derretir su cuerpo.","Su cuerpo ha estado sometido a la presión subterránea durante miles de años y no puede arañarse.","Se comunica por telepatía. Su plumaje refleja la luz, lo que le permite hacerse invisible.","Es un Pokémon muy inteligente. Puede adelantar a aviones a reacción plegando las alas.","Pokémon legendario que aumentó los mares con diluvios y maremotos. Fue un enemigo acérrimo de Groudon.","Dicen que aumentó la superficie terrestre evaporando el agua. Fue un enemigo acérrimo de Kyogre.","Vive en la capa de ozono sobre las nubes y no puede ser visto desde el suelo.","Desde antaño se dice que concederá los deseos escritos en las notas de su cabeza cuando se despierte.","Surgió a raíz de la mutación de ADN de un virus alienígena que cayó a la Tierra en un meteorito.","Realiza la fotosíntesis al bañarle los rayos de sol. Su concha está formada por tierra endurecida.","Vive en los bosques cerca del agua. Por el día, sale a que les dé el sol a las plantas de su espalda.","Las gentes de antaño creían que el planeta se sustentaba en la espalda de un gran Torterra.","El gas de su panza alimenta el fuego de su parte trasera, que ni la lluvia puede extinguir.","Controla hábilmente la intensidad del fuego de su cola para mantener al enemigo a una distancia ideal.","Su corona de fuego demuestra su naturaleza ígnea. Nadie le gana en velocidad.","No le gusta que lo cuiden. Como no aprecia el apoyo de su Entrenador, le cuesta coger confianza con él.","Vive solo, alejado de los demás. Cada uno piensa que es el más importante.","Nada tan rápido como un fueraborda. Con los afilados bordes de sus alas puede cortar el hielo.","Viaja en grandes bandadas. Aunque es pequeño, agita las alas con gran fuerza.","Vive siempre en grandes grupos y las disputas dentro de ellos son muy intensas.","Sus alas y sus patas son muy fuertes. Puede llevarse volando Pokémon pequeños.","Tiene nervios de acero y nada puede perturbarlo. Es más ágil y activo de lo que aparenta.","Con sus incisivos roe ramas y raíces y las apila para construir sus madrigueras junto al río.","Hablan entre sí chocando las antenas. Los sonidos producidos son muy característicos.","Cuando llora, cruza sus brazos con forma de cuchillo. Puede improvisar melodías.","La extensión y contracción de sus músculos genera electricidad. Brilla cuando está en peligro.","Sus garras emiten electricidad que puede debilitar a sus rivales. Viven en grupos pequeños.","Cuando sus ojos brillan como el oro, puede ver presas escondidas, incluso detrás de un muro.","Vive cerca de aguas cristalinas. Su cabello se abre y esparce polen cuando le bañan los rayos del sol.","Atrae a sus presas con una dulce fragancia y usa sus cepas venenosas para atenazarlas y acabar con ellas.","Fue recreado a partir de un fósil con forma esférica. Derriba a las presas a cabezazos.","Tiene sesos pequeños porque su duro cráneo, que soporta cualquier golpe, les impide desarrollarse.","Se abrillanta la cara frotándola contra los árboles. Es vulnerable a los ataques por la espalda.","Se alineaban y creaban una barrera que ningún enemigo podía cruzar. Así protegían a sus crías.","Para protegerse de los vientos fríos invernales, se cubre con un caparazón de ramas y hojas.","Su apariencia varía según dónde evolucione. Los materiales que haya pasan a formar parte de su cuerpo.","Le encanta la miel de las flores y roba la que recoge Combee.","El trío se forma al nacer y se pasa la vida recogiendo miel de las flores para satisfacer a Vespiquen.","Cría larvas en los panales de su cuerpo. Segrega diversas feromonas de su cuerpo con las cuales controla a sus crías.","Crea bolas de pelo que crepitan con electricidad estática. Las almacena en agujeros de árboles.","Nada rotando sus dos colas a modo de tornillo. Cuando bucea, el flotador se pliega.","Nada gracias a su flotador. Ayuda en los rescates de gente que se está ahogando.","Bajo la luz solar es rojo. La esfera pequeña pierde sus nutrientes y se seca para anunciar la evolución.","Cuando los rayos de sol inundan su capullo, abre de par en par sus pétalos y se vuelve muy dinámico.","No hay que apretarle muy fuerte, ya que, si lo haces, secreta un misterioso fluido morado.","Si se ve amenazado por sus enemigos naturales, segrega un líquido morado y huye rápidamente.","Habitan en grandes colonias y forman anillos uniendo sus colas, aparentemente en signo de amistad.","Está formado por los espíritus de personas y Pokémon. Le encantan las estaciones húmedas.","Transporta a gente y a Pokémon volando, pero, como se deja llevar, puede acabar en cualquier sitio.","Lleva las orejas enrolladas. Cuando las extiende, golpea con tal fuerza que incluso puede romper rocas.","Este Pokémon resulta muy precavido. Si siente peligro, escapa corriendo a grandes saltos.","Recita cánticos. Algunos de ellos atormentan a sus rivales, mientras que otros producen felicidad.","Si uno lanza un grito profundo, los demás acuden. Por eso se le llama también Invocador de la Noche.","Araña cuando está enfadado y ronronea cuando está cariñoso. Su imprevisibilidad es famosa.","Si se siente a gusto, no tiene ningún reparo en apropiarse de las moradas de otros Pokémon.","Emite un tintineo cada vez que salta. Ensordece a sus rivales con sonidos de alta frecuencia.","Expulsa un fluido maloliente por sus cuartos traseros. El hedor repele Pokémon en un radio de 2 km.","Para atacar, emite un fluido maloliente por la punta de su cola que puede llegar a más de 50 m.","Antaño se creía que en los dibujos de su parte posterior residía una fuerza misteriosa.","Desde antaño se adora a este Pokémon para que propicie lluvias abundantes. A veces se esconde bajo tierra.","Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar los niveles de fluido corporal.","Desconcierta a sus rivales imitando sus movimientos a la perfección y aprovecha para darse a la fuga.","Les da a sus amigos una roca con forma de huevo que transporta en la bolsa de su panza.","Imita los sonidos de sus rivales, haciéndoles creer que son amigos e impidiendo que le ataquen.","Se formó a partir de 108 espíritus. Está unido a la fisura de una piedra angular mística.","Vive en agujeros en las cuevas, al amparo del calor geotérmico. Si se acerca un enemigo, le muerde.","Le gustan las cosas brillantes. Busca tesoros en cuevas y se lleva el botín a su nido.","Cuando despliega su cuerpo y sus alas, parece un avión a reacción. Vuela a velocidad sónica.","Esconde comida bajo el largo pelo de su cuerpo, pero más tarde lo olvida.","Se comunica con los suyos mediante la emisión de unas ondas que cambian de forma en función de los sentimientos.","Puede leer los pensamientos y movimientos de su adversario a través de su aura.","Vive en zonas áridas. En lugar de sudar, su cuerpo expulsa granos de arena.","Hace gala de su fuerza abriendo su enorme boca. Para atacar levanta gran cantidad de arena.","Agarra a sus presas con las pinzas de la cola y les inyecta veneno. Espera hasta que hace efecto.","Aunque sabe que puede aplastar al rival con su gran fuerza, le gusta dar el golpe de gracia con su virulento veneno.","Tiene bolsas venenosas en las mejillas. Pilla desprevenidos a sus rivales para pincharles.","Almacena veneno en una bolsa de la garganta. Cuando croa, este se agita para lograr mayor potencia.","Atrae a sus presas con saliva de olor dulce y las mastica. Tarda todo un día en comérselas.","La línea que le recorre el costado puede almacenar luz solar. Brilla con mucha fuerza por la noche.","Vive en las profundidades marinas. Atrae a sus presas con parpadeos del dibujo de sus cuatro aletas.","Los símbolos de su espalda cambian según la región. A veces se mezcla con bancos de Remoraid y nada junto a ellos.","En las estaciones frías baja al pie de la montaña, pero regresa a las cimas nevadas en primavera.","Genera ventiscas con las que cubre de nieve grandes áreas. Se le llama el Monstruo de Hielo.","Vive en zonas nevadas. Deja marcas en los árboles con sus garras para comunicarse con sus compañeros.","Emiten campos magnéticos tan potentes que se atraen entre sí e incluso pueden llegar a inmovilizarse.","Agarra cosas con su lengua extensible. Si te acercas mucho, te deja lleno de babas.","Lanza Geodude por los agujeros de las manos. Gracias a Protector resiste erupciones volcánicas.","Atrapa a su presa desplegando las ramas de sus brazos, que no le importa perder ante depredadores.","Al almacenar mucha electricidad, desprende chispas de una claridad increíble entre sus dos cuernos.","Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. Vive en cráteres volcánicos.","Se dice que aparece en zonas pacíficas y las bendice con sus dones.","Su técnica favorita consiste en volar a gran velocidad y despedazar con su mandíbula a su oponente en un instante.","En días soleados duerme y hace la fotosíntesis, emitiendo aire puro a su alrededor.","Controla su temperatura corporal para congelar el ambiente y causar ráfagas de nieve en polvo.","Espera a sus presas colgado de una rama bocabajo. Cuando llega su oportunidad, se lanza en picado.","Ya existía en la antigüedad. Se encontró uno bajo hielo de hace más de 10 000 años.","Se le instaló un software para mejorarlo. Sin embargo, comenzó a comportarse de manera extraña.","Puede presentir los movimientos de sus rivales y por eso ataca siempre antes que ellos.","Emana un fuerte magnetismo. Controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices.","Se dice que recoge en su cuerpo flexible a los espíritus extraviados y los guía hasta casa.","Congela a sus enemigos con un aliento gélido de -50 °C. Su cuerpo está hueco.","Desde hace mucho tiempo se estudia su singular motor como fuente de energía motriz.","Se le conoce como el Ser de la Sabiduría. Se dice que puede borrar la memoria con una mirada.","Se le conoce como el Ser de la Emoción. Enseñó a los humanos la nobleza del dolor y la alegría.","Se le conoce como el Ser de la Voluntad. Duerme en el fondo de un lago para equilibrar el mundo.","Un Pokémon de leyenda. Se dice que el tiempo comenzó a avanzar cuando Dialga nació.","Se dice que vive en una dimensión espacial paralela. Aparece en la mitología.","Habita cuevas volcánicas. Cava con sus pies en forma de cruz para trepar por techos y paredes.","Se dice que usó rocas, magma y un hielo especial de montaña para crear Pokémon con su aspecto.","Vive en el Mundo Distorsión, un mundo opuesto al nuestro y cuyas leyes desafían el sentido común.","Sus alas emiten un velo de partículas brillantes. Se dice que representa un cuarto lunar.","Si sube la temperatura del mar, infla el flotador de su cabeza y flota en grupo en la superficie.","Nace con un maravilloso poder que le permite establecer vínculos con cualquier tipo de Pokémon.","Defiende su territorio de personas y Pokémon haciéndoles dormir y provocándoles pesadillas.","Puede disolver las toxinas del aire para transformar tierra yerma en campos de flores.","Según la mitología de Sinnoh, Arceus surgió de un huevo y después creó todo el mundo.","Pokémon que atrae la victoria. Dicen que el Entrenador que lo lleve saldrá vencedor de cualquier batalla.","Cuando recibe los rayos de sol, se mueve mucho más rápido que de costumbre. Usa mejor sus lianas que sus manos.","Parece que se desliza al correr. Engaña a sus rivales con su velocidad y los fustiga con su látigo.","Tan solo muestra su verdadero poder a quienes no se amedrentan ante su noble pero inquisitoria mirada.","Evita con agilidad los ataques enemigos. Lanza bolas de fuego por su hocico y tuesta bayas del bosque para comer.","Cuanto más come, más combustible tiene en su interior para avivar sus llamas, con lo que también aumenta su poder.","Calienta sus puños con las llamas de su barbilla para propinar puñetazos ardientes. Es muy fiel a sus compañeros.","La vieira de su ombligo no solo sirve como arma, sino también como instrumento para cortar las bayas que estén duras.","Gran espadachín. Utiliza sus dos vieiras con soltura al ejecutar las técnicas que aprende con una disciplina espartana.","En un abrir y cerrar de ojos, puede desenvainar y envainar los sables que hay en sus patas delanteras.","Almacena víveres en unas bolsas en sus mofletes y vigila durante días. Hace señales con la cola a sus compañeros.","Los componentes luminiscentes de su interior hacen que sus ojos y su cuerpo brillen, y así intimida a sus rivales.","Los mechones que cubren su cara actúan como un magnífico radar para detectar con precisión lo que hay a su alrededor.","Este Pokémon es muy leal. No solo ayuda a Entrenadores, sino que también se preocupa por otros Pokémon.","Socorre a humanos perdidos en montañas azotadas por ventiscas. Su largo pelaje le protege del frío.","Distrae a su oponente con movimientos gráciles y sustrae sus pertenencias. Cuando se enfada, ataca con las garras.","Su bella y grácil silueta le viene dada por su desarrollada musculatura, que le permite andar de noche sin hacer ruido.","Comparte las hojas de su cabeza con Pokémon agotados. Posee la facultad de aliviar el cansancio.","Ataca estampando las espinas de su cola en el enemigo. Es un Pokémon con mucho temperamento.","Pokémon muy inteligente que tiene la costumbre de tostar las bayas antes de comérselas. Ayuda mucho a los humanos.","Achicharra a sus enemigos desprendiendo llamas por la cola y la cabeza, fruto de su desmesurado calor interno.","El agua acumulada en su mata de pelo es rica en nutrientes. Usa su cola para regar plantas con esa misma agua.","Cuando lanza agua a alta presión con su cola, puede incluso resquebrajar una pared de cemento.","Cuando un humano o un Pokémon sufre una pesadilla, Munna se aparece ante ellos y la engulle.","Multitud de sueños de humanos y Pokémon se encuentran atrapados en el humo que despide por su frente.","Es un Pokémon muy despistado. Aunque reciba órdenes de su Entrenador, se le olvidan, y se queda esperando.","Según los rumores, en lo más profundo del bosque donde mora Tranquill, hay un mundo pacífico y exento de luchas.","El macho amenaza al enemigo meciendo el adorno de su cabeza. Al volar, la hembra es mucho más diestra que el macho.","Aparece cuando nubes envueltas en rayos encapotan el cielo. Atrapa rayos con su crin y almacena electricidad.","Es un Pokémon con mucho temperamento. Cuando se enoja, lanza rayos desde su crin en todas direcciones.","Su oreja tiene forma hexagonal. Su cuerpo fue comprimido bajo tierra. Por eso, es duro como el acero.","La energía que no puede contener en el interior de su cuerpo se escapa formando cristales naranjas.","Absorbe los rayos solares, procesa esa energía en su núcleo y lanza poderosas bolas de luz a sus enemigos.","Vive en bosques oscuros y cavernas. Emite ultrasonidos por la nariz para saber todo lo que pasa a su alrededor.","Cuando emite ondas ultrasónicas, que incluso pueden reventar el cemento, agita su cola con vehemencia.","Cuando junta las garras y comienza a dar vueltas frenéticas, avanza bajo tierra a gran velocidad.","Su taladro ha evolucionado y es capaz de atravesar una lámina de hierro. Es muy útil para construir túneles.","Con las antenas de sus oídos, perciben el estado de un rival o predicen cuándo va a eclosionar un Huevo Pokémon.","Siempre lleva vigas de madera. Normalmente ayuda en obras de construcción.","Gracias a su entrenada musculatura, puede blandir vigas de acero sin problema para así derribar edificios enteros.","Se cree que Conkeldurr enseñó a los humanos la técnica para elaborar cemento hace más de 2000 años.","Emite sonidos imperceptibles para los humanos con la vibración de sus mejillas y advierte de algún peligro a los suyos.","Cuando hace vibrar el bulto de su cabeza, no solo se embravece el mar, sino que la tierra también tiembla.","Aumenta la potencia de sus puñetazos haciendo vibrar sus puños. Es capaz de quebrar una roca de un solo golpe.","Aumenta su potencia si se aprieta el cinturón. Un Throh salvaje teje su propio cinturón usando lianas.","Para lograr dominar las técnicas de kárate más letales, se retiran a las montañas y entrenan día y noche.","Recorta hojas y las teje con el líquido viscoso que segrega por la boca para hacerse su propia ropa.","La vegetación abunda en los bosques que habita. Este Pokémon transforma las hojas caídas en nutrientes.","Si se encuentra con un Pokémon joven, segrega por la boca hilos pegadizos con los que le teje una prenda de ropa.","Percibe su entorno con su sentido del tacto, residente en su cabeza y cola. Su carácter es violento por naturaleza.","Lo protege un duro caparazón. Gira como una rueda y realiza brutales placajes contra sus enemigos.","Atenaza a sus presas con las garras que sobresalen de su cuello hasta que no se pueden mover y las remata con veneno.","Despide motas de algodón cuando lo atacan para confundir a los enemigos y poner pies en polvorosa.","Aparecen en medio de un torbellino y entran en las casas para descolocar los muebles o esparcir algodón por doquier.","Mordisquear las hojas de su cabeza permite recuperar toda la vitalidad, a pesar de que están muy amargas.","El aroma de la flor de su tocado relaja a cualquiera a su alrededor. Hay que cuidarle mucho para que no se marchite.","Los de color azul y los de color rojo siempre se pelean. Son muy violentos, pero su sabor es excepcional.","Se desplaza hundido en la arena, dejando al descubierto solo los ojos y la nariz. Una membrana negra le protege los ojos.","Viven en manadas. La membrana que cubre sus ojos los protege de la arena.","Un Pokémon bastante violento. Ataca todo lo que se mueva delante de él con sus mortíferas mandíbulas.","Como sus excrementos están muy calientes, la gente de antaño se los metía en los bolsillos para calentarse.","Cuando resulta gravemente herido, se endurece como una piedra y medita para agudizar la mente.","Espanta a los Pokémon pájaro con un baile rápido y haciendo ruido para evitar que picoteen las semillas de sus flores.","Abre un agujero en la roca y vive en él. Si la roca se resquebraja, no se queda tranquilo hasta que no encuentra otra.","Su inmensa capacidad motriz le permite desplazarse cargando a sus espaldas rocas enormes durante días.","Se sube la piel hasta el cuello para defenderse. Su elasticidad, similar a la de una goma, reduce el daño recibido.","Se protege de los ataques con la muda de su piel mientras reparte patadas. Cuanto mayor es su cresta, más se le respeta.","Fue la deidad protectora de una ciudad milenaria. Ataca con su poder psíquico a los enemigos que invaden su territorio.","Almas de humanos sepultados en tumbas que han adquirido forma de Pokémon. Recuerdan su vida antes de la muerte.","Se comenta que engulle a todo humano que se le acerca y lo momifica. Su comida favorita son las pepitas de oro.","Ya pululaba por las aguas hace 100 millones de años. También va a tierra a veces en busca de alimento.","Vive en el mar y en la superficie. Sus garras pueden abrir un agujero en el fondo de un petrolero.","Pokémon que renació de un fósil. Dicen que es el antepasado de todos los Pokémon pájaro.","Levanta el vuelo tras coger carrerilla. Coopera con sus compañeros de bandada para atrapar a sus presas.","Pokémon nacido de la reacción química entre una bolsa de basura y residuos industriales.","Apresa a su rival con el brazo izquierdo y le da el golpe de gracia exhalando por la boca un apestoso gas venenoso.","Adopta la apariencia de su enemigo para engañarlo vilmente y aprovecha su estupor para poner tierra por medio.","Tiene la facultad de confundir a muchos humanos a la vez. Protege su guarida creando un paisaje ilusorio.","Se saludan entre sí frotándose con la cola y limpiándose a conciencia.","El pelo que cubre su cuerpo proporciona una agradable sensación al tocarlo. No acumula ni polvo ni electricidad estática.","Amplifica su poder psíquico con sus antenitas en forma de lazo. Siempre está mirando algo fijamente.","La luz de las estrellas origina su poder. De noche, marca su posición haciendo levitar piedras con su poder psíquico.","Su inmenso poder psíquico distorsiona el espacio y le permite reflejar incluso estrellas a años luz de distancia.","Gracias a la sustancia viscosa que envuelve su cuerpo, permanece tranquilo por dura o rigurosa que sea la situación.","Dado que su cerebro está dividido en dos, a veces tiene conflictos a la hora de decidir qué hacer.","Hacen gala de su poder psíquico y mueven sus brazos compuestos de líquido para controlar rocas y hacerlas añicos.","Cuando se ve atacado, las plumas que lo recubren despiden ráfagas de agua que lo ayudan a escapar.","Aunque no lo parezca por su grácil elegancia, puede batir con fuerza las alas y volar durante miles de kilómetros.","Lanza un aliento de -50 °C. Crea bloques de nieve y es capaz de lograr que nieve a su alrededor.","Enfrían el aire a su alrededor y crean partículas de hielo mediante las cuales congelan a sus oponentes.","Si sus dos cabezas se irritan al mismo tiempo, genera una ventisca desde su cuerno cubriendo su entorno con nieve.","El color de su cuerpo cambia no solo con las estaciones, sino también con los cambios de humedad y temperatura.","Cambia de morada dependiendo de las estaciones. Observando sus cuernos, la gente sabe cuándo estas van a cambiar.","Vive en la copa de los árboles. Produce descargas mientras vuela con el interior de la membrana que hace de capa.","Si recibe un estímulo eléctrico al estar en contacto con un Shelmet, evoluciona.","Se defienden de los ataques con el caparazón que roban a los Shelmet. Atacan con sus dos mortíferas lanzas.","Gracias a su misterioso parecido a una Poké Ball, atrae a sus presas y lanza rápidamente esporas de veneno.","Aunque intenta pasar por parte superior de una Poké Ball para atraer a sus presas, consigue engañar a pocos.","Paraliza a sus presas con veneno y las lleva a su morada, que se encuentra a 8000 m en el fondo del mar.","Su cuerpo se compone de agua salada. Dicen que ha construido un palacio en el fondo del mar con restos de barcos.","Vive flotando a la deriva en mar abierto. Siempre que encuentra un Pokémon herido, lo abraza y lo lleva a la costa.","No puede generar electricidad por sí mismo, así que se encarama a Pokémon grandes y absorbe su energía estática.","Pone trampas con hilos electrificados. De este modo, electrocuta a sus enemigos y los inmoviliza por completo.","Lanza numerosas púas al detectar peligro. En cuanto tiene ocasión, echa a rodar y se escapa.","Azota al enemigo con sus tres tentáculos y después dispara púas hasta que no deja ni rastro del rival.","Genera la energía vital que necesita haciendo girar sus dos cuerpos.","Muestra sus sentimientos cambiando la dirección de su giro. Cuanto más se enfade, más rápido girará.","Recarga su energía rápidamente haciendo girar con gran celeridad el engranaje equipado con un núcleo rojo.","La electricidad de uno solo es diminuta, pero, si multitud de Tynamo se conectan, consiguen la potencia de un rayo.","Se enrolla alrededor de su presa, la paraliza con la electricidad de sus marcas circulares y le asesta mordiscos.","Pega la ventosa de su boca en su presa y la electrocuta con sus colmillos.","Posee un gran poder psíquico. Lo usa para comprimir el cerebro del enemigo y ocasionarle dolores de cabeza.","Parece que se comunica haciendo brillar sus dedos tricolores, pero nadie ha conseguido descifrar aún su patrón.","Finge ser una luz guía en el camino, pero en realidad solo quiere absorber la energía vital de quien lo sigue.","Al absorber almas, su llama se enciende. Espera a que la gente fallezca, así que suele deambular por los hospitales.","Sus llamas absorben el alma del enemigo y la abrasan, dejando solo su cuerpo inerte.","Usa sus colmillos para romper las bayas que come. Estos se regeneran una y otra vez, por eso son tan fuertes y afilados.","Sus colmillos pueden hacer añicos rocas inmensas. Las luchas territoriales de los Fraxure son encarnizadas.","Es gentil, pero no perdona a todo el que ose invadir su territorio. Su mayor baza son sus colmillos, que cortan el acero.","Siempre está con mucosidades colgando. Las aspira para hacer un movimiento, ya que son su materia prima para esto.","Adoran los mares gélidos del norte. Congelan su aliento para crear sendas por las que caminar sobre las aguas.","Nació entre nubes de nieve. Atrapa a sus presas con una cadena hecha de hielo cristalizado.","Si está junto a Karrablast, y ambos reciben una descarga eléctrica, evolucionan los dos a la vez.","Se siente ligero una vez liberado de su caparazón. Lucha y se mueve como un ninja.","Ni un pisotón de un luchador de sumo lo aplastaría gracias a su piel sólida. Sonríe al soltar descargas eléctricas.","La velocidad de sus ataques es su gran orgullo. Lo que le falta de fuerza bruta lo compensa en cantidad de golpes.","Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a manera de látigos. Sus ataques alcanzan velocidades de vértigo.","Corre por estrechas cavernas y atrapa a sus presas con sus afiladas garras. La piel de la cara es más dura que una roca.","Se mueve gracias a la energía que quema dentro de su cuerpo, pero el origen de esta energía es incierto.","Al parecer, aquel que antaño lo creó le ordenó proteger a los Pokémon y a los humanos.","Su cuerpo está provisto de hojas afiladas. Cuando se desgastan, las afila con cantos rodados a la orilla del río.","Un Pokémon temible que remata a su presa una vez que su séquito de Pawniard la ha debilitado e inmovilizado.","Embiste con la cabeza sin distinción. Su potencia es capaz de hacer descarrilar un tren en marcha.","Quiebra bayas con sus extremidades. Se enfrenta con valentía a todo enemigo por fuerte que este sea.","Un valiente guerrero del cielo que no duda en luchar por sus compañeros por graves que sean sus heridas.","No puede volar porque sus alas son muy pequeñas. Cuando va a evolucionar, se deshace de su calavera.","Vuela en círculos. Cuando avista una presa, la ataca y la transporta a su nido con suma facilidad.","Usa su lengua de fuego para derretir la armadura de acero de los Durant y llegar así hasta su interior.","Actúan en grupo para expulsar de sus colonias a los Heatmor, sus depredadores naturales.","No ve, por eso va haciendo placajes y dando mordiscos a diestro y siniestro. Su cuerpo está plagado de heridas.","Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal, y la que consigue comer más que la otra es la que lleva la voz cantante.","Las cabezas de sus dos brazos no tienen cerebro. Con sus tres cabezas destruye y devora todo a su paso.","Se dice que nació del sol. Al evolucionar, cubre su cuerpo con llamas que brotan de sus cuernos.","Cuando combate, despide escamas ardientes de sus seis alas y genera un mar ígneo a su alrededor.","Posee un cuerpo y un corazón de acero. Basta una mirada suya para que Pokémon violentos le obedezcan.","Su potencia al embestir es capaz de derribar las murallas de un castillo. Las leyendas hablan de sus proezas.","Sus cuernos son hojas afiladas. Sacude a sus enemigos con sus relampagueantes movimientos y los reduce.","La parte inferior de su cuerpo, similar a una nube, está recubierta de un campo de energía. Vuela a 300 km/h.","Lanza descargas eléctricas por las púas de su cola. Sobrevuela Teselia dejando caer rayos.","Pokémon legendario capaz de abrasar el mundo con sus llamas. Ayuda a quienes persiguen un mundo veraz.","Pokémon legendario capaz de chamuscar el mundo con sus rayos. Ayuda a quienes persiguen un mundo de ideales.","Lo consideran una deidad de las cosechas porque los cultivos crecen en abundancia en las tierras por las que pasa.","Pokémon legendario que aguarda al héroe que compense el vacío de su cuerpo de hielo con verdad e ideales.","Corre por mares, ríos o cualquier superficie acuática de todo el mundo. Aparece en aguas límpidas.","Las melodías que canta Meloetta tienen el poder de hacer sentir felicidad a los Pokémon que hay a su alrededor.","Pokémon de tipo Bicho de la antigüedad, modificado por el Equipo Plasma. El cañón de su lomo ha sido mejorado."],"y":[null,"Después de nacer, crece alimentándose de las semillas de su lomo.","Cuando el bulbo de su lomo se hincha, desprende un dulce aroma para indicar el florecimiento.","Después de un día de lluvia, la flor de su lomo tiene un aroma más potente y atrae a otros Pokémon.","Este Pokémon nace con una llama en la punta de la cola. Si la llama se apagara, el Pokémon se debilitaría.","Cuando balancea la ardiente cola, eleva la temperatura a niveles muy altos.","Con las alas que tiene puede alcanzar una altura de casi 1400 m. Suele escupir fuego por la boca.","Lanza agua a su presa desde el agua. Se esconde en su concha cuando se siente en peligro.","Se dice que vive 10 000 años. Su peluda cola es un símbolo de longevidad.","Es un Pokémon imponente. Tiene reactores de agua en el caparazón, que le sirven para atacar con fuerza.","Sus patas tienen ventosas con las que se adhiere a cualquier sitio. Escala árboles buscando forraje.","Este Pokémon es vulnerable al ataque cuando su coraza es blanda y no lo protege del todo.","Tiene las alas protegidas con una capa impermeable, de ahí que pueda volar también cuando llueve.","Su venenoso aguijón es muy potente y su colorido cuerpo hace que los enemigos huyan.","Se esconde de sus atacantes entre las ramas de los árboles mientras espera a evolucionar.","Puede aparecer en enjambres volando a gran velocidad. Suele usar el venenoso aguijón inferior para atacar.","Es manso y prefiere evitar los problemas. Sin embargo, si le molestan atacará ferozmente.","Muy protector de su amplio territorio, este Pokémon picoteará ferozmente a los intrusos.","Para intimidar a su enemigo, extiende las increíbles alas que tiene. Este Pokémon vuela a una velocidad increíble.","Tiene unos largos y afilados colmillos que no dejan de crecer. Le resultan muy útiles para destruir cosas.","Con las membranas de las patas traseras, puede atravesar ríos. Busca su alimento en zonas extensas.","Come bichos en zonas de hierba. Agita sus cortas alas muy rápido para mantenerse en el aire.","Tiene energía para volar todo el día con sus grandes alas. Lucha con su afilado pico.","Es muy silencioso y cauteloso. Come huevos de pájaros como los de Pidgey y Spearow.","Para intimidar a sus enemigos, hincha el pecho y echa aire por la boca emitiendo sonidos.","Las bolsas de las mejillas están llenas de electricidad, que libera cuando se siente amenazado.","Puede emitir ráfagas de 100 000 voltios capaces de acabar con rivales enormes.","Como odia el agua, vive en madrigueras muy profundas en zonas áridas. Puede hacerse una bola al instante.","Ante el peligro, se acurruca en un espinoso ovillo. De esta forma puede rodar para atacar o escapar.","De pequeño tamaño y dócil, cuando se le ataca, utiliza el cuerno venenoso que tiene encima de la cabeza.","Cuando alimenta a sus crías, primero mastica y ablanda la comida y luego la escupe para su prole.","Tiene el cuerpo recubierto de escamas duras y cortantes. Cuando se inquieta, las usa para defenderse.","Cambia la orientación de las grandes orejas que tiene para oír mejor. Si se enfada, despliega sus púas venenosas.","Un Pokémon agresivo, siempre listo para atacar. El cuerno de la cabeza segrega un potente veneno.","Un golpe de su poderosa cola puede partir un poste de teléfono como si fuese una cerilla.","La luz de luna que guarda en las alas de su lomo parece darle la habilidad de flotar en el aire.","Un encantador y tímido Pokémon muy raro de ver. Corre y se oculta en cuanto siente que viene gente.","De pequeño, tiene seis colas increíbles. A medida que crece, le van saliendo más.","Muy inteligente y vengativo. Agarrar una de sus colas podría traer 1000 años de mala suerte.","Si se hincha para cantar una nana, cantará más tiempo y podría causar sopor en el público.","Su cuerpo es blando y gomoso. Cuando se enfada, traga aire y se hincha muchísimo.","No tiene ojos. Se guía por las ondas ultrasónicas que emite. El eco le indica por dónde tiene que ir en la oscuridad.","Cuando chupa sangre, no para hasta hartarse. Por la noche sale volando a la caza de presas.","Su nombre científico es “Oddium Wanderus”. Se dice que de noche puede llegar a desplazarse hasta 300 m con sus dos raíces.","La miel que emana de su boca posee un hedor capaz de derribar enemigos a 2 km de distancia.","Tiene los pétalos más grandes del mundo. Estos expulsan densas nubes de polen tóxico al caminar.","Escarba bajo el suelo para roer las raíces de los árboles. Sus setas absorben los nutrientes.","Cuanto más grande sea la seta de su lomo, más resistentes serán las esporas que esta suelta.","Vive entre las sombras de árboles altos, donde come insectos. Por la noche, le atrae la luz.","Tiene las alas cubiertas de un polvillo de escamas que esparce cada vez que las bate.","Su piel es muy fina. Si se expone a la luz, su sangre se calienta y su crecimiento se debilita.","Muy poderosos, pueden excavar hasta los terrenos más duros a una profundidad de más de 100 km.","Adora los objetos redondos. De noche, camina por las calles en busca de monedas perdidas.","Sus ágiles músculos le permiten moverse sin hacer ruido. Ataca al instante.","Tiene poderes místicos que no recuerda haber usado. Por eso, siempre parece desconcertado.","Las patas traseras palmípedas le permiten nadar. Es común verlo chapotear con estilo en lagos y otras zonas acuáticas.","Vive en colonias en los árboles. Si uno se enfada, el resto de la manada ataca sin motivo.","Siempre está tremendamente enfadado. Cuando se empeña en una presa, no hay distancia para él.","De naturaleza valiente y honrada, se enfrenta sin miedo a enemigos más grandes y fuertes.","Su magnífico ladrido transmite majestuosidad. Todo el que lo escuche no podrá evitar adularlo.","La dirección de la espiral en el vientre cambia según el área. Prefiere nadar a correr.","Tiene unas extremidades inferiores muy desarrolladas. Aunque puede vivir en tierra, prefiere el medio acuático.","Experto nadador tanto a braza como a crol. Gana fácilmente a los nadadores profesionales.","Siente los ataques inminentes y se teletransporta a un lugar seguro, antes de que estos puedan darle.","Si usa sus habilidades, emite ondas alfa especiales que hacen que las máquinas fallen.","Su cerebro puede ganar al de un ordenador de alta gama. Tiene un coeficiente intelectual de 5000.","Es una masa de músculos y, aunque es pequeño, tiene fuerza de sobra para tomar en brazos a 100 personas.","Puede levantar un gran camión con una mano. Utiliza su fuerza para ayudar a la gente.","Usa sus cuatro poderosos brazos para agarrar a su enemigo y lanzarlo lo más lejos posible.","Tiene cara de persona. Por el aspecto que tiene se ha comentado que podría ser algún tipo de mandrágora legendaria.","Escupe Polvo Veneno para envenenar al enemigo y, luego, lo liquida con Ácido.","Cuando este Pokémon ingiere algo, incluso el objeto más duro se disolverá al instante.","Va a la deriva a poca profundidad. Si es pescado por accidente, el castigo será su punzante ácido.","Tiene 80 tentáculos que se mueven a su aire. Con ellos, pica, envenena y causa un dolor agudo e intenso.","Es imposible distinguirlos de las rocas. Para probar su dureza, chocan entre sí en duelo.","Se mueve rodando cuesta abajo y sobre cualquier obstáculo, sin frenar ni cambiar de dirección.","Ni siquiera la dinamita puede dañar su cuerpo rocoso. Muda la piel una vez al año.","Fortalece las patas mientras sigue a sus padres. Corre en el campo y en la montaña todo el día.","Galopa a casi 240 km por hora. Su crin ardiente parece una flecha cuando corre.","Descansa ocioso junto al agua. Si algo muerde su cola, no lo notará en todo el día.","Según parece, cuando Slowpoke fue a pescar al río, le mordió un Shellder en la cola y así se convirtió en Slowbro.","Está suspendido en el aire y no para de moverse. A través de las extremidades laterales dispara Onda Trueno.","Es capaz de elevar 2 °C la temperatura en un radio de un kilómetro emitiendo extrañas ondas electromagnéticas.","Siempre lleva un puerro consigo, con el que construye su nido.","Parece que los cerebros de sus dos cabezas se comunican por telepatía.","Es una especie muy rara y difícil de encontrar. Las tres cabezas simbolizan la alegría, la tristeza y la ira.","Está recubierto de un pelaje de color azul, y tiene una piel gruesa y tosca. Se mantiene activo a -40 °C.","Su aerodinámico cuerpo avanza fácilmente por el agua. Cuanto más fría, más diversión.","Aparece en zonas asquerosas. Crece absorbiendo los residuos tóxicos expulsados por las fábricas.","Su cuerpo segrega un fluido tóxico que elimina la vida vegetal cuando la toca.","Cuando atenaza a sus enemigos, se vuelve vulnerable. Por eso solo utiliza esta técnica como último recurso.","La concha que lo cubre es extremadamente dura. No es posible causarle rasguños y solo se abre si lo atacan.","Nació a partir de gases venenosos que asfixiarían a cualquiera que se viera envuelto en ellos.","Utiliza su lengua gaseosa para chupar la vida de la víctima. Acecha a sus presas en la oscuridad.","De noche, se oculta en las sombras y absorbe el calor de la gente. El frío que transmite es estremecedor.","Suele vivir bajo tierra. Va buscando comida a medida que se va abriendo camino a 80 km por hora.","Si crees haber tenido un buen sueño y no puedes acordarte, seguro que se lo ha comido un Drowzee.","Mirar su péndulo puede inducir al sueño en tres segundos, incluso si acabas de despertarte.","Es fácil encontrarlo cerca del mar. Las largas pinzas que tiene vuelven a crecer si se las quitan de su sitio.","Su pinza es muy grande. Si la levanta demasiado rápido, pierde el equilibrio y se tambalea.","Suele vivir en centrales de energía. Mucha gente acaba muy mal al confundirlo con una Poké Ball.","Almacena una enorme cantidad de electricidad en su cuerpo. Una pequeña sacudida le hará explotar.","Aunque los huevos que lo constituyen parecen de verdad, se ha visto que son como semillas.","Se le llama la Selva Andante. Si una cabeza crece demasiado, se cae y forma un Exeggcute.","Siempre lleva la calavera de su difunta madre, así que nadie sabe cómo es su cara oculta.","El hueso que lleva es su gran arma. Lo lanza hábilmente como un bumerán y deja a todos fuera de combate.","Si empieza a dar patadas, sus patas se alargarán aún más para golpear al enemigo en su huida.","Dicen que tiene el alma de un boxeador profesional. Da puñetazos a la velocidad del rayo.","La lengua es tan larga que duplica su altura. Es útil porque puede moverla para agarrar comida y atacar.","Los gases de su cuerpo le permiten flotar. Estos gases, además de oler mal, también son explosivos.","En raras ocasiones, se produce una mutación y dos pequeños Koffing se unen formando un Weezing.","Es un poco torpe al girar debido a sus cuatro cortas patas. Solo puede atacar y correr en una dirección.","Cuando evoluciona, comienza a andar con las patas traseras. Es capaz de horadar rocas con el cuerno que tiene.","Pone varios huevos al día. Según parece son muy nutritivos y están riquísimos.","Enreda cualquier cosa que se mueva con sus lianas. Si te atrapa, te hará cosquillas con su delicado balanceo.","Si no hay peligro, el joven sale de la bolsa y juega. El adulto vigila atentamente al joven.","Hace su nido entre los corales. Si se siente en peligro, escupe tinta y huye.","Puede nadar hacia atrás moviendo rápidamente las aletas pectorales y la robusta cola que tiene.","Sus aletas dorsal, trasera y pectoral ondean gráciles en el agua. Por eso es llamado el Bailarín Acuático.","Hace su nido en los agujeros que cava con el cuerno. Defiende sus huevos con su vida.","Suele aparecer en grupos en la orilla de la playa. Por la noche, el órgano central que tiene brilla con una luz roja.","El centro de su cuerpo alberga un órgano que emite extrañas señales de radio en la noche.","Dicen que puede hacer un muro a partir del aire mediante la pantomima. Es experto en crear ilusiones ópticas.","Avanza por la hierba con sus afiladas guadañas, más rápido de lo que el ojo humano pueda percibir.","Habla emitiendo sonidos que parecen humanos. Se está intentando descifrar lo que dice cuando habla.","Le encanta alimentarse de alta tensión. A veces, aparece cerca de centrales eléctricas y zonas similares.","Nació en el centro de un volcán. Su cuerpo está cubierto de llamas que brillan como el Sol.","Arremete violentamente con su cornamenta. Cuando llega el frío, se adentra en los bosques.","Cuando va a usar Placaje, se azota repetidas veces con las tres colas que tiene.","En un pasado lejano, era más fuerte de lo que hoy son sus débiles descendientes.","No es frecuente verlo en su medio. Es enorme y malvado, y capaz de destruir ciudades enteras de un ataque.","Tiene un coeficiente intelectual tan alto que puede entender el lenguaje humano. Le encanta llevar a gente sobre el lomo.","Tiene la capacidad de reorganizar su estructura celular para convertirse en otras formas de vida.","Su irregular estructura genética encierra el secreto de su capacidad para adoptar evoluciones de lo más diversas.","Ha evolucionado para adaptarse a la vida acuática. Se mimetiza a la perfección con el agua.","Acumula iones negativos de la atmósfera para lanzar rayos de 10 000 voltios de potencia.","Almacena llamas en el interior de su cuerpo. Tras inhalar profundamente, las lanza a una temperatura de 1700 °C.","Un Pokémon formado por códigos de programación. Se mueve libre por el ciberespacio.","Resucitado de un fósil, este Pokémon usa el aire de su concha para sumergirse y emerger.","Cuando agarra a su presa, nunca la deja escapar. Se la come despedazándola con sus colmillos.","Es un Pokémon regenerado a partir de un fósil de una criatura ancestral. Está protegido por un duro caparazón.","Este Pokémon es un hábil y rápido nadador. Atrapa a su presa para drenar sus fluidos vitales.","Dicen que este malvado Pokémon volaba por los antiguos cielos profiriendo sus agudos gritos.","Su estómago puede digerir todo tipo de comida, incluso si está podrida o mohosa.","Es un legendario pájaro Pokémon. Se aparece a la gente que se ha perdido en las heladas montañas.","Legendario Pokémon pájaro del que se dice que vive en los nubarrones. Controla los rayos eléctricos.","Uno de los legendarios Pokémon pájaro. Dicen que su presencia anuncia la llegada de la primavera.","Este Pokémon está lleno de vida. Muda su piel continuamente y crece cada vez más.","Es un Pokémon misterioso. Está rodeado de una sutil aura y tiene la capacidad de cambiar el clima.","Se dice que vive en algún lugar del mar. Guía a las tripulaciones de los barcos hundidos a la costa.","Pokémon creado por recombinación genética de Mew. Se dice que es el más salvaje de los Pokémon.","Dicen que su ADN contiene el código genético de todos los Pokémon, por lo que conoce cualquier técnica.","Con la hoja de su cabeza puede medir la temperatura y la humedad. Le encanta tomar el sol.","Su cuello desprende un dulce aroma que anima a quien lo huele.","El aliento de Meganium tiene el poder de revivir los rastrojos, además de regenerarlos.","Es un Pokémon muy tímido. Si se asusta, las llamas de su lomo arden con más fuerza.","Ten cuidado si te da la espalda en combate. Significa que te va a atacar con su lomo de fuego.","Tiene una habilidad secreta y devastadora. Causa explosiones al frotar su pelaje.","Sus desarrolladas y potentes fauces pueden romper cualquier cosa. Su Entrenador debe tener cuidado.","Cuando muerde algo, no lo suelta hasta que pierde sus colmillos. Estos se regeneran rápidamente.","Al morder con sus feroces fauces, mueve su cabeza despedazando salvajemente a su víctima.","Se apoya sobre su cola para ver a mucha distancia. Si divisa a un enemigo, dará la alarma a gritos.","Construye un nido donde introducir su largo y delgado cuerpo, en el que no pueden entrar otros Pokémon.","Camina con una sola pata. Cambia tan rápidamente de pata que apenas se le ve.","Cuando necesita pensar, gira su cabeza 180° para agudizar su capacidad intelectual.","Es muy tímido y se refugia con los de su especie. Al caminar, deja una estela que indica dónde está.","Los puntos de su caparazón crecen y decrecen dependiendo de las estrellas del cielo nocturno.","Mantiene la misma postura en su telaraña durante días, esperando a que se acerque una presa inocente.","Pega hilos de seda a sus presas y las libera para seguirlas más tarde y localizar también a sus amigos.","Al contar con cuatro alas, puede acechar de manera más rápida y sigilosa a sus presas sin que estas lo perciban.","Descarga electricidad positiva y negativa entre las puntas de sus dos antenas y electrocuta al enemigo.","Ciega a su presa con una luz intensa y luego se la traga de un solo bocado.","Todavía no domina el almacenamiento de electricidad y descargará un rayo si se divierte o asusta.","Muchos aparecen cuando hay estrellas fugaces en el cielo nocturno. Se esfuman al amanecer.","Su cuerpo es muy blando. Si se pone a rodar, rebotará contra todo y será imposible de parar.","Dice el proverbio que quien despierte a un Togepi de su sueño, alcanzará la felicidad.","Dicen que aparece entre gentes cuidadosas y de buen corazón, a quienes inunda de felicidad.","Normalmente busca comida por el suelo. En raras ocasiones, salta a las ramas para picotear brotes.","Dicen que se mantiene quieto y en silencio porque observa el pasado y el futuro al mismo tiempo.","Almacena aire en el lanudo pelaje que tiene. Así, se mantiene fresco en verano y caliente en invierno.","Cuando su pelaje se carga de electricidad, su cola se enciende. Lanza pelo que explota al impacto.","La punta de su cola reluce brillantemente y puede ser vista desde lejos. Es usado como faro.","Cuando acaba la estación de las lluvias, sale al sol e inicia una peculiar danza.","La punta de su cola está llena de un aceite que, al ser más ligero que el agua, le permite flotar.","Gracias al dibujo que tiene en el estómago, le resulta bastante fácil camuflarse en el agua.","Se disfraza de árbol para no ser atacado. Odia el agua, por lo que desaparecerá si empieza a llover.","Si Poliwag y Poliwhirl oyen su llanto, acudirán de todas partes para consolarlo.","Flotan en el aire. Se dice que, cuando los Hoppip se reúnen, es que la primavera está al caer.","Abre sus pétalos para absorber la luz solar. También flota en el aire para estar más cerca del sol.","Aunque sople el viento más fuerte, es capaz de controlar los pompones y moverse por donde quiera.","Su cola es tan potente que puede usarla para agarrarse a la rama de un árbol y no caer.","Se alimenta del rocío que hay sobre las hojas de las plantas. Dicen que no come nada más.","Obtiene energía de la luz solar. Este Pokémon es famoso por su heliotropismo.","Si aletea muy rápido, genera ondas expansivas capaces de hacer añicos todas las ventanas próximas.","Cuando la temperatura baja por la tarde, emerge del agua y va a la orilla en busca de comida.","Este despreocupado Pokémon es de naturaleza tranquila. Siempre que nada, choca con los barcos.","Su pelaje es tan sensible que percibe los cambios en el aire y predice así los ataques de sus enemigos y el tiempo.","Cuando lo baña la luz de la luna, los círculos de su pelaje brillan levemente y se ve revestido de un poder misterioso.","Temido y odiado por muchos, dicen que trae la desgracia a todos aquellos que lo ven por la noche.","Al ser mordido en la cabeza, Slowpoke absorbió unas toxinas que liberaron su oculto poder.","Le gusta hacer travesuras, como gritar y aullar por la noche, para asustar a la gente.","Tienen forma de letras antiguas. Se desconoce qué fue antes: si la escritura o los Unown.","Para mantener oculta su negra cola, vive en silencio en la oscuridad. Nunca ataca primero.","Su cola tiene un pequeño cerebro. ¡Cuidado! Si te acercas, puede reaccionar a tu olor y morder.","Es como una piña piñonera. Su coraza lo protege de los pájaros que lo picotean por error.","Permanece inmóvil agarrado a su árbol. Dispara trozos de su dura coraza para alejar al enemigo.","Cava el suelo con su cola para construir su madriguera. Puede volar distancias cortas.","Vuela directo a la cara del objetivo y acaba con su aterrada víctima inyectándole veneno.","Atraviesa rocas a mordisco limpio. Sus ojos pueden ver en la oscuridad subterránea.","Los Pokémon pequeños huyen al ver su cara agresiva. No obstante, para muchas féminas es mono.","Con solo enseñar las fauces, conseguirá ahuyentar prácticamente a todos los Pokémon con los que se cruce.","Las pequeñas púas que cubren su cuerpo eran escamas. Inyectan una toxina que debilita.","Su cuerpo es duro como el acero. Confunde a los rivales con los dibujos de ojos en sus pinzas.","Almacena bayas dentro de su concha. Para evitar ataques, se esconde inmóvil bajo las rocas.","Tiene una fuerza descomunal. Puede, sin gran esfuerzo, arrojar objetos que superen su peso en cien veces.","Sus ocultas garras son muy afiladas. Si le atacan, extiende sus garras y asusta al enemigo.","Antes de que la comida escasee en invierno, tiene por costumbre ocultar comida en lugares secretos.","Aunque es muy grande, no se le da nada mal lo de trepar árboles. Come y duerme en las copas.","Su cuerpo se compone de magma. Si deja de moverse, se enfría y se endurece.","Tiene un cuerpo que no deja de hincharse y tan caliente como la lava. La concha suelta llamas.","Si percibe un aroma tentador, se tira de cabeza para encontrar el origen de dicho olor.","Como su largo pelaje le impide ver con claridad, sigue atacando repetidamente.","Adoran las aguas cristalinas de los mares del sur, pues su coral pierde color y se deteriora en aguas sucias.","Usando su aleta dorsal para succionar, se une a un Mantine para buscar restos de comida.","Atrapa a los enemigos con sus tentáculos y después los golpea con su dura cabeza.","Lleva siempre comida consigo. Si se encuentra con montañeros que vagan perdidos, la comparte.","Nada con gran elegancia e ignora a los Remoraid que se aferran a sus aletas buscando restos de comida.","Una armadura de hierro cubre por completo su cuerpo. Vuela a más de 300 km/h.","Para arrinconar a sus presas, comprueban sus posiciones con ladridos que solo ellos entienden.","Las llamas que respira cuando se enfada contienen toxinas. Si causan una quemadura, dolerá toda la vida.","Almacena energía durmiendo en las profundidades submarinas, allá donde no llegan otros seres.","A pesar de su tamaño reducido, es tan fuerte que puede llevar a un humano a su espalda con facilidad.","Cuanto más grandes son sus colmillos, mayor su estatus en la manada. Los colmillos tardan mucho en crecer.","Tiene instalado un avanzado software astrofísico que le permite trabajar en el espacio.","Su cornamenta cambia el flujo del aire para crear un espacio de realidad distorsionada.","Cuando llega a adulto, suele dejar que sus camaradas dejen sus huellas sobre su lomo.","Para mejorar sus técnicas de lucha, desafiará a cualquiera. Tiene un espíritu muy competitivo.","Si te encantan sus suaves, elegantes y danzarinas patadas, acabarás taladrado.","Analiza todo tocándolo con los labios. Así puede recordar las cosas que le gustan y disgustan.","Al girar ambos brazos para generar electricidad, sus cuernos se iluminan con una luz blanquecina.","Su sangre es como magma y su temperatura corporal puede alcanzar los 600 °C.","Su leche, rica en nutrientes, es la mejor bebida contra el cansancio y la enfermedad.","Este amable Pokémon cuida de Pokémon enfermos y los sana. Puede percibir la tristeza.","Este duro Pokémon almacena energía en su cuerpo. Después, cuando se desplaza por tierra, la suelta.","Se dice que, cuando ruge, un volcán entra en erupción en algún punto del globo.","Conocido como la reencarnación de los vientos del norte, puede purificar aguas turbias y sucias.","Nace muy profundo en el suelo y sube a la superficie, donde se convierte en una larva comiéndose la tierra que lo rodea.","Su caparazón es duro como una piedra y muy resistente. Su Golpe puede derribar montañas.","Puede alterar el paisaje derribando montañas y enterrando ríos. Da mucho trabajo a los cartógrafos.","Dicen que es el guardián de los mares. Hay rumores de que fue visto en una noche de tormenta.","Se revelará ante Entrenadores de corazón puro mostrando sus brillantes alas arcoíris.","Puede viajar en el tiempo, pero se dice que solo aparece en tiempos de paz.","Tiene pequeñas púas en las plantas de los pies que le permiten andar por techos y paredes sin caerse.","Vive en selvas frondosas. Salta de rama en rama para acercarse a sus presas.","Corre con elegancia de un lugar a otro de la selva y usa las afiladas hojas de sus brazos para cazar.","En su interior arde una llama que mantiene su cuerpo caliente. Tira bolas de fuego a 1000 °C.","Al pelear, el fuego de su interior se intensifica. Es capaz de propinar unas patadas demoledoras.","Ante un rival difícil, expulsa llamas por las muñecas. Tiene mucha fuerza en las patas; hasta puede saltar edificios.","La aleta de su cabeza detecta las corrientes de agua y los peligros. Tiene fuerza para levantar rocas.","Vive en el lodo, lo que contribuye a que sus piernas sean extremadamente robustas.","Puede nadar y arrastrar un barco grande. Golpea a sus enemigos con sus gruesos brazos.","Es tenaz por naturaleza. Tiene un sentido del olfato tan agudo que nunca se le escapa la presa que quiere.","Forman manadas de diez individuos y cercan a sus presas valiéndose de un trabajo en equipo impecable.","Es un Pokémon muy inquieto, se interesa por todo. Siempre está de aquí para allá.","Carga contra sus enemigos a más de 100 km/h. Como solo va en línea recta, falla a menudo.","Vive en bosques y zonas de hierba alta. Si le atacan, se defiende con las púas venenosas de su cola.","Bebe el rocío que recoge con su seda mientras espera evolucionar. Se defiende en su capullo.","Es un Pokémon agresivo. Con su boca larga y afilada ataca a sus rivales para drenar sus fluidos.","Jamás olvida a quienes lo atacaron mientras estaba en su capullo. Cuando evoluciona, busca venganza.","Cuando se le ataca, bate las alas con fuerza para esparcir polvo tóxico. Es un Pokémon nocturno.","Va buscando agua potable para beber. Si no la encuentra pasado un tiempo, se le marchita la hoja de la cabeza.","Tiene carácter travieso. Si ve un pescador, tira del anzuelo para confundirlo.","El ritmo de la música alegre y animada activa las células de Ludicolo y estas le dan fuerza.","Cuando cuelga de las ramas, parece una bellota. Le encanta asustar a otros Pokémon.","Vive en lo más profundo del bosque. Utiliza la hoja de su cabeza como flauta con un sonido perturbador.","Con sus abanicos puede provocar vientos de 30 m/s capaces de levantar casas.","No le gustan las bajas temperaturas. En las estaciones frías se recorre casi 300 km al día en busca de zonas cálidas.","Vive en los bosques. Si encuentra una presa, se lanza en picado y la atrapa con sus afiladas garras.","Anida en acantilados y alcanza gran altura aprovechando las corrientes ascendentes.","Transporta a pequeños Pokémon y Huevos en su pico hasta lugares seguros.","Capta muy bien lo que sienten las personas y los Pokémon. Cuando nota cierta hostilidad, se esconde.","Con sus poderes psíquicos puede deformar el espacio a su alrededor y predecir el futuro.","Tiene la capacidad de predecir el futuro. Cuando protege a su Entrenador se vuelve más fuerte.","Parece que patina sobre el agua. Atrae a las presas con el suave aroma de su cabeza.","Sus cuatro alas le permiten volar en cualquier dirección a su antojo.","Lanza esporas venenosas desde la parte superior de la cabeza. Inhalarlas es muy doloroso.","Esparce esporas venenosas muy nocivas y asesta puñetazos de gran intensidad a sus enemigos.","Si se come tres hojas al día, ya se queda satisfecho. Aparte de eso, se pasa durmiendo 20 horas al día.","Si no puede estar en continuo movimiento, su nivel de estrés se dispara y puede llegar a enfermar.","Es el Pokémon más vago que hay. Aun así, puede liberar de una vez una cantidad tremenda de energía acumulada.","Algunos pasan más de diez años bajo tierra. Absorbe nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles.","Se mueve tan rápido que a veces resulta invisible. Le atrae la savia de los árboles.","Es un Pokémon muy peculiar; aparece de repente en una Poké Ball cuando Nincada evoluciona.","Cuando percibe peligro, lanza gritos con volumen similar al de un reactor e intimida a sus enemigos.","Las ondas de sus gritos pueden voltear un camión. Patea el suelo para ganar potencia.","El bramido que emite al atacar puede sacudir la tierra con la intensidad de un terremoto.","A base de duro entrenamiento se hace cada vez más fuerte. Es tan resistente que puede soportar cualquier ataque.","Le encanta enfrentarse a Pokémon grandes y probar su fuerza. Sus brazos pueden derribar un camión.","Para hacer frente a oponentes más grandes que él, agita su gran cola, llena de nutrientes, de un lado a otro.","Siempre está con el pico magnético orientado hacia el norte. Quienes viajan toman a Nosepass como referencia.","Le gusta jugar persiguiéndose la cola hasta que se marea, mostrando así su lado más mono.","Tiene mucho éxito entre las Entrenadoras por su suave pelaje. No vive en un sitio fijo.","Hace su guarida en cuevas oscuras. Usa sus afiladas garras para desenterrar las gemas que se come.","Las grandes fauces de su cabeza están formadas por cuernos. Puede romper el hierro con ellas.","Al evolucionar, la coraza de acero que recubre todo su cuerpo se cae para crear una nueva.","Para alardear de su fuerza, hace saltar chispas frotando contra grandes rocas el cuerpo de acero que tiene.","Mientras busca hierro para comer, excava túneles en la roca con sus potentes cuernos de acero.","Solo come una baya al día. El ayuno fortalece su espíritu y su capacidad de concentración.","Puede prever los movimientos de su rival usando sus poderes psíquicos, fortalecidos por el yoga.","Acumula electricidad estática en el pelaje para lanzar descargas. Cuando va a haber tormenta, suelta chispas.","Descarga electricidad desde su melena. Crea nubarrones desde los que lanza rayos.","Absorbe electricidad de los postes de teléfono. La almacena en su cuerpo y crea cortocircuitos.","Le gusta animar a sus amigos. Si pierden, su cuerpo suelta cada vez más chispas.","Vive cerca de estanques de agua clara. De noche, enciende la luz de la cola para comunicarse con otros de su especie.","Su suave aroma guía a Volbeat para que haga señales luminosas en el cielo nocturno.","Se dice que le brotan flores de colores poco usuales si bebe agua de manantial rica en nutrientes.","Es capaz de digerir cualquier cosa. Para hacer la digestión, se ayuda de un fluido y un gas capaces de corroerlo todo.","Se traga todo lo que le quepa en su enorme boca. Sus jugos gástricos pueden digerir cualquier cosa.","Habita caudalosos ríos que atraviesan las junglas. Si alguien invade su territorio, acude con más de su especie.","Propulsándose con sus aletas, nada a 120 km/h. Es el terror de los mares.","Engulle una tonelada de comida al día. Le gusta jugar expulsando con energía el agua marina por sus espiráculos.","Es el más grande de los Pokémon. Puede nadar a una profundidad de 3000 m aguantando la respiración.","Almacena en su cuerpo magma a 1200 °C. Su joroba mengua cuando utiliza movimientos de tipo Fuego.","Cuando se enfada, las jorobas del lomo entran en erupción y expulsan lava. Habita los cráteres de los volcanes.","Quema carbón en su caparazón para obtener energía. Si le atacan, echa un denso humo negro.","Bota usando su cola para mantener el latido de su corazón. Lleva una perla de Clamperl en la cabeza.","Usa perlas negras para potenciar sus poderes psíquicos. Con su raro baile controla a los rivales.","La probabilidad de que dos Spinda con dibujos idénticos en su pelaje se encuentren es casi inexistente.","Excava fosas cóncavas de las cuales resulta imposible escapar y espera a que una presa caiga en su interior.","Genera ondas ultrasónicas batiendo las alas violentamente. Cuando debilita a su presa, la destruye con ácido.","Se le conoce como el Alma del Desierto. Levanta tormentas de arena al batir sus alas y se refugia en su interior.","Prefiere los medios hostiles como los desiertos. Puede sobrevivir 30 días sin beber, gracias al agua que almacena.","Persiguen en grupo a los viajeros del desierto y los acechan hasta que el cansancio los agote.","Está continuamente acicalándose las alas de algodón que tiene. Si se ensucia, se da una ducha para limpiarse enseguida.","En días soleados, le gusta mezclarse con las nubes y disfrutar de la libertad del cielo mientras trina con voz de soprano.","Se le eriza todo el pelaje con solo oler un Seviper. Con sus afiladas zarpas puede rajar a sus enemigos.","Le une una relación de enemistad con Zangoose. Se lima con las rocas su cola en forma de espada para tenerla afilada.","Descubierto hace 40 años junto a un meteorito. Duerme a sus enemigos con solo mirarlos.","De día, absorbe energía solar. No es nada expresivo, pero capta perfectamente lo que piensa su rival.","Sus bigotes le sirven de radar para localizar a sus presas, incluso en las aguas más turbias.","Construye su nido en el fondo de los pantanos. Es capaz de comerse cualquier cosa.","Su organismo le permite adaptarse a cualquier entorno. Sus pinzas nunca sueltan a su presa.","De naturaleza violenta. Si un Pokémon se aventura en su territorio, lo agarra con sus tenazas y lo arroja por los aires.","Se mueve girando sobre su eje. Es un extraño Pokémon que fue encontrado en unas viejas ruinas.","Dicen que es una figurilla de barro elaborada por una civilización de hace 20 000 años que cobró vida.","Vivió en los fondos marinos hace unos 100 millones de años y fue recreado científicamente.","Atrapa a su presa con los ocho tentáculos que tiene y, antes de devorarla, la baña en ácido.","Este Pokémon fue recreado a partir de restos fósiles. Vivía en el mar y cazaba con sus pinzas.","Está protegido por una fuerte armadura y tiene un cuerpo robusto. Engancha a sus presas con las pinzas y las devora.","Es el Pokémon con peor aspecto. Vive en grupos en lechos de ríos con abundantes plantas acuáticas.","Es el Pokémon más hermoso del mundo. Milotic ha inspirado numerosas obras de arte.","Tiene la habilidad de cambiar y adaptarse al tiempo. Según el clima, se transformará en sol, nubarrones de lluvia o nieve.","Acecha a sus presas adaptando sus colores a los del paisaje, pero los dibujos de su panza nunca cambian.","Les atraen los sentimientos de rencor y celos. Suelen vivir cerca de las casas de gente vengativa.","Cuando abandonaron a este muñeco de felpa, se convirtió en Pokémon. Libera una energía que hechiza al enemigo.","Corre el rumor de que, por las noches, se lleva a los niños que no son obedientes.","Su cuerpo está hueco. Se dice que quien mire dentro, será tragado por un agujero negro.","Los racimos de su cuello dan fruto cada seis meses. A los niños de zonas tropicales les encanta su dulzor.","Emite ondas ultrasónicas que le permiten flotar en el viento para viajar grandes distancias.","Aparece cuando prevé una catástrofe natural inminente, por eso dicen que trae mala suerte.","Se fortalecen empujándose unos a otros en grupos. Les encantan los dulces.","En las zonas nevadas, las leyendas dicen que si un Snorunt vive en una casa, trae prosperidad.","Congela a sus presas enfriando en un momento la humedad contenida en el aire que lo rodea.","Tiene un suave pelaje que lo protege del frío cuando se revuelca por el hielo.","Hace girar con pericia sobre la punta de su nariz cualquier cosa redondeada, ya sea una Poké Ball o un Spheal.","Sus fuertes colmillos destrozan los témpanos de hielo. Su capa de grasa lo protege de sus enemigos.","Está protegido por una sólida concha. Puede llegar a formar una perla extraordinaria.","Vive en los fondos marinos. Atrae a sus confiadas presas con la cola, que tiene forma de pez.","Tiene una forma de nadar de lo más elegante. Se alimenta de las algas marinas que crecen entre las rocas.","Un Pokémon raro descubierto en una exploración marina. No ha cambiado en más de 100 millones de años.","Durante el desove, multitud de Luvdisc se concentran en los arrecifes de coral coloreando de rosa el agua.","Sueña con volar algún día, por lo que siempre practica saltando desde acantilados.","La robusta capa que lo rodea repele los ataques. Aunque es una buena protección, lo hace lento y pesado.","Si se enfada, no hay forma de que se calme. Echa a volar e incendia campos y montañas desde el cielo.","Se comunican mediante pulsos magnéticos. Cuando van en grupos, se mueven al unísono.","Está formado por dos Beldum unidos. Tiene dos cerebros, así que cuenta con poderes psíquicos amplificados.","Está formado por varios Metang. Con cuatro cerebros, tiene la inteligencia de un superordenador.","Las rocas que componen el cuerpo de Regirock pueden encontrarse en todos los estratos geológicos.","Su cuerpo está hecho con hielo de la glaciación. Controla aire gélido a -200 °C.","Se dice que su cuerpo es más duro que cualquier metal. Su interior es hueco, según ciertos estudios.","Se comunica por telepatía con la gente. Cambia de aspecto refractando luz con el plumaje.","Es muy inteligente y entiende el lenguaje humano. Es un Pokémon muy dócil y no le gusta nada combatir.","Se dice que aumentó el nivel del mar a base de aguaceros. Ha estado durmiendo en una fosa marina.","Dicen que este Pokémon legendario simboliza la tierra. Tras batirse en duelo con Kyogre se echó a dormir.","Como hasta hace poco volaba a la altura de la capa de ozono, nadie lo había visto nunca.","Se dice que puede otorgar cualquier deseo durante una semana cada 1000 años.","Pokémon surgido a raíz de la mutación de un virus alienígena. Aparece cerca de la aurora.","Realiza la fotosíntesis para obtener oxígeno. Si tiene sed, las hojas de la cabeza se marchitan.","Sabe dónde encontrar manantiales de agua pura y lleva a los Pokémon amigos hasta allí en su lomo.","Algunos Pokémon pequeños se juntan en su espalda para hacer sus nidos.","El fuego que arde en su cola lo generan los gases de su estómago y disminuye cuando está débil.","Utiliza techos y paredes para lanzar ataques aéreos. También emplea su cola ígnea como arma.","Maneja a sus rivales con tremenda agilidad. En su especial forma de luchar usa todos sus miembros.","Es muy orgulloso, por lo que odia aceptar comida de la gente. Su grueso plumón lo protege del frío.","No hace amigos. Puede partir en dos un árbol gigantesco de un fuerte aletazo.","Los tres cuernos de su pico son muestra de su fuerza. El líder tiene los cuernos más grandes.","Sobrevuela los campos buscando Pokémon de tipo Bicho. Chilla de forma muy estridente.","Vive en bosques y campos. Si dos bandadas se encuentran, pelean por el territorio.","Al evolucionar a Staraptor deja su bandada y pasa a vivir en soledad. Sus alas son inmensas.","Roe constantemente los troncos y las rocas para limarse los dientes. Anida cerca del agua.","Para anidar, crea presas en los ríos con maderas y barro. Tiene fama de trabajador.","Si choca sus antenas, emite un sonido similar al de un xilófono.","Los científicos tratan de estudiar sus melodías, que son reflejo de sus emociones.","Si siente peligro, todo su pelaje brilla. Aprovecha la ceguera temporal de su rival para huir.","Por las puntas de sus garras pasa una fuerte corriente eléctrica. El mínimo roce debilita al enemigo.","La potente visión de Luxray resulta extremadamente valiosa cuando acecha el peligro.","En invierno cierra su capullo para protegerse del frío. En primavera, el capullo se abre y esparce polen.","Se mueve como un bailarín y golpea con látigos repletos de púas venenosas.","Vivía en la jungla hace 100 millones de años. Apartaba los árboles del camino a cabezazos.","Su cráneo es duro como el hierro. Es tan bruto que destroza la jungla cuando persigue presas.","Surgió de un fósil de hace 100 millones de años. Su protección facial es tremendamente dura.","Repele cualquier ataque frontal. Es muy dócil y se alimenta de hierba y bayas.","Si su caparazón se rompe en combate, lo rehace rápidamente con lo que tenga a mano.","Cuando Burmy evolucionó, su caparazón pasó a formar parte de este Pokémon.","Hace vida nocturna. Revolotea y roba la miel de las colmenas de Combee cuando duermen.","Almacenan miel en su colonia. Por la noche, se apiñan para formar una colmena y dormir.","Su abdomen es un panal de larvas que alimenta con la miel recogida por Combee.","A veces se ve a dos frotándose las bolsas de las mejillas para compartir electricidad almacenada.","Hincha el flotador de su cuello para flotar y saca la cabeza de la superficie del agua para explorar sus alrededores.","Su flotador se desarrolló a raíz de perseguir presas acuáticas. También sirve como balsa.","Obtiene la energía necesaria para evolucionar de esa pequeña esfera que está cargada de nutrientes.","Cuando detecta luz solar fuerte, despliega los pétalos y absorbe todos los rayos posibles.","Shellos adapta la forma y color de su cuerpo dependiendo del lugar en donde viva.","Al parecer, hace mucho tiempo tenía una gran concha protectora. Vive en aguas poco profundas.","Para comer, rompe nueces con sus dos colas. Raras veces utiliza sus brazos.","Se dice que es como un hito que guía a las almas. Los niños que sostienen un Drifloon a veces desaparecen sin más.","Durante el día está somnoliento, pero por la noche sale volando en grupo, aunque nadie sabe adónde.","Cuando siente peligro, levanta las orejas. En noches frías, duerme con la cabeza metida en el pelaje.","Sus orejas son muy delicadas. Si alguien las toca con brusquedad, recibirá una espléndida patada.","Atormenta a sus rivales con gritos que parecen conjuros. Aparece en ocasiones y lugares imprevistos.","Está activo por la noche y pulula arrastrando a numerosos Murkrow.","Dependiendo de su humor, mueve grácilmente su cola, que se asemeja a un lazo de gimnasia rítmica.","Para intimidar y parecer más corpulento, se aprieta la cintura con su cola bífida.","Tiene una esfera en la boca. Cuando salta, la esfera rebota y emite un tintineo.","Se protege expulsando un fluido nocivo por su parte trasera. El hedor dura 24 horas.","Emite un fluido apestoso por la cola. Cuanto más tiempo pasa, peor huele.","Se descubrieron herramientas con su forma en tumbas antiguas, pero se desconoce si tiene relación.","Antaño se creía que rezándole se conjuraba la lluvia y se propiciaban las buenas cosechas.","Prefiere entornos áridos. Sus ojos expulsan agua para ajustar sus niveles de hidratación corporal.","Suele imitar a sus enemigos. Cuando lo hace, su rival no puede apartar los ojos de él.","Cuida de una pequeña roca blanca y redonda creyendo que es un huevo. Le gusta arreglarse el tirabuzón.","Puede imitar el lenguaje humano. Si se juntan varios, todos aprenden las mismas palabras.","Como castigo por una fechoría 500 años atrás, está unido a la fisura de una piedra angular mística.","Anida en pequeños agujeros en las paredes de cuevas. Cuando una presa pasa cerca, salta hacia ella.","Tiende a acumular las gemas en bruto que encuentra cuando agranda su guarida.","Vuela tan rápido como un avión a reacción. Nunca se le escapa una presa.","En el interior de su pelaje revuelto esconde la comida que luego engullirá de una vez.","Su aura se intensifica para alertar a otros cuando está triste o tiene miedo.","Emite unas ondas que le permiten percibir todo lo que se encuentre a 1 km, incluso los sentimientos de otras personas.","Se embadurna de arena para protegerse de los gérmenes. No le gusta mojarse.","Cuando ataca, expulsa arena almacenada en su interior para crear un gran tornado.","Acecha a sus presas escondido en la arena y las aturde con el veneno de su cola.","Sus brazos tienen fuerza para destrozar un coche. La punta de sus zarpas segrega veneno.","Infla sus bolsas venenosas para emitir un sonido macabro mientras asesta golpes que hacen retroceder a los rivales.","Sus garras segregan una toxina tan potente que un simple arañazo puede ser mortal.","Se cuelga de los árboles en los pantanos. Atrae a sus presas con su dulce olor y las engulle.","Si se expone mucho al sol, los dibujos de sus aletas brillan en la oscuridad.","Para que los depredadores no lo detecten, se arrastra por el fondo marino con las aletas del pecho.","Cuando nada cerca de la superficie, pueden observarse los dibujos de su lomo desde los barcos.","En primavera, le crecen bayas con apariencia de helado alrededor de la panza.","Vive en paz en cordilleras de nieves eternas. Genera ventiscas para ocultarse.","Viven en zonas frías y forman grupos de cuatro o cinco para cazar con gran coordinación.","Evolucionó por la exposición a un campo magnético especial. Tres unidades generan magnetismo.","La alta concentración de sustancias en su saliva lo disuelve todo. Un lametón provoca un entumecimiento permanente.","Pone rocas en los agujeros de sus manos y las lanza con los músculos. A veces lanza Geodude.","Cuando llega el calor, se cubre por completo con sus lianas y no se le pueden ver ni los ojos.","Toca a su enemigo con las puntas de sus dos colas y le suelta una descarga de más de 20 000 voltios.","Sus brazos disparan bolas de fuego de más de 2000 °C. El aliento que desprende es abrasador.","Congenia muy bien con las personas que respetan los derechos de los demás y evitan riñas innecesarias.","Con sus seis patas puede llevar a un adulto y volar con comodidad. Se equilibra con las alas de su cola.","Al igual que una planta, hace la fotosíntesis. Como consecuencia, siempre está rodeado de aire puro.","Al reducir su temperatura corporal, su pelaje se congela y se convierte en afilados pinchos que puede disparar.","Vuela sin hacer nada de ruido. Con su larga cola captura a sus presas y las muerde con sus colmillos.","Sus impresionantes colmillos están hechos de hielo. Su población se redujo tras la glaciación.","Aunque le instalaron un software para desplazarse por otras dimensiones, algo no funcionó bien.","Lucha con las espadas que salen de sus codos. Es un maestro de la cortesía y la esgrima.","Con el magnetismo que emana, controla tres pequeñas unidades llamadas mininarices.","La antena de la cabeza capta ondas de otra dimensión que le incitan a llevarse allí a la gente.","Cuenta la leyenda que es la reencarnación de mujeres que sufrieron accidentes en la nieve.","Su cuerpo está hecho de plasma. Puede infiltrarse en dispositivos electrónicos e inutilizarlos.","Se dice que su aparición otorgó a los humanos la inteligencia para mejorar sus vidas.","Duerme en el fondo de un lago. Se dice que su espíritu deja el cuerpo para volar sobre el agua.","Se cree que Uxie, Mesprit y Azelf provienen del mismo huevo.","Tiene el poder de controlar el tiempo. Aparece en los mitos de Sinnoh como una vieja deidad.","Tiene la habilidad de distorsionar el espacio. La mitología de Sinnoh lo describe como una deidad.","Su sangre fluye ardiendo como si fuera magma. Vive en cráteres de volcanes.","Una antigua leyenda afirma que este Pokémon arrastraba continentes con cuerdas.","Fue desterrado por su violencia. Observa el mundo en silencio desde el Mundo Distorsión.","Si alguien se duerme con una pluma suya, tendrá sueños maravillosos. Encarna el creciente lunar.","Va a la deriva por mares cálidos. Siempre vuelve a donde nació, por mucho que se haya alejado.","Posee un poder singular que hace que entable amistad con casi cualquier Pokémon.","Puede adormecer a la gente y hacerles soñar. Está activo en las noches de luna nueva.","Se dice que, cuando florecen las Gracídeas, Shaymin alza el vuelo para mostrar su gratitud.","La mitología cuenta que este Pokémon nació antes de que el Universo existiera.","Cuando Victini comparte su energía ilimitada, esa persona o Pokémon irradia abundante poder.","Sintetiza la luz del sol que recoge con su cola. Esta se le queda abatida cuando le fallan las energías.","Cuando su cuerpo está sucio, no puede realizar la fotosíntesis con sus hojas, así que cuida mucho su higiene personal.","Detiene los movimientos del rival con una sola mirada. Expande la energía solar dentro de su cuerpo.","Le encanta comer bayas tostadas, pero a veces se emociona demasiado y termina churruscándolas.","Cuando las llamas de su interior se avivan, aumenta su velocidad y agilidad. Emite humo si está en peligro.","Posee una tupida barba fogosa. Es tanto rápido como poderoso, y su principal baza es la lucha cuerpo a cuerpo.","Ataca con la vieira de su ombligo. En cuanto para un ataque, pasa al contraataque sin dilación.","Tras un exhaustivo entrenamiento, Dewott puede dominar diversas técnicas para usar con sus vieiras.","Derriba a su rival con un solo tajo del sable que lleva en su coraza. Acalla al enemigo con una simple mirada.","Aunque es un Pokémon muy precavido y siempre hay uno montando guardia, si se acercan por detrás, no se dará cuenta.","Ataca lanzando las semillas de las bayas que acumula en sus mofletes. Su cola se tensa al avistar a un enemigo.","Aunque se trata de un Pokémon valeroso, también es lo bastante inteligente como para escapar si el rival es muy fuerte.","Un robusto pelaje cubre su cuerpo a modo de capa y disminuye el daño que recibe en los ataques.","Un humano podría pasar una noche gélida en las montañas sin pasar frío si se tapara con su largo y tupido pelaje.","Hurta a los humanos por mera diversión, pero las víctimas lo perdonan al ver a este Pokémon tan encantador.","Se aproxima evitando que lo detecten. Con sigilo, se acerca a su rival por la espalda y lo ataca.","Es todo un experto en la búsqueda de bayas y es tan gentil que las comparte con todos sus compañeros.","Pokémon muy temperamental que lucha con su cola revestida de púas. Las hojas de su cabeza están muy amargas.","Vive en cuevas volcánicas. El interior de su mata de pelo arde, llegando a alcanzar hasta 300 °C.","Cuando se emociona, echa chispas por la cola y la cabeza, y calienta su cuerpo. Por alguna razón le encantan los dulces.","La acuosidad que acumula en su mata de pelo es rica en nutrientes, ideal para regar plantas y que crezcan mucho.","Le encantan los lugares con agua limpia. Cuando desciende el nivel de agua de su pelo, se abastece a través de su cola.","Se alimenta de los sueños de humanos y Pokémon. Si los sueños son felices, despide humo rosa.","El color del humo que despide por su abultada frente varía según el contenido de los sueños que haya engullido.","Vive en la ciudad, pues se lleva muy bien con la gente. Le encantan los parques y las plazas, donde se reúne con otros.","Puede regresar sin problema alguno a su nido desde cualquier lugar del globo y jamás se separa de quien lo entrena.","El macho hace gala de ornamentación en la cabeza. No es dado a hacerse amigo de alguien que no sea su Entrenador.","Su crin brilla cuando emite una descarga eléctrica. Se comunica con los suyos mediante el ritmo y el número de brillos.","Su velocidad se asemeja a la de un rayo. Si corre al máximo, se dejan oír truenos por doquier.","Descubierto en unas grietas generadas por un terremoto hace 100 años. Tiene un núcleo energético en su cuerpo.","Si se encuentra bien, deja entrever su núcleo. Puede cambiar rápidamente la dirección en la que avanza sin girarse.","El núcleo de su cuerpo comprime la energía para lanzar ataques capaces de destruir una montaña.","Se dice que la marca con forma de corazón que deja un Woobat al incrustar su nariz trae buena suerte.","Todos rebosan de alborozo cuando perciben las ondas ultrasónicas emitidas por el macho para cortejar a la hembra.","Puede girar su cuerpo a una velocidad de 50 km/h y, si la mantiene, puede perforar el suelo y atravesarlo.","Construye madrigueras laberínticas a 100 m bajo tierra. A veces abre agujeros en los túneles de metro.","Al tocar a alguien con las antenas de sus orejas, conoce su estado de ánimo y de salud por los latidos del corazón.","Siempre lleva una viga de madera y ayuda en las construcciones. Se busca una viga más grande cuando se hace más fuerte.","Sus músculos están tan desarrollados que no se inmuta aunque lo ataquen varios luchadores.","En vez de hacer uso de la fuerza bruta, blande columnas de hormigón con la energía centrífuga de sus movimientos.","Emite sonidos imperceptibles para los humanos con la vibración de sus mejillas y se comunica con el ritmo de los mismos.","Vive tanto en tierra como en el fondo del mar. Con su larga y viscosa lengua, inmoviliza a sus contrincantes.","Despide un líquido paralizador por los bultos de su cabeza. Atormenta a sus oponentes con enormes vibraciones.","Si se topa con un rival más fuerte, ansía lanzarlo por los aires. Al hacerse más fuerte, cambia su cinturón.","La potencia de sus puñetazos aumenta si se aprieta el cinturón. Si le molestan cuando se entrena, se enfada.","Usa hojas como material para fabricar su propia ropa, por lo que los diseñadores más famosos los tienen como mascota.","Se guarece del frío envolviéndose en hojas. Se desplaza por el bosque comiendo a su paso las hojas caídas.","Calienta sus huevos con el calor desprendido por el humus. Hace mantillas con las hojas para Sewaddle.","Inocula un poderoso veneno al morder. Hasta sus enemigos acérrimos, los Pokémon pájaro, se quedan inmóviles.","Normalmente no se mueve, pero se pone a rodar frenéticamente y contraataca con placajes si lo atacan.","Arrincona a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos y los ensarta con sus cuernos. No se detiene hasta vencer.","Quizá por el hecho de que se relajan al estar con los suyos, forman un grupo al encontrar amigos y parecen nubes.","Es capaz de atravesar las más mínimas fisuras. A su paso, deja bolitas blancas de pelo.","Habita tierras húmedas ricas en nutrientes donde la cosecha es abundante.","Todos los famosos quieren uno de estos Pokémon. Incluso a los Entrenadores más curtidos les cuesta que florezca.","Los Basculin con la raya roja y aquellos con la raya azul se llevan fatal, pero algunos tienden a agruparse.","Vive en las arenas desérticas, donde las altas temperaturas de las mismas evitan que su cuerpo se enfríe.","Una membrana especial cubre sus ojos y le permite detectar el calor de los cuerpos, por eso ve en la oscuridad.","Jamás deja escapar a su presa. Sus mandíbulas son capaces de destrozar la carrocería de un coche.","Cuando se dispone a dormir, retrae sus piernas y sus brazos, y reduce la llama de su interior a 600 °C para relajarse.","Genera llamas que alcanzan los 1400 °C con las que es capaz de destrozar un camión.","Vive en territorio árido. Emite un sonido parecido a unas maracas si se mueve de forma rítmica.","Si encuentran una piedra de tamaño ideal, segregan un líquido por la boca para crear un agujero y deslizarse dentro.","Se disputa el territorio con sus congéneres. Pierde aquel al que le rompan la roca que lleva a cuestas.","Está orgulloso de su sólido cráneo. Reparte cabezazos a diestro y siniestro con tal vehemencia que él mismo se marea.","El líder del grupo es aquel cuya cresta es mayor. Es capaz de romper bloques de cemento con sus potentes patadas.","Deidad protectora de una antigua ciudad. Siempre merodea por la misma ruta y permanece alerta en busca de intrusos.","Su máscara representa la cara que poseía cuando era humano. A veces se le saltan las lágrimas al contemplarla.","Atrapan en su interior a los ladrones de tumbas que los confunden con ataúdes de verdad.","Ha renacido de un fósil prehistórico. Puede sumergirse hasta 1000 m de profundidad.","Un golpe con sus desarrolladas aletas delanteras puede hacer perder a un rival el conocimiento o romperle los huesos.","Dicen que es el Pokémon pájaro primigenio. No puede volar, así que solo salta de rama en rama.","Corre a mayor velocidad de la que puede volar. Alcanza una velocidad de 40 km/h antes de alzarse en vuelo hacia el cielo.","Le gustan los lugares con suciedad. Quien inhala los gases que eructa duerme durante una semana.","Absorbe y procesa en su interior basura para generar nuevos gases nocivos y líquidos venenosos de alta virulencia.","Se transforma en humanos o en otros Pokémon. Se defiende del peligro ocultando su verdadera apariencia.","Siempre ha protegido a su manada embaucando a sus enemigos. Dentro de la manada están todos muy unidos.","Le encanta la limpieza. Usa su cola a modo de escoba y se pasa el día barre que te barre.","El cuerpo de Cinccino está recubierto por una grasa especial que hace que los golpes y ataques enemigos no acierten.","Clava su mirada en Pokémon y Entrenadores como si observara algo solo perceptible por él.","Según muchas leyendas, durante las noches estrelladas controlan a los niños que duermen, tan solo como diversión.","Predice el futuro analizando la posición de los astros y su movimiento. Conoce la esperanza de vida de los Entrenadores.","Desata su poder psíquico para ahuyentar al enemigo. Se comunica con sus compañeros por telepatía.","Cuando las dos partes de su cerebro piensan lo mismo, saca todo su poder a relucir.","Cuando los Reuniclus se dan la mano, sus cerebros se conectan y multiplican sus poderes psíquicos.","Nada a mayor velocidad de la que puede volar. Se sumerge en el agua para buscar musgo acuático, su comida favorita.","Comienzan a danzar al amanecer. El líder de la bandada se sitúa en el centro.","Nació de un carámbano que absorbió la energía del sol al alba. Duerme arropado por la nieve.","Vive en las cumbres nevadas. Migró hacia el sur durante la era glaciar hace muchísimos años.","Absorben grandes cantidades de agua y la transforman en ventisca en su cuerpo, expulsándola cuando se enojan.","Durante los cambios de estación, su pelaje y olor cambian. Esto anuncia el comienzo de una estación.","Migra con el cambio de estación, por lo que hay quien considera a Sawsbuck el heraldo de la primavera.","Almacena en una membrana la electricidad generada por sus mejillas y planea por los aires soltando descargas.","Si recibe una descarga eléctrica durante un combate contra un Shelmet, puede evolucionar. Se desconoce el porqué.","Pokémon que evolucionó poniéndose el caparazón de Shelmet. Su armazón de acero le protege todo el cuerpo.","Atraen a otros Pokémon gracias a su similitud con una Poké Ball y los atacan expulsando esporas venenosas.","Baila meciendo rítmicamente los dos brazos a modo de Poké Ball para hacer que sus presas se acerquen.","Rodea a sus presas con sus tentáculos, las entumece y las arrastra a 8000 m de profundidad hasta que las ahoga.","Jellicent hunde los barcos que acaban perdidos en su territorio y absorbe la energía vital de su tripulación.","Abraza gentilmente con sus aletas a Pokémon que están lastimados y cura sus heridas con su membrana especial.","Se agarra a Pokémon de gran tamaño, absorbe su electricidad estática y la guarda en una bolsa interna.","Cuando un enemigo lo ataca, expulsa por la boca hilos electrificados para crear una barrera.","Absorbe los componentes ferruginosos de las rocas al colgarse del techo de las cuevas. Dispara púas si se ve en peligro.","Se pega al techo de cuevas y lanza púas de metal a todo el que pase por debajo de donde se encuentre.","La combinación de sus dos cuerpos es predeterminada. Si no se corresponde con su homólogo, se separa.","Se compone de una rueda dentada grande y otra pequeña. Lanza la pequeña para atacar, pero se debilita si no regresa.","El núcleo rojo sirve como depósito de la energía que expulsa por las púas una vez que está cargado.","Apenas puede generar energía por sí mismo, pero un banco de Tynamo puede crear violentas descargas eléctricas.","Pokémon de apetito voraz. En cuanto encuentra una presa, la paraliza con electricidad y la engulle.","Sale del mar con la fuerza de sus brazos y ataca a sus presas en la costa. Luego se las lleva de vuelta al mar.","Según cuentan los rumores, procede de un desierto donde hace 50 años se estrelló un ovni.","Controla el cerebro del rival con su poder psíquico y manipula sus recuerdos.","La luz que desprende absorbe la energía vital de humanos y Pokémon.","Aparece hacia el final de la vida y absorbe el alma en cuanto esta se separa del cuerpo.","Las almas que han ardido bajo sus oscuras llamas vagan sin rumbo y eternamente por este mundo.","Deja la huella de sus colmillos en los árboles para marcar su territorio. Si se le rompen, se regeneran muy rápido.","Sus colmillos no vuelven a crecer, por lo que, al término de cada combate, los afila cuidadosamente con cantos de río.","Sus colmillos no se quiebran ni aunque los hinque en un armazón de acero. Está protegido por una resistente armadura.","Sus mocos son su barómetro de salud. Si es buena, serán densos, y la fuerza de sus movimientos de tipo Hielo aumentará.","Congela su aliento y crea colmillos y garras de hielo para combatir. Vive en las gélidas tierras del norte.","Usa cadenas de cristales de hielo para atrapar a sus presas y congelarlas a temperaturas de hasta -100 °C.","Evoluciona si entra en contacto con energía eléctrica junto a Karrablast. Aún no se ha esclarecido el porqué.","Los ambientes secos lo debilitan. Evita la sequedad envolviéndose en muchas membranas finas superpuestas.","Acecha a sus presas oculto en la arena húmeda de la playa. Las paraliza con una descarga eléctrica cuando lo tocan.","Abruma a su rival con oleadas de ataques veloces. Corta al enemigo con sus afiladas garras.","Usa el pelaje de sus brazos a modo de látigos para encadenar ataques que nadie puede parar una vez iniciados.","Calienta su cuerpo absorbiendo los rayos de sol por las alas. No se puede mover si baja su temperatura corporal.","Un Pokémon creado a partir del barro gracias a la ciencia de antaño. Lleva activo miles de años.","Vuela a velocidad mach. Pierde el control de su energía si se le retira el sello del pecho.","Ataca en grupo ignorando sus heridas y hundiendo en su presa las cuchillas que recubren su cuerpo.","Su séquito son los Pawniard. Acorralan a su presa con todo el grupo y Bisharp propina el golpe de gracia.","Aunque encaje un cabezazo violento, su pelaje absorbe el daño.","Desafía indiscriminadamente a rivales poderosos. Librar numerosas batallas lo hace fuerte.","Lucha por sus compañeros sin reparar en el peligro. Es capaz de volar alto incluso con un coche en sus garras.","Sus pequeñas alas no le permiten volar. Usa una calavera que le dio Mandibuzz para proteger sus posaderas.","Otea la superficie desde el cielo y ataca a Pokémon debilitados. Tiene por costumbre hacerse adornos con huesos.","Absorbe aire por el orificio de su cola para prender una lengua de llamas con la que derrite a los Durant para comerlos.","Llevan una armadura de acero. Se defienden en grupo para contrarrestar a sus depredadores, los Heatmor.","No ve bien a su alrededor, por eso va chocándose a diestro y siniestro, y mordiendo todo lo que se mueve.","Cambia de morada siempre que termina con la comida de una zona. Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal.","Un Pokémon temible que ataca todo lo que se mueve y devora con sus tres cabezas cuanto halla a su paso.","Vive en las laderas de los volcanes. Emite fuego por sus cinco cuernos para ahuyentar a sus enemigos.","Antaño, las cenizas volcánicas cubrieron los cielos. Entonces, sus llamaradas sirvieron de sol.","Posee cuerpo y alma de acero. Junto con sus compañeros, castiga a aquellas personas que hacen daño a Pokémon.","Las leyendas hablan de este Pokémon, que derribó un castillo con su propia fuerza para proteger a otros Pokémon.","Cuenta la leyenda que Virizion confunde a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos para proteger a otros Pokémon.","La energía que desprende de su cola genera violentas tempestades capaces de echar abajo casas.","Su gusto por surcar el cielo lanzando rayos y provocando incendios forestales le ha granjeado pocas simpatías.","Cuando la cola de Reshiram arde, su energía calorífica altera la atmósfera, y el tiempo meteorológico cambia.","Genera electricidad con su cola y, para ocultarse, sobrevuela Teselia envuelto en nubes de rayos.","Utiliza energía que obtiene del viento y del relámpago para nutrir el suelo y generar abundantes cosechas.","Produce en su interior una intensa energía gélida, y cualquier fuga hace que su cuerpo se congele.","Cuando está decidido, su cuerpo rebosa brío, y es capaz de saltar más alto y correr más de lo que la vista alcanza.","Controla los sentimientos de los que escuchan las melodías que emite con su singular vocalización.","Un Pokémon de hace 300 millones de años y alterado por el Equipo Plasma, quienes le han equipado con un cañón en el lomo."]};
